  "Eager. I can make titanium equipment and more here.": "意欲的。ここでチタニウムの装備などを作れる",
  "This forge let's me craft equipment out of metal!": "この鍛冶場で金属から装備を作れる！",
  "A crafting station dedicated to creatin' equipment out of metal.": "金属から装備を作るためのクラフトステーション",
  "This forge will come in handy for creatin' equipment out of metal.": "この鍛冶場は金属から装備を作るのに役立つ",
