  "I can create equipment to use for wiring here.": "ここで配線用の装備を作れる",
  "It's a workstation for crafting equipment to use for wiring.": "配線用の装備を作るワークステーション",
  "Floran can make equipment for wiring thingsss.": "フローランは配線のための装備を作れるsss",
