  "This string of small, twinkling holiday lights is the perfect way to get festive.": "小さく煌めく妖精の灯りが連なっています。",
  "Much sssparkle.": "キラキラしてる",
  "Happy. These twinkling lights add much to the cheery atmosphere.": "硬い石",
  "Little twinklin' lights, kinda pretty.": "小さなツインクリンのライト、かわいいですね",
  "Holiday Lights": "妖精のライト",
  "A striped pole...": "丈夫な天井の支え",
