  "A short Conveyer Belt for moving heavy loads.": "重い荷物を運ぶための短いコンベアベルト",
  "An uninteresting human construct.": "面白くない人間の構造物",
  "A device for carryin' heavy things from one place to another.": "重いものを運ぶための装置だ",
