  "A dash that can be used in the air! Cooldown: 0.8s": "ジャンプ中でもダッシュできる！クールダウン：0.8秒",
  "Air Dash": "空中ダッシュ",
  "A dash that blinks past traps and enemies! Cooldown: 2.5s": "トラップや敵をすりぬけるダッシュ！クールダウン：2.5秒",
  "Blink Dash": "ブリンクダッシュ",
  "Double tap ^green;[A]^white; or ^green;[D] ^white;to quickly dash! Cooldown: 0.8s": "^green;[A] ^white;または^green;[D]^white;をダブルタップでダッシュします！クールダウン：0.8秒",
  "Dash": "ダッシュ",
  "Replaces the dash with a sprint which costs energy!": "エネルギーを消費して地上を素早く移動できる！",
  "Sprint": "スプリント",
  "Turn into a sphere and move quickly across liquids! ^green;[F]": "スフィアの回転で、液体上をすばやく移動！^green;[F]^white;",
  "Turn into a sphere that can fit into smaller places! ^green;[F]": "小さい場所に収まる球に^green;[F]^white;で変身！",
  "Distortion Sphere": "歪曲球",
  "Perform a sphere dash by holding ^green;[F] ^white;to transform!": "^green;[F]^white;長押しでチャージし、離してスフィアダッシュを実行！",
  "Sonic Sphere": "ソニックスフィア",
  "Transform into a sphere that can climb walls! ^green;[F]": "壁を登ることができる球に、^green;[F]^white;で変身できます！",
  "Spike Sphere": "スパイクスフィア",
  "An additional jump that can be used while in the air!": "空中で追加のジャンプができる！",
