  "Laced with unusual chemicals. Extremely psychotropic.": "珍しい化学物質が混ざっている。極度のサイケデリック効果",
  "Exceptional Honeycomb": "エクセプショナルハニーコム",
  "A delicious and top-quality honey comb.": "美味しくて最高品質のハニーコム",
  "Reaper Honeycomb": "リーパーハニーコム",
  "Possesses a meaty taste that resembles pork, and is rich with red honey.": "豚肉に似た肉の味があり、赤い蜂蜜が豊富",
  "Floral Honeycomb": "フローラルハニーコム",
  "An aromatic honeycomb. Low grade healing.": "芳香のあるハニーコム。低級回復効果",
  "Forest Honeycomb": "フォレストハニーコム",
  "A delicious forest honeycomb! Low grade healing.": "美味しい森のハニーコム！低級回復効果",
  "Ambrosia Honeycomb": "Ambrosiaハニーコム",
  "The nutritional and medicinal qualities of this comb are staggering.": "このコムの栄養と薬効は驚異的",
  "Gold Honeycomb": "金ハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb contains traces of gold and can heal wounds over time.": "このハニーコムには金の痕跡があり、時間経過で傷を癒す",
  "Iron Honeycomb": "鉄ハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb has high iron contents. Increases armor when eaten.": "このハニーコムは鉄分が豊富。食べると装甲が増加",
  "Rich Honeycomb": "Richハニーコム",
  "A delicious green-tinted honeycomb that provides medicinal benefits.": "薬効のある美味しい緑がかったハニカム",
  "Fiery Honeycomb": "Fieryハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb is on fire. Try using it in an industrial centrifuge! Great fire proofing when eaten.": "このハニーコムは燃えている。産業用遠心分離機で使おう！食べると耐火性向上",
  "Earthen Honeycomb": "Earthenハニーコム",
  "This earthy comb increases max health by 25%": "この土のコムは最大体力を25%増加させる",
  "Moon Honeycomb": "Moonハニーコム",
  "A honeycomb with unusual gravitational abilities if consumed.": "食べると重力に関する不思議な効果があるハニーコム",
  "Harlequin Honeycomb": "Harlequinハニーコム",
  "A honeycomb that contains strong anti-shadow properties.": "強力な対シャドウ特性を含むハニカム",
  "Stellar Honeycomb": "ステラーハニーコム",
  "A comb that is said to be infused with mystical healing energy.": "神秘的な治癒エネルギーが注入されていると言われるコーム",
  "Shrouded Honeycomb": "Shroudedハニーコム",
  "Cosmic antimatter energy infuses this comb. Grants Shadow Taint immunity.": "宇宙の反物質エネルギーが注入されたコム。影の汚染免疫を付与",
  "Honeycomb": "ハニーコム",
  "A delicious honeycomb with mild medicinal properties.": "穏やかな薬効のある美味しいハニーコム",
  "Plutonium Honeycomb": "プルトニウムハニーコム",
  "RADIOACTIVE! DO NOT EAT!\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "放射性！食べるな！\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Crystalline Honeycomb": "クリスタリンハニーコム",
  "A glittering honeycomb with small particles of pure crystal within.": "純粋なクリスタルの微粒子が内部にあるキラキラしたハニーコム",
  "Radioactive Honeycomb": "ラジオアクティブハニーコム",
  "RADIOACTIVE! DO NOT EAT!\n^blue;+^white;1 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "放射性！食べるな！\n^blue;+^white;1 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Red Honeycomb": "Redハニーコム",
  "A delicious red honeycomb. Smells like meat.": "美味しい赤いハニーコム。肉の匂いがする",
  "Silk Honeycomb": "Silkハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb is packed full of silk. Not tasty, but still medicinal.": "このハニーコムはシルクがぎっしり。美味しくはないが薬効あり",
  "Silver Honeycomb": "銀ハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb has high silver contents. Great poison resistance.": "このハニーコムは銀含有量が高い。優れた毒耐性",
  "Solarium Honeycomb": "ソラリウムハニーコム",
  "RADIOACTIVE! DO NOT EAT!\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "放射性！食べるな！\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Solar Honeycomb": "ソーラーハニーコム",
  "Too hot for the honey extractor.\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "蜂蜜抽出機には熱すぎる\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Titanium Honeycomb": "チタンハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb has high titanium contents. Increases electric resistance": "このハニーコムはチタン含有量が高い。電気耐性が増加",
  "Tungsten Honeycomb": "タングステンハニーコム",
  "This honeycomb has high tungsten contents. Increases protection.": "このハニーコムはタングステン含有量が高い。防御力が増加",
  "Violium Honeycomb": "ヴィオリウムハニーコム",
  "A honeycomb with high violium contents. Increases energy max.": "ヴィオリウム含有量の高いハニーコム。最大エネルギーが増加",
  "Volcanic Honeycomb": "ヴォルカニックハニーコム",
  "A volcanic honeycomb. Try placing it in a centrifuge! Good fire proofing.": "火山のハニーコム。遠心分離機に入れてみよう！優れた耐火性",
  "Bee Silk": "ビーシルク",
  "Strands of sticky silk! Craft with them!": "粘着シルクの束！クラフトに使おう！",
