  "^white;           Your one-stop-shop for furnishings and more!^white;": "^white; 家具や様々な商品が揃うワンストップショップ!^white;",
  "PRODUCT DESCRIPTION": "商品説明",
  "Seline's Mineral Shop": "セリーヌの鉱物店",
  "Beautiful and delicious rocks.": "美しくて美味しい鉱石",
  "Munchies Totally Legal Goods": "マンチーズの完全合法商品店",
  "Doesn't sell narcotics or other illegal things.": "麻薬やその他の違法品は販売していません",
  "Purchase": "購入",
  "MATTER ASSEMBLER": "物質組立機",
  "Primary Lab crafting.": "ラボの主要クラフト装置",
  "Downloading the newest Skath codex entries": "最新のスカス族コデックスをダウンロード中",
  "SKATH FORGE": "スカス族の鍛冶場",
  "Melt things and craft things!": "溶かして作ろう!",
  "Skath Worktable": "スカス族の作業台",
  "Blocks, Objects and Farming": "ブロック、オブジェクト、農業",
  "TOME DAIS": "書の台座",
  "Write genius works.": "天才的な作品を書こう",
  "Write": "執筆",
  "XENO LAB": "ゼノラボ",
  "Make genes in this lab.": "このラボで遺伝子を作成",
  "Red Shirt Contract": "赤シャツ契約書",
  "Hires a lowly red-shirt.": "下っ端のレッドシャツを雇用する",
  "Agaran Sellsword Contract": "アガラン傭兵契約書",
  "Hires an Agaran sellsword to fight alongside you. Gives ^green;10% poison resistance^reset;.": "共に戦うアガランの傭兵を雇用する",
  "Arctic Contract": "アークティック契約書",
  "Hires an arctic explorer that provides ^cyan;30% Cold resistance^reset; and reduces ship fuel costs by 8%.": "^cyan;冷気耐性30%^reset;を付与し、船の燃料コストを8%削減する北極探検家を雇用する",
  "Biohazard Contract": "Biohazard契約書",
  "Hires a Biohazard specialist. Provides ^yellow;30% Radiation resistance^reset;, and increase your ship's fuel capacity by 340.": "バイオハザードスペシャリストを雇用する",
  "Bounty Contract": "Bounty契約書",
  "Hires a lethal bounty hunter that talks loudly and carries a big gun.": "大声で話し巨大な銃を持つ致命的な賞金稼ぎを雇用する",
  "Chef Contract": "Chef契約書",
  "Hires an apprentice chef to keep you slightly fed and reduce fuel costs by 2%.": "わずかな食事を提供し燃料コストを2%削減する見習いシェフを雇用する",
  "Line Chef Contract": "LineChef契約書",
  "Hires a Line Chef to keep you fed and reduce fuel costs by 4%.": "食事を提供し燃料コストを4%削減するラインシェフを雇用する",
  "Sous Chef Contract": "SousChef契約書",
  "Hires a Sous Chef to keep you stuffed and reduce fuel costs by 6%.": "満腹にし燃料コストを6%削減するスーシェフを雇用する",
  "Chemist-A Contract": "ケミストA契約書",
  "Hires a chemist that boosts your jump power.": "ジャンプ力を強化する化学者を雇用する",
  "Chemist-B Contract": "ケミストB契約書",
  "Hires a chemist that increases your speed.": "速度を上昇させる化学者を雇用する",
  "Chemist-C Contract": "ケミストC契約書",
  "Hires a chemist that gives you free rage-drugs. Sweet.": "無料の興奮剤を提供する化学者を雇用する",
  "Chemist-D Contract": "ケミストD契約書",
  "Hires a chemist that helps you see in the dark.": "暗視を助ける化学者を雇用する",
  "Collector Contract": "Collector契約書",
  "Loves to hurl his balls at things until they crawl inside. Also provides a 2% fuel cost reduction and a useful ^green;Thorns effect.^reset;": "ボールを投げつけて中に入るまでやめない。燃料コスト2%削減と^green;棘の効果^reset;も提供",
  "Counsellor Contract": "カウンセラー契約書",
  "Counsellor are quite useful - they can keep madness at bay! They also provide 2% reduced fuel cost.": "カウンセラーは非常に便利 - 狂気を抑えてくれる！燃料コストも2%削減",
  "Ship Psychologist Contract": "船心理士契約書",
  "Mental health expert. Reduces madness effects up to 40%. Reduces fuel costs by 2%.": "メンタルヘルスの専門家。狂気効果を最大40%軽減。燃料コスト2%削減",
  "Ship Psychiatrist Contract": "船精神科医契約書",
  "Master brain-healer-guy. Reduces madness effects up to 65%. Reduces fuel costs by 2%.": "脳の治療マスター。狂気効果を最大65%軽減。燃料コスト2%削減",
  "Cultist Contract": "Cultist契約書",
  "Hires a flesh-hungry cultist. Increases max ship fuel by 150 and provides ^pink;Insanity Immunity^reset; and ^green;Moderate Poison Protection.^reset;": "肉に飢えたカルト信者を雇用する",
  "Cyborg Contract": "Cyborg契約書",
  "Hires a deadly cyborg. Increases ship speed by 1.25 and grants ^pink;Aether Immunity^reset;.": "致命的なサイボーグを雇用する",
  "Engineer Contract": "Engineer契約書",
  "Hires an engineer to increase ship speed by 3.75 and reduce fuel costs by 10%. Also provides special coffee.": "船速を3上昇させるエンジニアを雇用する",
  "Engineer II Contract": "エンジニアII契約書",
  "Provides 20% reduced fuel costs, and +3.75 ship speed. Also provides extra special coffee.": "燃料コスト20%削減、船速+3.75。特別なコーヒーも提供する",
  "Beeguy Contract": "Beeguy契約書",
  "BZZ BZZZ! BEE ENGINES PROVIDE 2 SHIP SPEED! ^yellow;BEES DON'T STING^reset;": "ブンブン！蜂エンジンは船速度2を提供！^yellow;蜂は刺さない^reset;",
  "Hunter Contract": "Hunter契約書",
  "Hires a hunter. Provides ^red;Burning^reset;, ^yellow;Proto-Poison^reset;, jungle and mud slow immmunities.": "hunterを雇用する",
  "Alpaca Contract": "Alpaca契約書",
  "Hires a tough Alpaca warrior.": "屈強なアルパカ戦士を雇用する",
  "Gas Specialist Contract": "ガススペシャリスト契約書",
  "Hires a gas specialist to boost max ship fuel by 200 and grant ^pink;Gas Immunity^reset;.": "最大燃料を200増加し^pink;ガス耐性^reset;を付与するガススペシャリストを雇用する",
  "Geologist Contract": "Geologist契約書",
  "Sells useful resources.": "有用な資源を販売する",
  "Ghostbuster Contract": "ゴーストバスター契約書",
  "Hires a Ghostbuster. Provides ^yellow;Immunity to Ghosts^reset;, and increases your ship's fuel capacity by 340.": "ゴーストバスターを雇用する",
  "Guardian Contract": "Guardian契約書",
  "Impressive defensive crewmate. Provides a massive ^green;Defense Boost^reset; and 5% increased fuel efficiency.": "印象的な防御クルー。大幅な^green;防御強化^reset;と5%の燃費向上を提供",
  "Hobo Contract": "Hobo契約書",
  "Hires... a homeless guy that pukes on things. Increases max fuel by 250, but constantly makes you drunk.": "雇用…物に嘔吐するホームレス。最大燃料250増加だが常に酔わされる",
  "Custodian Contract": "Custodian契約書",
  "Has a mop. Sweeps.": "モップ持ち。掃除する",
  "Kirhosi Hacker Contract": "キルホシハッカー契約書",
  "Hire a Kirhosi Hacker on the run from the law, to increase ship speed by 3.75, grant ^yellow;30% Electric resistance^reset; and ^yellow;protection from electrical storms^reset;.": "法から逃亡中のキルホシハッカーを雇用。船速度3.75増加、^yellow;電気耐性30%^reset;と^yellow;電気嵐保護^reset;を付与",
  "Magical Girl Contract": "マジカルガール契約書",
  "A magic girl with a staff. Provides ^pink;Shadow Taint and Caliginous Gas Immunity^reset;, and 5% reduced fuel costs.": "杖を持った魔法少女。^pink;影の汚染と暗黒ガス免疫^reset;を提供し、燃料コスト5%削減",
  "Mechanic Contract": "Mechanic契約書",
  "Hires a mechanic to ^cyan;reduce fuel costs by 10%^reset;. Also provides special coffee.": "^cyan;燃料コストを10%削減^reset;するメカニックを雇用する",
  "Mechanic II Contract": "メカニックII契約書",
  "Reduces fuel costs by 20%. Also provides extra special coffee.": "燃料コスト20%削減。特別なコーヒーも提供",
  "Medic Contract": "Medic契約書",
  "Hires a basic medic to help keep you alive and kicking.": "生存を助ける基本メディックを雇用する",
  "Medic Contract II": "Medic契約書 II",
  "Hires a trained medic to help keep you alive and kicking.": "生存を助ける訓練されたメディックを雇用する",
  "80s Metalhead Contract": "80年代メタルヘッド契約書",
  "Dude. 4% reduced fuel costs. Rock on.": "やぁ。燃料コスト4%削減。ロックだぜ",
  "Oceanographer Contract": "海洋学者契約書",
  "Hires an Oceanographer to help you swim much faster, and provides ^cyan;Lava^reset; and ^cyan;Liquid Nitrogen^reset; immunity.": "泳ぎを大幅に速くし^cyan;溶岩^reset;と^cyan;液体窒素^reset;耐性を付与する海洋学者を雇用する",
  "Outlaw Contract": "Outlaw契約書",
  "Hires a ruthless outlaw companion.": "冷酷な無法者の仲間を雇用する",
  "PLUR Contract": "PLUR契約書",
  "The danciest companion in the universe, with booze and 4% reduced fuel costs.": "宇宙一踊る仲間。酒と燃料コスト4%削減付き",
  "Precursor Drone Control Chip": "プリカーサードローンコントロールチップ",
  "The control chip for a Precursor Drone, able to increase fuel efficiency by ^green;10%^reset;, protect you with ^cyan;30% Shadow resistance^reset; and ^pink;Shadow Taint immunity^reset;, and grant ^green;+3 passive research^reset;.": "プリカーサードローンの制御チップ。燃費^green;10%^reset;向上、^cyan;影耐性30%^reset;と^pink;影の汚染免疫^reset;を付与し、^green;パッシブリサーチ+3^reset;を提供",
  "X'ian Explorer Contract": "シーアン探検家契約書",
  "Hires a unique, powerful crew member that provides a 20% reduction to fuel costs and ^yellow;Extreme Radiation Immunity^reset;": "燃料コスト20%削減と^yellow;極度放射線耐性^reset;を付与する強力なクルーを雇用する",
  "Researcher Contract": "研究者契約書",
  "Hires a field researcher to take notes on the worlds you explore. ^cyan;+1 passive research^reset; - ^red;doesn't stack^reset;.": "探検する世界の記録を取る現地研究者を雇用する",
  "Drug Specialist Contract": "薬物スペシャリスト契約書",
  "Hires a drug specialist to increase jump height and speed, and reduces your ship's fuel costs by 5%.": "ジャンプ高度と速度を上昇させ燃料コストを5%削減する薬物スペシャリストを雇用する",
  "Scuba Contract": "Scuba契約書",
  "Hires a Marine Biologist to help you swim faster.": "泳ぎを速くする海洋生物学者を雇用する",
  "Assassin Contract": "Assassin契約書",
  "Hires a deadly assassin. Grants ^green;Poisoned and Bio Ooze Immunity^reset;, and 160 ship maximum fuel.": "致命的な暗殺者を雇用する",
  "Tailor Contract": "Tailor契約書",
  "Hires a tailor to keep your crew looking great.": "クルーの見た目を整えるテーラーを雇用する",
  "Volcanologist Contract": "火山学者契約書",
  "Hires a volcanologist to provide ^red;30% Fire resistance^reset;.": "^red;炎耐性30%^reset;を付与する火山学者を雇用する",
  "Warrior Contract": "ウォーリアー契約書",
  "Hires an inexperienced warrior to fight alongside you.": "共に戦う未熟な戦士を雇用する",
  "Veteran Contract": "Veteran契約書",
  "Hires an experienced warrior to fight alongside you.": "共に戦う経験豊富な戦士を雇用する",
  "General Contract": "General契約書",
  "Hires a hardened general to fight at your side.": "あなたの側で戦う歴戦の将軍を雇用する",
  "Pro Fishing Rod": "プロフィッシングロッド",
  "A pro-level rod with long line length and fast reeling time. Also durable.": "長い糸と高速巻き上げのプロ仕様ロッド。耐久性も高い",
  "Shining, shimmering splendour": "輝く、きらめく光彩",
  "Ghost Lantern": "Ghostランタン",
  "Said to repel moon ghosts and punish those who harm you.": "月の幽霊を退け、あなたを傷つける者を罰するという",
  "Khe's Ghost Lantern": "Khe'sGhostランタン",
  "It's covered in what appears to be drool, and rustles when you shake it.": "よだれのようなもので覆われ、振るとガサガサ音がする",
  "Tacti-Cool Mug": "タクティクールマグ",
  "Infinite Beer + Flashlight. What could be better?": "無限ビール + 懐中電灯。これ以上何を望む？",
  "Fossil Hammer": "Fossilハンマー",
  "Not at all precise, but smacks stone well!": "全く精密ではないが、石をよく叩く！",
  "Microparticle Brush": "マイクロパーティクルブラシ",
  "Impossibly precise.": "不可能なほど精密",
  "Hookshot": "フックショット",
  "Launch Hookshot": "ランチフックショット",
  "You cheated to get this. You're a butthole.": "チートで入手したな。このケツの穴め",
  "Precursor Hookshot": "プリカーサーフックショット",
  "Be careful not to get whiplash.": "むち打ちに注意",
  "Elder Hook": "エルダーフック",
  "A grappling hook dripping with...stuff. Has strange properties.": "何かが滴るグラップリングフック。奇妙な特性を持つ",
  "Ice Axe": "アイスアックス",
  "Useful for extremely short-ranged grappling. Survival tool. Can also do 5 damage.": "超近距離グラップリングに有用。サバイバルツール。5ダメージも可能",
  "Bloodhook": "ブラッドフック",
  "Short-ranged grapple. ^red;Regenerates health^reset; when attached. Improves healing.": "近距離グラップル。接続時^red;体力再生^reset;。回復効果向上",
  "Lasher Hook": "Lasherフック",
  "Zip through the air like a boss, and slice foes too! Weighted.": "ボスのように空中を飛び回り、敵も切り刻む！加重あり",
  "A more advanced lasher hook that also deals more damage. Weighted.": "より多くのダメージも与える。重量型の高性能ラッシャーフック",
  "Lasher Hook II": "Lasherフック II",
  "X'ian Grapple Vine": "シーアングラップルツタ",
  "A useful genetic trick of the X'i.": "シーの有用な遺伝的トリック",
  "Used for making messes on the ceiling.": "天井を汚すのに使われる",
  "Dark Slime Hook": "ダークスライムフック",
  "Slime Hook": "スライムフック",
  "Purple Slime Hook": "紫スライムフック",
  "Nano-Tether": "ナノテザー",
  "An amazing grappler. Use carefully, as it is ^orange;very^reset; fast.": "すごいグラップラー。^orange;非常に^reset;速いので注意",
  "An amazing grappler that ^orange;regenerates your energy^reset; when extended.": "展開時に^orange;エネルギーを回復する^reset;すばらしいグラップラー",
  "Energy Tether": "エネルギーテザー",
  "Shadow Line": "シャドウライン",
  "Siphons light and ^orange;converts it to food^reset; when extended.": "展開時に光を吸収して^orange;食料に変換^reset;する",
  "Web Shooter": "ウェブシューター",
  "Well, that's pretty useful. And a bit horrifying. Weighted.": "かなり便利。そしてちょっと恐ろしい。加重あり",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Miniknog^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークミニノグ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Miniknog Stronghold^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nTropical Humidity\nExtreme Poison\nExtreme Maddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークミニノグ要塞^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n熱帯湿度\n極度の毒\n極度の狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Sovereign^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークソヴリン^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Sovereign Temple^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nImpossibly Acidic Atmosphere\nDeadly Desert Heat\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークソヴリン神殿^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n超酸性大気\n致命的な砂漠の熱\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Bronze Arena^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ブロンズアリーナ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Bronze Arena^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nUnyielding Madness": "^orange;ブロンズアリーナ^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n不屈の狂気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Silver Arena^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;シルバーアリーナ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Silver Arena^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nUnyielding Madness": "^orange;シルバーアリーナ^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n不屈の狂気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Gold Arena^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ゴールドアリーナ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Gold Arena^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nUnyielding Madness": "^orange;ゴールドアリーナ^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n不屈の狂気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Hunting^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークハンティング^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;the Dark Hunting Grounds^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nTropical Humidity\nExtreme Heat\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークハンティンググラウンド^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n熱帯湿度\n極度の熱\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Cave^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークケイヴ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Cave Dungeon^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークケイブダンジョン^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Keep^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークキープ^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Glitch Keep^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nExtreme Electrical Storms\nExtreme Radiation\nExtreme Aetheric Atmosphere\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークグリッチキープ^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n極度の電気嵐\n極度の放射線\n極度のエーテル大気\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Erchius^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークエルキウス^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Erchius Mining Facility^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークエルキウス採掘施設^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Library^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークライブラリー^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Pagoda Library^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nExtreme Cold\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークパゴダ図書館^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n極度の冷気\n狂気の大気",
  "Beacon: ^orange;Dark Precursor^reset;": "ビーコン: ^orange;ダークプリカーサー^reset;",
  "Teleports the user to the ^orange;Dark Precursor Ruins^reset; in the Nightmare World.\n^red;Environmental Hazards^reset;:\nExtreme Electrical Storms\nExtreme Radiation\nMaddening Atmosphere": "^orange;ダークプリカーサー遺跡^reset;（ナイトメアワールド）にテレポート\n^red;環境ハザード^reset;:\n極度の電気嵐\n極度の放射線\n狂気の大気",
  "Crystalline Skull": "クリスタリンスカル",
  "This mysterious skull leads you to the site of your most recent demise. ^green;[ Hold Button ]^reset; to teleport. Will consume skull.": "この謎の頭蓋骨は最も最近の死亡地点へ導く。^green;[ボタン長押し]^reset;でテレポート。頭蓋骨は消費される",
  "Monster Field Guide": "モンスターフィールドガイド",
  "^green;[Arrow Keys] - Navigate options, [Space or Enter] - Select options^reset;": "^green;[矢印キー] - 選択肢を移動、[スペースまたはEnter] - 選択^reset;",
  "X'ian Floatbulb": "シーのフロートバルブ",
  "Open to gently float while falling.": "開くと落下中に穏やかに浮遊する",
