  "Activate to deploy the stored bot.": "起動して格納されたボットを展開",
  "Dimensional Siphon": "次元サイフォン",
  "Box of Confiscated Weapons": "没収武器の箱",
  "A box of guns confiscated from a gun-running sting operation. It's not like they need them anymore.": "銃密売おとり捜査で没収された銃の箱。もう必要ないだろう",
  "Box of Contraband Ores": "禁制鉱石の箱",
  "A box of ores seized from a raid on an illegal Novakid asteroid mine. You can have the surplus.": "違法なノヴァキッド小惑星鉱山の摘発で押収された鉱石の箱。余剰分はあなたに",
  "Illicit Research Disk": "違法な研究ディスク",
  "A data disk containing research seized from an illegal Miniknog blacksite. You can put it to better use. Maybe.": "違法なミニクノグ秘密施設から押収された研究データディスク。もっと良い使い道があるかも",
  "Superior Bug Net": "上級虫取り網",
  "A net for catching bugs! Faster than the wooden one, with less delay!": "虫を捕まえる網！木製のものより速く、遅延も少ない！",
  "10k Voxel (EZ)": "10kボクセル（EZ）",
  "10000 pixels compressed into a voxel. Now with easy decompress.": "10000ピクセルをボクセルに圧縮。簡単解凍機能付き",
