  "2000 pixels compressed into a voxel. Now with easy decompress.": "2000ピクセルをボクセルに圧縮。簡単解凍機能付き",
  "5k Voxel (EZ)": "5kボクセル（EZ）",
  "5000 pixels compressed into a voxel. Now with easy decompress.": "5000ピクセルをボクセルに圧縮。簡単解凍機能付き",
  "Portable Music Player": "ポータブルミュージックプレイヤー",
  "^cyan;Primary^reset;: Plays the selected music\n^yellow;Secondary^reset;: Resets the background music": "^cyan;メイン^reset;: 選択した曲を再生\n^yellow;サブ^reset;: BGMをリセット",
  "This feels both firm and squishy to the touch. What could it be?": "触ると硬くもあり柔らかくもある。何だろう？",
  "Bag of Oranges": "オレンジの袋",
  "It's quite heavy, must be a lot of oranges!": "かなり重い、オレンジがたくさん入っているに違いない！",
  "'Perfect Outfit' Box": "「完璧な衣装」ボックス",
  "A box from Khe containing 'the most perfect outfit ever'. Looks suspiciously empty.": "ケーからの箱、「史上最も完璧な衣装」入り。怪しいほど空っぽに見える",
  "Space-Time Crystal": "スペースタイムクリスタル",
  "Broken off from a Space-Time Obelisk. Use to open its trans-dimensional storage.": "時空のオベリスクから折れた破片。超次元収納を開くのに使用",
  "^cyan;Default Unlock Checker^reset;": "^cyan;デフォルトアンロックチェッカー^reset;",
  "Use to check if you have any missing default unlocks. Prints items that could be causing the issue to the log.": "デフォルトアンロックの欠落を確認するために使用。問題の原因となるアイテムをログに出力",
  "Loot Box": "ルートボックス",
  "Click a gift box to select reward category.": "ギフトボックスをクリックして報酬カテゴリを選択",
  "Material Mod Placer": "素材モッド配置ツール",
  "^cyan;Primary^reset;: Place Foreground\n^yellow;Secondary^reset;: Place Background\n^cyan;Shift + Primary^reset;: Select Mod\n^yellow;Shift + Secondary^reset;: Change Mode": "^cyan;メイン^reset;: 前景に配置\n^yellow;サブ^reset;: 背景に配置\n^cyan;Shift + メイン^reset;: モッド選択\n^yellow;Shift + サブ^reset;: モード変更",
  "Monster Detector": "モンスターディテクター",
  "Reveals nearby monsters.": "近くのモンスターを表示する",
  "Monster Inspector": "モンスターインスペクター",
  "Inspects monsters.": "モンスターを調査する",
  "Transmutation Matrix": "変成マトリクス",
  "A single use kit for upgrading a single piece of equipment.": "装備1つをアップグレードする使い捨てキット",
  "Gyrostabilizer": "ジャイロスタビライザー",
  "Capable of stopping inertia completely for a brief moment.": "一瞬だけ慣性を完全に止められる",
  "Harvester Beamgun": "ハーベスタービームガン",
  "Left-click: quick harvest of crops/flowers/trees.\nRight-click: till soil": "左クリック: 作物/花/木を素早く収穫\n右クリック: 土を耕す",
  "Harvester Beamgun II": "ハーベスタービームガン II",
  "Harvester Beamgun III": "ハーベスタービームガン III",
  "Object Data Sensor": "オブジェクトデータセンサー",
  "[Equip] Detects placement points of nearby objects.\n[Primary] Show Colony Tags.": "[装備] 近くのオブジェクトの配置ポイントを検出\n[メイン] コロニータグを表示",
  "A Beach Photograph": "ビーチの写真",
  "A picture of you on a beach, dated 600 years ago. On the horizon, a misty figure stands. It emanates cold malice.": "600年前の日付が入ったビーチでのあなたの写真。水平線に霧の人影が立つ。冷たい悪意を放っている",
  "A book that pairs a sapient being with a random mythological creature.": "知的存在とランダムな神話の生き物を組み合わせる本",
  "Bizarre Erotica": "奇妙なエロティカ",
  "Bizarre Fiction": "奇妙なフィクション",
  "Weird fiction that is completely bonkers.": "完全にイカれた奇妙なフィクション",
  "Blinding Envelope": "目くらましの封筒",
  "Any time you glance at it, you are blinded for a moment.": "一瞬見るだけで目がくらむ",
  "Blood Ritual": "血の儀式",
  "Channel the Old Ones thoughts into your mind.": "旧き者の思考を心に流し込む",
  "A Bloody Finger": "血まみれの指",
  "It looks identical to your index finger.": "あなたの人差し指とそっくりだ",
  "All About Bees": "蜂のすべて",
  "This is the Bee Movie script. Over and over again.": "ビームービーの脚本。延々と繰り返される",
  "Stench Candle": "Stenchキャンドル",
  "Smells exactly like corpses, and your grandfathers house.": "死体と祖父の家のような匂いがする",
  "Strange Carving": "奇妙な彫刻",
  "This symbol tingles your memories, but you can't quite place where you've seen it.": "この記号は記憶をくすぐるが、どこで見たか思い出せない",
  "A Chipotle Coupon (2 for $24.99)": "チポトレのクーポン（2個で$24.99）",
  "The fact that this place still exists is maddening.": "この場所がまだ存在するという事実が狂気を誘う",
  "A Comb": "Aコム",
  "This comb exudes unimaginable menace.": "このコムは想像を絶する脅威を放つ",
  "Crayon of Lies": "嘘のクレヨン",
  "Anything written or drawn with it is a lie.": "これで書いたり描いたりしたものは全て嘘になる",
  "Odd Glyph": "奇妙なグリフ",
  "A strange language is carved around the edge of this disk, whispering into your mind.": "奇妙な言語がディスクの縁に刻まれ心に囁きかける",
  "Impossible Theories": "不可能な理論",
  "Flying in the face of reason, this book of your theories is utterly insane.": "理性に逆らい、この理論書は完全に狂っている",
  "Insane Notes": "狂気のメモ",
  "Your lab notes. Thoroughly nutters.": "あなたのラボノート。完全にイカれている",
  "A law book that encourages committing arson.": "放火を奨励する法律書",
  "Law and Order": "法と秩序",
  "Unimaginable Equations": "想像を超えた方程式",
  "This math is so outlandish as to be offensive. It's also *right*.": "この数学は不快なほど奇抜だ。そして*正しい*",
  "Creepy Mask": "Creepyマスク",
  "This unsettling mask it eerily cheery. It gazes back.": "この不穏なマスクは不気味に陽気だ。こちらを見返してくる",
  "Strange Glyph": "奇妙なグリフ",
  "Unknown Artifact": "未知のアーティファクト",
  "You have no idea what deity these markings praise, but it isn't pretty.": "この刻印がどの神を讃えているか不明だが、良いものではない",
  "Glowing Glyph": "発光グリフ",
  "Crackling with horrible energy and malign promise. Edible.": "恐ろしいエネルギーと邪悪な約束でパチパチしている。食用",
  "Forgotten Knowledge": "忘れられた知識",
  "Strange experiments long forgotten, involving bizarre devices and theories.": "奇妙な装置と理論を含む忘れ去られた実験の記録",
  "Strange Statue": "Strange像",
  "The angles of this carving are all wrong, making you violently hallucinate.": "この彫刻の角度は全て間違っており、激しい幻覚を引き起こす",
  "Map of the Dreamlands": "夢の国の地図",
  "Gazing at this hurts your brain.": "これを見つめると脳が痛む",
  "Mirror of Vision": "視覚の鏡",
  "Reflects only things you hate.": "嫌いなものだけを映し出す",
  "Confusing Dust": "Confusingダスト",
  "A mote of dust that just won't stop following you.": "付いてくるのをやめない塵の粒子",
  "Mysterious Parcel": "謎の小包",
  "Post-marked directly to you at your current location. No return-to-sender. ^red;Origin unknown^reset;.": "現在地に直接宛てられた消印。差出人返送なし。^red;出所不明^reset;",
  "A Sharpened Mouse": "研がれたネズミ",
  "A rather unusual choice in weaponry.": "かなり珍しい武器の選択",
  "Stick of Truth": "真実の棒",
  "A mere glance at this compels you to be truthful.": "一瞥するだけで真実を語らずにはいられなくなる",
  "A Terracotta Bust": "テラコッタの胸像",
  "Whatever being this represents is unknown, but it chills you.": "何の存在を表しているか不明だが、寒気がする",
  "Three Coins": "3枚のコイン",
  "No matter how much you try, they cannot be spent.": "どんなに試しても使うことができない",
  "A Good Luck Tonsil": "幸運の扁桃腺",
  "So long as you hold this, the deceased have great luck.": "これを持っている限り、死者に大きな幸運がある",
  "Undulating Meat": "うねる肉",
  "This unusual meat never rots and constantly undulates in fear.": "この珍しい肉は決して腐らず、恐怖で常にうねっている",
  "Universal Parking": "ユニバーサルパーキング",
  "Unlimited parking. For a different universe than this one.": "無制限駐車。この宇宙とは別の宇宙用",
  "Vile Conch": "邪悪な法螺貝",
  "Listening to this shell reveals abhorrent secrets in vile whispers.": "この貝殻に耳を当てると忌まわしい秘密が卑劣なささやきで明かされる",
  "Voynich Manuscript": "ヴォイニッチ手稿",
  "What does it mean? How can it be translated?": "何を意味する？どう翻訳できる？",
  "Whispering Crystal": "ウィスパリングクリスタル",
  "This unusual mineral formation keeps whispering your name, as if intimate with you.": "この珍しい鉱物は親しげにあなたの名前をささやき続ける",
  "Mech Tablet": "メカタブレット",
  "^cyan;Primary^reset;: Mech Assembly\n^yellow;Secondary^reset;: Mech Fuel": "^cyan;メイン^reset;: メカ組み立て\n^yellow;サブ^reset;: メカ燃料",
  "Multi-ore Detector": "マルチオアディテクター",
  "Ore Detector MKIIIk": "鉱石探知機 MKIIIk",
  "Emits pulses to analyse the composition of nearby minerals.\nModified.": "近くの鉱物の構成を分析する改良型パルスを放出する",
  "Your imagination has conjured up this artistic piece.": "あなたの想像力がこの芸術作品を生み出した",
  "Inspired Painting": "Inspired絵画",
  "Something feels off about this art...": "この芸術品には何か違和感がある…",
  "Open to gently float while falling. Upgrade using your ^orange;Tricorder^reset;.": "開いて落下中にゆっくり浮遊できる。^orange;トリコーダー^reset;でアップグレード可能",
  "Reverse Parasol": "逆さ傘",
  "Open to gently fall upwards while falling. Because screw physics.": "開くと落下中に穏やかに上に落ちる。物理法則なんて知らない",
  "Perpetual Accelerator": "Perpetualアクセラレーター",
  "Constantly applies increased movement so long as it is held.": "保持している間、常に移動速度が向上する",
  "Pocket Anchor": "ポケットアンカー",
  "When held, will weigh you down. Great to sink fast.": "持つと重くなる。素早く沈むのに最適",
  "Barracks Set Bundle": "バラックセットバンドル",
