  "Boreal Set Bundle": "ボレアルSetバンドル",
  "A complete set of ^green;Boreal^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^green;ボレアル^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
