  "Joja Set Bundle": "JojaSetバンドル",
  "A complete set of ^blue;Joja^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^blue;ジョジャ^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
