  "A complete set of ^green;Pristine^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^green;プリスティン^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
  "Protectorate Set Bundle": "プロテクトレートセットバンドル",
  "A complete set of ^green;Protectorate^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^green;プロテクトレート^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
  "Rococo Set Bundle": "ロココSetバンドル",
  "A complete set of ^green;Rococo^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^green;ロココ^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
  "Roman Set Bundle": "ローマンSetバンドル",
  "A complete set of ^green;Roman^white; themed furniture. ^green;A savings of 25%!^reset;": "^green;ローマン^white;テーマの家具フルセット。^green;25%お得！^reset;",
