  "Great Scion": "グレートサイオン",
  "A traditional Hylotl weapon of war.\n^cyan;Huge striking power. Cold edged^reset;.\n^green;Slowing Alt^reset;": "Hylotlの伝統的な戦争武器\n^cyan;強大な打撃力。冷気の刃^reset;\n^green;減速の副射撃^reset;",
