  "Obsidian Mace": "オブシディアンメイス",
  "Specially formed with Pharitu methods.": "ファリトゥの製法で特別に成形",
  "Penumbra Mace": "Penumbraメイス",
  "Potent and heavy. Serious impact damage.": "強力で重い。深刻な衝撃ダメージ",
  "Pyreite Mace": "パイライトメイス",
  "Masterful crafting, deadly edges.\n^cyan;Inflicts Napalm^reset;": "匠の技、致死の刃。\n^cyan;ナパームを付与^reset;",
  "Quantum Mace": "量子メイス",
  "Don't ask, because Science.": "聞くな、科学だから",
