  "Ion Rifle": "イオンライフル",
  "Reliable infantry weapon for anti-robot warfare.\n^yellow;Inflicts Electrified^reset;\n^green;Area-Denial Alt^reset;": "対ロボット戦用の信頼性の高い歩兵武器\n^yellow;感電を付与^reset;\n^green;範囲制圧副射撃^reset;",
