  "Even if you graze 'em, the radiation burn is deadly.\n^yellow;Inflicts radiation burn^reset;": "かすっただけでも放射線やけどは致命的\n^yellow;放射線やけどを付与^reset;",
  "Pyre Vulcan": "パイアバルカン",
