  "Ice Slime Whip": "Iceスライムムチ",
  "A whip made of sticky, cold slime.": "粘着質で冷たいスライム製のムチ",
  "Ice Slime Whip II": "アイススライムムチ II",
  "Ice Slime Whip III": "アイススライムムチ III",
  "Irradium Whip": "イラジウムウィップ",
  "A whip coated in irradium. Rad.\n^cyan;Inflicts Radiation Burn^reset;": "イラジウムでコーティングされた鞭。イカす\n^cyan;放射線やけどを付与^reset;",
  "Isogen Whip": "アイソゲンウィップ",
  "Hit 'em with the snap freeze.\n^cyan;Inflicts Freezing^reset;": "瞬間冷凍の一撃をお見舞いしろ\n^cyan;凍結を付与^reset;",
  "Lasher Whip": "Lasherムチ",
  "Made from a Lasher plant.": "ラッシャープラントで作られている",
  "Lunari Whip": "ルナリウィップ",
  "A cool whip fashioned from crystal. Put your enemies on ice!\n^cyan;Inflicts Slow^reset;": "クリスタルから作られたクールな鞭。敵を氷漬けにせよ！\n^cyan;減速を付与^reset;",
  "Penumbrite Chain Knife": "ペナンブライトChainナイフ",
  "A chain knife fashioned from penumbrite, also makes a great glowstick.": "ペナンブライトで作ったチェーンナイフ、グロースティックとしても優秀",
  "Concealed Poison Slime Whip": "隠しポイズンスライムムチ",
  "A concealed whip made of sticky, poisonous slime.": "粘着質で有毒なスライム製の隠しムチ",
  "Poison Slime Whip": "ポイズンスライムムチ",
  "A whip made of sticky, poisonous slime.": "粘着質で有毒なスライム製のムチ",
  "Poison Slime Whip II": "ポイズンスライムムチ II",
  "Poison Slime Whip III": "ポイズンスライムムチ III",
  "Pyreite Whip": "パイリートウィップ",
  "There is no whip hotter than this. Take that as you will.\n^cyan;Inflicts Napalm^reset;": "これ以上熱い鞭はない。ご自由にどうぞ\n^cyan;ナパームを付与^reset;",
  "Silver Whip": "シルバーウィップ",
  "Vanquish monsters with stylish silver!\n^cyan;Able to damage all elements equally^reset;": "スタイリッシュな銀でモンスターを退治せよ！\n^cyan;全属性に均等なダメージが可能^reset;",
  "Concealed Slime Whip": "隠しスライムムチ",
  "A concealed whip made of sticky slime.": "粘着スライム製の隠しムチ",
  "Slime Whip": "スライムムチ",
  "A whip made of sticky slime.": "粘着スライム製のムチ",
  "Slime Whip II": "スライムムチ II",
  "Slime Whip III": "スライムムチ III",
  "Stinger Whip": "Stingerムチ",
  "Real jellyfish aren't electric, but this bad boy sure is. Deals great damage at the tip.": "本物のクラゲは電気じゃないが、こいつは違う。先端で大ダメージ",
  "Telebrium Whip": "テレブリウムムチ",
  "A poisonous lash made from telebrium. Not for recreational use.": "テレブリウム製の有毒な鞭。娯楽目的の使用不可",
  "Trianglium Whip": "トライアングリウムウィップ",
  "Trianglium shards gravitated into a whip. Don't ask, just whip.\n^cyan;Shoots radioactive exploding shards^reset;": "トライアングリウムの破片が鞭に集まった。聞くな、振れ\n^cyan;放射性の爆発破片を射出^reset;",
  "Cosmic Blade-lash": "コズミックブレードラッシュ",
  "Opens cosmic rifts to summon stabby blades.\n^cyan;Inflicts Minor Vulnerability^reset;": "宇宙の裂け目を開いて刺突する刃を召喚する\n^cyan;軽度の脆弱性を付与^reset;",
  "Zerchesium Whip": "ゼルケシウムムチ",
  "A whip with an ice cold tip. Swings with a zip.": "氷のように冷たい先端のムチ。素早く振るう",
  "Codex Logbook": "コーデックスログブック",
  "Use this to open your logbook.": "ログブックを開くのに使用",
  "Acid EPP": "酸EPP",
  "+10% Phys. Resist. Immune: Acid. Helpful on ^red;Sulphuric^reset; planets. +250s oxygen and halves how quickly you breathe.": "+10%物理耐性。耐性: 酸。^red;硫黄^reset;惑星で有効。+250s酸素、呼吸速度半減",
  "ArCon Protector": "アーコンプロテクター",
  "+25% Cosmic Resist. Immune: Acid, Oxygen. Helpful on ^red;Aether^reset; planets.": "+25%コズミック耐性。耐性: 酸、酸素。^red;エーテル^reset;惑星で有効",
  "It's incredible how lifelike these wings are. The added energy and health is nice, too.": "信じられないほど本物そっくりな翼。エネルギーとヘルスの追加も嬉しい",
  "This cape was designed to swish dramatically as the wearer enters a room. +25 Health.": "部屋に入った時にドラマチックになびくようデザインされたケープ。+25ヘルス",
  "So that you always look energised! +25 Energy.": "いつでもエネルギッシュに見せるために！ +25エネルギー",
  "Battle Pack": "Battleパック",
  "Damage x1.1. +4 Health, +4 Energy, +4 Shield Bash.": "ダメージx1.1。+4体力、+4エネルギー、+4シールドバッシュ",
  "Battle Pack II": "Battleパック II",
  "Damage x1.15. +7 Health, +7 Energy, +7 Shield Bash.": "ダメージx1.15。+7体力、+7エネルギー、+7シールドバッシュ",
  "Battle Pack III": "Battleパック III",
  "Damage x1.20. +16 Health, +16 Energy, +10 Shield Bash.": "ダメージx1.20。+16体力、+16エネルギー、+10シールドバッシュ",
  "Equip these gilded, batlike wings and become the stuff of nightmares! Gain slower falls.": "この金色のコウモリの翼を装備して、悪夢のような存在になろう！落下速度が低下",
  "Imposing wings, made from sharp blades shaped like feathers. +5% Crit Chance.": "羽の形をした鋭い刃で作られた威圧的な翼。+5% クリティカル率",
  "A portable boiler, powered by movement. +^green;12^reset;% Ice Resist.": "動きで発熱する携帯式ボイラー。+^green;12^reset;% 氷耐性",
  "Certainly the only thing spookier than a skeleton is a flying one! +^green;5^reset;% Phys. Resist.": "骸骨より怖いものがあるとすれば、空飛ぶ骸骨に違いない！ +^green;5^reset;% 物理耐性",
  "Heating EPP": "加熱EPP",
  "+20% Ice Resist. Useful on ^cyan;mildly cold^reset; planets.": "+20%氷結耐性。^cyan;やや寒い^reset;惑星で役立つ",
  "Heating EPP II": "加温EPP II",
  "+40% Ice Resist. Useful on ^orange;moderately cold^reset; planets. +150s oxygen and halves how quickly you breathe.": "+40%氷耐性。^orange;やや寒い^reset;惑星で有効。+150s酸素、呼吸速度半減",
  "Heating EPP III": "加温EPP III",
  "+60% Ice Resist. Useful on ^red;extremely cold^reset; planets. Provides air.": "+60%氷耐性。^red;極度に寒い^reset;惑星で有効。空気を供給",
  "A shiny crystal that can be worn on your back. Very stylish. +^green;15^reset;% Cosmic Resist.": "背中に装備できる輝くクリスタル。とてもスタイリッシュ。+^green;15^reset;% コズミック耐性",
  "Cute Wings": "キュートウィング",
  "A cute pair of glowing wings.": "光り輝くかわいい翼。",
  "A dangerous barrel. Try not to have a wardrobe malfunction. +^green;15^reset;% Fire Resist.": "危険なバレル。ポロリしないよう気をつけて。+^green;15^reset;% 火炎耐性",
  "These dark wings look imposing and sinister. +20% Power": "この黒い翼は威圧的で不吉な外見。+20% パワー",
  "Diamond Lantern": "ダイヤモンドランタン",
  "A diamond lantern. Refracts light for high brightness.": "ダイヤモンドのランタン。光を屈折させて高輝度を実現する。",
  "Erchius Buddy": "エルキウスバディ",
  "Provides an ^orange;air supply^reset;, ^cyan;Ghost Immunity^reset; and a ^#b72ebc;purple glow^reset;. ^red;Reduces defense by 10^reset;.": "^orange;空気供給^reset;、^cyan;ゴースト耐性^reset;、^#b72ebc;紫の光^reset;を提供。^red;防御-10^reset;",
  "Erchius Bro": "エルキウスブロ",
  "Provides an ^orange;air supply^reset;, ^cyan;Ghost Immunity^reset; and a ^#b72ebc;bright purple glow^reset;. No penalty.": "^orange;空気供給^reset;、^cyan;ゴースト耐性^reset;、^#b72ebc;明るい紫の光^reset;を提供。ペナルティなし",
  "Black Erchius Buddy": "ブラックエルキウスバディ",
  "Provides an ^orange;air supply^reset;, ^cyan;Ghost Immunity^reset; and a ^#00aa00;green glow^reset;. No penalty.": "^orange;空気供給^reset;、^cyan;ゴースト耐性^reset;、^#00aa00;緑の光^reset;を提供。ペナルティなし",
  "Erithian Energy Pack": "Erithianエネルギーパック",
  "This lovely piece of gear grants: Energy x1.1, +10% E. Regen, -5% E. Block, protection from electrical storms and a slight ^#00aa00;glow^reset;.": "この素敵な装備: エネルギー x1.1、E.リジェネ+10%、E.ブロック-5%、電気保護",
  "An ancient cape made from a mysterious glimmering material. +12% Crit Damage": "かすかに光る不思議な素材で作られた古代のケープ。+12% クリティカルダメージ",
  "These dark wings look imposing and sinister. +10% Power": "この黒い翼は威圧的で不吉な外見。+10% パワー",
  "Field Generator": "フィールド発電機",
  "Protects you from extreme heat/cold/radiation, proto-poison and electric storms. +25% to Fire, Ice and Radiation Resist.": "極度の熱/冷気/放射線、プロト毒、電気嵐から保護。火炎・氷結・放射線耐性+25%",
  "Flexx Cape": "Flexxケープ",
  "Built of extra-resistant fibres that block kinetic force. +^green;15^reset;% Phys. Resist.": "運動力を遮断する超耐性繊維製。物理耐性+^green;15^reset;%",
  "Fallen Wings": "Fallenウイング",
  "Black, like your soul. +25% Shadow Resist, +15 Health/Energy.": "あなたの魂のように黒い。+25%暗影耐性、+15体力/エネルギー",
  "Burning Wings": "燃焼ウイング",
  "Rise like the phoenix. +30% Fire Resist, +15 Health/Energy": "不死鳥のように蘇れ。+30%火炎耐性、+15体力/エネルギー",
  "Icarus Wings": "Icarusウイング",
  "Beware the sun. Increases Energy and Health by +50": "太陽に注意。エネルギーと体力を+50増加",
  "Meteor Shell": "メテオシェル",
  "Provides a Fall Damage Multiplier based on fall speed, scaling to ^green;0.0^reset;x at 200 Units per second.": "落下速度に応じた落下ダメージ倍率を付与し、毎秒200ユニットで^green;0.0^reset;倍にまで軽減する。",
  "Type-S Survival Pack": "Type-Sサバイバルパック",
  "Grants +15% Health, +5% Energy, and a mild glow. Prevents proto-poison and blocks effects of electrical storms.": "+15%体力、+5%エネルギー、微弱な光を付与。プロト毒を防ぎ、電気嵐の効果を遮断",
  "A pump that has been modified to drain your blood at a slower rate than your body can replace it. ^red;Health x0.95^reset;.": "体が補充できるより遅い速度で血を抜くよう改造されたポンプ。^red;体力x0.95^reset;",
  "Blood Drainer": "ブラッドドレイナー",
  "A water pump that can be worn on your back.": "背中に装着できるウォーターポンプ",
  "Portable Water Pump": "ポータブルウォーターポンプ",
  "Precursor Beer Generator": "プリカーサーBeer発電機",
  "Generates an infinite amount of beer.": "無限のビールを生成する",
  "Blue Guardian Wings": "ブルーガーディアンウイング",
  "These ancient crystals hum with energy. They release a gentle, healing light and slow your descent.": "古代のクリスタルがエネルギーで唸る。穏やかな癒しの光を放ち降下を減速",
  "Green Guardian Wings": "グリーンガーディアンウイング",
  "These ancient crystals hum with energy. They release a gentle, healing light.": "この古代のクリスタルはエネルギーで唸る。穏やかな癒しの光を放つ",
  "Pink Guardian Wings": "ピンクガーディアンウイング",
  "Yellow Guardian Wings": "イエローガーディアンウイング",
  "Cooling EPP": "冷却EPP",
  "+20% Fire Resist. Helpful on ^cyan;mildly hot^reset; planets.": "+20%火炎耐性。^cyan;やや暑い^reset;惑星で役立つ",
  "Cooling EPP II": "冷却EPP II",
  "+40% Fire Resist. Helpful on ^orange;moderately hot^reset; planets. +150s oxygen and halves how quickly you breathe.": "+40%炎耐性。^orange;やや暑い^reset;惑星で有効。+150s酸素、呼吸速度半減",
  "Cooling EPP III": "冷却EPP III",
  "+60% Fire Resist and Burning Immunity. Helpful on ^red;extremely hot^reset; planets. Provides air.": "+60%炎耐性と燃焼耐性。^red;極度に暑い^reset;惑星で有効。空気を供給",
  "Invisible Backpack": "Invisibleバックパック",
  "Hide those ugly EPPs with this handy item!": "この便利なアイテムで醜いEPPを隠せ！",
  "Thermal Shell": "サーマルシェル",
  "Immune: Moderate Heat/Cold, Lava, Burning. +^green;20^reset;% Ice and Fire Resist.": "免疫: 中程度の暑さ/寒さ、溶岩、燃焼。+^green;20^reset;% 氷・炎耐性",
  "Plasma Light Pack": "プラズマライトパック",
  "A very bright portable plasma powered device. Cool yet practical.\n^cyan;Immune^reset;: Pressure, Oxygen": "非常に明るいプラズマ動力の携帯装置。クールかつ実用的。\n^cyan;免疫^reset;: 気圧、酸素",
  "Provides light while leaving your hands free. An essential accessory for adventuring!": "両手を自由にしたまま照明を確保。冒険の必需品！",
  "Antimatter Energy Pack": "アンチマターエネルギーパック",
  "An advanced energy pack. Blocks electrical storms. Energy x1.2, +30% E. Regen, -15% E. Block, and a slight ^#b72ebc;glow^reset;.": "高性能エネルギーパック。電気嵐を遮断。エネルギーx1.2、+30%E回復、-15%Eブロック、微弱な^#b72ebc;光^reset;",
  "Core Pack": "Coreパック",
  "A very basic tank which provides ^yellow;60s^reset; oxygen, a ^orange;dim glow^reset;, and 10% ^blue;cold resistance^reset;.": "^yellow;60秒^reset;の酸素、^orange;微弱な光^reset;、10%^blue;冷気耐性^reset;を提供する基本タンク",
  "Handy oxygen source. +62.5s breath": "便利な酸素源。+62.5秒の呼吸時間",
  "Ornamental wings handmade from paper and wood. They're impractically heavy! +^green;2^reset;% Phys. Resist.": "紙や木材から手作りされた観賞用の翼。非現実的な重さだ！ +^green;2^reset;% 物理耐性",
  "Poison EPP I": "ポイズンEPP I",
  "Gives +20% Poison Resist. Use it on planets with ^cyan;mild poison levels^reset;.": "+20%毒耐性を付与。^cyan;軽度の毒^reset;がある惑星で使用",
  "Poison EPP II": "ポイズンEPP II",
  "Gives +40% Poison Resist. Use it on planets with ^orange;moderate poison levels^reset;. +150s oxygen and halves how quickly you breathe.": "+40%毒耐性。^orange;中程度の毒^reset;がある惑星で使用。+150s酸素、呼吸速度半減",
  "Poison EPP III": "ポイズンEPP III",
  "Gives +60% Poison Resist. Use it on planets with ^red;extreme poison levels^reset;. Provides air.": "+60%毒耐性。^red;極度の毒^reset;がある惑星で使用。空気を供給",
  "Protocite Energy Pack": "プロトサイトエネルギーパック",
  "An improved energy pack. Immune: proto-poison, electrical storms. Energy x1.15, +20% E. Regen, -10% E. Block, and a slight ^#3c3c00;glow^reset;.": "改良型エネルギーパック。耐性: プロト毒、電気嵐。エネルギーx1.15、+20%E回復、-10%Eブロック、微弱な^#3c3c00;光^reset;",
  "Quantum Energy Pack": "量子エネルギーパック",
  "Extremely powerful energy tank. Blocks electrical storms. Energy x1.25, +40% E. Regen, -20% E. Block, and a slight ^#0000aa;glow^reset;.": "極めて強力なエネルギータンク。電気嵐を遮断。エネルギーx1.25、+40%E回復、-20%Eブロック、微弱な^#0000aa;光^reset;",
  "Radiation EPP": "放射線EPP",
  "+20% Radiation Resist. Use it on planets with ^cyan;mild radiation levels^reset;.": "+20%放射線耐性。^cyan;軽度の放射線^reset;がある惑星で使用",
  "Radiation EPP II": "放射線EPP II",
  "+40% Radiation Resist. Use it on planets with ^orange;moderate radiation levels^reset;. +150s oxygen and halves how quickly you breathe.": "+40%放射線耐性。^orange;中程度の放射線^reset;がある惑星で使用。+150s酸素、呼吸速度半減",
  "Radiation EPP III": "放射線EPP III",
  "+60% Radiation Resist. Use it on planets with ^red;extreme radiation levels^reset;. Provides air.": "+60%放射線耐性。^red;極度の放射線^reset;がある惑星で使用。空気を供給",
  "X'ian Lantern Bulb": "シーアンランタン球根",
  "Grows out of your back when you need it most. ^green;+1 Gene production^reset;.": "最も必要な時に背中から生える。^green;遺伝子生産+1^reset;",
  "X'ian Water Repulsor": "シーのウォーターリパルサー",
  "Allows a X'i to walk on top of liquids.  ^green;+2 Gene production^reset;.": "シーが液体の上を歩ける。^green;遺伝子生産+2^reset;",
  "Studies have shown that it is impossible to be unhappy whilst wearing this cape. +^green;15^reset;% Radiation Resist.": "このケープを着用しながら不幸になることは不可能だという研究結果が出ている。+^green;15^reset;% 放射能耐性",
  "Repulsor Field Pack": "リパルサーフィールドパック",
  "+^green;20^reset;% Phys. and +^green;20^reset;% Fire Resist at the expense of ^red;20^reset;% Cosmic Resist. Great for warm climates such as deserts and rainforests.": "+^green;20^reset;%物理耐性と+^green;20^reset;%炎耐性（^red;20^reset;%コズミック耐性を犠牲に）。砂漠や熱帯雨林などの暖かい気候に最適",
  "Vortex Cape": "ヴォルテクスケープ",
  "A cape saturated with shadow energy. +^green;15^reset;% jump height.": "影のエネルギーに満ちたケープ。+^green;15^reset;% ジャンプ高度",
  "Generally a short cape. Arguably a long cape for penguins. +^green;15^reset;% Shadow Resist.": "一般的には短い外套。ペンギンにとっては長い外套かもしれないが。+^green;15^reset;% シャドウ耐性",
  "A basic cape. One solid colour is all you need! +^green;15^reset;% Poison Resist.": "基本的な外套。単色で十分！ +^green;15^reset;% 毒耐性",
  "Slime Bio-Light Growth": "スライム生物発光体",
  "A glowing slime crystal. Grants +^green;12^reset;% to Fire, Ice, Poison and Electric Resists. Immune: Moderate Heat/Cold/Radiation, Oxygen. ^#5500ff;Glows best with bright slimes.^reset;": "光るスライムクリスタル。火炎・氷結・毒・電撃耐性+^green;12^reset;%。免疫: 中程度の熱/冷気/放射線、酸素。^#5500ff;明るいスライムと最もよく光る^reset;",
  "A bioluminescent light that matches a slime's body color. ^#5500ff;Defaults to bluish purple on non-slimes.^reset; Air supply.": "スライムの体色に合わせた生物発光ライト。^#5500ff;非スライムは青紫がデフォルト^reset;。空気供給付き",
  "Slime Glow Growth": "スライム発光体",
  "No tigers were harmed in the manufacturing of this decorative tiger tail. +20% Shield Regen.": "この装飾用トラの尾の製造にあたって、トラは一匹も傷つけておりません。+20% シールド回復",
  "A large toxic flower that converts light into energy. Why not wear it on your body? +30% Energy Regen": "光をエネルギーに変える大きな毒の花。体に装備しない理由はないね？ +30% エネルギー回復",
  "A barrel of actual toxic waste. Why would you even consider wearing this on your back? -70% Health": "本物の有毒廃棄物が入ったバレル。こんなもの背負ってどうするつもり？ -70% ヘルス",
  "Primitive feather fetishes are all the rage. Increases energy by +25.": "原始的な羽飾りのフェティッシュが大流行中。エネルギー+25",
  "A turtle shell. It's quite spacious inside! Increases Defense.": "カメの甲羅。中は意外と広い！防御が上昇",
  "Spacepunk Tank": "Spacepunkタンク",
  "Generates a protective field that grants +5% Phys., Rad., Shadow, & Cosmic Res., and provides an Oxygen recycler. ^cyan;+10% Physical & Knockback Res^reset;.": "+5%物理、放射線、シャドウ、コズミック耐性と酸素リサイクラーの防護フィールドを生成。^cyan;+10%物理&ノックバック耐性^reset;",
  "Spacesuit Airtank": "宇宙服エアタンク",
  "A tungsten-reinforced life support tank. Grants 5% to Fire, Ice, Poison and Electric Resists and an Oxygen Recycler.": "タングステン強化のライフサポートタンク。炎、氷、毒、電気耐性5%と酸素リサイクラーを付与",
  "X'i Acid Node": "X'i酸ノード",
  "Immune: Acid, Oxygen. Helpful on ^red;Sulphuric^reset; planets.": "耐性: 酸、酸素。^red;硫黄^reset;惑星で有効",
  "Bee Keeper's Armor": "養蜂家のアーマー",
  "Prevents nasty bee stings!": "厄介な蜂刺されを防ぐ!",
  "Bee Keeper's Helm": "養蜂家のヘルム",
  "Bee Keeper's Pants": "養蜂家のパンツ",
  "Bee Wings": "Beeウイング",
  "A pair of giant bee wings. Increases air agility, reduces fall speed.": "巨大な蜂の翼。空中機動性向上、落下速度低下",
  "Amber Plate Armor": "アンバープレートアーマー",
  "^orange;Set Bonuses^reset;:\n^yellow;^reset; ^green;Thorns^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; Bladed Melee: Damage x^green;1.1^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Beestings, Honey": "^orange;セットボーナス^reset;:\n^yellow;^reset; ^green;棘の反撃^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; 刃付き近接: ダメージ x^green;1.1^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 蜂刺され、蜂蜜",
  "Amber Knight's Helm": "アンバーナイトヘルム",
  "Amber Leg Plates": "アンバーレッグプレート",
  "Queen's Dress": "クイーンのドレス",
  "^orange;Set Bonuses^reset;:\n^yellow;^reset; +^green;25^reset;% Speed, +^green;15^reset;% Jump\n^yellow;^reset; Bee Weapons: +^green;8^reset;% Crit Chance, +^green;50^reset;% Crit Damage, Damage x^green;1.2^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Beestings, Honey, Extreme Radiation": "^orange;セットボーナス^reset;:\n^yellow;^reset; +^green;25^reset;% 速度、+^green;15^reset;% ジャンプ\n^yellow;^reset; 蜂武器: +^green;8^reset;% クリティカル率、+^green;50^reset;% クリティカルダメージ、ダメージ x^green;1.2^reset;\n^yellow;^reset; ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 蜂刺され、蜂蜜、極度の放射線",
  "Queen's Head": "クイーンのヘッド",
  "Queen's Skirt": "クイーンのスカート",
  "+^green;10^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;10^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^green;2^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)\n-^green;2^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "+^green;10^reset;% ダメージ（弓）\n+^green;10^reset;% 引き速度（弓）\n+^green;2^reset;% 空中ダメージ（弓）\n-^green;2^reset; 一射あたりのエネルギー消費（弓）",
  "Basic Quiver": "ベーシック矢筒",
  "Aether Quiver": "エーテルの矢筒",
  "+^green;30^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;70^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^red;10^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "ダメージ+^green;30^reset;%（弓）\n引き速度+^green;70^reset;%（弓）\n射撃エネルギー+^red;10^reset;（弓）",
  "Skill Quiver": "Skill矢筒",
  "+^green;30^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)": "+^green;30^reset;%空中ダメージ（弓）",
  "Sniper's Quiver": "スナイパーの矢筒",
  "+^green;55^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)": "+^green;55^reset;%空中ダメージ（弓）",
  "Energy Quiver": "エナジー矢筒",
  "-^green;6^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "-^green;6^reset;ショットあたりエネルギー（弓）",
  "Lightning Quiver": "Lightning矢筒",
  "^green;x3.5^reset; Draw Speed (Bows), ^red;+5^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "^green;x3.5^reset; 引き速度（弓）、^red;+5^reset; 1射あたりエネルギー（弓）",
  "Power Quiver": "Power矢筒",
  "+^green;30^reset;% Damage (Bows)": "+^green;30^reset;%ダメージ（弓）",
  "Quality Quiver": "上質な矢筒",
  "+^green;15^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;15^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^green;4^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)\n-^green;3^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "ダメージ+^green;15^reset;%（弓）\n引き速度+^green;15^reset;%（弓）\n空中ダメージ+^green;4^reset;%（弓）\n射撃エネルギー-^green;3^reset;（弓）",
  "Exceptional Quiver": "極上の矢筒",
  "+^green;20^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;20^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^green;8^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)\n-^green;4^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "ダメージ+^green;20^reset;%（弓）\n引き速度+^green;20^reset;%（弓）\n空中ダメージ+^green;8^reset;%（弓）\n射撃エネルギー-^green;4^reset;（弓）",
  "Amazing Quiver": "驚異の矢筒",
  "+^green;25^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;25^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^green;12^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)\n-^green;7^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "ダメージ+^green;25^reset;%（弓）\n引き速度+^green;25^reset;%（弓）\n空中ダメージ+^green;12^reset;%（弓）\n射撃エネルギー-^green;7^reset;（弓）",
  "Peerless Quiver": "無双の矢筒",
  "+^green;30^reset;% Damage (Bows)\n+^green;30^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)\n+^green;20^reset;% Airborne Damage (Bows)\n-^green;9^reset; Energy Per Shot (Bows)": "ダメージ+^green;30^reset;%（弓）\n引き速度+^green;30^reset;%（弓）\n空中ダメージ+^green;20^reset;%（弓）\n射撃エネルギー-^green;9^reset;（弓）",
  "Speed Quiver": "Speed矢筒",
  "+^green;30^reset;% Draw Speed (Bows)": "+^green;30^reset;%引き速度（弓）",
  "Collar Holder": "カラーホルダー",
  "A cloth collar and iron tag with protective powers.": "保護力のある布の首輪と鉄のタグ",
  "Cat's Collar T1": "猫の首輪 T1",
  "A collar possessing protective powers. Made of somewhat sturdier materials.": "やや頑丈な素材で作られた防御力を持つカラー",
  "Cat's Collar T2": "猫の首輪 T2",
  "An enchanted collar that provides decent protection.": "まあまあの防御力を持つ魔法のカラー",
  "Cat's Collar Tier 3": "猫の首輪 Tier3",
  "Cat's Collar Tier 4": "猫の首輪 Tier4",
  "A cat's collar imbued with protective power.": "保護力を宿した猫の首輪",
  "Cat's Energy Collar 1": "猫のエネルギー首輪 1",
  "Imbued with a special power to increase energy generation, while also protecting its wearer.": "エネルギー生成を増加させる特別な力を宿し、装着者を保護",
  "Cat's Power Collar": "Cat'sPowerカラー",
  "Imbued with extra attack power, this collar provides fine defensive ability.": "追加の攻撃力を宿したこの首輪は優れた防御能力を提供",
  "Cat's Health Collar": "キャッツヘルスカラー",
  "This collar is meant to increase health and provide excellent defensive power.": "この首輪は体力を増加させ優れた防御力を提供",
  "Cat's Prime Energy Collar": "Cat'sPrimeエネルギーカラー",
  "Imbued with extra defensive power, this collar fills its wielder with extra energy.": "追加の防御力を宿し装着者に余分なエネルギーを満たす",
  "Cat's Prime Power Collar": "キャッツプライムパワーカラー",
  "A collar with even more protective power than its prototype state.": "プロトタイプ以上の保護力を持つ首輪",
  "Cat's Prime Health Collar": "キャッツプライムヘルスカラー",
  "An even stronger protective collar which boosts its wearer's health.": "装着者の体力を強化するさらに強力な保護首輪",
  "Kitty Butterfly Wings": "キティバタフライウイング",
  "Finally I can be a kitty-fairy!": "ついに猫妖精になれる！",
  "Hi-Fi Earphones": "ハイファイイヤホン",
  "Listen in style. Perfect for Floyd.": "おしゃれに音楽を。フロイドに最適",
  "Hero Cowl": "ヒーローカウル",
  "Hides your secret identity.": "正体を隠す",
  "Joke Glasses": "ジョークメガネ",
  "Laugh it up.": "大笑い",
  "Metalhead Hair": "メタルヘッドヘア",
  "Adorable man-eater.": "愛らしい人喰い。",
  "Midnight Shirt": "Midnightシャツ",
  "Dark as night.": "暗いas night",
  "Midnight Pants": "Midnightパンツ",
  "Shark Mask": "シャークマスク",
  "Starfarer's Shirt": "スターフェアラーシャツ",
  "A shirt worn by attractive spacefarers.": "魅力的な宇宙旅行者が着るシャツ",
  "Starfarer's Skirt": "スターフェアラーのスカート",
  "A skirt worn by attractive spacefarers.": "魅力的な宇宙旅行者が着るスカート",
  "Operative Chest Armor": "オペレイティブチェストアーマー",
  "Stylish, classy, and dangerous.": "スタイリッシュ、上品、そして危険",
  "Operative Leg Armor": "オペレイティブレッグアーマー",
  "Stalker's Robe": "ストーカーローブ",
  "Death themed body armor!": "死をテーマにしたボディアーマー!",
  "Stalker's Hood": "ストーカーフード",
  "Deadly hood. Armor that really demands attenSHUN!": "致命的なフード。まさに「気をつけ!」と言わんばかりのアーマー!",
  "Stalker's Legs": "ストーカーレッグ",
  "Dangerous and deadly pants!": "危険で致命的なパンツ!",
  "Inferno Chest": "インフェルノチェスト",
  "Designed for combat in super-hot environments..": "超高温環境での戦闘用に設計されている。",
  "Inferno Helm": "インフェルノヘルム",
  "Designed for combat in super-hot environments.": "超高温環境での戦闘用に設計されている。",
  "Inferno Pants": "インフェルノパンツ",
  "Arctic Parka": "アークティックパーカー",
  "Capable of withstanding the harshest cold.": "最も過酷な寒さに耐えられる",
  "Arctic Hood": "アークティックフード",
  "Fully featured gas filtration mask with built-in re-breather unit.": "リブリーザーユニット内蔵の高機能ガスフィルタリングマスク",
  "Arctic Snowpants": "アークティックスノーパンツ",
  "Repels even the most extreme cold temperatures.": "最も極端な低温をも退ける",
  "Scroll of Devastation": "壊滅の巻物",
  "Wands/Staves: +^green;5^reset; Projectiles, +^red;100^reset;% Cast/Charge Time, +^green;100^reset;% Range": "ワンド/スタッフ: 弾数+^green;5^reset;、詠唱/チャージ時間+^red;100^reset;%、射程+^green;100^reset;%",
  "A Technowizard scroll pulsing with power.\n^green;20%^reset; Wand & Staff Mastery\n-^green;^green;20^reset;% Wand & Staff Charge Time": "力がみなぎるテクノウィザードの巻物\n^green;20%^reset; ワンド＆スタッフ習熟\n-^green;^green;20^reset;% ワンド＆スタッフ詠唱時間",
  "Fool's Hat": "フール's帽子",
  "Pity yourself.": "自分を哀れめ",
  "Head in Jar": "瓶詰めの頭",
  "Used to store and preserve heads. Filled with H2OGfat. A special liquid used to keep heads alive. It is rich in nutrients and refreshing to drink.\n^cyan;Immune^reset;: Oxygen": "頭部の保存・貯蔵に使用される。H2OGfatで満たされている。頭部を生かしておくための特殊な液体で、栄養豊富で飲むと爽快\n^cyan;免疫^reset;: 酸素",
  "Mech Helmet Hider": "メックヘルメットハイダー",
  "You shouldn't have this. It is just to hide hair rather than force the player to wear a helmet.": "これは持つべきでない。ヘルメット強制ではなく髪を隠すためだけのもの",
  "Wagner's Face": "ワグナーの顔",
  "Did you cheat this in?": "チートで入手した？",
  "Agrobat Hat": "Agrobat帽子",
  "Really swooped in to get this one huh?": "これを手に入れるために頑張ったな？",
  "Amy Hedgeleap Mask": "エイミー・ヘッジリープマスク",
  "Just as clingy as the real thing!": "本物と同じくらいくっつく！",
  "Autumnbop Mask": "Autumnbopマスク",
  "Don't worry. The leaf is more durable than it looks!": "心配するな。葉は見た目より丈夫！",
  "Batong Mask": "Batongマスク",
  "The mask's tongue is textured just like the real thing!": "マスクの舌は本物そっくりの質感！",
  "Bobfae Mask": "Bobfaeマスク",
  "Less flimsy than the real thing!": "本物よりしっかり！",
  "Bulbop Mask": "Bulbopマスク",
  "Doesn't bleed when cut.": "切っても血が出ない",
  "Caketop Mask": "Caketopマスク",
  "Before you ask, no, it isn't edible.": "聞く前に言っておくと、食べられない",
  "Candybop Mask": "Candybopマスク",
  "Just like the candy, it's somewhat of an underdog in the collection!": "キャンディと同じく、コレクションの中ではダークホース！",
  "Chocolate Caketop Mask": "チョコレートケイクトップマスク",
  "Chucklefish Mask": "チャックルフィッシュマスク",
  "Has built-in snack holders, television and air conditioning.": "スナックホルダー、テレビ、エアコン内蔵",
  "Cleanerbot Hat": "クリーナーボット帽子",
  "This mask may help keep your head clean! (Spoilers: It doesn't.)": "このマスクは頭を清潔に保つかも！（ネタバレ: 保たない）",
  "Cottonbop Mask": "Cottonbopマスク",
  "Made with 99.9999% cotton!": "99.9999%コットン製！",
  "Crabcano Hat": "Crabcano帽子",
  "A perfect fit if you have a bad temper!": "短気な人にぴったり！",
  "Crustoise Mask": "Crustoiseマスク",
  "The rocks are very real, and still very sharp. We suggest you don't leave this lying around!": "岩は本物で、まだとても鋭い。放置しないことをお勧め！",
  "Crutter Mask": "Crutterマスク",
  "Thankfully not nearly as poisonous as the real thing!": "ありがたいことに本物ほど毒はない！",
  "Electrix Hat": "Electrix帽子",
  "This hat may generate slight traces of static electricity. Try not to touch electrical appliances!": "このの帽子は微量の静電気を発生するかも。電化製品に触れないで！",
  "Eyevalve Mask": "Eyevalveマスク",
  "Hey, it's like two masks in one!": "一つで二つのマスク！",
  "Fennix Hat": "Fennix帽子",
  "This hat will surely warm your noggin!": "この帽子は頭を温めるぞ！",
  "Frostix Hat": "Frostix帽子",
  "A nice hat to wear on a hot day!": "暑い日にかぶるのにいい帽子！",
  "Gift Monster Mask": "ギフトモンスターマスク",
  "You can look like you're wrapped up for the holidays with this!": "これで休日の装いに見える！",
  "Gleap Mask": "Gleapマスク",
  "Made from the same springy substance as the real thing!": "本物と同じバネ素材で作られている！",
  "Glitch Spider Mask": "グリッチスパイダーマスク",
  "The metal interior is a little cold, but it's a cool mask, so it's definitely worth it!": "金属の内側は少し冷たいが、かっこいいマスクだから価値あり！",
  "Glitchtop Mask": "Glitchtopマスク",
  "I don't even remember when we started stocking this, but it looks cool, so we kept it!": "いつから在庫してたか覚えてないが、かっこいいから残した！",
  "Gosmet Mask": "Gosmetマスク",
  "A somewhat popular item among our Hylotl customers.. I wonder why?": "ハイロトルのお客さんに人気…なぜだろう？",
  "Gummi Mask": "Gummiマスク",
  "We used a sugary substance in the material once, but customers complained it irritated their eyes.. Whoops.": "以前素材に糖分を使ったが目が痛いと苦情が…おっと",
  "Iguarmor Hat": "Iguarmor帽子",
  "Despite its protective appearance, this will not serve as a replacement for a proper helmet.": "防護的な外見だが、ちゃんとしたヘルメットの代わりにはならない",
  "King Nutmidgeling Mask": "キングナットミジリングマスク",
  "The mask's tuft is more durable than the real thing.": "マスクの房は本物より丈夫",
  "Kluex Sentry Mask": "クルエックスセントリーマスク",
  "These were salvaged from damaged Kluex Sentries! Careful. We don't know if we disarmed their energy beams right...": "損傷したKluex歩哨から回収された！注意。エネルギービームが正しく無力化されたかは不明…",
  "Knuckles Hedgeleap Mask": "ナックルズヘッジリープマスク",
  "Doesn't chuckle.": "クスクス笑わない",
  "Lilodon Mask": "Lilodonマスク",
  "Like a shark mask, but more adorable.": "サメのマスクだが、もっと愛らしい",
  "Lumoth Mask": "Lumothマスク",
  "Makes cute headwear, and actually and actually provides some light if worn in the regular headgear slot.": "かわいい頭飾りで、通常ヘッドギアスロットに装着すると実際に光を放つ",
  "Mallowbop Mask": "Mallowbopマスク",
  "It's having your head squeezed by a plush parasite!": "ぬいぐるみの寄生虫に頭を締められている感覚！",
  "Miasmop Mask": "Miasmopマスク",
  "We once included a button on the side of the mask that released Miasmop fumes. (Those eventually got recalled.)": "以前ミアスモップの煙ボタンを付けた（結局リコール）",
  "Minidrone Mask": "Minidroneマスク",
  "Another example of potentially highly complex technology converted into headwear!": "高度に複雑な技術を頭飾りに転用した更なる例！",
  "Mister Wisper Mask": "ミスターウィスパーマスク",
  "Jolly good show!": "実に素晴らしい！",
  "Monopus Hat": "Monopus帽子",
  "Spinball attack not included.": "スピンボールアタックは含まれない",
  "Mushtop Mask": "Mushtopマスク",
  "Fungal spore free! (Potentially..)": "菌類胞子フリー！（たぶん…）",
  "Mysterix Hat": "Mysterix帽子",
  "Not even we're sure what it does. How mysterious!": "我々にも何をするか不明。なんと神秘的！",
  "Narfin Helmet": "Narfinヘルム",
  "Careful not to poke someone's eye out!": "誰かの目を突かないように注意！",
  "Nocttop Mask": "Nocttopマスク",
  "Almost as frightening as the real thing.": "本物とほぼ同じくらい怖い",
  "Normix Hat": "Normix帽子",
  "A completely average Normix hat.": "完全に普通のノーミックスハット",
  "Oculob Mask": "Oculobマスク",
  "We thought about using real Oculob goop.. but that would be too unsanitary.": "本物のオキュロブの粘液を使おうと思ったが…不衛生すぎる",
  "Omnix Hat": "Omnix帽子",
  "This hat is a jack of all trades! Not really sure what those trades are though.": "この帽子は万能！その万能が何かは不明だけど",
  "Orbide Mask": "Orbideマスク",
  "How are you even supposed to see out of this thing?": "これでどうやって前が見えるんだ？",
  "Parasprite Mask": "パラスプライトマスク",
  "I for one think it suits you perfectly!": "個人的にはぴったりだと思う！",
  "Paratail Mask": "Paratailマスク",
  "The explosive version of this has long since been recalled! (At least.. I think we recalled them.)": "爆発版はとっくにリコール済み！（たぶん…リコールしたはず）",
  "Peblit Mask": "Peblitマスク",
  "It makes you a little top heavy.. but hey, at least it looks nice right?": "少し頭でっかちになるけど…見た目はいいでしょ？",
  "Petricub Hat": "Petricub帽子",
  "With its beady eyes, it could give you the upper hand in a staring contest!": "ビーズのような目で、にらめっこで有利になれる！",
  "Po Mask": "Poマスク",
  "I know what you're thinking, and the answer is no, it isn't real. I'm a businesstop, not a lunatic.": "何を考えてるかわかるが、答えはノー、本物じゃない。商売人であって狂人じゃない",
  "Poptop Mask": "Poptopマスク",
  "Poptop music not included.": "ポップトップの音楽は含まれない",
  "Pulpin Hat": "Pulpin帽子",
  "An all-natural Pulpin adhesive helps keep it planted firmly on your head!": "天然のパルピン接着剤で頭にしっかり固定！",
  "Quagmutt Hat": "Quagmutt帽子",
  "Isn't hazardous to your health! (We promise.)": "健康に害はない！（約束する）",
  "Repairbot Mask": "修復botマスク",
  "This mask can repair even the worst fashion sense!": "このマスクは最悪のファッションセンスも修復できる！",
  "Ruin Mask": "Ruinマスク",
  "It may destroy worlds, but at least it makes for cool headwear right?...": "世界を破壊するかもだが、少なくともかっこいい頭飾りでしょ？…",
  "Scandroid Mask": "Scandroidマスク",
  "Our scanners indicate this will be a popular product.": "スキャナーによるとこれは人気商品になる",
  "Serpentdroid Mask": "サーペントドロイドマスク",
  "We used some robots from some abandoned bunkers to make these hats... Not like they were being used for anything else anyway.": "廃棄バンカーのロボットでこの帽子を作った…どうせ他に使い道もなかったし",
  "Shadow Hedgeleap Mask": "シャドウヘッジリープマスク",
  "Careful. You could cut yourself on its edge.": "注意。刃で怪我するかも",
  "Silver Hedgeleap Mask": "シルバーヘッジリープマスク",
  "We tried to think of a decent description for this mask, but it was no use.": "このマスクのまともな説明を考えたが無駄だった",
  "Skimbus Mask": "Skimbusマスク",
  "Just as light as the real thing (We are not responsible if this product blows off your face in the wind.)": "本物と同じくらい軽い（風で顔から飛んでも責任は取りません）",
  "Snaggler Hat": "Snaggler帽子",
  "Isn't as protective as it looks. That would cost you extra!": "見た目ほど防御的じゃない。それは追加料金！",
  "Snaunt Mask": "Snauntマスク",
  "Non-Toxic and kid friendly!": "無毒で子供にも安全！",
  "Snorktop Mask": "Snorktopマスク",
  "It's like wearing a mask over a mask.": "マスクの上にマスクを被るようなもの",
  "Snuffish Mask": "Snuffishマスク",
  "You'd probably startle the real thing if you wore this!": "これを被ったら本物もびっくりするかも！",
  "Sonic Hedgeleap Mask": "ソニックヘッジリープマスク",
  "Can be put on at sonic speed.": "音速で装着可能",
  "Springbop Mask": "Springbopマスク",
  "Its petals are made with soft silk!": "花びらは柔らかいシルク製！",
  "Squeem Hat": "Squeem帽子",
  "There is no orb on this hat, because 'you' are the orb!": "この帽子にオーブはない。「あなた」がオーブだから！",
  "Summerbop Mask": "Summerbopマスク",
  "To all customers with tree nut allergies, we can assure you this batch of masks is perfectly safe!": "ナッツアレルギーのお客様へ、このマスクは完全に安全です！",
  "Super Sonic Hedg. Mask": "スーパーソニックヘッジマスク",
  "And it didn't even cost you seven gemstones to obtain!": "入手に7つの宝石すら必要なかった！",
  "Swarpion Hat": "Swarpion帽子",
  "Non-venomous, and safe to wear.": "無毒で安全に着用可能",
  "Tails Hedgeleap Mask": "テイルズヘッジリープマスク",
  "Not capable of flying high.": "高く飛ぶことはできない",
  "Taroni Mask": "タールoniマスク",
  "Early versions of its materials utilized real tar, but it proved to be unpopular.": "初期版は本物のタールを使ったが不人気だった",
  "Tintic Hat": "Tintic帽子",
  "Made from real Tintic silk!": "本物のティンティックシルク製！",
  "Toumingo Hat": "Toumingo帽子",
  "Toumingo Legs not included.": "トゥミンゴの脚は含まれない",
  "Toxix Hat": "Toxix帽子",
  "We promise wearing this hat will not induce poison.": "この帽子を被っても毒にはならないと約束",
  "Trictus Cap": "Trictusキャップ",
  "Needle-free, for your safety.": "安全のため針なし",
  "Winterbop Mask": "Winterbopマスク",
  "Insulated on the inside to keep your face warm!": "内側が断熱されて顔を暖かく！",
  "Wisper Mask": "Wisperマスク",
  "Won't lead you astray.": "道を踏み外させない",
  "Invisible Shirt": "Invisibleシャツ",
  "Are you sure these are clothes?": "これ本当に服なの?",
  "Invisible Hat": "透明な帽子",
  "Invisible Pants": "Invisibleパンツ",
  "Temple Shirt": "Templeシャツ",
  "A sleeveless shirt woven from crystal.": "クリスタルで織られたノースリーブシャツ",
  "Temple Helmet": "Templeヘルム",
  "A helmet worn by Eld'uukhar guards.": "エルドゥーカーの護衛が着用するヘルメット",
  "Temple Shorts": "テンプルショーツ",
  "A pair of shorts with gold anklets.": "金の足首飾り付きショーツ",
  "Ahvis worshipper's garb.": "アーヴィス崇拝者の衣装",
  "Worshipper's Shirt": "ウォーシッパーシャツ",
  "Worshipper's Helmet": "ウォーシッパーヘルム",
  "Worshipper's Cloth": "ウォーシッパークロス",
  "Invisible Chest": "Invisibleチェスト",
  "Show those muscles to the world with this handy item!": "この便利アイテムで筋肉を世界に見せよう！",
  "Invisible Legs": "Invisibleレッグアーマー",
  "Let 'em hang with this handy item!": "この便利アイテムでぶら下げよう！",
  "Invisible Head": "透明な頭部",
  "Free your mane with this handy item!": "この便利アイテムでたてがみを解放！",
  "Arbiter Helmet": "アービターヘルメット",
  "The mask of station for a Pharitu Arbiter.": "ファリトゥ族のアービターの役職を示す仮面。",
  "Centurion Helmet": "センチュリオンヘルメット",
  "The Pharitu hold their Centurions in high regard.": "ファリトゥ族はセンチュリオンを高く評価している。",
  "Stormbreaker Helmet": "ストームブレイカーヘルメット",
  "Stormbreakers are responsible for collecting charged gems from the surface.": "ストームブレイカーは地表から帯電した宝石を回収する役目を担う。",
  "Scrapper's Mask": "スクラッパーマスク",
  "Simple Pharitu headwear made for sparring.": "模擬戦用に作られたシンプルなファリトゥ族のヘッドウェア。",
  "Treyarch Mask": "トレイアークマスク",
