  "A potent natural adhesive that is commonly found in certain mushrooms.\n^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "特定のキノコに含まれる強力な天然接着剤\n^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量 ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;",
  "A decent fuel source once refined.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.25 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;Uses -^white;0.5 ^cyan;fluid use ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "精錬すればまともな燃料源\n^green;成長速度x^white;1.25 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;使用 -^white;0.5 ^cyan;液体 ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子^reset;",
  "Xenophagic Substance": "異食性物質",
