  "Densinium Ore": "デンシニウム鉱石",
  "A rare, multi-phasic, super-dense ore. Impossibly hard.": "希少な多相性の超高密度鉱石。信じられないほど硬い",
  "Duskiline Crystal": "Duskilineクリスタル",
  "A purely cosmetic gemstone to the Eld'uukhar. It is grown purely to trade.": "エルドゥーカーにとって純粋に装飾用の宝石。取引用に栽培される",
  "Effigium Ore": "エフィジウム鉱石",
  "An almost invisible crystalline metal due to its large traces of the element Rhodium.": "ロジウム元素を多く含むためほぼ透明な結晶金属",
  "Emera Crystal": "Emeraクリスタル",
  "A brittle gemstone that is spun into strong crystal fabric.": "強いクリスタル繊維に紡がれる脆い宝石。",
  "Exonite Crystal": "Exoniteクリスタル",
  "A gem grown in secret on the Eld'uukhar homeworld. It has hallucinogenic properties.": "エルドゥーカーの母星で密かに育てられた宝石。幻覚作用がある",
  "Feya Crystal": "Feyaクリスタル",
  "Used to store thermal energy for later use.": "後で使うための熱エネルギーを蓄えるのに使われる",
  "Advanced Plastic": "高度なプラスチック",
  "By the power of science, behold Polyetheretherketone! This synthetic compound is strong, heat-resistant, and bio-compatible.": "科学の力を見よ、ポリエーテルエーテルケトン！この合成化合物は強靭で耐熱性があり生体適合性を持つ",
  "Resin": "レジン",
  "Useful for adhesives, and hardening certain materials.": "接着剤や特定素材の硬化に有用",
  "Silicon": "シリコン",
  "This element has many uses in science and tech due to its semiconductor property.": "半導体特性により科学と技術で多くの用途を持つ元素",
  "Handy bits. Probably worth extracting, too.": "便利な欠片。抽出する価値もありそう",
  "Frozen Beeswax": "凍った蜜蝋",
  "A frozen chunk of beeswax.": "凍った蜜蝋の塊",
  "Fresh brain": "新鮮な脳",
  "A bloody brain still pulsing with grossness.": "まだ気持ち悪く脈打つ血まみれの脳",
  "Fuel Catalyst": "燃料触媒",
  "A material used as a catalyst to refine mech fuel.": "メック燃料の精製触媒として使用される素材",
  "Dense Bone": "高密度の骨",
  "Dense, tough bone such as a femur.": "大腿骨のような高密度で頑丈な骨",
  "Epidermis": "表皮",
  "The skin from a body.": "体から取った皮膚",
  "Unknown Epidermis": "未知の表皮",
  "Guts": "内臓",
  "A mass of internal organs": "内臓の塊",
  "Bunch of hair": "毛束",
  "A pile of hair.": "髪の毛の山",
  "Heart": "ハート",
  "Somebody had a heart. This was it.": "誰かに心臓があった。これがそれだ",
  "Unknown Heart": "未知の心臓",
  "Something had a heart. This was it.": "何かに心臓があった。これがそれだ",
  "Molecular Nano-Fibre": "分子ナノファイバー",
  "An amazing super-fabric with nearly magical potential.": "ほぼ魔法のようなポテンシャルを持つ驚異のスーパーファブリック",
  "Tooth": "トゥース",
  "A tooth.": "歯",
  "Carbon": "カーボン",
  "There exist more chemical compounds involving Carbon than don't.": "炭素を含む化合物は含まないものより多い",
  "Carbon Dioxide": "二酸化炭素",
  "A common trace gas with many applications.": "多くの用途を持つ一般的な微量ガス",
  "Pure Carbon": "ピュアカーボン",
  "Pure carbon graphite.": "純粋なカーボングラファイト",
  "Encoded Research": "エンコードされた研究",
  "Your hard-earned work, ready for use in experiments and blueprints": "苦労して得た成果、実験と設計図に使用可能",
  "Hydrogen": "水素",
  "Wonderful applications exist for this, the lightest element.\n^blue;+^white;1 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "最も軽い元素であるこれには素晴らしい用途がある\n^blue;+^white;1 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "A quantum-viable super-conductor.\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "量子適格の超伝導体\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Nitrogen": "窒素",
  "Pure diatomic ^gray;N2^reset; nitrogen gas.": "純粋な二原子^gray;N2^reset;窒素ガス",
  "Strange Nodule": "奇妙な結節",
  "Primarily found in rare deep-water plants, this unusual compound is rich with aberrant genes.": "希少な深海植物に主に含まれるこの珍しい化合物は異常遺伝子が豊富",
  "Oxygen": "酸素",
  "Oxygen is one of the most versatile elements, with many uses.": "酸素は最も汎用性の高い元素の一つで多くの用途がある",
  "Salt": "塩",
  "Common table salt ^gray;NaCl^reset; is extremely useful in everything from culinary arts to chemical engineering.": "食卓塩^gray;NaCl^reset;は料理から化学工学まで極めて有用",
  "Exspiravit Wax": "エクスピラヴィトワックス",
  "A chunk of semi transparent, white-hued wax. Known to be a potent hallucinogen.": "半透明の白い蝋の塊。強力な幻覚剤として知られる",
  "^#77acc3;Graphene^reset;": "^#77acc3;グラフェン^reset;",
  "This sheet of pure carbon is seemingly magical due to its extreme durability, flexibilty, and conductivity despite being only 1-atom thick!": "この純炭素シートは1原子の厚さにもかかわらず極めて丈夫で柔軟で導電性がある、まるで魔法のよう！",
  "^#e43774;D-Hydrogen Phase Core^reset;": "^#e43774;D水素フェーズコア^reset;",
  "Hydrogen and Dark Matter combined to provide ample power.\n^blue;+^white;8000 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "水素とダークマターを組み合わせた十分な電力源\n^blue;+^white;8000 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Hydrolium": "ハイドロリウム",
  "A fantastic, conductive material ideal for circuitry.": "回路に理想的な素晴らしい導電素材",
  "Hydrolium Circuitry": "ハイドロリウム回路",
  "A highly efficent circuitry made out of hydrolium, commonly used by the Skath.": "スカスが一般的に使用するハイドロリウム製の高効率回路",
  "Impervium Plating": "Imperviumプレート",
  "Impervium, carefully prepared for crafting furniture with.": "家具製作用に丁寧に加工されたインペルヴィウム",
  "Iodine": "ヨウ素",
  "Iodine ^gray;I^reset; is extremely useful as it is the heaviest and therefore most heat-resistant halogen.": "ヨウ素^gray;I^reset;は最も重く最も耐熱性の高いハロゲンとして極めて有用",
  "Irradium Ore": "イラジウム鉱石",
  "Irradium is a rare and valuable radioactive metal. Handle with care!": "イラジウムは希少で価値のある放射性金属。取り扱い注意！",
  "Isogen Ore": "アイソジェン鉱石",
  "This unusual aluminum-heavy compound is the most endothermic metal ever discovered": "このアルミニウム豊富な珍しい化合物はこれまで発見された中で最も吸熱性の高い金属",
  "Kelp Fabric": "Kelpファブリック",
  "Despite being made out of kelp, this material is both durable and flexible.": "昆布でできているにもかかわらず耐久性と柔軟性がある",
  "Kespar Crystal": "Kesparクリスタル",
  "A purple and green gem that sparkles in the sun.": "太陽に輝く紫と緑の宝石",
  "An ore that can be used to produce phosphorus via extraction.": "抽出でリンを生産できる鉱石。",
  "Lead ^gray;Pb^reset; is notable for being denser than other common metals, great for radiation shielding, but also poisonous.": "鉛^gray;Pb^reset;は他の一般的な金属より密度が高く放射線遮蔽に最適だが、有毒でもある",
  "Magnesite": "マグネサイト",
  "Great for creating magnesium powder!": "マグネシウム粉末の作成に最適！",
  "Magnesium Powder": "Magnesiumパウダー",
  "Magnesium ^gray;Mg2+^reset; ions in a lab-ready, powdery form!": "ラボ用の粉末状マグネシウム^gray;Mg2+^reset;イオン！",
  "Magnesium Sulfate": "硫酸マグネシウム",
  "This salt is very useful in agriculture by increasing magnesium and sulfur content in soil.": "土壌のマグネシウムと硫黄含有量を増やし農業に有用な塩",
  "Mascagnite": "マスカグナイト",
  "Mascagnite is a mineral abundant in Ammonium Sulfate, which can be extracted.": "マスカグナイトは硫酸アンモニウムが豊富な鉱物で抽出可能",
  "Matter Converter": "Matterコンバーター",
  "Converts matter into new states. Quite useful for gas/liquid/solid conversions.": "物質を新しい状態に変換する。気体/液体/固体の変換に便利",
  "Methanol": "メタノール",
  "This light, volatile alcohol is produced from destructive extraction from wood.": "この軽い揮発性アルコールは木の破壊的抽出から生産される",
  "Mutavisk Silk": "ムタヴィスクシルク",
  "Superior, resistant and durable silk fibres.": "優れた耐性と耐久性を持つシルク繊維",
  "Bio Thread": "バイオスレッド",
  "A versatile, resistant thread made from Mutavisk plants.": "ムタヴィスク植物で作られた万能で耐久性のある糸",
  "Nhydri Crystal": "Nhydriクリスタル",
  "A blue gem that grows in a teardrop shape. It feels cold to touch.": "涙型に成長する青い宝石。触ると冷たい",
  "High Grade Paper": "高品質紙",
  "A high quality, stiff paper.": "高品質で硬い紙",
  "Raw Nocxium": "生ノクシウム",
  "Raw, untainted Nocxium.": "生の汚染されていないノクシウム",
  "Oceanite Crystal": "Oceaniteクリスタル",
  "The main power source of the Eld'uukhar. Its liquid form has slight healing properties.": "エルドゥーカーの主要電源。液体形態は軽い治癒効果がある",
  "Opul Crystal": "Opulクリスタル",
  "An incredibly strong gem that is primarily used for creating glass in Eld'uukhar temples.": "エルドゥークハルの神殿でガラスの作成に主に使用される信じられないほど強い宝石。",
  "Penumbrite Ore": "ペナンブライト鉱石",
  "Some super-hard penumbrite, waiting to be smelted.": "精錬を待つ超硬度のペナンブライト",
  "Pesticide": "殺虫剤",
  "Kills bugs dead.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;3 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;Uses +^white;2 ^cyan;fluid use ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "害虫を完全に駆除\n^green;成長速度 x^white;3 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;液体消費 +^white;2 ^gray;& ^cyan;種子消費 -^white;1^reset;",
  "Phosite Crystal": "Phositeクリスタル",
  "The main power source of the Pharitu. Eld'uukhar grow it in a much weaker form.": "ファリトゥの主な動力源。エルドゥーカーはより弱い形態で栽培",
  "Phosphorus": "リン",
  "A life-essential non-metallic chemical element.": "生命に不可欠な非金属元素",
  "Plasma Core": "プラズマコア",
  "A pulsing core of energized plasma. \n^blue;+^white;250 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "帯電プラズマの脈動するコア\n^blue;+^white;250 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Protheon Shard": "Protheonシャード",
  "Artifact from an ancient race.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "古代種族のアーティファクト\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "A unique element found only on protoworlds.": "プロトワールドでのみ見つかる希少な元素",
  "Psi-1 Energy": "Psi-1エネルギー",
  "The harnessed mental energy of sapient beings, ready to be used as power.\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "知的存在の精神エネルギーを活用。電力として使用可能\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Psi-2 Energy": "Psi-2エネルギー",
  "Infused with additional power.\n^blue;+^white;20 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "追加のパワーが注入されている\n^blue;+^white;20 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Psi-3 Energy": "Psi-3エネルギー",
  "A massively charged psionic energy cell.\n^blue;+^white;35 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "大量に充電されたサイオニックエネルギーセル\n^blue;+^white;35 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Psi-4 Energy": "Psi-4エネルギー",
  "The most potent form of psionic energy.\n^blue;+^white;50 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "最も強力なサイオニックエネルギー形態\n^blue;+^white;50 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Pure Erchius Crystal": "ピュアErchiusクリスタル",
  "You've never seen a more pristine erchius crystal.\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "これほど綺麗なエルキウスクリスタルは見たことがない\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Pyreite Ore": "パイライト鉱石",
  "An ore that burns eternally.": "永遠に燃える鉱石",
  "Quietus Ore": "クワイタス鉱石",
  "A strange ore that challenges the scientific definition of \"life\".": "「生命」の科学的定義に疑問を投げかける奇妙な鉱石。",
  "Dinosaur Egg": "恐竜の卵",
  "Jammed full of genetic materials.": "遺伝素材がぎっしり詰まっている。",
  "Rasiline Crystal": "Rasilineクリスタル",
  "A holy gem to the Eld'uukhar. Produces severe hallucinations when consumed.": "エルドゥーカーの聖なる宝石。摂取すると激しい幻覚を引き起こす",
  "Reactormagnet": "リアクターマグネット",
  "A key part of most reactors, keeping energy contained and stored.": "大半のリアクターの重要部品。エネルギーを封じ込め蓄積",
  "Reanimation Fluid": "蘇生液",
  "Able to revive dead flesh with the help of a proper catalyst.": "適切な触媒があれば死んだ肉体を蘇生できる",
  "Red Matter": "レッドマター",
  "Long thought impossible to create, this supreme energy is exceptionally dangerous.": "長らく創造不可能と考えられていたこの究極のエネルギーは極めて危険",
  "Red Beeswax": "赤い蜜蝋",
  "A red chunk of beeswax.": "赤い蜜蝋の塊",
  "Rekite Crystal": "Rekiteクリスタル",
  "Reacts with the Oceanite in Eld'uukhar tech to create a small amount (+2) of fuel.": "エルドゥーカー技術のオセアナイトと反応し少量（+2）の燃料を生成",
  "Rukar Crystal": "Rukarクリスタル",
  "A blood red gem.": "血のように赤い宝石",
  "Sahkite Crystal": "Sahkiteクリスタル",
  "A gem harvested in a similar shape to Thanatite.": "タナタイトに似た形で採取された宝石",
  "Come Visit Us!": "遊びに来てね！",
  "An informational brochure about a science facility.": "科学施設の案内パンフレット",
  "Behavior Module": "Behaviorモジュール",
  "A droid behavior module.": "ドロイドの行動モジュール",
  "Servitor Chassis": "サーヴィターシャーシ",
  "A servitor chassis. Perhaps I could build my own droid!": "サーヴィターのシャーシ。自分のドロイドを作れるかも！",
  "Weapon System Parts": "兵器システムパーツ",
  "A potential weapon system for a droid.": "ドロイド用の潜在的兵器システム",
  "Shoggoth Flesh": "Shoggoth肉",
  "Chunks of flesh from a horrifying Shoggoth.": "恐ろしいショゴスの肉片",
  "Sivite": "シヴァイト",
  "Can produce magnesium and phosphorus via extraction.": "抽出でマグネシウムとリンを生産可能",
  "Impervium Compound": "Imperviumコンパウンド",
  "The sturdiest material there is. Too stiff and expensive to be used for armor though.": "最も頑丈な素材。だが硬すぎて高価で防具には使えない",
  "Reinforced Glass": "強化ガラス",
  "Sturdy and durable glass.": "頑丈で耐久性のあるガラス",
  "Lunari Shard": "ルナリシャード",
  "A sparkling yellow crystal shard.": "キラキラした黄色いクリスタルシャード",
  "This common element is essential to life despite readily forming explosive compounds.": "爆発性化合物を容易に形成するにも関わらず、生命に不可欠な元素",
  "Tethyde": "テシデ",
  "An extremely durable material consisting of bonded durasteel and penumbrite.": "デュラスチールとペナンブライトの結合による極めて耐久性の高い素材",
  "Tethyde Plating": "Tethydeプレート",
  "Tethyde, carefully prepared for crafting furniture with.": "家具製作用に丁寧に加工されたテシデ",
  "Thanatite Crystal": "Thanatiteクリスタル",
  "A gem that generates thermal energy. Can be used to keep warm on colder planets.": "熱エネルギーを生成する。寒い惑星で暖を取るのに使える宝石。",
  "Tokanite Crystal": "Tokaniteクリスタル",
  "A green gem that rings with a high tone when struck.": "叩くと高い音が鳴る緑の宝石",
  "Upilite Crystal": "Upiliteクリスタル",
  "A gemstone often used to strengthen Emera to create more sturdy fabric.": "エメラを強化してより頑丈な布を作るのによく使われる宝石",
  "Edible Uranium": "食用ウラニウム",
  "X'ian processes have stripped the impurities. \n^yellow;Type: Isotope^reset;": "シーの工程で不純物が除去されている\n^yellow;タイプ: 同位体^reset;",
  "Warp Manifold": "ワープマニフォールド",
  "A key component in FTL drives.": "FTLドライブの重要な部品",
  "Beeswax": "蜜蝋",
  "A chunk of beeswax.": "蜜蝋の塊",
  "Woven Crystal": "Wovenクリスタル",
  "Crystal stretched and spun into fabric.": "クリスタルを引き延ばして紡いだ布",
  "Wrapped Corpse": "包まれた死体",
  "A corpse, wound unceremoniously in cloth to prevent gore leaving a mess.": "血糊が散らからないよう無造作に布で巻かれた死体",
  "Wrapped Alien Corpse": "包まれたエイリアンの死体",
  "A wrapped corpse of an unknown alien species.": "未知のエイリアン種族の包まれた死体",
  "Wrapped Avian Corpse": "包まれたエイビアンの死体",
  "A corpse, bound in an elaborate gold-plated casket.": "精巧な金メッキの棺に収められた死体",
  "Wrapped Putrid Corpse": "包まれた腐った死体",
  "A rotting, putrid corpse best avoided by the sane.": "正気なら避けるべき腐敗した悪臭の死体",
  "X'ian Bulb": "X'ian球根",
  "A highly radioactive plant-like bulb.": "高放射性の植物のような球根",
  "Xithricite Ore": "ジスリサイト鉱石",
  "A super-dense crystalline metal.": "超高密度の結晶金属",
  "Zerchesium Ore": "ゼルケシウム鉱石",
  "Can be refined into a nearly unmeltable alloy.": "ほぼ溶けない合金に精製可能",
  "^#88e25b;Alien Compound^reset;": "^#88e25b;エイリアンコンパウンド^reset;",
  "Strange compounds with various amazing uses in scientific research.": "科学研究に様々な驚くべき用途を持つ奇妙な化合物",
  "Biofuel Canister": "バイオ燃料キャニスター",
  "A decent biofuel.\n^blue;+^white;8 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "まともなバイオ燃料\n^blue;+^white;8 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Erithian Biofuel Canister": "エリシアンバイオ燃料キャニスター",
  "A superior biofuel.\n^blue;+^white;15 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "高品質バイオ燃料\n^blue;+^white;15 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Protocite Fuel Canister": "プロトサイト燃料キャニスター",
  "A truly amazing fuel source.\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "驚異的な燃料源\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Purrpetual Energy": "パーペチュアルエネルギー",
  "Impossibly good fuel.\n^blue;+^white;3000 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "信じられないほど良い燃料\n^blue;+^white;3000 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Mutated Cell": "Mutatedセル",
  "A cell riddled with unusual biological mutations.": "異常な生物学的変異だらけの細胞",
  "Spliced Cell": "Splicedセル",
  "An engineered cell.": "エンジニアードセル",
  "Viral Cell": "Viralセル",
  "Potentially dangerous viral cells.": "潜在的に危険なウイルス細胞",
  "^#88e25b;Lasombrium Seed^reset;": "^#88e25b;ラソンブリウムの種^reset;",
  "Applied sparingly to various materials to encourage unusual changes in structure.": "素材に少量塗布して構造の異常な変化を促す",
  "It's what plants crave.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "植物が求めるもの\n^green;成長速度 x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;",
  "Advanced Fertilizer": "高度な肥料",
  "A step above lesser fertilizers.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;2.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "下位の肥料より一段上\n^green;成長速度x^white;2.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;",
  "Superior Fertilizer": "上級肥料",
  "Ultra fertilizer.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;3 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;Uses -^white;0.25 ^cyan;fluid use ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;2 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "ウルトラ肥料\n^green;成長速度 x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;3 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;液体消費 -^white;0.25 ^gray;& ^cyan;種子消費 -^white;2^reset;",
  "Mulch": "マルチ",
  "Great for fertilizing a hydroponics tray.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.25 ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "水耕栽培トレイの肥料に最適\n^green;成長速度 x^white;1.25 ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;",
  "Methyl Iodide": "ヨウ化メチル",
  "An extremely toxic, but useful lab reagent.": "極めて有毒だが有用な実験試薬",
  "^#88e25b;Morphite^reset;": "^#88e25b;モルファイト^reset;",
  "A lab-built custom alloy. Tough but malleable.": "ラボ製カスタム合金。頑丈だが可鍛性あり",
  "Potent Mutagene": "強力ミュータジーン",
  "A potent mutagenic extract, laced with various single-celled experiments.": "様々な単細胞実験を含む強力な変異原性抽出物",
  "Powerful Mutagene": "超強力ミュータジーン",
  "A powerful mutagenic extract with multiple lab applications.": "複数の研究用途を持つ強力な変異原性抽出物",
  "Mutagene": "ミュータジーン",
  "This mutagen is nearly devoid of useful material, yet can adversely affect cell structure.": "この変異原はほぼ有用物質を含まないが、細胞構造に悪影響を及ぼす",
  "Durable Mutagene": "耐久ミュータジーン",
  "Vibrant with moving colors, this bizarre substance can alter the structure of cells.": "動く色彩が鮮やかなこの奇妙な物質は細胞構造を変えられる",
  "^#88e25b;Unstable Particles^reset;": "^#88e25b;不安定粒子^reset;",
  "Unstable but contained particles for use in weapons, energy projection and more.": "不安定だが封じ込められた粒子。武器、エネルギー投射等に使用",
  "Aethercreep": "エーテルクリープ",
  "^green;Weight : 1g^reset;^green;Weight : 1g^reset; ^red;Narcotic.\n^white; Doubles health, but halves energy reserve.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "ナルコティック（麻薬）",
  "Dried Fay Mushrooaams": "乾燥フェイマッシュルーム",
  "^green;Weight : 0.1g^reset; ^red;Narcotic\n^white; Triggers severe hallucinations. Breaks the mind, but inspires creativity.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 9": "ナルコティック（麻薬）",
  "Ghost Mushrooms": "ゴーストマッシュルーム",
  "^green;Weight : 1g^reset;^red; Narcotic\n^white;Reduces defense by 80%, but gain 60% energy regen rates.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "ナルコティック（麻薬）",
  "Dried Radleaf": "乾燥ラドリーフ",
  "^green;Weight : 1g^reset;^red; Narcotic\n^white;Relaxes your mind, opening it to vistas of scientific possibility previously unconsidered.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "ナルコティック（麻薬）",
  "Expiravit Tar": "エクスピラヴィトタール",
  "^green;Weight : 1g^reset;.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "^green;重量: 1g^reset;\n^blue;狂気増加^reset; 3",
  "Mal-Jak 1.21": "マルジャク 1.21",
  "Rolled Radleaf Funstick": "巻きラドリーフファンスティック",
  "Radiant": "ラディアント",
  "Toxictop Blotter": "トキシックトップブロッター",
  "Vex-roids": "ヴェクスロイド",
  "Wubby Wubby": "ウビーウビー",
  "^#88e25b;Advanced Alloy^reset;": "^#88e25b;高度な合金^reset;",
  "Compression of various metals has resulted in a super strong metal plating.": "各種金属の圧縮により超強力な金属メッキが完成",
  "^#88e25b;Aetherium Alloy^reset;": "^#88e25b;エーテリウム合金^reset;",
  "A godly and thunderous alloy composed of the densest and rarest substances in the Cosmos.": "宇宙で最も高密度で希少な物質から成る神々しく雷鳴のような合金",
  "Carbon Plate": "カーボンプレート",
  "Carbon plating can be used for armor or other goods.": "カーボンメッキは防具や他の製品に使用可能",
  "^#88e25b;Dense Alloy^reset;": "^#88e25b;デンス合金^reset;",
  "Aegisalt, violium and ferozium have formed this into a dense alloy.": "イージスアルト、ヴィオリウム、フェロジウムが高密度合金に",
  "Densinium Bar": "デンシニウムのインゴット",
  "A supreme metal of unsurpassed hardness and density.": "硬度と密度が比類なき最高の金属",
  "Ebon Shard": "Ebonシャード",
  "A shiny shard of ebon gemstone.": "漆黒の宝石の光沢のあるシャード",
  "Effigium Bar": "エフィジウムのインゴット",
  "Light has issues refracting off of this shadowy surface, rendering this metal nearly invisible.": "光がこの影の表面で屈折し、この金属はほぼ不可視になる",
  "Amber Chunk": "琥珀の塊",
  "A chunk of solid amber.": "固体の琥珀の塊",
  "Irradium Bar": "イラジウムのインゴット",
  "Compressed, purified irradium. Generally found on Irradiated worlds.": "圧縮・精製されたイラジウム。主に汚染された世界に存在",
  "Isogen Bar": "アイソジェンのインゴット",
  "A super-cold alloy with numerous powerful applications.\nOften located on Ice Wastes.": "多くの強力な用途を持つ超低温合金\n氷の荒野でよく見つかる",
  "Telebrium Bar": "テレブリウムのインゴット",
  "Forged Telebrium, commonly found on moons.": "鍛造テレブリウム。月でよく見つかる",
  "Morphite Bar": "Morphiteのインゴット",
  "Lab-created and highly malleable metal that can serve many uses.": "ラボ製の高可鍛性金属。多くの用途に使える",
  "^#88e25b;Nocxium Bar^reset;": "^#88e25b;ノクシウムインゴット^reset;",
  "An abhorrent metal created of raw chaos.": "生の混沌から作られた忌まわしい金属",
  "Penumbrite Shard": "ペナンブライトシャード",
  "A perfectly refined shard of penumbrite, located on Penumbra planets.": "完璧に精製されたペナンブライトのシャード。ペナンブラ惑星に存在",
  "You've no idea what metals this is made from.": "何の金属でできているか見当もつかない",
  "Protocite Bar": "プロトサイトのインゴット",
  "A bar of compressed protocite, found on Protoworlds.": "圧縮プロトサイトのインゴット。プロトワールドに存在",
  "Pyreite Bar": "パイライトのインゴット",
  "A naturally hot metal with high durability. Typically found on Infernus worlds.": "天然の高温金属で高耐久。主にインフェルヌス世界に存在",
  "Quietus Bar": "クワイタスのインゴット",
  "Able to hold super-sharp edges, and withstand kinetic force.": "超鋭利な刃を保持し、運動力に耐える",
  "Condensed and hardened Lunari crystal.": "凝縮・硬化されたルナリクリスタル",
  "Trianglium Pyramid": "トライアングリウムピラミッド",
  "A melding of trianglium shards, which are found in many unusual places.": "珍しい場所で見つかるトライアングリウムシャードの融合",
  "^#88e25b;Tritanium Bar^reset;": "^#88e25b;トリタニウムインゴット^reset;",
  "A fantastic alloy composed of various metals.": "各種金属から成る素晴らしい合金",
  "A pan-dimensional powerhouse often found in aether seas.": "エーテルの海でよく見つかる次元を超えた強力な物質",
  "Zerchesium Bar": "ゼルケシウムのインゴット",
  "Has the highest melting point of any known alloy, much greater than even tungsten! Found on Mountainous worlds.": "既知の合金で最高の融点。タングステンをも凌ぐ！山岳世界に存在",
  "^#88e25b;Anti-Neutronium Rod^reset;": "^#88e25b;反ニュートロニウムロッド^reset;",
  "A 'natural' opposite to neutronium. Exceptionally unsafe.\n^blue;+^white;600 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "ニュートロニウムの「天然の」対極。極めて危険\n^blue;+^white;600 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Deuterium Rod": "Deuteriumロッド",
  "A condensed rod of Deuterium.\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "凝縮された重水素ロッド\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Enriched Plutonium Rod^reset;": "^#88e25b;濃縮プルトニウムロッド^reset;",
  "An improved form of plutonium.\n^blue;+^white;28 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "改良型プルトニウム\n^blue;+^white;28 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Enriched Uranium Rod^reset;": "^#88e25b;濃縮ウラニウムロッド^reset;",
  "An improved form of uranium.\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "改良型ウラニウム\n^blue;+^white;25 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Neptunium Ore": "Neptunium鉱石",
  "Commonly used in weapons development\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "兵器開発によく使われる\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Edible Neptunium": "食用ネプツニウム",
  "Neptunium Rod": "Neptuniumロッド",
  "This radioactive isotope is typically found on Threat 3+ planets.\n^blue;+^white;5 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "この放射性同位体は脅威レベル3以上の惑星で見つかる\n^blue;+^white;5 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Neutronium Rod^reset;": "^#88e25b;ニュートロニウムロッド^reset;",
  "A substance composed purely of neutrons. Ultra-dense.\n^blue;+^white;300 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "純粋に中性子で構成された物質。超高密度\n^blue;+^white;300 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Edible Plutonium": "食用プルトニウム",
  "Thorium Ore": "Thorium鉱石",
  "Commonly used in weapons development.\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "兵器開発によく使われる.\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Edible Thorium": "食用トリウム",
  "Thorium Rod": "トリウムロッド",
  "This radioactive isotope is typically found on Threat 4+ planets.\n^blue;+^white;6 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "この放射性同位体は脅威レベル4以上の惑星で見つかる\n^blue;+^white;6 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Tritium Rod": "Tritiumロッド",
  "A rod of tritium. Product of fission.\n^blue;+^white;3 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "トリチウムのロッド。核分裂の産物\n^blue;+^white;3 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Ultronium Rod^reset;": "^#88e25b;ウルトロニウムロッド^reset;",
  "A unique isotope created by very specific circumstances.\n^blue;+^white;120 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "非常に特殊な状況で生成される固有の同位体\n^blue;+^white;120 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Unknown Artifact^reset;": "^#88e25b;未知のアーティファクト^reset;",
  "You have absolutely no idea what this could be. But the language imprints itself in your brain, revealing secrets.": "これが何か全く見当もつかない。だが言語が脳に刻まれ秘密が明かされる",
  "^#77acc3;Advanced Circuit^reset;": "^#77acc3;高度な回路^reset;",
  "A robust and advanced circuit board.": "頑丈な高性能回路基板",
  "^#88e25b;A.I. Chip^reset;": "^#88e25b;A.I.チップ^reset;",
  "An unrivaled chipset capable of impossibly complex processes.": "不可能なほど複雑な処理が可能な比類なきチップセット",
  "Coil": "コイル",
  "A special electrical coil. It has the ability to charge itself.": "希少な電気コイル。自己充電能力を持つ",
  "^#77acc3;Advanced Processor^reset;": "^#77acc3;高度なプロセッサー^reset;",
  "A high-end processor.": "ハイエンドプロセッサー",
  "^#77acc3;Electromagnet^reset;": "^#77acc3;電磁石^reset;",
  "An advanced electromagnet.": "高性能電磁石",
  "An array that can redirect passing particle streams.": "通過する粒子ストリームをリダイレクトできるアレイ。",
  "^#88e25b;Focusing Array^reset;": "^#88e25b;フォーカシングアレイ^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Quantum Processor^reset;": "^#88e25b;量子プロセッサー^reset;",
  "Top-of-the-line computing power.": "最高水準の演算能力",
  "^#88e25b;Warped A.I. Chip^reset;": "^#88e25b;歪みA.I.チップ^reset;",
  "^red;DEPRECATED ITEM: EXTRACT TO RECLAIM RESOURCES^reset;": "^red;非推奨アイテム: 資源回収のため抽出^reset;",
  "Electromagnetic Shielding": "電磁シールド",
  "A material shielded against electromagnetic waves.": "電磁波を遮断する素材",
  "Microchip": "マイクロチップ",
  "A basic microchip.": "シンプルなmicrochip",
  "^#88e25b;Nuclear Core^reset;": "^#88e25b;ニュークリアコア^reset;",
  "Great and terrible nuclear power. Handle with care.": "偉大で恐ろしい核エネルギー。取り扱い注意",
  "^#77acc3;Particle Core^reset;": "^#77acc3;パーティクルコア^reset;",
  "The energy source for particle weapons.": "粒子兵器のエネルギー源",
  "^#88e25b;Power Core^reset;": "^#88e25b;パワーコア^reset;",
  "A power core used to energize tech.": "テックに電力を供給するパワーコア",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Artifact^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダーアーティファクト^reset;",
  "A strange, unknowably ancient artifact.": "奇妙で計り知れないほど古代のアーティファクト",
  "^#ffe50e;Unknown Technology^reset;": "^#ffe50e;未知のテクノロジー^reset;",
  "What purpose could this thing serve?": "この物体の目的は何だ？",
  "^#ffe50e;Akashic Stone^reset;": "^#ffe50e;アカシックストーン^reset;",
  "This stone reads as inorganic, yet bleeds if cut.": "この石は無機物だが切ると血が出る",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Core^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダーコア^reset;",
  "Some sort of power core, or perhaps a battery.": "何らかのパワーコア、あるいはバッテリー",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Fragment^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダーの断片^reset;",
  "Lost knowledge of an unknown race.": "未知の種族の失われた知識",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Sign^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダー看板^reset;",
  "Some sort of warding symbol.": "何らかの守護のシンボル",
  "^#ffe50e;Trapezohedron^reset;": "^#ffe50e;台形二十四面体^reset;",
  "A non-euclidian artifact.": "非ユークリッド的なアーティファクト",
  "^#ffe50e;Celaeno Fragment^reset;": "^#ffe50e;セラエノの断片^reset;",
  "A piece of the fabled Celaeno.": "伝説のセラエノの一片",
  "^#ffe50e;Blade Shard^reset;": "^#ffe50e;ブレードシャード^reset;",
  "A small shard from a larger blade. Ancient.": "より大きな刃から取れた小さな破片。古代のもの",
  "^#ffe50e;Engraved Device^reset;": "^#ffe50e;彫刻された装置^reset;",
  "This glowing device is marked with ancient, unknown script.": "この光る装置には古代の未知の文字が刻まれている",
  "^#ffe50e;Ancient Glyph^reset;": "^#ffe50e;古代のグリフ^reset;",
  "A strange glyph with an embossed symbol.": "浮き彫りのシンボルがある奇妙なグリフ",
  "^#ffe50e;Valtan Casing^reset;": "^#ffe50e;ヴァルタンケーシング^reset;",
  "Fractal patterns swirl within a red crystalline sphere.": "赤い結晶球の中でフラクタルパターンが渦を巻く",
  "^#ffe50e;Rune Wand^reset;": "^#ffe50e;走りのワンド^reset;",
  "The purpose of these runed wands is unknown.": "これらのルーンワンドの目的は不明",
  "^#ffe50e;Unknown Reactor^reset;": "^#ffe50e;アンノウンリアクター^reset;",
  "This seems to be a hand-sized power source. Origin unknown.": "手のひらサイズの電源のようだ。起源不明",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Bust^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダーの胸像^reset;",
  "A bust of a hideous alien. Probably not the best decoration. Unless you're evil.": "醜悪なエイリアンの胸像。最高の装飾ではない。邪悪でない限り",
  "^#ffe50e;Elder Tome^reset;": "^#ffe50e;エルダーの書^reset;",
  "A book containing ancient and malign texts.": "古代の邪悪な文書を含む本",
  "^#ffe50e;Tattered Grimoire^reset;": "^#ffe50e;ボロボロの魔導書^reset;",
  "Whispers from the cosmos compel you to write this text.": "宇宙からのささやきがこのテキストを書かせる",
  "Exotic Matter": "エキゾチックマター",
  "Elusive, and potentially impossible.": "捉えどころがなく、おそらく不可能",
  "Honed Lunari": "研ぎ澄まされたルナリ",
  "A perfectly re-shaped piece of lunari, ready to charge with energy.": "エネルギー充填準備の整った完璧に再成形されたルナリ",
  "Anulax Battery": "Anulaxバッテリー",
  "A battery made of some now unknown form of energy. Looks valuable.": "今は知られていない形のエネルギーで作られたバッテリー。高価そうだ",
  "Precursor Charge Module": "プリカーサーChargeモジュール",
  "Able to store potent charges for various uses.": "様々な用途に強力な充電を蓄積可能",
  "Neural Processor": "Neuralプロセッサー",
  "Incredibly powerful neuron-based processor.": "信じられないほど強力なニューロンベースのプロセッサー",
  "Flux Core": "Fluxコア",
  "A quantum-state energy matrix suspended in...antimatter?": "反物質に浮遊する量子状態のエネルギーマトリクス…？",
  "Precursor Data Storage": "プリカーサーDataストレージ",
  "Physical storage containing unknown ancient secrets.": "未知の古代の秘密を含む物理ストレージ",
  "Quantum Fluid": "量子流体",
  "A nearly magical space-time fluid suspended in a portable gravity well.\n^blue;+^white;200 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "携帯重力井戸に浮遊するほぼ魔法の時空流体\n^blue;+^white;200 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Dimensional Cell": "ディメンショナルセル",
  "A hand-held fuel cell with limitless potential!": "無限のポテンシャルを持つ携帯型燃料電池！",
  "State-Phase Gel": "ステートフェーズジェル",
  "A hybrid gel capable of multiple states simultaneously.": "同時に複数の状態を取れるハイブリッドジェル",
  "Subspace Flux Fluid": "亜空間フラックス流体",
  "A strange fluid with no true stable state.": "本当の安定状態がない奇妙な流体",
  "Precursor Harddrive": "プリカーサーハードドライブ",
  "What wonders are stored within?": "中にどんな驚異が蓄えられている？",
  "Precursor Memory Unit": "プリカーサーメモリユニット",
  "Some form of data-storage, not unlike RAM.": "RAMに似たデータストレージの一種",
  "Unknown Gene": "未知の遺伝子",
  "A bizarre quadruple-helix gene.": "奇妙な四重らせん遺伝子",
  "Ale Mash": "Aleマッシュ",
  "Ale mash, the product of soaked wheat, yellow petals and water.": "エールマッシュ。浸した小麦、黄色い花びら、水の産物",
  "Apple Juice": "リンゴジュース",
  "A sweet juice made from apples.\n^green;Heal ^white;50% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "リンゴから作った甘いジュース\n^green;回復 ^white;50% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Apple Mash": "Appleマッシュ",
  "Apple Mash, the product of crushed and squeezed apples.": "アップルマッシュ。リンゴを潰して絞った産物",
  "Caramel": "キャラメル",
  "Ooey-gooey caramel!": "とろ〜りキャラメル！",
  "Cherry Mash": "Cherryマッシュ",
  "Cherry Mash, the product of crushed and squeezed cherries.": "チェリーマッシュ。サクランボを潰して絞った産物",
  "Cinnamon": "シナモン",
  "Spicy cinnamon sticks!": "スパイシーなシナモンスティック！",
  "Dark Ale Mash": "ダークAleマッシュ",
