  "A bottle of mild ale. The alcohol content is around 5%.\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^red;Buzzed ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)^reset;": "マイルドエールのボトル。アルコール度数は約5%\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Tiy Lager": "ティイラガー",
  "A mug of lager. The alcohol content is relatively low.\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;25s^gray;)^reset;": "ラガージョッキ。アルコール度数は比較的低い\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Sarkomand Ale": "サルコマンドエール",
  "Honed from the very essence of dreams...and made into booze. Probably not safe.\n^cyan;+^white;17 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;, ^red;Insane^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "夢のエッセンスから作られた…酒。おそらく安全ではない\n^cyan;+^white;17 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;, ^red;狂乱^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;鈍足 ^gray;, ^red;酔い ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Esteemed Vintage": "名高いヴィンテージ",
  "Yes, you read that right. It's made from insect babies.\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^orange;\"New Friend\" ^gray;after ^white;2m^reset;": "読み間違いじゃない。昆虫の赤ちゃんで作られている\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Taelon Mead": "Taelonミード",
  "It is said this ale brings amazing luck.\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Buzzed ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)\n^orange;chance of gifts^reset;": "このエールは驚くべき幸運をもたらすと言われている\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Tenebrhaeic Kilvrat": "テネブレイクキルヴラト",
  "An offensively strong alcohol intended for consumption by the multiphasic Tenebrhae.\n^cyan;+^white;120 ^cyan;HP^gray;, ^pink;Mud^gray;, ^pink;Slime^gray;, ^pink;Icy^gray;, ^pink;Snow ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)\n^red;Hammered ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "多相テネブレイ向けの攻撃的に強いアルコール\n^cyan;+^white;120 ^cyan;HP^gray;, ^pink;泥^gray;, ^pink;スライム^gray;, ^pink;氷^gray;, ^pink;雪^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)\n^red;泥酔 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Lager": "ラガー",
  "A bottle of frothy lager!\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;25s^gray;)^reset;": "泡立つラガーのボトル！\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Grape Lambic": "グレープランビック",
