  "Pale Ale": "ペールエール",
  "A bottle of very pale ale\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)^reset;": "非常に淡いペールエールのボトル\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Protovex": "プロトヴェクス",
  "A sort of energy-infused, beer-ish liquid.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Poison ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;50 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^red;Hammered ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "エネルギーが注入されたビール風の液体\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;50 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^red;泥酔 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "X'ian Ale": "シーのエール",
