  "A Glitch favorite.\n^cyan;+^white;4 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "グリッチのお気に入り\n^cyan;+^white;4 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Coal Stout": "コールスタウト",
  "A mug of stout\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;25s^gray;)^reset;": "スタウトジョッキ\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Thelusian Fire Wine": "テルシアンファイアワイン",
  "One of the strongest known alcohols.\n^cyan;+10% Physical & Knockback Res.^reset; & ^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Ice ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Frost ^cyan;Immunity^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;Hammered^gray; (^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "知られる中で最も強いアルコールの一つ\n^cyan;+10% 物理 & ノックバック耐性^reset; & ^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;霜^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;, ^red;泥酔^gray; (^white;30s^gray;)^reset;",
  "VX Special Blend": "VXスペシャルブレンド",
  "One of the rarest known alcohols. It's good stuff.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Poison^gray;, ^pink;Moderate Radiation^gray;, ^pink;Shadow^gray;, ^pink;Cosmic ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;50 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^pink;Frost ^cyan;Immunity^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^red;Hammered ^gray;(^white;4m^gray;)^reset;": "知られる中で最も希少なアルコールの一つ。良い酒だ\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;毒^gray;, ^pink;中度放射線^gray;, ^pink;シャドウ^gray;, ^pink;コズミック ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;50 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^pink;霜^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;鈍足 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^red;泥酔 ^gray;(^white;4m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Blood Chalice": "ブラッドチャリス",
  "A Chalice full of blood from a terrible ritual devised by ^orange;Synniebun^reset;, ^orange;Izuna^reset;, and ^orange;Koshi^reset;.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;), ^green;Heal ^white;60 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;), ^green;Heal ^white;200.2% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;": "恐ろしい儀式の血で満たされた聖杯。^orange;Synniebun^reset;、^orange;Izuna^reset;、^orange;Koshi^reset;が考案。\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;), ^green;回復 ^white;60 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;), ^green;回復 ^white;200.2% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;",
  "A cold drink that provides a energy boost. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "エネルギーを補給する冷たい飲み物。^green;種類: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Hard Apple Cider": "ハードアップルサイダー",
  "A bottle of apple cider!\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "リンゴサイダーのボトル！\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Mantizan Wine": "Mantizanワイン",
  "The rarest and most highly-esteemed wine in the known universe\n^cyan;+^white;8 ^cyan;Defense^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;All ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "既知の宇宙で最も希少で最も尊ばれるワイン\n^cyan;+^white;8 ^cyan;防御^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;全 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Meadbee Mead": "蜂蜜酒beeミード",
  "A jug of sweet meadbee mead!\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "甘いミードビー蜂蜜酒の瓶！\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;、^red;酔い^reset;",
  "Miracle Ambrosia": "ミラクルアンブロシア",
  "A miraculous ambrosia.\nFully restores ^green;Health ^reset;and ^green;Energy^reset;, as well as filling your ^green;belly^reset; and making you ^red;drunk^reset;.": "奇跡のアンブロシア\n^green;体力^reset;と^green;エネルギー^reset;を完全回復し、^green;腹^reset;も満たすが^red;酔い^reset;になる",
  "Perry": "ペリー",
  "A bottle of sweet perry!\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "甘いペリーのボトル！\n^cyan;+^white;3 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45秒^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;、^red;酔い^reset;",
  "Poire": "ポワール",
  "Jeroboam of sweet perry!\n^cyan;+^white;10 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "甘いペリーのジェロボアム！\n^cyan;+^white;10 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;, ^red;酔い^reset;",
  "Premium Cyanider": "プレミアムシアナイダー",
  "Cyanider for the knowledgeable!\n^cyan;+^white;10 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "知識人のためのサイアニダー！\n^cyan;+^white;10 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;, ^red;酔い^reset;",
  "Puka-Cola": "プカコーラ",
  "Ingesting this seems distinctly unwise. But screw it! DOWN THE HATCH!\n^red;Frost Burn ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;), ^red;Insane^gray;(^white;2m^gray;), ^cyan;+^white;8 ^cyan;Defense^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;All ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "これを食べるのは明らかに賢くない。でもいいや！いただきます！\n^red;凍傷 ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;), ^red;狂乱^gray;(^white;2m^gray;), ^cyan;+^white;8 ^cyan;防御^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;全 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Soulleaf Spritz": "ソウルリーフスプリッツ",
  "A strange, ethereal brew. Perfect for an out of body experience.\n^cyan;Ethereal^reset; and ^red;Drunk^reset; for 30s.": "奇妙なエーテルの醸造酒。体外離脱体験に最適\n^cyan;エーテル化^reset; and ^red;酔い^reset; for 30s.",
  "Blonde Coffee": "ブロンドコーヒー",
  "A less potent, commercial-grade coffee.\n^cyan;Weakly Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "弱めの市販グレードコーヒー\n^cyan;弱カフェイン ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Chunky Meat Coffee": "チャンキーミートコーヒー",
  "Please don't.\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^cyan;Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "やめてくれ\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^cyan;カフェイン ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Espresso": "エスプレッソ",
  "A rich and potent caffeinated blend.\n^cyan;Strongly Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "豊かで強力なカフェインブレンド\n^cyan;強カフェイン ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Cafe Au Lait": "カフェオレ",
  "Coffee and hot milk.\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;), ^cyan;Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "コーヒーとホットミルク\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;), ^cyan;カフェイン ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Dark Roast Coffee": "ダークRoastコーヒー",
  "Concentrated coffee. Dense and very strong, as dark as tar but much more palatable.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^cyan;Extremely Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "濃縮コーヒー。濃厚でとても強い。タールのように黒いがずっと飲みやすい\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^cyan;超強カフェイン ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "A cold sweet drink. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "冷たく甘い飲み物。^green;種類: フルーツ^reset;",
