  "A bottle of cherry flavored schnapps!\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "チェリー風味シュナップスのボトル！\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Cinnamon Schnapps": "Cinnamonシュナップス",
  "A bottle of cinnamon-infused schnapps!\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "シナモン風味シュナップスのボトル！\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Scumslim": "スカムスリム",
  "Looks pretty toxic, but it tastes surprisingly great.\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Poison ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "かなり有毒そうだが、驚くほど美味しい\n^red;酔い^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Doom Vodka": "ドゥームウォッカ",
  "A booze that increases shadow resistance.\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Shadow ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "シャドウ耐性を上げる酒\n^red;酔い^gray;、^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;シャドウ ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Grape Schnapps": "Grapeシュナップス",
  "A bottle of grape flavored schnapps!\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "グレープ風味シュナップスのボトル！\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Gygaxian Shadow Juice": "Gygaxianシャドウジュース",
  "Well...it's alcohol. For sure. It might be safe to drink.\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Shadow ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "まあ…アルコールではある。確実に。飲んでも安全かもしれない\n^red;酔い^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;シャドウ ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Ice Spirits": "アイススピリッツ",
  "A chilling drink. Har har.\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Ice ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "冷え冷えのドリンク。はは\n^red;酔い^gray;、^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Magma Whiskey": "Magmaウイスキー",
  "Is this wise to ingest? It appears to be ^red;extremely^reset; hot.\n^red;Burning ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)\n^red;Melting ^gray;(^white;3s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Physical ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "これを食べるのは賢明か？見た目は^red;極めて^reset;熱い。\n^red;燃焼 ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)\n^red;溶解 ^gray;(^white;3s^gray;)\n^red;酔い^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;物理 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Peach Schnapps": "Peachシュナップス",
  "A bottle of peach flavored schnapps!\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "ピーチ風味シュナップスのボトル！\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Shadow Spirits": "シャドウスピリッツ",
  "Delicious spirits infused with raw chaos. And you're going to drink it.\n^pink;Shadow Taint ^cyan;Immunity^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "生のカオスを注入した美味しいスピリッツ。あなたはこれを飲む\n^pink;シャドウ汚染 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^red;酔い ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Rectified Spirits": "レクティファイドスピリッツ",
  "A bottle of fruit-infused rectified spirits!\n^white;35% ^red;Slow ^gray;, ^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)^reset;": "フルーツ風味蒸留酒のボトル！\n^white;35% ^red;鈍足^reset;",
  "Timewinder Schnapps": "タイムワインダーシュナップス",
  "A bottle of...time...flavored schnapps? The best drink that never happened!\n^white;Temporal Loop ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;": "時間…風味のシュナップス？起こらなかった最高の飲み物！\n^white;時間ループ ^gray;(^white;5秒^gray;)^reset;",
