  "Berrymeat": "ベリーミート",
  "The combination of a poisonous berry and a frozen steak ends up with a surprisingly tasty meal!\n^green;Heal ^white;30 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Fruits^reset;": "毒ベリーと冷凍ステーキの組み合わせが驚くほど美味しい食事に！\n^green;回復 ^white;30 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+フルーツ^reset;",
  "Coldmarrow Panini": "コールドマロウパニーニ",
  "A frozen meat and Boneboo sandwich, cooked to perfection - then served cold. ^green;Heal ^white;20 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "冷凍肉とボーンブーのサンドイッチ。完璧に調理されてから冷やされた。^green;回復 ^white;20 ^gray;(^white;2秒^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Apple Cinnamon Pie": "アップルシナモンパイ",
  "An old Protectorate favorite dessert! Just like mom used to make. \n^cyan;+^reset;10% ^green;Energy^reset;^cyan; +^reset;10% ^green;HP^reset; \n^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "旧プロテクトレートの定番デザート！お母さんの味 \n^cyan;+^reset;10% ^green;エネルギー^reset;^cyan; +^reset;10% ^green;HP^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Kadavan Meal": "カダヴァンの食事",
  "A traditional Kadavan meal, a warrior's favourite.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;210s^gray;)\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Rage ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "伝統的なカダヴァンの食事、戦士のお気に入り\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;210s^gray;)\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;レイジ ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Awful Offal Smoothie": "オーフルオファルスムージー",
  "Blended rotten food. The greatest invention of Dupont Dewpawnt. 90^red;s -^reset;5^red;% Health^reset; 15^red;s Poisoned^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^red;Type: Raw Meat Dairy Dessert^reset;": "腐った食べ物のブレンド。デュポン・デューポーントの最大の発明 90^red;s -^reset;5^red;% 回復^reset; 15^red;s 毒^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^red;タイプ: 生肉+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Banana Pudding": "バナナプリン",
  "Sweet, creamy and delicious.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Crit Chance ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "甘くてクリーミーで美味しい\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;クリティカル率 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Big Breakfast": "ビッグブレックファスト",
  "A full breakfast plate of cinnamon apple pancakes; the best way to start the day! \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; Energy^reset;^cyan; +^reset;10%^green; HP^reset; \n^orange;Type: Fruits + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "シナモンアップルパンケーキの朝食プレート。一日の最高のスタート！ \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; エネルギー^reset;^cyan; +^reset;10%^green; HP^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: フルーツ+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Blam": "ブラム",
  "'Blam', short for Butchered Lambian, a now extinct Floran favorite.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Fire ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Fire ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "「ブラム」、Butchered Lambianの略。今は絶滅したフローランのお気に入り\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;炎 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;炎 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Bloody Boogerbread": "血まみれ鼻くそパン",
  "Whose twisted idea was this?! Revolting! \n60^red;s -^reset;15^red;% Health^reset; \n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "誰のひねくれたアイデアだこれ？！不快！ \n60^red;s -^reset;15^red;% 回復^reset; \n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Bloody Corpse Waffles": "血まみれ死体ワッフル",
  "Clearly the breakfast of choice for a growing child.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "成長期の子供に最適な朝食\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Blue Cheese": "ブルーチーズ",
  "Let's just say it was always blue.\n^purple;Glow^reset; ^cyan;300s^reset; \n^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "最初から青かったということにしておこう\n^purple;発光^reset; ^cyan;300s^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Bluelotl Jelly": "ブルーロトルゼリー",
  "Gelatin flavored with Hylotl blood.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Poison ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Poisoned ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "ハイロトルの血で味付けしたゼラチン\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Bolbohn Jam": "Bolbohnジャム",
  "A good way to make something nasty even nastier.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;225s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "不味いものをさらに不味くする良い方法\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;225s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Boogerbread": "鼻くそパン",
  "What IS this disgusting creation?! \n^red;-^reset;5^red;% Health^reset; \n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "何だこの不快な創造物は？！ \n^red;-^reset;5^red;% 回復^reset; \n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Bowel Chocolate": "内臓チョコレート",
  "At least it's sweetened... \n^red;Poisoned^reset; ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "少なくとも甘くはある… \n^red;毒^reset; ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Bowl o' Brains": "脳みそ丼",
  "Looks like a nice, wholesome bowl of mashed brains matter. \n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "見た目は素敵で健康的な脳みそのマッシュ \n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Edible Brains": "食用の脳みそ",
  "You've gone ahead and cut the less tasty bits off. Nobody wants to eat cerebellum. ^red;-^white;10% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;), ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2 ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "美味しくない部分を切り落とした。小脳を食べたい人はいない ^red;-^white;10% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;), ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2 ^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Butter on a Stick": "棒付きバター",
  "I can guarantee this is not healthy.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Ice ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Frost ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "これが健康的でないことは保証する\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;霜^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Caramelized Soggy Paper": "キャラメリゼ湿った紙",
  "Way more delicious than it has any right to be.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "あるべき以上に遥かに美味しい\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Cattle Feed": "飼料",
  "A food that cattle just love. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "家畜が大好きな飼料。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;、^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Improved Feed": "改良飼料",
  "Improved feed for cattle. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "改良型家畜飼料。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Superior Feed": "上級飼料",
  "Great feed for cattle. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "牛の最高の飼料。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Ultra Feed": "ウルトラ飼料",
  "Astounding cattle feed. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "驚異的な家畜飼料。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Cherry Crumble": "チェリークランブル",
  "A wonderfully tasty desert.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "素晴らしく美味しいデザート\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;タイプ: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Cherry Jam": "Cherryジャム",
  "Super sweet. Great on toast.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "超甘い。トーストに最適\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;タイプ: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Cherry Pie": "Cherryパイ",
  "Puts a smile on your face, 10 miles wide.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "16km幅の笑顔になる\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;)\n^green;タイプ: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Cherry Porridge": "チェリーポリッジ",
  "Thick, with whole cherries to accent the flavor.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;120s^gray;)\n^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "丸ごとチェリーで風味を引き立てた厚切り\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;120s^gray;)\n^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Chewable Magnet": "噛める磁石",
  "Not healthy, but useful. \n^yellow;Item Magnet II^reset; (400s)": "健康的ではないが便利 \n^yellow;アイテムマグネットII^reset; (400秒)",
  "Chicken Juice": "Chickenジュース",
  "With pulp. \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP ^gray;(^white;180s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "果肉入り \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP ^gray;(^white;180s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Chocolate Donut": "チョコレートドーナツ",
  "Delicious donut. ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "美味しいドーナツ ^orange;タイプ: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Chocolate Yum Yum": "チョコレートヤムヤム",
  "A cream-filled moon cake. ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "クリーム入り月餅。^orange;タイプ: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Churros": "チュロス",
  "Fried dough coated in sugar and cinnamon; a festival favorite. \n^cyan;+^reset;12% Energy ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "砂糖とシナモンをまぶした揚げパン。祭りの定番 \n^cyan;+^reset;12% エネルギー ^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "The Cinnamon Challenge": "シナモンチャレンジ",
  "Can YOU endure the challenge? \n^red;Burning ^reset;30s": "あなたはこの挑戦に耐えられるか？ \n^red;燃焼 ^reset;30s",
  "Cinnamon Oatmeal": "シナモンオートミール",
  "A breakfast favorite among humans. Great with a side of milk. \n^cyan;+^green;12% Energy^reset; ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "ヒューマンの朝食の定番。牛乳と一緒にどうぞ\n^cyan;+^green;12%エネルギー^reset; ^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Cinnamon Roll": "シナモンロール",
  "A confectionary made of cinnamon, sugar, and dough. ^green;Type: Grain Dessert^reset;": "シナモン、砂糖、生地で作ったお菓子 ^green;タイプ: 穀物デザート^reset;で作ったconfectionary",
  "Cinnamon Sugar Cups": "シナモンシュガーカップ",
  "Good with a cup of coffee! \n^cyan;+^reset;15%^green; HP^reset; \n^orange;Type: Grain Dairy Dessert^reset;": "コーヒーと一緒にどうぞ！ \n^cyan;+^reset;15%^green; HP^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 穀物+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Cinnamon Swirl Bread": "シナモンスワールパン",
  "Add butter or jelly for a sweet cinnamon treat! \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; HP^reset; \n^green;Type: Grain Dessert^reset;": "バターかジェリーを添えて甘いシナモンのお菓子に！ \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; HP^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 穀物デザート^reset;",
  "Corpse Candy": "死体キャンディー",
  "Dried and sweetened...um...corpses. Delicious.\n^cyan;+^white;12% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "乾燥させて甘くした…えーと…死体。美味しい\n^cyan;+^white;12% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Cthushi": "クトゥシ",
  "Mad not to use soy sauce... ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4 \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Grain^reset;": "醤油を使わないのは狂気… ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4 \n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+穀物^reset;",
  "Dunce Cookie": "Dunceクッキー",
  "Eating these apparently makes you stupider than you already are. ^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Shadow ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Shadow Taint ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "これを食べると今以上にバカになるらしい ^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;シャドウ ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;シャドウ汚染 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Dunebun": "デューンバン",
  "Almost like bread, but it tastes sort of odd.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "パンに似ているが少し変わった味\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Eldurkey": "エルダーキー",
  "A meal of Eldritch proportions. ^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP^reset; ^cyan;+^reset;15%^green; Energy^reset;^red; Insanity^reset; 180s ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "エルドリッチサイズの食事 ^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP^reset; ^cyan;+^reset;15%^green; エネルギー^reset;^red; 狂気^reset; 180s ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Erchius Omlette": "エルキウスオムレツ",
  "Not the kind of fuel you need... ^yellow;Glow^reset; 120s ^green;+^reset;40 ^green;Fuel^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "必要な種類の燃料じゃない… ^yellow;発光^reset; 120s ^green;+^reset;40 ^green;燃料^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Fiery Candy": "炎のキャンディー",
  "The cinnamon treat that gives you a sugar rush! \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; Energy^reset;^cyan; +^reset;15%^green; Movement Speed^reset; ^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "シュガーラッシュをくれるシナモンのお菓子！ \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; エネルギー^reset;^cyan; +^reset;15%^green; 移動速度^reset; ^green;タイプ: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Compressed Algae": "圧縮藻",
  "This tastes !@#!$!%! disgusting.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "これはめちゃくちゃ不味い\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 野菜^reset;",
  "Burger": "バーガー",
  "Meaty and delicious. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "肉々しくて美味しい ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Butter": "バター",
  "It's butter. I don't think you need a description. ^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "バターだ。説明は不要でしょ。^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Compressed Erithian Algae": "圧縮エリシアン藻",
  "Holy !@#!$!%!, I never thought it could get worse!\n^red;-^white;15% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "なんてこった！これ以上ひどくなるとは思わなかった！\n^red;-^white;15% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)^reset; \n^green;タイプ: 野菜^reset;",
  "Lemony Lobster": "レモニーロブスター",
  "Butter, lemon, lobster, and joy. All in one. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood^reset;": "バター、レモン、ロブスター、そして喜び。全部入り ^orange;タイプ: 調理済みシーフード^reset;",
  "Lobster": "ロブスター",
  "Raw aquatic horror. ^orange;Type: Seafood^reset;": "生の水棲の恐怖。^orange;タイプ: シーフード^reset;",
  "Lobster Bisque": "ロブスタービスク",
  "Sinfully delicious. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "罪深いほど美味しい。^orange;タイプ: 調理済みシーフード + 野菜 + 乳製品^reset;",
  "Cooked Lobster": "調理済みロブスター",
  "Delicious aquatic horror. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood^reset;": "美味しい水棲の恐怖。^orange;タイプ: 調理済みシーフード^reset;",
  "Lobster Paste": "ロブスターペースト",
  "Mashed and reconstituted lobster... stuff. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood^reset;": "潰して再構成したロブスター…的なもの ^orange;タイプ: 調理済みシーフード^reset;",
  "Lobster Paste on Toast": "ロブスターペーストオントースト",
  "Because bread isn't bread without mashed crustacean on it.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Grain + Cooked Seafood^reset;": "潰した甲殻類なしでパンはパンじゃない\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 穀物+調理済みシーフード^reset;",
  "Pest": "害虫",
  "A small mammalian pest. Edible, and nutritious. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "小さな哺乳類の害獣。食用で栄養あり。^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Cooked Pest": "調理済み害虫",
  "Well-cooked rodent meat. Mm. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "よく調理されたネズミ肉。うーん。^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Edible Soggy Paper": "食用の湿った紙",
  "For some reason, I feel inclined to eat this.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset;": "なぜか食べたくなる\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Sushi Platter": "寿司プラッター",
  "Raw fish. Rice. Seaweed. Clearly meant to work together.\n^cyan;Powerful Swim ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Seafood + Grain^reset;": "生魚。米。海苔。明らかに組み合わせるべき\n^cyan;パワフルスイム ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: シーフード+穀物^reset;",
  "Warmed Organic Soup": "温めオーガニックスープ",
  "When scientists call it 'soup' they're being metaphorical, amino acids aren't food.\n^green;Regeneration^reset; ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;-^white;10%^red; HP^reset; ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;": "科学者が「スープ」と呼ぶのは比喩で、アミノ酸は食べ物ではない\n^green;リジェネ^reset; ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;-^white;10%^red; HP^reset; ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Yeah Toast": "Yeahトースト",
  "You know what they say, all toasters toast toast.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "よく言うじゃない、全てのトースターはトーストを焼くって\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Garflipp": "ガーフリップ",
  "A brain leech primarily found on Nitrogen seas.\n^cyan;+^white;2% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;20% ^cyan;Risk of Madness Effects^reset;": "主に窒素の海で見つかる脳リーチ\n^cyan;+^white;2% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;20% ^cyan;狂気効果リスク^reset;",
  "Gnomewich": "ノームウィッチ",
  "One gnome was harmed in making this sandwich. \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP^reset;^cyan; +^reset;20%^green; Energy^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "このサンドイッチの製造で1体のノームが犠牲になった \n^cyan;+^reset;20%^green; HP^reset;^cyan; +^reset;20%^green; エネルギー^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Gorge Cake": "Gorgeケーキ",
  "A 'cake' made from rendered fat and bonemeal. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "精製脂肪と骨粉で作った「ケーキ」 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;で作った'cake'",
  "Greg Head": "グレッグヘッド",
  "The severed head of a Greg\n^green;Heal ^white;20% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)\n^red;Drunk ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "グレッグの生首\n^green;回復 ^white;20% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)\n^red;酔い ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Grilled Sneeze": "グリルくしゃみ",
  "Disgusting to anything that isn't a floran.^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Electric ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^pink;Electrified ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "フローラン以外には不快^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;電気 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^pink;帯電 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Gutstoppers": "ガッツストッパー",
  "Which will last longer, you or them? \n^cyan;+^reset;20% ^green;Energy^reset; \n^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "あなたとこれ、どちらが長持ちする？ \n^cyan;+^reset;20% ^green;エネルギー^reset; \n^yellow;タイプ: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Hobby Glue": "ホビーグルー",
  "Welcome back to Kindergarten.": "幼稚園にお帰り",
  "Honey Bread": "Honeyパン",
  "Sweet bread baked with honey.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;120 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "ハチミツで焼いた甘いパン\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;120 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Honey Nut Boltos": "ハニーナッツボルトス",
  "Mmm, cereal.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;120 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "うーん、シリアル\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;120 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^yellow;タイプ: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Horchata": "オルチャータ",
  "A type of milk made of rice, and seasoned with cinnamon. \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; HP^reset;^cyan; +^reset;5%^green; Energy^reset; \n^orange;Type: Dairy + Grain^reset;": "米から作った牛乳、シナモンで味付け \n^cyan;+^reset;10%^green; HP^reset;^cyan; +^reset;5%^green; エネルギー^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 乳製品+穀物^reset;",
  "Horkulbeast Sausage": "ホルクルビーストソーセージ",
  "A rare meat with potent nutrients\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "強力な栄養素を含む希少な肉\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "I-C Tea": "I-Cお茶",
  "I-C Tea; a rather eye-opening beverage.\n^green;Glow 300s ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "I-Cティー。目が覚める飲み物\n^green;発光 300s ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Idiot Sandwich": "バカサンドイッチ",
  "IT'S FRACKIN' RAW \n^red;Drunk^reset; 2m \n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4 \n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "めちゃくちゃ生だ \n^red;酔い^reset; 2m \n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4 \n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Irradium Roll": "イラジウムロール",
  "Not recommended for carbon-based lifeforms.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)^reset;": "炭素ベースの生命体には非推奨\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Jarred Fetus": "瓶入りの胎児",
  "A fetus, too early in development to determine species without research. ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "発育が早すぎて研究なしには種を特定できない胎児。^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Kadavan Cactus Juice": "カダヴァンカクタスジュース",
  "Prickly, somewhat bland cactus juice.\n^cyan;+^white;100% ^pink;Physical ^cyan;Thorns ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "トゲトゲで、やや味気ないサボテンジュース\n^cyan;+^white;100% ^pink;物理 ^cyan;ソーン ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 野菜^reset;",
  "Kadavan Meat Juice": "カダヴァンミートジュース",
  "Prickly cactus juice blended with poorly cooked meat. What could go wrong? ^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;), ^cyan;+^white;100% ^pink;Physical ^cyan;Thorns ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "トゲトゲのサボテンジュースと半生肉のブレンド。何が悪くなる？ ^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;150s^gray;), ^cyan;+^white;100% ^pink;物理 ^cyan;ソーン ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Latte": "ラテ",
  "Nectar of the Gods. ^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "神々のネクター。^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Pb and J Sandwich": "ピーナツバター&ジェリーサンド",
  "Don't eat this.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2\n^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "これを食べるな\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2\n^yellow;タイプ: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Lice Cream": "シラミクリーム",
  "Made from 100% lice.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Poison ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "100%シラミ製\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Magical Lunch": "魔法のランチ",
  "You have no idea what is inside. This does not look magical.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "中身が何かわからない。魔法的には見えない\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Marrow Soup": "Marrowスープ",
  "450% of your daily amount of calcium. \n^cyan;+^reset;10% ^green;Physical Resist^reset; ^cyan;(300s)^reset; ^orange;Type: Meaty Plant + Dairy^reset;": "カルシウムの日量の450% \n^cyan;+^reset;10% ^green;物理耐性^reset; ^cyan;(300秒)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 肉質植物+乳製品^reset;",
  "Meat Pickle": "肉のピクルス",
  "The origin of this meat is not clear, but it sure -looks- familiar...\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;75s^gray;)^reset; \n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "この肉の起源は不明だが、確かに見覚えがある…\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;75s^gray;)^reset; \n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Meat Smoothie": "Meatスムージー",
  "This is exactly what it sounds like. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "名前の通りのもの。^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Mint Humbug": "ミントハンバグ",
  "A small treat used for after a meal. Esther has a lot of these. \n^cyan;+^reset;8%^green; Energy ^reset;": "食後の小さなお菓子。エスターはたくさん持っている \n^cyan;+^reset;8%^green; エネルギー ^reset;",
  "Meaty Meal": "肉の食事",
  "100% meat from anywhere the manufacturer could locate.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Physical ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "メーカーが見つけられた場所から100%の肉\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;物理 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Nightmare Fuel": "ナイトメアフュエル",
  "An ominous coffee-like substance for robotic consumers. ^cyan;+^reset;35%^green; Energy^reset;^red; Nightmare^reset; 180s^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "ロボット消費者向けの不吉なコーヒー風物質 ^cyan;+^reset;35%^green; エネルギー^reset;^red; ナイトメア^reset; 180s^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^yellow;タイプ: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Ocular Oobleck": "眼球ウーブレック",
  "A meaty, mysterious menagerie of eyes and oculemon. ^cyan;+^reset;10^green;% Energy^reset;^red; Poisoned^reset; 10s^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^green;Type: Meaty Plant^reset;": "目とオキュレモンの肉々しく神秘的な寄せ集め ^cyan;+^reset;10^green;% エネルギー^reset;^red; 毒^reset; 10s^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^green;タイプ: 肉質植物^reset;",
  "Oil Stew": "Oilシチュー",
  "Likely incredibly inedible for non-mechanicals. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "機械以外の者にはおそらくとても食べられない代物。^yellow;種類: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Orphan Paste": "Orphanペースト",
  "Made from only the finest ingredients. A perfect food for Vegans! Can fuel ships (40) and mechs.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;75s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "最高級の材料のみ使用。ヴィーガンに最適！船(40)とメックの燃料にもなる\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;75s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Pancakes": "パンケーキ",
  "A favorite in every galaxy. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "どの銀河でも人気。^orange;タイプ: 野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Plague Pest Pancakes": "疫病害虫パンケーキ",
  "I've heard of bacon in pancakes, but pest? Eugh! \n^red;-^reset;5^red;% Health^reset; 60s ^red;Poisoned^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "パンケーキにベーコンは聞いたことあるけど、害虫？おえっ！ \n^red;-^reset;5^red;% 回復^reset; 60s ^red;毒^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Poutine": "プーティン",
  "The most important survivor of Earth.\n^red;-^white;35% ^red;Run^gray;, ^red;Jump ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset;": "地球の最も重要な生存者\n^red;-^white;35% ^red;走り^gray;, ^red;ジャンプ ^gray;(^white;125s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Proto Pancakes": "プロトパンケーキ",
  "Looks toxically delicious.\n^pink;Proto-Poison ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "毒々しいほど美味しそう\n^pink;プロト毒 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Putrid Pest Puree": "腐敗害虫ピューレ",
  "A blended mixture of pest, larva, and pussplum. Guaranteed to flush your bowels. ^cyan;+^green;12% HP^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Fruits^reset;": "害虫、幼虫、パスプラムのブレンド。腸を洗い流すこと保証 ^cyan;+^green;12% HP^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+フルーツ^reset;",
  "Pyreite Curry": "パイレイトカレー",
  "About 672 degrees hot.\n^pink;Icy ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Ice ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;), ^red;Burning ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)^reset;": "約672度の熱さ\n^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;), ^red;燃焼 ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Rusty Chowder": "錆びたチャウダー",
  "Jamed full of nutritious rust and iron. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "栄養たっぷりの錆と鉄が詰まっている。^yellow;種類: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Sanity Leech": "正気リーチ",
  "These leeches, placed in the ear, cure insanity and madness.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;80% ^cyan;Risk of Madness Effects^reset;": "この蛭を耳に入れると狂気と発狂を治す\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;80% ^cyan;狂気効果のリスク^reset;",
  "Sentient Cookie": "Sentientクッキー",
  "It won't stop begging for life, unless you eat it.\n^blue;+Insanity^reset; and...? ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "食べない限り命乞いをやめない\n^blue;+狂気^reset; and...? ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Severed Head Platter": "切断された頭の皿",
  "It's literally just a rotting severed head. There is no platter.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 5 ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "文字通り腐った生首だ。皿はない\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 5 ^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Sewer Fries with Bacon": "下水道フライwithベーコン",
  "Fries with a fermented gravy, adorned with bacon. What a crappy meal. ^red;-^reset;5^red;% Health ^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2 ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "発酵グレービーとベーコンのフライ。なんてひどい食事 ^red;-^reset;5^red;% 回復 ^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2 ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Carnivore Slew": "肉食者シチュー",
  "A food that carnivores just love. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "肉食動物が大好きな餌。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;、^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Improved Slew": "改良シチュー",
  "Improved carnivore slew. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "改良型肉食獣の餌。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Superior Slew": "上級シチュー",
  "Great carnivore slew. Not for sapient ingestion. You'll get sick.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "最高の肉食獣の餌。知的生命体は食べないで。病気になる\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Ultra Slew": "ウルトラシチュー",
  "Sludge Cone": "スラッジコーン",
  "For species that can't get enough radioactive iced cream.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;Radiation ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "放射能アイスクリームが大好きな種族向け\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;放射線 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Small Crayon Box": "小さなクレヨンボックス",
  "Are... Are you really going to eat this?": "え…本当にこれ食べるの？",
  "Snarshed Garflipp": "スナーシュドガーフリップ",
  "A reality-challenging flavor. Is it meat? Is it fruit? Is it bike? It's all three\n^cyan;-^white;5% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;70s^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;60% ^cyan;Risk of Madness Effects^reset;": "現実に挑む味。肉か？フルーツか？自転車か？全部だ\n^cyan;-^white;5% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;70s^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;60% ^cyan;狂気効果のリスク^reset;",
  "Solarium Biscuit": "ソラリウムビスケット",
  "Super-dangerous to eat if you can't roll in radiation.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Radiation ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "放射能に浸かれないなら食べると超危険\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;放射線 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Sour Milk and Bees": "酸っぱい牛乳と蜂",
  "Enough people drink this that it comes in cartons?\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;& ^red;Damage^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;5% ^cyan;Run^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;8% ^cyan;Jump^gray;, ^cyan;Increased Air Force ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "カートンで売れるほど人気なの？\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;& ^red;ダメージ^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;5% ^cyan;走り^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;8% ^cyan;ジャンプ^gray;, ^cyan;空中力増加 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 乳製品^reset;",
  "Soylent Gnome": "ソイレントノーム",
  "Canned, processed gnome corpses. Never goes bad! \n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^reset; (1m) \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "缶詰加工されたノームの死体。腐らない！\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^reset; (1分)\n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Spice Bol": "スパイスボル",
  "Spiced and cooked Bolbohns make for a decidedly odd taste.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;245s^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "スパイスを効かせて調理したボルボーンは独特の味\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;245s^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 野菜^reset;",
  "Spider Cotton": "スパイダーコットン",
  "Woven for consumption. \n^red;+Slow^reset; (60s) \n^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "消費用に紡がれた \n^red;+鈍足^reset; (60秒) \n^green;タイプ: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Stuffed Dunebun": "詰め物デューンバン",
  "A dunebun stuffed full of meat and bolbohn. An acquired taste.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;210s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "肉とボルボーンをたっぷり詰めたデューンバン。好みが分かれる味\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;210秒^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Tearnut Butter": "Tearnutバター",
  "Thick, nutty and delicious. ^green;Type: Nut^reset;": "濃厚でナッツ風味で美味しい。^green;タイプ: ナッツ^reset;",
  "Tearnut Butter Sandwich": "ティアナッツバターサンド",
  "Mingling cherries and tearnuts was a genius idea. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "チェリーとティアナッツの組み合わせは天才的。^green;タイプ: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Jikjik Tofu": "ジクジク豆腐",
  "Unlike 'normal' tofu, no one knows what this type is made from! Tasty!\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Cosmic ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "「普通の」豆腐と違い、これが何で出来ているか誰も知らない！美味しい！\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;コスミック ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Sludgey Blubs": "スラッジーブラブ",
  "Nothin' fancy. Just typical radioactive waste sold as a snack.\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;Radiation ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "凝ったものじゃない。ただの放射性廃棄物をスナックとして販売\n^cyan;+^white;10% ^pink;放射線 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Burnt Toast": "焦げトースト",
  "Left it in the toaster for too long. \n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "トースターに入れすぎた \n^cyan;+^white;10% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;45s^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 穀物^reset;",
  "Wartweed Salad": "Wartweedサラダ",
  "A salad of wartweed, tomato, and pearlpeas. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "ワートウィード、トマト、パールピーのサラダ。^green;タイプ: 野菜^reset;",
  "Thought to exist only in legend, until the recipe was found after 4000 years.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Radiation ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4": "4000年後にレシピが発見されるまで伝説の中にしか存在しないと思われていた\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;放射線 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4",
  "Glowburger": "グローバーガー",
  "A glowing hamburger with some violiroot and phasefruit inside.\n^cyan;+^#ffd700;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;228^gray;)\n^white;Glow ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^red;Electrified ^gray;(^white;18s^gray;)^reset;": "ヴァイオリルートとフェーズフルーツ入りの光るハンバーガー\n^cyan;+^#ffd700;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;228^gray;)\n^white;発光 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^red;帯電 ^gray;(^white;18s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Caketop Cake": "Caketopケーキ",
  "A delicious cake-like pastery produced by Caketops.": "ケイクトップが作ったケーキ風ペストリー",
  "Cupcaketop Cupcake": "カップケーキトップカップケーキ",
  "A delicious small cake-like pastery produced by Cupcaketops.": "カップケーキトップが作った小さなケーキ風ペストリー",
  "Gummi Cake": "Gummiケーキ",
  "A delicious gelatin-pastery combination!.": "美味しいゼラチン＆ペストリーの組み合わせ！",
  "Gummi Cupcake": "グミカップケーキ",
  "A bite sized delicious gelatin-pastery combination!.": "一口サイズの美味しいゼラチン・ペストリーの組み合わせ！",
  "Gummi Glob": "グミグロブ",
  "A somewhat chewy, gelatinous glob. Has a hint of sweetness.": "やや噛み応えのあるゼラチン質の塊。ほのかな甘み",
  "Phaseshake": "フェイズシェイク",
  "A plasma shake. As dangerous as tasty.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;175s^gray;)\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;50s^gray;)\n^red;Burning ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;": "プラズマシェイク。美味しさと同じくらい危険\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;175s^gray;)\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;50s^gray;)\n^red;燃焼 ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Plasmango Ice Cream": "プラズマンゴーアイスクリーム",
  "I scream, you scream.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;366s^gray;)\n^red;Burning ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)^reset;": "アイスクリーム、ユースクリーム\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;366s^gray;)\n^red;燃焼 ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Solstew": "ソルシチュー",
  "Stew made from solusberry. Can shock you.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;228^gray;)\n^red;Electrified ^gray;, ^red;Burning ^gray;(^white;4s^gray;)^reset;": "ソラスベリーで作ったシチュー。感電することもある\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;& ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;228^gray;)\n^red;帯電 ^gray;, ^red;燃焼 ^gray;(^white;4s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Solus Jam": "Solusジャム",
  "Jam made from solusberry. But is it so dangerous? Only one way to find out!\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;325s^gray;)\n^red;Electrified ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;": "ソラスベリーで作ったジャム。そんなに危険？確かめる方法は一つ！\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;325s^gray;)\n^red;帯電 ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Crispy on the outside, hot as molten lava on the inside. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "外はカリッと、中は溶岩のように熱々。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A bowl of rather bland boiled pearlpeas. ^green;Type: Legumes^reset;": "茹でただけの味気ないパールピー。^green;種別: 豆類^reset;",
  "Light and fluffy. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "軽くてふわふわ。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "Mmm, fresh out of the oven. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "うーん、焼きたてだ。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "Soft, sweet and juicy. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "柔らかくて、甘くてジューシー。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A buttery ear of corn on the cob. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "バターたっぷりのトウモロコシ。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Simple fish dumplings, steamed and lightly seasoned. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "シンプルな魚の餃子、蒸して軽く味付け。^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "Tasty fried fish in stick form. Where's the custard? ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "スティック状のおいしい魚フライ。カスタードはどこ？^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "Fry all the things! This is an old favorite for humans. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "全部揚げてしまえ！人類の古くからのお気に入り。^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "Stargazy pie! Baked fish in sauce, topped with creamy mash. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "スターゲイジーパイ！ソースで焼いた魚にクリーミーなマッシュポテトのせ。^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "A light stew that goes down easy. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "するっと食べられる軽めのシチュー。^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "Smashing potatoes is scientifically proven to make them 500% tastier. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "じゃがいもを潰すと500%おいしくなる。科学的に証明済み。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Steamed meat dumplings. Beautifully simple! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "蒸した肉餃子。素朴な美味しさ！^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Minced meat in a rich gravy, topped with creamy mash. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "濃厚なグレイビーの挽肉にクリーミーなマッシュポテトのせ。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Just like mama used to make! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "ママがよく作ってくれたやつだ！^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "A slightly more substantial meal than just boiling pearlpeas. ^green;Type: Legumes^reset;": "ただ茹でたパールピーよりちょっとはましな食事。^green;種別: 豆類^reset;",
  "Perfectly ripe pearlpeas work best for this hearty rice dish. ^green;Type: Grain + Legumes^reset;": "完熟のパールピーがこのボリュームたっぷりのライス料理に最適。^green;種別: 穀物+豆類^reset;",
  "Pop it like it's hot! ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "ポンッとはじけて熱々！^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A crispy golden exterior protects the soft and fluffy potato within. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "サクサクの金色の外側が、ふわふわのじゃがいもを守っている。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Roasted to perfection. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "完璧な焼き加減。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Roasting them really brings out all the flavour. ^green;Type: Mushroom^reset;": "じっくり焼くことで風味が格段に引き立つ。^green;種別: キノコ^reset;",
  "A slice of warm, eggy bread. Delicious. ^orange;Type: Grain + Eggs^reset;": "温かい卵風味のパン。おいしい。^orange;種別: 穀物+卵^reset;",
  "Sweet, stewed apple under a blanket of golden crumble. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "甘く煮たリンゴに黄金色のクランブルをかけて。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Pancake. Bacon. Pancake. Bacon. Pancake. Butter. Eat. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "パンケーキ。ベーコン。パンケーキ。ベーコン。パンケーキ。バター。食べる。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Dense, heavy bread packed full of seeds. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "種がぎっしり詰まった、ずっしり重いパン。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "Sweet and crunchy. If only there was a seedless variety. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "甘くてカリカリ。種なしの品種があればいいのに。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Created out of necessity in beakseed season to make use of all the jam. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "ビークシードの季節にジャムを使い切るために生まれた一品。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Eureka! The only possible way to improve on perfection is to multiply it. ^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "ひらめいた！完璧なものをさらに良くする唯一の方法は、倍にすることだ。^green;種別: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Confectionery perfection. ^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "完璧なお菓子。^green;種別: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Cool as a cactus. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "サボテンのようにクール。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "It's a delicious cake! ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "おいしいケーキだ！^orange;種別: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Vegan Cake": "Veganケーキ",
  "It's a delicious vegan cake! Like the original, but for ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "美味しいヴィーガンケーキ！オリジナルと同じだが ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;タイプ: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "It looks like the old spooky holiday treat, but there's actual corn in the centre of each morsel. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "昔の不気味なお祭りのお菓子に似ているが、一粒一粒の中心に本物のコーンが入っている。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "All the nutritious value of an apple masked by globs of sweet, sweet sugar. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "リンゴの栄養価を甘い甘い砂糖でたっぷりコーティング。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A loaf of carrot bread. Let's be honest, it's just bread-shaped cake. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "にんじんパン。正直に言うとパンの形をしたケーキだ。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "It's a delicious carrot cake! Tastes better than it sounds. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "おいしいキャロットケーキ！名前から想像するよりおいしい。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Vegan Carrot Cake": "ヴィーガンキャロットケーキ",
  "It's a delicious carrot cake! Like the original, but for ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "美味しいキャロットケーキ！オリジナルと同じだが ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;タイプ: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Carrots in liquid form. Surprisingly sweet, unsurprisingly nutritious. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "液体状のにんじん。驚くほど甘くて、当然ながら栄養満点。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Creamy, delicious, nutritious! ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "クリーミーで、おいしくて、栄養満点！^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "A juicy hamburger, topped with cheese. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "チーズをのせたジューシーなハンバーガー。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "A cake made of chocolate! And other cake ingredients. ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "チョコレートで作ったケーキ！あとその他のケーキの材料も。^orange;種別: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Vegan Chocolate Cake": "ヴィーガンチョコレートケーキ",
  "A vegan chocolate cake. Like the original, but for ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "ヴィーガンチョコレートケーキ。オリジナルと同じだが ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;タイプ: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "A moist cake enriched with coffee. Moreish! ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "コーヒー風味のしっとりしたケーキ。もう一口！^orange;種別: 穀物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Vegan Coffee Cake": "ヴィーガンコーヒーケーキ",
  "A moist vegan cake enriched with coffee. Like the original, but for ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "コーヒーで風味を付けたしっとりヴィーガンケーキ。オリジナルと同じだが ^green;herbivores^reset;. ^green;タイプ: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Beakseed and dried corn. A common Avian trail mix, or breakfast cereal. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "ビークシードとドライコーン。エイビアンの定番トレイルミックスや朝食シリアル。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A sweet and flavoursome preserve, precious among Avians. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "甘く風味豊かなジャム。エイビアンにとって貴重な一品。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "A traditional Avian ceremonial food eaten at celebrations. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "お祝いの場で食べられる伝統的なエイビアンの儀式料理。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Coffee with milk. ^orange;Type: Dairy^reset;": "ミルク入りコーヒー。^orange;種別: 乳製品^reset;",
  "They're ruffy and fluffy! ^orange;Type: Grain + Eggs^reset;": "フワッフワでひだひだ！^orange;種別: 穀物+卵^reset;",
  "A big bowl of mixed veggies. Nutritious! ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "色とりどりの野菜がたっぷりの大きなボウル。栄養満点！^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A juicy hamburger. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "ジューシーなハンバーガー。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Tangy and refreshing. Try it on toast! ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "ピリッとさわやか。トーストに塗ってみよう！^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A sweet and tropical juice made of kiwis. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "キウイから作った甘くてトロピカルなジュース。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A mild blend of coffee and hot chocolate. ^orange;Type: Dairy Dessert^reset;": "コーヒーとホットチョコレートのマイルドなブレンド。^orange;種別: 乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "This loaf of bread has mushrooms baked right into it. Yum! ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "キノコを練り込んで焼き上げたパン。うまい！^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "A cheesy quiche packed full of fresh mushrooms. ^orange;Type: Mushrooms + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "新鮮なキノコがたっぷり入ったチーズのキッシュ。^orange;種別: キノコ+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "Delicious eggy fried rice with mushrooms. ^orange;Type: Grain + Eggs^reset;": "キノコ入りのおいしい卵チャーハン。^orange;種別: 穀物+卵^reset;",
  "Easily prepared and delicious, you can't go wrong with an omelette! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "簡単でおいしい、オムレツに失敗なんてありえない！^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "A traditional Earthling pastry meant for snacking on when underground. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "地下作業中の軽食用に作られた伝統的な地球のパイ。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Commonly known as \"pearl jam\". Has a nice ring to it. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "通称「パールジャム」。いい響きだ。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "They look like pancakes, but they've got an aftertaste of mushy peas. ^orange;Type: Legumes + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "見た目はパンケーキだが、豆のどろっとした後味がある。^orange;種別: 豆類+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "A whole pizza! Are you going to eat all that? ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "ピザまるごと一枚！全部食べる気かい？^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "A hot slice of pepperoni pizza. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "アツアツのペパロニピザ一切れ。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "A bowl of piping hot porridge. The healthy way to start your day. ^orange;Type: Grain + Dairy^reset;": "アツアツのおかゆ。健康的な一日のスタートに。^orange;種別: 穀物+乳製品^reset;",
  "A classic bacon quiche. Perfect for picnics! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs^reset;": "定番のベーコンキッシュ。ピクニックにぴったり！^orange;種別: 肉+野菜+乳製品+卵^reset;",
  "A sharp relish to compliment savoury meaty flavours. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "香ばしい肉料理を引き立てるピリッとした薬味。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A sweet, warm bowl of rice pudding. ^orange;Type: Grain Dairy Dessert^reset;": "甘くて温かいライスプディング。^orange;種別: 穀物+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Just a regular roast dinner. Nothing fancy, but satisfying all the same. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "ごく普通のローストディナー。豪華じゃないが、満足できる。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "This pleasantly filling dish leaves you with a warm feeling. ^orange;Type: Grain + Eggs^reset;": "食べると心まで温かくなる、満足感のある一品。^orange;種別: 穀物+卵^reset;",
  "Just like normal cookies, only spikier. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "普通のクッキーと同じ、ただちょっとトゲトゲしてるだけ。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Sweet and sticky ribs. Delicious! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "甘くてベタベタのリブ。おいしい！^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "A baked tomato with a delicous savoury filling. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "おいしい香ばしいフィリングを詰めた焼きトマト。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "A rare sweet Floran dish of candied bacon. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "珍しく甘いフローランの料理、ベーコンの砂糖漬け。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "Freshly popped corn, with a sweet, buttery coating. ^green;Type: Vegetable Dessert^reset;": "はじけたてのポップコーンに、甘いバターのコーティング。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "A hearty tomato juice. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "ボリュームたっぷりのトマトジュース。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A rich, silky soup made of ripe tomatoes. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "完熟トマトで作った濃厚でなめらかなスープ。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "The most basic of Glitch cuisine. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "グリッチ料理の中で最も基本的なもの。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A healthy mix of bananas and grapes. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "バナナとブドウのヘルシーなミックス。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A crispy Apex dish. A fried corn fritter, with banana of course. ^orange;Type: Fruits + Dairy^reset;": "サクサクのエイペックス料理。コーンのフリッターに、もちろんバナナ添え。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品^reset;",
  "An automato milkshake! Mmm. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "オートマトのミルクシェイク！うーん。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A surprisingly tasty stew, if you watch out for the bits of metal. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "金属片にさえ気をつければ、驚くほどおいしいシチュー。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "With bacon, a banana and some wizardry, you get a bananacon. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Fruits^reset;": "ベーコン、バナナ、そしてちょっとした魔法で、バナナーコンの完成。^orange;種別: 肉+フルーツ^reset;",
  "A delicious donut filled with banana and cream. It's almost healthy! ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "バナナとクリームが入ったおいしいドーナツ。ほぼヘルシー！^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Better for eating, or for throwing in people's faces? ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "食べるのと人の顔に投げつけるの、どっちがいい？^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Creamy, icy, banana goodness. ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "クリーミーで冷たい、バナナの美味しさ。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Your standard banana, battered and fried in a rich dough. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "リッチな生地をまとわせて揚げた、定番のバナナ。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A tasty, prickly treat! ^orange;Type: Vegetable Dairy Dessert^reset;": "トゲだらけのおいしいおやつ！^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "A banana roasted over a campfire, with gratuitous amounts of chocolate. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "キャンプファイヤーで焼いたバナナに、たっぷりのチョコレート。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "It's like an automato flavoured lollipop! Which is kind of weird. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "オートマト味のロリポップみたい！ちょっと変だけど。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A delicious fusion of coconut and chocolate in donut form. ^orange;Type: Fruits + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "ココナッツとチョコレートのおいしいフュージョン、ドーナツ仕立て。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Perfect for when you're stranded on a tropical island. ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "熱帯の島に取り残された時にぴったり。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "The best reason to crack open a coconut. The taste is amazing. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "ココナッツを割るべき最大の理由。味は最高。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "You can't see the coconut, but it's there! The taste is amazing. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "ココナッツは見えないけど、ちゃんと入ってる！味は最高。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "A refreshing salsa made from desert fruits. The taste is amazing. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food + Vegetables^reset;": "砂漠のフルーツで作ったさわやかなサルサ。味は最高。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード+野菜^reset;",
  "A whole fish shoved haphazardly inside a boneboo. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Meaty Plant^reset;": "ボーンブーの中に魚をまるごと無造作に突っ込んだもの。^orange;種別: 魚介+肉質植物^reset;",
  "Various fruits all conveniently mixed together. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "さまざまなフルーツを手軽にミックス。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A sweet juice made of grapes. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "ブドウで作った甘いジュース。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Bananas and carrots mashed in a bowl makes for an Apex snacktime favorite. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "バナナとにんじんをボウルでマッシュ。エイペックスのおやつタイムの定番。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A super sweet jam made of pineapples. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "パイナップルで作ったとっても甘いジャム。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Sweet, tasty pineapple juice. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "甘くておいしいパイナップルジュース。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "More toppings! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Fruits + Dairy^reset;": "トッピングをもっと！^orange;種別: 肉+フルーツ+乳製品^reset;",
  "One tasty snowcone, multiple flavours! ^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "おいしいかき氷、いろんな味！^green;種別: 砂糖^reset;",
  "Too spooky. ^orange;Type: Meaty Plant + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "不気味すぎる。^orange;種別: 肉質植物+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "Just spooky enough. ^green;Type: Meaty Plant^reset;": "ちょうどいい不気味さ。^green;種別: 肉質植物^reset;",
  "Tastes like an actual stuffed tomato, if you can get through it without breaking your teeth! ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "歯が折れなければ、本物のトマトの詰め物みたいな味がする！^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A mixture of only the sweetest of sweet fruit. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "最高に甘いフルーツだけのミックス。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "More thorn than juice. ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "ジュースというよりトゲ。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A tropical mix that packs a punch. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "パンチの効いたトロピカルミックス。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Alien fruit jam. Sticky. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "エイリアンフルーツのジャム。ネバネバ。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A pleasantly sweet juice made from an alien fruit. ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "エイリアンフルーツから作った、ほんのり甘いジュース。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Avesmingos can taste like anything! For better or worse, so can this ice cream. ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "アベスミンゴはどんな味にもなれる！良くも悪くも、このアイスクリームも同じ。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "A juice that can taste like anything! ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "どんな味にもなれるジュース！^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "The secret ingredient in this Apex favourite is pineapple! ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "エイペックスのお気に入りの隠し味はパイナップル！^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "A thick, shake-like drink of meat and pussplum. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "肉とパスプラムのドロッとしたシェイク風ドリンク。^red;種別: 生肉^reset;",
  "Jellied coralcreep inside of a glazed pineapple, served warm. A fancy Hylotl treat! ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "コーラルクリープのゼリーをグレイズドパイナップルに入れ、温かく提供。おしゃれなハイロトルのお菓子！^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A mulled drink made of oculemon and pussplum. Delicious! ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "オキュレモンとパスプラムで作ったホットドリンク。おいしい！^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A salty and aromatic rice dish. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Vegetables^reset;": "塩味の効いた、香り豊かな米料理。^orange;種別: 魚介+野菜^reset;",
  "A refreshing salsa made from tropical and ocean fruits. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "トロピカルフルーツと海のフルーツで作ったさわやかなサルサ。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A Hylotl dish, overloaded with ingredients of questionable oceanic origin. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Fruits^reset;": "怪しい海の食材をふんだんに使ったハイロトルの料理。^orange;種別: 魚介+フルーツ^reset;",
  "A sour oculemon-filled pie with a sweet meringue topping. ^orange;Type: Meaty Plant Dairy Dessert^reset;": "酸っぱいオキュレモンが詰まったパイに甘いメレンゲのトッピング。^orange;種別: 肉質植物+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "A tangy, somewhat slimy stew made of oculemon and meat scraps. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "オキュレモンと肉の切れ端で作った、酸っぱくてちょっとぬるっとしたシチュー。^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Jam made from pussplum. It's surprisingly chunky. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "パスプラムで作ったジャム。驚くほどゴロゴロしている。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A watery rice pudding, topped with pussplum compote. ^orange;Type: Fruit Dairy Dessert^reset;": "水っぽいライスプディングにパスプラムのコンポートのせ。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "Pretty much the only good use for pussplum jam. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "パスプラムジャムのほぼ唯一のまともな使い道。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A pleasantly sweet and salty juice. Refreshing! ^green;Type: Fruit^reset;": "ほんのり甘くて塩味のあるジュース。さっぱり！^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A lot more sour than you might have expected. Surprise! ^orange;Type: Meaty Plant + Fruits^reset;": "予想以上にかなり酸っぱい。サプライズ！^orange;種別: 肉質植物+フルーツ^reset;",
  "A reefpod milkshake! Kids love it. ^orange;Type: Fruit + Dairy^reset;": "リーフポッドのミルクシェイク！子供に大人気。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品^reset;",
  "A simple snack formed of rice, held together by seaweed. ^green;Type: Grain^reset;": "米を海苔でまとめたシンプルなおやつ。^green;種別: 穀物^reset;",
  "Coralcreep, reefpod and pearlpea make for a salty, crunchy salad. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "コーラルクリープ、リーフポッド、パールピーの塩味シャキシャキサラダ。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "Fish baked with fish-like fruit. A fishy dish! ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood + Fruits^reset;": "魚のようなフルーツと魚を焼いた、なんとも魚づくしの一品！^orange;種別: 魚介+フルーツ^reset;",
  "Dirturchin innards stuffed into a coralcreep to make a dish that sounds terrible and tastes alright. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "ダートアーチンの中身をコーラルクリープに詰めたもの。名前はひどいが味はまとも。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A dirturchin stuffed with pearlpeas. The taste is kind of bland... ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy^reset;": "ダートアーチンにパールピーを詰め込んだもの。ちょっと味気ない...^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品^reset;",
  "Delicious rolls of rice and seaweed. A Hylotl favourite. ^orange;Type: Seafood + Grain^reset;": "おいしい米と海苔の巻物。ハイロトルのお気に入り。^orange;種別: 魚介+穀物^reset;",
  "A harmless donut filled with toxictop jam. ^orange;Type: Fruits + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "トキシックトップジャム入りの無害なドーナツ。^orange;種別: フルーツ+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "What do you get if you blend a toxictop with an alien fruit? That's right, you guessed it. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "トキシックトップとエイリアンフルーツをミキサーにかけたら？そう、想像通り。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "What else are you going to do with all that toxictop jam? ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "トキシックトップジャムの他の使い道って？^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Jam made from toxictop fruit. But is it actually toxic to eat? Only one way to find out! ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "トキシックトップの果実から作ったジャム。本当に毒なのか？確かめる方法は一つだけ！^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "A pasty big enough to hold all your favourite metallic tasting vegetables. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "お気に入りの金属味野菜を全部入れられるほど大きなパイ。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "It's good if you can get past the metallic aftertaste! ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "金属っぽい後味さえ乗り越えればおいしい！^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Bolt O's, for when you wake up so hungry you don't care what you're putting in your mouth! ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "ボルトオーズ、空腹で目が覚めて口に入れるものなんか気にしていられない時に！^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Ice cream with the delightful taste of custard. ^orange;Type: Vegetable Dairy Dessert^reset;": "うれしいカスタード味のアイスクリーム。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品デザート^reset;",
  "A simple yet substantial salad of eggshoot and feathercrown. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "エッグシュートとフェザークラウンのシンプルだが食べ応えのあるサラダ。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Oculemon stuffed inside half an eggshoot. ^green;Type: Meaty Plant + Vegetables^reset;": "エッグシュートの半分にオキュレモンを詰め込んだもの。^green;種別: 肉質植物+野菜^reset;",
  "Assorted copper flavoured morsels. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "銅風味のひとくちアソート。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A variation on pizzap, it's got more of a coppery tang to it. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "ピザップの一種で、より銅っぽい風味が強い。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "A famous Glitch chef tried to imitate mashed potatoes. He succeeded. Kinda. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "有名なグリッチのシェフがマッシュポテトを再現しようとした。まあ、成功した。たぶん。^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Watch out, they're super spicy! ^green;Type: Meaty Plant^reset;": "気をつけろ、超辛いぞ！^green;種別: 肉質植物^reset;",
  "A mildly spicy curry made with the coralcreep fruit. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "コーラルクリープで作った、マイルドなスパイシーカレー。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Boneboo roasted with chillies makes for a crunchy, spicy Floran treat. ^green;Type: Meaty Plant^reset;": "ボーンブーをチリと一緒にローストした、カリカリでスパイシーなフローランのごちそう。^green;種別: 肉質植物^reset;",
  "So incredibly hot! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat + Vegetables^reset;": "信じられないくらい辛い！^orange;種別: 肉+野菜^reset;",
  "Super-delicious neonmelon jam. ^green;Type: Fruit Dessert^reset;": "とびきりおいしいネオンメロンのジャム。^green;種別: フルーツデザート^reset;",
  "Pearlpeas wrapped neatly in a wartweed bundle. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "パールピーをワートウィードできれいに包んだもの。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A popular Glitch energy drink. Or is it just a placebo? ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "グリッチに人気のエナジードリンク。それとも単なるプラシーボ？^yellow;種別: ロボットフード^reset;",
  "Feathercrown fried with spicy chilli peppers. Hot hot hot! ^green;Type: Vegetable^reset;": "スパイシーチリペッパーと炒めたフェザークラウン。辛ッ辛ッ辛ッ！^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Sweet and spicy ribs. Delicious! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "甘くてスパイシーなリブ。おいしい！^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "All the fruit, in a juice. ^green;Type: Fruits^reset;": "全フルーツ入りジュース。^green;種別: フルーツ^reset;",
  "A fiery salsa made from fruit and veg that can really bring the heat! ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "本気で辛い野菜とフルーツで作った灼熱のサルサ！^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "A coarse, seedy jam that leaves behind a dry taste in your mouth. ^green;Type: Vegetable Desert^reset;": "粗くて種だらけのジャム。口の中が乾く後味が残る。^green;種別: 野菜デザート^reset;",
  "Many have been fooled by this unpleasant donut's tempting appearance. ^orange;Type: Vegetables + Dairy + Eggs + Sugar^reset;": "おいしそうな見た目に騙されてきた人は数知れず。^orange;種別: 野菜+乳製品+卵+砂糖^reset;",
  "A hearty, thick stew of wartweed and vegetables. ^green;Type: Vegetables^reset;": "ワートウィードと野菜のボリュームたっぷりの濃厚シチュー。^green;種別: 野菜^reset;",
  "Uberdinner": "ウーバーディナー",
  "All plasma plants mixed and cooked.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Run^gray;, ^cyan;Jump^gray;, ^cyan;Rage^gray;, ^cyan;HP^gray;, and ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)\n^red;Burning^gray;, ^red;Electrified ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)^reset;": "全プラズマ植物を混ぜて調理\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;走り^gray;, ^cyan;ジャンプ^gray;, ^cyan;レイジ^gray;, ^cyan;HP^gray;, ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)\n^red;燃焼^gray;, ^red;帯電 ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Violiroot Plate": "ヴァイオリルートプレート",
  "Sliced violiroot is a simple but delicious Novakid food. ^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Jump ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)\n^red;Electrified ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;": "スライスしたヴァイオリルートはシンプルだが美味しいノヴァキッドの食べ物 ^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;ジャンプ ^gray;(^white;100s^gray;)\n^red;帯電 ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Unknown Substance": "未知の物質",
  "Has the consistency of cat puke.\n^pink;Insanity ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "猫の嘔吐物のような粘度\n^pink;狂気 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Empty Honey Jar": "空のハニーの瓶",
  "An empty honey jar.": "空の蜂蜜瓶",
  "Floral Honey Jar": "フローラルHoneyの瓶",
  "A jar of aromatic honey with slight healing properties.\n^green;Heal^white;106.67 ^gray;(^white;80s^gray;)^reset;": "わずかな回復効果のある芳香ハチミツの瓶\n^green;回復^white;106.67 ^gray;(^white;80秒^gray;)^reset;",
  "Green Honey Jar": "グリーンハニーの瓶",
  "A jar of greenish honey.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Poison ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;41.67 ^gray;(^white;50s^gray;)^reset;": "緑がかったハチミツの瓶\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;毒 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;41.67 ^gray;(^white;50秒^gray;)^reset;",
  "Honey Jar": "Honeyの瓶",
  "A delicious jar of healing honey! Gobble it down, or bake with it!\n^green;Heal ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "美味しい回復ハチミツの瓶！がぶ飲みするか、お菓子に使おう！\n^green;回復 ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Inferno Honey": "Infernoハニー",
  "A delicious jar of hot honey.^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Fire ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "美味しいホットハニーの瓶\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;炎 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Mythical Honey Jar": "ミシカルハニーの瓶",
  "A delicious jar of imaginary honey!\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Cosmic ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "美味しい空想ハチミツの瓶！\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;コズミック ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30秒^gray;)^reset;",
  "Dark Honey Jar": "ダークHoneyの瓶",
  "A dark jar of honey!\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Shadow ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "暗いハチミツの瓶！\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;シャドウ ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30秒^gray;)^reset;",
  "Healing Honey Jar": "回復ingHoneyの瓶",
  "Plutonium-enriched honey. Probably dangerous!\n^green;Heal ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;8 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "プルトニウム強化ハチミツ。おそらく危険！\n^green;回復 ^white;57.5 ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;8 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Mutagenic Honey Jar": "変異原性ハニーの瓶",
  "Radioactive, but not dangerous.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Radiation ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "放射性だが危険ではない\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;放射線 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;4 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Red Honey Jar": "RedHoneyの瓶",
  "A red jar of honey! Exceptional healing ability.\n^green;Heal ^white;100 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "赤いハチミツの瓶！卓越した回復能力\n^green;回復 ^white;100 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Shell Honey Jar": "シェルハニーの瓶",
  "A delicious jar of shell honey.^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Physical ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "美味しいシェルハニーの瓶\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;物理 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Frozen Honey Jar": "凍ったHoneyの瓶",
  "A jar of frozen honey.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;Ice ^cyan;Resistance ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "凍ったハチミツの瓶\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^pink;氷 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Quasar Honey Jar": "クエーサーハニーの瓶",
  "Top-shelf stuff.\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;All ^cyan;Res ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;Fuel^reset;": "最高級品\n^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;全 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^blue;+^white;10 ^blue;燃料^reset;",
  "Speed Honey Jar": "スピードハニーの瓶",
  "A contraband jar of honey.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;": "密輸品のハチミツの瓶\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;3分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Strong Honey Jar": "ストロングハニーの瓶",
  "Grants a massive health boost.\n^cyan;+^white;70 ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;": "大幅な体力ブーストを付与\n^cyan;+^white;70 ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Kirhosi Station Keycard": "キルホシステーションキーカード",
  "An expensive Kirhosi keycard, providing VIP access to space station teleporters.": "高価なキルホシキーカード。スペースステーションテレポーターのVIPアクセスを提供",
  "Baby Head (on a stick)": "赤ん坊の頭（棒付き）",
  "Floran delicacy.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 1\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "フローランの珍味\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 1\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "^#88e25b;Bag of Farts^reset;": "^#88e25b;おならの袋^reset;",
  "Mysterious Juice": "ミステリアスジュース",
  "You should drink this.\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "これを飲むべきだ\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "The Devil's Bargain": "悪魔の取引",
  "^red;-^white;25% ^red;HP ^gray;& ^red;EP^gray;,\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;All ^cyan;Res ^gray;& ^cyan;Damage^gray;,\n^cyan;+^white;55% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "^red;-^white;25% ^red;HP ^gray;& ^red;EP^gray;,\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^pink;全 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;& ^cyan;ダメージ^gray;,\n^cyan;+^white;55% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Dirt (5g)": "ダート（5g）",
  "Dirt, but in dose-size quantities for X'i to use recreationally as a psychotropic.\n^red;Drunk^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;Slow^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;4m^gray;) (^white;X'i Only^gray;)^reset;": "土。ただしシーアンが嗜好品として使う用量サイズ\n^red;酔い^gray;, ^white;35% ^red;鈍足^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;4m^gray;) (^white;X'i専用^gray;)^reset;",
  "Face Skin": "顔の皮",
  "Just like mom used to make.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2 \n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "お母さんの味\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2 \n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Fecal Matter": "糞便",
  "Fecal matter. I doubt you require more description\n^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;": "排泄物。これ以上の説明は不要だろう\n^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2\n^green;成長速度 x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;",
  "Ancient Device": "古代の装置",
  "^red;This item is no longer needed, it's safe to sell it.^reset;\nA strange device made by the Ancients.": "^red;このアイテムはもう不要です。売っても安全^reset;\n古代人が作った奇妙な装置",
  "Telk Death-Stick": "テルクデスステック",
  "A narcotic extracted from the Gemglow seed.\n^cyan;+^white;20 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;Heavily Intoxicated^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;Defense^reset; (220s) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "ジェムグロウの種から抽出した麻薬\n^cyan;+^white;20 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;重度酩酊^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;防御^reset; (220秒) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Diet Pill": "ダイエットピル",
  "Suppresses hunger for a time. \n^cyan;-^white;35% ^cyan;Hunger Drain^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;Defense^reset;": "一時的に空腹を抑える \n^cyan;-^white;35% ^cyan;空腹減少^gray;, ^red;-^white;20 ^red;防御^reset;",
  "Cappa": "カッパ",
  "Extracted from Capriole flowers. A heavy class-A narcotic.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;Energy Regen^gray;, ^cyan;Heavily Intoxicated^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;Defense^gray;, ^red;Insanity^reset; (220s) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "カプリオーレの花から抽出。重度のクラスA麻薬\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;エネルギー回復^gray;, ^cyan;重度酩酊^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;防御^gray;, ^red;狂気^reset; (220秒) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Ghost-Spore": "ゴーストスポア",
  "Ghost mushroom spores. Best when burned.\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;Heavily Intoxicated^gray;, ^red;Insanity^gray; (^white;520s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "ゴーストマッシュルームの胞子。燃やすと最高\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;重度酩酊^gray;, ^red;狂気^gray; (^white;520s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Teltik Vision Worm": "テルティックヴィジョンワーム",
  "Parasites found on fletchweed. Converts saliva into hallucinogens.\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;Heavily Intoxicated^gray;, ^red;Insanity^gray;, ^reset;(^white;220s^reset;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 2": "フレッチウィードに寄生する虫。唾液を幻覚剤に変換\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;重度酩酊^gray;, ^red;狂気^gray;, ^reset;(^white;220s^reset;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 2",
  "Grav-Stim": "グラビティスティム",
  "Temporarily alters your gravity. Don't ask how.\n^cyan;-^white;30% ^cyan;Gravity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "一時的に重力を変える。どうやってかは聞くな\n^cyan;-^white;30% ^cyan;Gravity ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Honeyboon Stim": "ハニーブーンスティム",
  "A long-lasting honey repellant.\n^pink;Honey Slow ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;5m^gray;)^reset;": "長時間ハチミツ忌避剤\n^pink;ハニー鈍足 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;5分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Honor Coin": "名誉のコイン",
  "When consumed it provides a defense boost.": "消費すると防御強化を提供",
  "Myphis Mist Injector": "ミフィスミストインジェクター",
  "A mysterious drug.\n^red;Hammered^gray;, ^red;-^white;50% ^red;Run^gray;, ^red;-^white;30% ^red;Jump^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;All ^cyan;Res^gray;, ^cyan;Extremely Caffeinated ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 1": "謎の薬物\n^red;泥酔^gray;, ^red;-^white;50% ^red;走り^gray;, ^red;-^white;30% ^red;ジャンプ^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;15% ^pink;全 ^cyan;耐性^gray;, ^cyan;超強カフェイン ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 1",
  "Novaglow": "ノヴァグロー",
  "Your skin gives off light for a while when consuming this illicit substance. Makes you feel sloppy.\n^cyan;Cosmetic Effect ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset;": "この違法物質を摂取すると肌がしばらく光る。だらしなくなる\n^cyan;外見効果 ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Disposable Light": "ディスポーザブルライト",
  "A handy portable light source.\n^#ffd700;Glow ^gray;(^white;20m^gray;)^reset;": "便利な携帯光源\n^#ffd700;発光 ^gray;(^white;20分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Portal Juice": "Portalジュース",
  "^cyan;If near death, warps you elsewhere and gives ^gray;(^white;10m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 1": "^cyan;瀕死の際にワープし ^gray;(^white;10m^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 1",
  "Bigraxian Hellpowder": "ビグラクシアンヘルパウダー",
  "Absolutely illegal in 97 sectors. Awesome in all of them.\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;Extremely Caffeinated^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;Defense^gray;, ^red;Insanity^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "97セクターで完全に違法。全てで最高\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;超強カフェイン^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;防御^gray;, ^red;狂気^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Organic Energy Stim": "有機エネルギースティム",
  "A long-lasting energy enhancer.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset;": "長時間のエネルギー強化剤\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;EP ^gray;(^white;2分^gray;)^reset;",
  "Pure Narcotium": "ピュアナルコティウム",
  "You probably shouldn't be seen carrying this around.\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;Extremely Caffeinated^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;Defense^gray;, ^red;Insanity^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "これを持ち歩いているところを見られない方がいい\n^cyan;+^white;30 ^cyan;EP^gray;, ^cyan;超強カフェイン^gray;, ^red;-^white;30 ^red;防御^gray;, ^red;狂気^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset; ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Blood Serum Stim": "血清スティム",
  "A long-lasting vitality enhancer.\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 1": "長時間の活力強化剤\n^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;2分^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 1",
  "Shield Patch": "シールドパッチ",
  "^green;Repair ^white;140% ^green;Shield HP^reset;, and gain +^cyan;42^reset;% Defense Tech Efficiency (^white;30s^reset;)": "^green;修復 ^white;140% ^green;シールドHP^reset;, +^cyan;42^reset;% 防御テック効率を獲得 (^white;30s^reset;)",
  "The Sauce": "ザ・ソース",
  "Protects you from damage via some sort of...weird mojo.\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 4": "何らかの…奇妙なモジョでダメージから守る\n^cyan;+^white;30% ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 4",
  "Uber-Stim": "ウーバースティム",
  "A VERY high dosage of performance enhancers.\n^cyan;+^white;350% ^cyan;Run^gray;, ^cyan;+^white;150% ^cyan;Jump^gray;, ^cyan;Feather Fall ^gray;(^white;24s^gray;) ^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "非常に高用量のパフォーマンス強化剤\n^cyan;+^white;350% ^cyan;走り^gray;、^cyan;+^white;150% ^cyan;ジャンプ^gray;、^cyan;フェザーフォール ^gray;(^white;24秒^gray;) ^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "X-Stim": "Xスティム",
  "^cyan;+^white;6 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;30% ^cyan;Gravity ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)\n^green;Repair ^white;160% ^green;Shield HP ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)\n^green;Heal ^white;40% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^blue;Madness Gain^reset; 3": "^cyan;+^white;6 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)\n^cyan;-^white;30% ^cyan;重力 ^gray;(^white;15s^gray;)\n^green;修復 ^white;160% ^green;シールドHP ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)\n^green;回復 ^white;40% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)\n^blue;狂気蓄積^reset; 3",
  "Deepwater Stim": "ディープウォータースティム",
  "^cyan;Swim Boost 2 ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset;": "^cyan;水泳ブースト 2 ^gray;(^white;220s^gray;)^reset;",
  "^#ffe50e;Ancient Artifact^reset;": "^#ffe50e;古代のアーティファクト^reset;",
  "A strange, unknowably ancient artifact.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "奇妙で計り知れないほど古代のアーティファクト\n^green;顕微鏡で研究しよう^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Anti-Psychotics^reset;": "^#77acc3;抗精神病薬^reset;",
  "^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;Mental Protection ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;": "^cyan;+^white;25% ^cyan;精神防御 ^gray;(^white;60s^gray;)^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Bounce Wrap^reset;": "^#77acc3;バウンスラップ^reset;",
  "Gives you tremendous bounce.": "すごい跳躍力を付与",
  "^#77acc3;Corvex Putty^reset;": "^#77acc3;コーヴェクスパテ^reset;",
  "Coat yourself in no-stick putty to prevent slipping and sticking.": "ノンスティックパテを塗って滑りと粘着を防止",
  "Crunchy Chick": "カリカリヒヨコ",
  "Floran delicacy. A live baby chicken.\n^green;Heals ^white;5% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "フローランの珍味。生きた赤ちゃん鶏。\n^green;回復 ^white;5% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;5s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Deluxe Crunchy Chick": "デラックスカリカリヒヨコ",
  "Floran delicacy. A live baby boobie.\n^green;Heals ^white;100% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;50s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "フローランの珍味。生きた赤ちゃんカツオドリ。\n^green;回復 ^white;100% ^green;HP ^gray;(^white;50s^gray;)^reset;\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Crunchy Evil Chick": "カリカリ悪魔のヒヨコ",
  "Possessed by Richard Simmons. Unimaginably evil. And fit.\n^red;Insanity ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;\n^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "リチャード・シモンズに取り憑かれている。想像を絶する邪悪さ。そして健康的\n^red;狂気 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;\n^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Honeysilk Bandage": "ハニーシルク包帯",
  "^green;Heal ^white;120 ^gray;over ^white;20s\n^green;Cures ^pink;Burning^gray;, ^pink;Cold^gray;, ^pink;Electrified^gray;, ^pink;Poisoned^reset;": "^green;回復 ^white;120 ^gray;/ ^white;20s\n^green;治癒 ^pink;燃焼^gray;, ^pink;冷気^gray;, ^pink;帯電^gray;, ^pink;毒^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Hermes Pill^reset;": "^#77acc3;ヘルメスピル^reset;",
  "^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;Run ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "^cyan;+^white;15% ^cyan;走り ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Mutavisk Bandage^reset;": "^#77acc3;ミュータヴィスク包帯^reset;",
  "^green;Heal ^white;85 ^gray;over ^white;1s^reset;": "^green;回復 ^white;85 ^gray;/ ^white;1s^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Wretchel Poultice^reset;": "^#77acc3;レッチェル湿布^reset;",
  "^pink;Insanity ^cyan;Immunity ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;": "^pink;狂気 ^cyan;耐性 ^gray;(^white;3m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Alien Broadcast Node": "エイリアンBroadcastノード",
  "Some form of broadcasting device.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "何らかの通信装置\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Modified Broadcast Node": "改良ブロードキャストノード",
  "Some form of broadcasting device, 'acquired' by Khe and modified.": "ケーが「入手」して改造した何らかの放送装置",
  "Ancient Remote": "古代のリモート",
  "A remote for some sort of device of the Ancients.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "古代人の何らかの装置のリモコン\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Greenfinger Medal": "グリーンフィンガーメダル",
  "Given to accomplished Greenfingers as a mark of honor.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "優秀なグリーンフィンガーに名誉の印として与えられる\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Lucky Coin": "ラッキーコイン",
  "A rare, ancient lucky coin.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "希少な古代の幸運のコイン\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Ghost Coin": "ゴーストコイン",
  "A slightly ethereal coin engraved with the image of a boatman. ^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "船頭の像が刻まれたやや霊的なコイン。^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Gnawed Coin": "齧られたコイン",
  "A rare, ancient lucky coin. Somehow, it has been gnawed and is no longer recognizable.": "希少な古代のラッキーコイン。なぜか齧られて判別不能",
  "X'i Relic": "シーの遺物",
  "A relic of importance to none but a X'i.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "シーアン以外には重要でない遺物\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Crystalline Trophy": "クリスタリントロフィー",
  "A valuable crystal trophy.\n^green;Research in a microscope.^reset;": "貴重なクリスタルトロフィー\n^green;顕微鏡で研究^reset;",
  "Broken Crystalline Trophy": "壊れたクリスタリントロフィー",
  "A formerly valuable crystal trophy. Now it's just gnawed and broken.": "かつて価値があったクリスタルトロフィー。今は齧られて壊れただけ",
  "A slab of delicious cooked alien meat. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "おいしく焼けたエイリアン肉の厚切り。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "Salty, crispy alien bacon. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "塩辛くてカリカリのエイリアンベーコン。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "A tasty fillet of cooked fish. ^orange;Type: Cooked Seafood^reset;": "おいしく焼いた魚の切り身。^orange;種別: 魚介^reset;",
  "A haunch of roasted alien ham. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "ローストしたエイリアンハムの塊。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "A perfectly roasted bird. What a beautiful sight to behold. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "完璧に焼き上げた鳥肉。なんと美しい光景だろう。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "Pass the barbecue sauce! ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "バーベキューソースをよこせ！^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "Chewy... But in a nice way. ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "噛みごたえがある...いい意味で。^orange;種別: 肉^reset;",
  "Delicious Mystery Meat": "デリシャスミステリーミート",
  "A wonderfully tasty looking morsel which you should *definitely* eat.\n^red;Bleeding ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "絶対に食べるべき見た目が最高に美味しい一口\n^red;出血 ^gray;(^white;20s^gray;)^reset; ^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Frostburnt Alien Meat": "凍傷のエイリアン肉",
  "A Peglaci delicacy. An accident for everyone else.\n^green;Heal ^white;10 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "ペグラシの珍味。他の種族には事故\n^green;回復 ^white;10 ^gray;(^white;2秒^gray;)^reset;\n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Honey Ham": "ハニーハム",
  "A haunch of honey roasted ham.\n^green;Heal ^white;115 ^gray;(^white;90s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "ハニーローストハムの塊\n^green;回復 ^white;115 ^gray;(^white;90秒^gray;)^reset;\n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "A Squishy Human Eye": "ASquishyヒューマンアイ",
  "Delicious and nutritious. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "美味しくて栄養満点。^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Meat Chunk": "肉の塊",
  "A large chunk of barely cooked alien meat. An Avikan favourite.\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;2m^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Cooked Meat^reset;": "ほぼ生のエイリアン肉の大きな塊。エイビカンのお気に入り\n^cyan;+^white;20% ^cyan;HP ^gray;(^white;2分^gray;)^reset;\n^orange;タイプ: 調理済み肉^reset;",
  "Meaty Kibble": "肉入りキブル",
  "Bloody, raw chunks of meat. Great for carnivores. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "血まみれの生肉の塊。肉食動物に最適。^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
  "Raw strips of bacon. I should cook them first, right? ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "生のベーコン。まず焼くべきだよね？^red;種別: 生肉^reset;",
  "A fillet of raw fish...slimy. ^orange;Type: Seafood^reset;": "生の魚の切り身...ぬるぬる。^orange;種別: 魚介^reset;",
  "Raw poultry. Might wanna cook it first... ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "生の鶏肉。まず焼いた方がいいかも...^red;種別: 生肉^reset;",
  "Robo-Snax": "ロボスナックス",
  "Specially formulated Robo-Food. ^yellow;Type: Robot Food^reset;": "特別配合のロボフード。^yellow;タイプ: ロボット食^reset;",
  "Severed human ear": "切断された人間の耳",
  "A delicious severed human ear. ^red;Type: Raw Meat^reset;": "美味しい切断された人間の耳。^red;タイプ: 生肉^reset;",
