  "Medical Kit IV": "メディカルキット IV",
  "^green;Heal ^white;200 ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^green;Cures ^pink;Burning^gray;, ^pink;Cold^gray;, ^pink;Electrified^gray;, ^pink;Poisoned^reset;": "^green;回復 ^white;200 ^gray;(^white;10s^gray;)\n^green;治癒 ^pink;燃焼^gray;, ^pink;冷気^gray;, ^pink;帯電^gray;, ^pink;毒^reset;",
  "Whatever's inside is heavy, and feels both squishy and firm.": "中身は重くて、グニグニしつつも固い感触がする",
  "Precursor Hyper-Grav": "プリカーサー超重力装置",
