  "An indispensable item for a X'i.\n^green;Heal ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;": "シーアンに不可欠なアイテム\n^green;回復 ^white;50 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Reactive Gel II": "リアクティブジェル II",
  "An indispensable item for a X'i.\n^green;Heal ^white;75 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;": "シーアンに不可欠なアイテム\n^green;回復 ^white;75 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Reactive Gel III": "リアクティブジェル III",
  "An indispensable item for a X'i.\n^green;Heal ^white;100 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;": "シーアンに不可欠なアイテム\n^green;回復 ^white;100 ^gray;(^white;1s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Gross. There's absolutely no way this is still edible.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.25^reset;": "気持ち悪い。これがまだ食べられるなんてことは絶対にない\n^green;成長速度 x^white;1.25^reset;",
