  "Quasi-Sentient Being Chow": "準意識体フード",
  "For the ship pet in your life. ^red;Do Not Consume.\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;Poisoned ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;": "あなたの船のペットのために ^red;摂取厳禁。\n^red;-^white;5% ^red;HP^gray;, ^red;毒 ^gray;(^white;1m^gray;)^reset;",
  "Wartweed Kibble": "ワートウィードキブル",
  "Mr. Chow's Troll Food": "Mr.チョウのトロールフード",
