  "Wretchel Fruit": "レッチェルフルーツ",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;100% HP Damage Barrier^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^red;Wretchel Poisoning^reset;: 1m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;100% HPダメージバリア^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^red;レッチェル中毒^reset;: 1m",
  "Wubstem": "ウブステム",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune: Electrified, Electric Storm & +10% Electric Res^reset; : 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;耐性: 帯電, 電気嵐 & +10% 電気耐性^reset; : 2m",
  "Xax Wing": "ザックスウイング",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Levitation^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Grav Rain: 3m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;浮遊^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: 重力雨: 3m",
  "Yellow-foot Mushroom": "イエローフットキノコ",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Energy x1.15^reset;^reset;: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;エネルギー x1.15^reset;^reset;: 2m",
  "Zathi Node": "Zathiノード",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+30% Cosmic Res^reset;: 3m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+30% コズミック耐性^reset;: 3m",
  "Kiri Fruit [FU]": "キリフルーツ [FU]",
  "The fruiting body of a subterranean slime mold.\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Heal in Darkness 250.25%-252.5% HP^reset;: 5m": "地下粘菌の子実体\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;回復 in 暗闘 250.25%-252.5% HP^reset;: 5m",
  "Nakati Bark": "ナカティバーク",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Proto-Poison, ^cyan;+7 Defense^reset;: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: プロト毒, ^cyan;+7 防御^reset;: 2m",
  "Piru Frond [FU]": "ピルフロンド [FU]",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Swim Boost^reset;, ^cyan;+15% Run^reset;: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;水泳ブースト^reset;, ^cyan;+15% 走り^reset;: 2m",
  "Aenema Petal": "エネマの花びら",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;100% Fire Thorns^reset;: 1m.\nSpicy!": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;100% 炎 ソーン^reset;: 1m.\nスパイシー！",
  "Battery Stem Charge": "バッテリーステムチャージ",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+40 EP^reset;, ^cyan;+2.5% E Regen & -1.25% E. Block^reset;: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+40 EP^reset;, ^cyan;+2.5% E 回復 & -1.25% Eブロック^reset;: 2m",
  "Darklight Blossom": "ダークライトブロッサム",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Insanity, Darkness: 1.5m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: 狂気, 暗闘: 1.5m",
  "Fletchweed Stem": "フレッチウィードの茎",
  "Garikleaf Blossom": "ガリクリーフブロッサム",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+50% Run^reset;, ^cyan;Low Gravity^reset;: 1m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+50% 走り^reset;, ^cyan;低重力^reset;: 1m",
  "Herrod Bush Gem": "ヘロッドブッシュジェム",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Shadow Taint: 3m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: シャドウ汚染: 3m",
  "Kramil Spine": "クラミルスパイン",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Icy, Slush, Snow, Extreme Cold: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: 氷, 雪解け, 雪, 極度の冷気: 2m",
  "Quellstem Bud": "クエルステムの蕾",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;25% Fire Res & Immune: Burning, Lava^reset;, ^cyan;Immune^reset;:  Extreme Heat: 1m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;25% 炎耐性 & 耐性: 燃焼, 溶岩^reset;, ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 極度の熱: 1m",
  "Victor Leaf Bud": "ヴィクターリーフバッド",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+50% Run^reset;, ^cyan;+25% Jump^reset;: 1m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+50% 走り^reset;, ^cyan;+25% ジャンプ^reset;: 1m",
  "Whitespine Shell": "ホワイトスパインシェル",
  "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Immune^reset;: Sulphuric Acid: 2m": "^yellow;^reset;^cyan;免疫^reset;: 硫酸: 2m",
  "Phasefruit": "フェイズフルーツ",
  "Has it just melted my teeth?!\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+20% Run^reset;: 40s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;Burning^reset;: 10s": "歯が溶けた？！\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+20% 走り^reset;: 40s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;燃焼^reset;: 10s",
  "Plasmango": "プラズマンゴー",
  "\"Everything is gonna be fine\" - non-Novakid prior to eating a Plasmango. \n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+20% Jump^reset;: 40s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;Burning^reset;: 10s": "「全部大丈夫」 — プラズマンゴーを食べる前のノンノヴァキッドの言葉 \n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;+20% ジャンプ^reset;: 40s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;燃焼^reset;: 10s",
  "Solusberry": "ソルスベリー",
  "I don't think this is healthy food...\n^yellow;^reset;^#b3b398;Glow^reset;: 90s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;Burning^reset;: 10s": "これが健康的な食べ物だとは思えない…\n^yellow;^reset;^#b3b398;発光^reset;: 90s\n^yellow;^reset;^red;燃焼^reset;: 10s",
  "Violiroot": "ヴァイオリルート",
  "Both tasty and useful! Not!\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;Health x1.2^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^red;Burning^reset;: 10s": "美味しくて便利！嘘！\n^yellow;^reset;^cyan;回復x1.2^reset;: 1m\n^yellow;^reset;^red;燃焼^reset;: 10s",
  "Banana Milk": "バナナミルク",
  "Contains no bees.\n^cyan;+^white;4 ^cyan;Defense ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;Type: Fruits + Dairy^reset;": "蜂は入っていない\n^cyan;+^white;4 ^cyan;防御 ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset; \n^orange;タイプ: フルーツ+乳製品^reset;",
  "Just objectively the best thing ever. ^green;Type: Sugar^reset;": "客観的に見て、史上最高のもの。^green;種別: 砂糖^reset;",
  "It's an egg! ^orange;Type: Omnivore^reset;": "卵だ！^orange;種別: 雑食^reset;",
  "^blue;Joja^reset; Cola": "^blue;Joja^reset;コーラ",
  "The flagship product of the Joja corporation.\n^blue;Blue ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;": "ジョジャコーポレーションの主力商品\n^blue;ブルー ^gray;(^white;30s^gray;)^reset;",
  "Slushpaste": "スラッシュペースト",
  "A pureed mixture of snow and plant matter that can barely be termed food. It'll keep you from starving, but only just.\n^green;Heal ^white;10 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; ^green;Type: Plant^reset;": "食べ物とは言い難い雪と植物のピューレ。餓死は免れるが、ギリギリ\n^green;回復 ^white;10 ^gray;(^white;2s^gray;)^reset; ^green;タイプ: 植物^reset;",
  "Chemical Compounds": "化合物",
  "A sealed crate of chemical compounds, valuable for interstellar trade.": "密封された化合物のクレート、星間貿易で価値がある",
  "Contraband": "禁制品",
  "A sealed crate of 'asking for trouble', valuable for the wrong kinds of people.": "密封された「問題を招く」クレート、悪い人間にとって価値がある",
  "Empty Crate": "空のクレート",
  "A crateful of nothing.": "何も入っていないクレート",
  "Luxury Goods": "贅沢品",
  "A sealed crate of luxorious trinkets, valuable for interstellar trade.": "密封された贅沢な小物のクレート、星間貿易で価値がある",
  "Minerals": "鉱物",
  "A sealed crate of minerals, valuable for interstellar trade.": "密封された鉱物のクレート、星間貿易で価値がある",
  "Cornu": "コルヌ",
  "A large, curved brass horn.": "大きな湾曲した真鍮のホルン",
  "A highly corrosive organic substance.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "非常に腐食性の高い有機物質。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Plasmic Fluid": "プラズマ液",
  "A measure of an unusual plasmic fluid.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "珍しいプラズマ流体の計量分\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A strange, thick liquid that feels like it doesn't belong in this universe.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "この宇宙に属さないような奇妙で粘性のある液体。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Dark Water": "ダークウォーター",
  "D2OAs. Nearly identical in nature to heavy water, but with high concentrations of arsenic.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "D2OAs。重水とほぼ同一の性質だが、高濃度のヒ素を含む。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Mercury": "水銀",
  "Mercury is the only metal that is liquid at standard temperatures and pressures. Caution: Toxic\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "水銀は標準温度・圧力で液体の唯一の金属。注意: 有毒\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Salt Water": "塩水",
  "A measure of salt water.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "塩水の計量分\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Frozen Honey": "凍ったハニー",
  "A measure of icy honey that is somehow in a perpetual liquid state. Cold to the touch.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "永久に液体状態を保つ氷のハチミツの計量分。触ると冷たい。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Exspiravit Honey": "エクスピラヴィットハニー",
  "A measure of semi-transparent, white-hued honey. Known to be a potent hallucinogen.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "半透明で白みがかったハチミツの計量分。強力な幻覚剤として知られる\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Pure Honey": "ピュアハニー",
  "A measure of sweet, sweet honey.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "甘い甘いハチミツの計量分\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Crimson Honey": "Crimsonハニー",
  "Sickeningly sweet honey that contains nearly-microscopic meat and flesh particles in great abundance.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "吐き気がするほど甘い、ほぼ顕微鏡サイズの肉粒子を大量に含むハチミツ。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "A measure of cool, clear, healing water. Drinking it will restore your body.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "冷たく澄んだ癒しの水。飲むと体を回復させる。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Helium-3": "ヘリウム3",
  "Exceptional in nuclear applications despite being non-radioactive.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "非放射性にもかかわらず核用途に優れている\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of bubbling, searing lava.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "煮えたぎる灼熱の溶岩。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of liquid aether, a strange black liquid. Feels dry.\n^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;Uses -^white;0.5 ^cyan;fluid use ^gray;& ^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "液体エーテルの計量分。奇妙な黒い液体。乾いた感触。\n^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;液体消費 -^white;0.5 ^gray;& ^cyan;種子消費 -^white;1^reset;\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Beer": "ビール",
  "A holy liquid loved by even the Gods themselves.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;produce.^reset;\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "神々にすら愛される聖なる液体。\n^green;成長速度 x^white;2 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;1 ^green;収穫量^reset;\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Bio-Ooze": "バイオウーズ",
  "A measure of bio-ooze.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "バイオウーズの計量分\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Black Tar": "ブラックタール",
  "A measure of viscous tar.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "粘性タールの計量分\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of blood.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "血液の計量分\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Liquified Crystal": "Liquifiedクリスタル",
  "A measure of liquified crystals.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;2.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "液化クリスタルの計量分\n^green;成長速度 x^white;2.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Liquid Deuterium": "液体デュテリウム",
  "A powerful cold-source and thus has many nuclear applications.\n^blue;+^white;5 ^blue;Fuel\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "強力な冷却源で核関連の用途が多い\n^blue;+^white;5 ^blue;燃料\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Essentia Obscura": "エッセンティア・オブスキュラ",
  "A measure of a strange, unidentifiable liquid.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "奇妙な正体不明の液体の計量分\n^green;成長速度 x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Blue Grav-Liquid": "ブルーグラビティリキッド",
  "A measure of blue grav-liquid, manipulating gravity upon touch. How does this liquid even exist!?\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "触れると重力を操作する青い重力液の計量分。この液体はどうやって存在しているんだ！？\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Liquid Iron": "液体鉄",
  "Iron ^gray;Fe^reset; has a melting point of 1811K (1537C). Let that be a word of caution.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "金属の^gray;Fe^reset;。融点1811K (1537℃)。ご注意を\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Liquid Irradium": "液体イラジウム",
  "A measure of liquid irradium.\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;Fuel\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "液体イラジウムの計量分\n^blue;+^white;2 ^blue;燃料\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Refined Fuel": "精製燃料",
  "An industrial-grade fuel obtained from refining lesser fuel using a catalyst.": "触媒を使って低級燃料を精製した工業グレード燃料",
  "Liquid Mercury": "液体水銀",
  "A measure of Mercury ^gray;Hg^reset; in its most common state. Caution: Toxic": "最も一般的な状態の水銀^gray;Hg^reset;。注意: 有毒",
  "Liquid Metallic Hydrogen": "液体金属水素",
  "Manipulation of ZPE via ^blue;Arc^reset; tech has unlocked liquid state at STP!\n^blue;+^white;32 ^blue;Fuel\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "^blue;アーク^reset;技術によるZPE操作で標準状態での液体化を解放！\n^blue;+^white;32 ^blue;燃料\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Liquid Nitrogen": "液体窒素",
  "A measure of nitrogen at temperatures at or below 77K. Proceed with care.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "77K以下の温度の窒素の計量分。取り扱い注意。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Orange Grav-Liquid": "オレンジグラビティリキッド",
  "A measure of orange grav-liquid, manipulating gravity upon touch. How does this liquid even exist!?\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "触れると重力を操作するオレンジ色の重力液の計量分。この液体はどうやって存在しているんだ！？\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Organic Soup": "Organicスープ",
  "A measure of organic soup.\n^green;Growth Rate x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;produce.\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;seed use^reset;\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "有機スープの計量分\n^green;成長速度 x^white;1.5 ^gray;& ^green;+^white;2 ^green;収穫量\n^cyan;-^white;1 ^cyan;種子消費^reset;\n^green;抽出可能^reset;, ^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "Pus": "膿",
  "A measure of pus. This is absolutely disgusting.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "膿の計量分。絶対的に不快\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Sulphuric Acid": "硫酸",
  "Sulphuric Acid ^gray;H2SO4^reset; is one of the strongest naturally occurring acids.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "硫酸^gray;H2SO4^reset;は天然に存在する最も強力な酸の一つ\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Contaminated Water": "汚染水",
  "A measure of filthy, brackish water.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "汚い汽水の計量分\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of coconut milk. The taste is amazing.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "ココナッツミルク。味は最高。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of strong poison.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "強力な毒。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Caliginous Gas": "暗黒ガス",
  "WF6CF4Po. Able to absorb light and alter gravitic force through unusual carbon nanotube formations. Toxic.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "WF6CF4Po。珍しいカーボンナノチューブ構造により光を吸収し重力を変える能力を持つ。有毒。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;.",
  "A slimey liquid.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "ぬるぬるした液体。\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of dirty swamp water.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "汚れた沼の水。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Unrefined Fuel": "未精製燃料",
  "Unrefined fuel modified from oil. If exposed to air, it reverts to oil.": "石油から改質した未精製燃料。空気に触れると石油に戻る",
  "Liquid Protocite": "液体プロトサイト",
  "A measure of liquid protocite.\n^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "液体プロトサイトの計量分\n^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "A measure of cool, clear water.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^yellow;Centrifugable^reset;.": "冷たく澄んだ水。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^yellow;遠心分離可能^reset;",
  "Stellara Crystal": "ステラーラクリスタル",
  "Light seems to twist inside these crystals.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "光がこのクリスタルの中でねじれているようだ\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Aen Bridge Plank": "エンBridge板",
  "Some Aen Wood carved for use in bridges, supports need not apply.": "橋に使用するために彫られたエンウッド。支えは不要",
  "Aen Nebula Lattice": "エンNebula格子",
  "A lattice of Aen Wood made for use in windows, has a nebulaic membrane.": "窓用に作られたエンウッド。星雲膜付き",
  "Aen Window Lattice": "エンWindow格子",
  "A lattice of Aen Wood made for use in windows.": "窓用に作られたエンウッド製品",
  "Aen Nebula Fence": "エンNebulaフェンス",
  "A fence made from Aen Wood, has a nebulaic membrane for extra stopping power.": "エンウッド製のフェンス。星雲膜で防御力が向上",
  "Aen Fence": "エンフェンス",
  "A fence made from Aen Wood.": "エンウッド製のフェンス",
  "Aen Flooring": "エンフローリング",
  "Some high quality wood flooring made from Aen Wood.": "エンウッド製の高品質木製フローリング",
  "Aen Wood Support": "エンWood支柱",
  "A well made Aen Wood log support, strong and starry.": "エンウッドの丸太支柱。頑丈で星のよう",
  "Aen Wood Platform": "エンWood足場",
  "A pretty Aen Wood platform.": "エンウッドのplatform",
  "Aen Timber": "エン木材",
  "Some processed Aen Wood, \"perfect\" for building and crafting.": "エンウッドの加工材。建築とクラフトに最適",
  "Aen Window": "エン窓",
  "A slightly glowing window made from Aether glass and Aen Wood.": "エーテルガラスとエンウッド製のほのかに光る窓",
  "Aen Wood Blinds": "エンWoodブラインド",
  "Some blinds made of Aen Wood, keeps light out but also makes it.": "エンウッド製のブラインド。光を遮りつつも通す",
  "This strange rock comes from an alien world.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;, ^red;Smeltable^reset;.": "異世界から来た奇妙な岩。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;、^red;製錬可能^reset;",
  "Alien Soil": "エイリアンの土壌",
  "Strange soil with an almost neon glow.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Siftable^reset;.": "ほぼネオンのように光る奇妙な土壌\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;ふるい可能^reset;",
  "A piece of alien striped wood. Stripey!\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "エイリアンストライプの木片。しましま！\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
  "Amber Platform": "Amber足場",
  "A rich amber platform": "豊かな琥珀色の足場",
  "Ancient Cracked Block": "エンシェントCrackedブロック",
  "These bricks have been weathered by time.": "時間の風化を受けたレンガ",
  "Ancient Plain Block": "エンシェントPlainブロック",
  "These plain bricks have certainly survived the test of time.": "この素朴なレンガは確かに時の試練を生き延びた",
  "Ancient Plain Brick": "エンシェントPlainレンガ",
  "This plain carved brick is immeasurably old.": "この素朴な彫刻レンガは計り知れないほど古い",
  "Andesite": "安山岩",
  "A rough volcanic rock.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "粗い火山岩\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "A pile of tightly packed ash.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Siftable^reset;.": "ぎゅっと詰まった灰の山。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;ふるい可能^reset;",
  "A cheap but effective construction material.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "安価だが効果的な建設素材。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Aen Wood Log": "エンの丸太",
  "A starry kind of wood imbued with Aether.\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "エーテルが染み込んだ星のような木材\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
  "Fallen Leaves": "落ち葉",
  "A bunch of fallen leaves.\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "落ち葉の束\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
  "^cyan;Aeroponic Tubing^reset;": "^cyan;エアロポニックチューブ^reset;",
  "Once tilled, these tubes transport a nutrient aerosol for growing plants within.": "耕すと、これらのチューブが植物栽培用の栄養エアロゾルを輸送",
