  "A thick plate of smooth stone.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "滑らかな石の厚い板\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Rough Dirt": "Roughダート",
