  "A crudely produced set of rock bricks.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "粗雑に作られた岩レンガ。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Rostone": "ロストーン",
  "Rough, unrefined rostone.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "粗い未精錬のロストーン\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Rotting Flesh": "Rotting肉",
  "Okay, ew.\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "えっ、うげっ\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
  "Old metal encrusted with rust.\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "錆びだらけの古い金属。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
  "It's Silt. It's very silty.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Siftable^reset;, ^red;Smeltable^reset;.": "沈泥だ。とても泥っぽい。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;ふるい可能^reset;、^red;製錬可能^reset;",
  "A fine glittering sand. Could probably be made into glass!\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Siftable^reset;, ^red;Smeltable^reset;.": "きらきら光る細かい砂。ガラスにできそう！\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;ふるい可能^reset;、^red;製錬可能^reset;",
  "Sand Pillar": "Sand柱",
  "A pillar. Made from sand. Fairly self-explanatory, I'd say.": "砂製の柱。説明不要だろう",
  "Sand Decorated Pillar": "サンドデコレーテッド柱",
  "A decorated pillar. Made from sand. Fairly self-explanatory, I'd say.": "砂製の装飾柱。説明不要だろう",
  "Tough natural sandstone.\n^green;Extractable^reset;, ^orange;Crushable^reset;.": "丈夫な天然の砂岩。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;、^orange;粉砕可能^reset;",
  "Bricks made from smoothed sandstone.\n^green;Extractable^reset;.": "なめらかな砂岩から作られたブロック。\n^green;抽出可能^reset;",
