  "Dangerous, sandy quicksand.": "危険な砂の流砂",
  "Salty ocean water": "塩辛い海水",
  "Strange, blue gravity-filled liquid. Likely artificial.": "奇妙な青い重力充填液。おそらく人工物",
  "Handy energy-infused gas. Great for fusion.": "便利なエネルギー注入ガス。核融合に最適",
