  "Liquid nitrogen is a teency bit cold.": "液体窒素はほんのちょっと冷たい",
  "Refined mech fuel.": "精製メック燃料",
  "Definitely unsafe levels of mercury.": "間違いなく危険な量の水銀",
  "Degenerate matter. Extremely valuable quantum/electrical conductor.": "縮退物質。極めて価値の高い量子/電気伝導体",
  "Liquefied metallic hydrogen.": "液化金属水素",
  "Pure nitrogen gas": "純粋な窒素ガス",
  "Strange, orange gravity-filled liquid. Likely artificial.": "奇妙なオレンジの重力充填液。おそらく人工物",
  "A unique and unusual biological liquid.": "希少で珍しい生物学的液体",
  "Really poisonous gas.": "本当に有毒なガス",
  "You could call this protoliquid.": "プロトリキッドと呼べるかも",
