  "Hates Iceballers. It's mutual.": "アイスボーラーが大嫌い。お互い様",
  "Glower": "グロワー",
  "Is he a glower, or a shower?": "光る奴か、それとも見せびらかし屋か？",
  "Glow Worm": "発光ワーム",
  "A rather apt name for this creature, I should think.": "この生き物にはぴったりの名前だと思う",
  "Pygmy Goat": "ピグミーヤギ",
  "Perhaps not so great for goats' milk. But they make great pets.": "ヤギの乳には向かないかも。でもペットには最高",
  "Noot": "ヌート",
  "Loves muddy and dark places.": "泥だらけの暗い場所が好き",
  "Aliveoil": "アライブオイル",
  "Great little pet. Also amazing for cooking. Cruel, but delicious!": "素晴らしい小型ペット。料理にも最高。残酷だが美味しい！",
  "Ugly Scorponok": "醜いスコルポノク",
  "Ew. Ew ew ew. Arachnid. Nope. Noooppppppeee.": "うぇ。うぇうぇうぇ。蜘蛛類。無理。ムリムリムリ",
  "Funga-Gnome": "ファンガノーム",
  "Half gnome, half mushroom. All tasty.": "半分ノーム、半分キノコ。全部おいしい",
  "Icewalker": "アイスウォーカー",
  "Their loathing of the Fireballs is unmatched.": "ファイアボールへの嫌悪は比類なし",
  "Albatross": "アホウドリ",
  "A small sea bird with great wings. It soars through the sky and dives for food on the surface of the water.": "大きな翼を持つ小さな海鳥。空を舞い、水面の餌に飛び込む",
  "Amazon Parrot": "コンゴウインコ",
  "One of the most intelligent of birds. It can be found in a rainforest.": "最も賢い鳥の一つ。熱帯雨林に生息する",
  "A large omnivore found in temperate woodlands. Though normally a docile animal, it has been known to attack.": "温帯林に生息する大型雑食動物。普段は大人しいが、攻撃することもある",
  "Brown Snake": "Brownスネーク",
  "A tiny venomous snake found in the woods and swamps.": "森や沼地に生息する小さな毒蛇",
  "Two-Humped Camel": "フタコブラクダ",
  "A large, long-necked creature with two fleshy humps on its back. It is domesticated to carry passengers and cargo.": "背中に2つの肉質のこぶを持つ首の長い大型生物。乗客と貨物の運搬用に家畜化されている",
  "A small flying beast that can sail through the sky on wings stretching between its front and hind legs.": "前脚と後脚の間に広がる翼で空を飛べる小型の飛行獣。",
  "Pterodactyl": "プテロダクティル",
  "A tiny reptile that eats insects. It is commonly found in deserts.": "昆虫を食べる。砂漠でよく見られる小さな爬虫類。",
  "Lizard": "トカゲ",
  "A flightless bird that eats fruit.": "フルーツを食べる飛べない鳥",
  "Dodo": "ドードー",
  "Dragonfly": "トンボ",
  "A relatively large insect found in swamps and marshland.": "沼地や湿地に生息する比較的大型の昆虫",
  "A small water bird. It has a long neck and powerful legs meant for swimming and diving.": "小さな水鳥。泳ぎと潜水に適した長い首と強靭な脚を持つ",
  "A medium-sized hoofed forest creature that grows its antlers back each year.": "毎年角が生え変わる中型の有蹄類の森の生き物。",
  "Deer": "鹿",
  "Fox": "キツネ",
  "A small carnivorous animal found in temperate climates. It has orange fur and is known for its cleverness.": "温帯気候に生息する小さな肉食動物。オレンジの毛皮を持ち賢さで知られる",
  "Giraffe": "キリン",
  "A huge leaf-eating mammal. It has an extremely long neck. Its skin has a distinctive brown and white pattern.": "大型の草食哺乳類。極めて長い首を持つ。皮膚は特徴的な茶と白の模様",
  "Horse": "馬",
  "A large hooved, maned herbivore. They can run swiftly and many are domesticated as steeds.": "蹄とたてがみを持つ大型草食動物。素早く走り、多くが乗騎として家畜化されている",
  "A tiny agile bird that drinks nectar from flowers. They are known for their speed and colorful feathers.": "花の蜜を吸う。速さとカラフルな羽で知られる小さくすばしこい鳥。",
  "Humming Bird": "ハチドリ",
  "Scarlet Ibis": "ショウジョウトキ",
  "A medium sized shorebird with a long curved bill. They are commonly found near tropical coasts.": "長い湾曲した嘴を持つ中型の水鳥。熱帯の海岸付近でよく見られる",
  "Monkey": "猿",
  "A tiny diurnal mammal. It spends its time in the trees searching for food.": "昼行性の小さな哺乳類。木の上で食べ物を探して過ごす",
  "Moth": "蛾",
  "A tiny nocturnal insect. It flies toward lights in the night.": "夜行性の小さな昆虫。夜に光に向かって飛ぶ",
  "A predatory reptile that hunts in forests. It uses the leaves on its head as camouflage.": "森で狩りをする。頭の葉をカモフラージュに使う捕食性爬虫類。",
  "Green Snake": "Greenスネーク",
  "Polar Bear": "シロクマ",
  "A huge predatory mammal covered in white hair. It hunts the shores along tundra and glaciers.": "白い毛に覆われた大型捕食哺乳類。ツンドラや氷河沿いの海岸で狩りをする",
  "Pterosaur": "翼竜",
  "Raccoon": "アライグマ",
  "A small nocturnal animal found in temperate forests. They are curious and are known to steal from civilized areas.": "温帯林に生息する小さな夜行性動物。好奇心旺盛で文明地域から盗むことで知られる",
  "A small insect that seeks out unwatched food and garbage. They fear light.": "放置された食べ物とゴミを探す。光を恐れる小さな昆虫。",
  "Roach": "ゴキブリ",
  "A small fast-running bird that feeds on insects and fruit.": "昆虫と果実を食べる小さな足の速い鳥。",
  "Roadrunner": "ロードランナー",
  "Snow Fox": "ユキギツネ",
  "A small carnivorous animal found in cold climates. It has white fur and is known for its cleverness.": "寒冷気候に生息する小さな肉食動物。白い毛皮を持ち賢さで知られる",
  "Snow Goose": "ハクガン",
  "A small migratory bird. It has a very long neck and can be found in lakes and other bodies of water.": "小さな渡り鳥。非常に長い首を持ち湖や水域で見つかる",
  "A small white bird that hunts in the coldest reaches of the world.": "世界で最も寒い地域で狩りをする小さな白い鳥。",
  "Snowy Owl": "シロフクロウ",
  "A tiny brown bug that lacks a web but can leap short distances.": "巣は張らないが短距離を跳べる小さな茶色い虫。",
  "Jumping Spider": "ジャンプingスパイダー",
  "Toad": "ヒキガエル",
  "A squat amphibian with leathery skin, found in relatively dry areas.": "革のような皮膚を持つ小柄な両生類。比較的乾燥した地域に生息",
  "A majestic deer-like creature native to cold places.": "寒冷地に生息する雄大な鹿のような生き物",
  "A majestic deer-like creature.": "雄大な鹿のような生き物",
  "Cleaning Bot": "Cleaningボット",
  "For those too lazy to do the vacuum cleaning themselves.": "自分で掃除機をかけるのが面倒な人向け",
  "Creepy Doll": "不気味な人形",
  "Possessed by an evil spirit": "悪霊に取り憑かれている",
  "Muta-Moontant": "ミュータムーンタント",
  "Gift Box": "ギフトボックス",
  "I wonder what's inside. Maybe love? Or viscera?": "中に何が入っているだろう。愛？それとも内臓？",
  "Gift Box (Small)": "ギフトボックス（小）",
  "I wonder what's inside. Maybe love? Or just a little viscera?": "中に何が入っているだろう。愛？それともちょっとだけ内臓？",
  "A heaping mound of refuse, walking under its own power.": "自力で歩く巨大なゴミの山。",
  "Po Golem": "ポーゴーレム",
  "Repair Bot": "修復ボット",
  "A robotic sentry designed for maintaining U.S.C.M. robots and machinery, it's armed for basic self-defense.": "U.S.C.M.のロボットや機械の保守用に設計されたロボット歩哨。基本的な自衛武装あり",
  "Turtle mkI": "タートル mkI",
  "Aggressively defends its creator.": "創造者を攻撃的に守る",
  "Security Bot": "Securityボット",
  "Even though it's very loyal, it's never forgiving when it comes to misplaced id cards.": "非常に忠実だが、IDカードの紛失には決して寛容ではない",
  "Star Spawn of Cthulhu": "スタースポーン・オブ・クトゥルフ",
  "Ancient, and emanating malice.": "古代のもので、悪意を放っている。",
  "Toy Horse": "おもちゃの馬",
  "Filled with toy knights.": "おもちゃの騎士でいっぱい",
  "Toy Knight": "おもちゃの騎士",
  "A tiny knight animated by sorcery.": "魔法で動く小さな騎士",
  "Erchibud": "エルキバッド",
  "It's an erchibud. Their diet consists of things found on moons, and after time they will generate Erchius Crystals.": "エルキバッドだ。月で見つかるものを食べ、時間が経つとエルキウスクリスタルを生成する",
  "Erchibud Baby": "ベビーエルキバッド",
  "A newborn erchibud! It'll eat moondust and other lunar items.": "生まれたてのエルキバッド！月の塵や月の物を食べる",
  "Copperbeak": "コッパービーク",
  "A handy farm animal, since they digest their food into copper pellets. Carnivore.": "食物を銅のペレットに消化する便利な家畜。肉食",
  "Ironbeak": "アイアンビーク",
  "A handy farm animal, since they digest their food into iron pellets. Carnivore.": "食物を鉄のペレットに消化する便利な家畜。肉食",
  "A robotic Orbis, which regularly regurgitates spare parts.": "定期的にスペアパーツを吐き出すロボットのオルビス",
  "Mooshi Calf": "ムーシーの子牛",
  "A newborn mooshi! It'll eat most fruits and vegetables.": "生まれたてのムーシー！ほとんどの果物と野菜を食べる",
