  "The Scourge of Midnight planets...": "ミッドナイト惑星の災い…",
  "Aliep": "アリエプ",
  "It patiently waits for an opportunity to strike, watching its prey with its many eyes.": "多くの目で獲物を見つめ、攻撃の機会を辛抱強く待つ",
