  "A crude explosive for mining. Detonation requires impact.": "採掘用のシンプルな爆発物。起爆には衝撃が必要",
  "Aenema Flower": "Aenema花",
  "The buds on this plant produce caliginous gas and are hot to the touch.": "この植物の蕾は暗黒ガスを発生させ、触ると熱い",
