  "Sssharp sssticksss for ssstabbing.": "刺すための鋭い棒",
  "Statement. Bamboo.": "報告。竹",
  "Fresh Bamboo.": "新鮮な竹だ",
  "Delicious Bamboo.": "美味なる竹じゃ。",
  "Battery Stem": "バッテリーステム",
  "Not surprisingly, these are jammed with energy.": "当然ながら、エネルギーが詰まっている",
  "Beeflower Seed": "Beeflowerの種",
  "The seed of a bright yellow beeflower": "鮮やかな黄色いビーフラワーの種",
  "Beetle Sprout": "ビートルスプラウト",
  "A strange insect-jelly plant. Very tough.": "奇妙な虫ゼリー植物。非常に頑丈",
  "Produces poisonous barbs great for killing stuff.": "殺傷に最適な毒のトゲを生産する",
