  "Mantizi Link Banner": "マンティジLinkバナー",
  "An Mantizi banner embroidered with a golden link.": "金色の鎖が刺繍されたマンティジバナー",
  "A wonderfully rich banner.": "見事に豪華なバナーだ",
  "Such a rich color.": "何と豊かな色合いだ",
  "Floran dissslike this symbol.": "フローランはこのシンボルが嫌い",
  "Inquisitive. Is it symbol of authority?": "探究心。権威の象徴だろうか？",
  "Looks kind of menacing.": "ちょっと不気味だな",
  "There's somethin' about this banner. I don't like it.": "この旗にはなんか嫌な感じがするぜ",
  "Mantizi Imperial Banner": "マンティジImperialバナー",
  "A bright woven banner. I wonder what the jewel in the middle means.": "鮮やかな織りのバナーだ。真ん中の宝石は何を意味するのだろうか",
  "A thick woven banner depicting the imperial crest.": "帝国の紋章を描いた厚い織りバナー",
  "I enjoy the golden accents woven into the fabric.": "織り込まれた金のアクセントが気に入った",
  "Floran usually avoid this sssymbol.": "フローランは普通このシンボルを避ける",
  "Concerned. Is the Empire nearby?": "心配。帝国が近くにいるのか？",
  "A sun? Or some kind of creature?": "太陽じゃろうか？それとも何かの生き物じゃろうか？",
  "This banner looks like it has a beetle woven on it.": "この旗にはカブトムシが織り込まれてるみたいだ",
  "Mantizi Worm Banner": "マンティジWormバナー",
  "A Mantizi banner made of gorgeous silk, depicting a golden worm.": "黄金の蛇虫を描いた豪華なシルク製マンティジバナー",
  "A patterned Mantizi banner. With a worm or a snake in the center.": "模様入りのマンティジのバナー。中央に虫か蛇が描かれている",
  "It makes sense that the worm has different meanings between our cultures.": "虫が文化によって異なる意味を持つのは理解できる",
  "Floran like squigglesss.": "フローランはぐにゃぐにゃ模様が好き",
  "Amused. The Mantizi venerate worms.": "面白い。マンティジは虫を崇拝している",
  "A worm? How curious.": "虫じゃと？なんとも奇妙じゃな。",
  "That a graboid?": "グラボイドか？",
  "Mantizi Small Banner": "マンティジ小型バナー",
  "A standard cloth Mantizi banner.": "標準的なマンティジ布バナー",
  "These banners are made by beginner Mantizi craftsmen.": "これらのバナーはマンティジの見習い職人が作ったものだ",
  "Are these banners the work of novices? I approve.": "この旗は初心者の作じゃろうか？感心するのじゃ。",
  "Seems t'me like this banner was made by a beginner.": "この旗は初心者が作ったように見えるぜ",
  "Mantizi Bed": "マンティジベッド",
  "A solid bed with silky sheets.": "シルクのシーツ付きの頑丈なベッド",
  "The sheets are pleasant to the touch.": "シーツは触り心地が良い",
  "Description. A commoner's bed. Mantizi sheets do not tend to stay clean for very long.": "説明。平民のベッド。マンティジのシーツは長く清潔さを保てない傾向がある",
  "Mantizi Bookcase": "マンティジ本棚",
  "Probably filled with gossip and smut.": "おそらくゴシップとわいせつな話でいっぱい",
  "A nicely decorated book case.": "きれいに装飾された本棚だ",
  "A home for Mantizi books.": "マンティジの本の住処だ",
  "Do not like bug books.": "虫の本は嫌い",
  "Inspection. The Mantizi are famous for their tabloid publications, and infamous for their erotica.": "調査。マンティジはタブロイド誌で有名であり、成人向け出版物では悪名高い",
  "I found a copy of this in the woods when I was young.": "子供の頃、森でこれのコピーを見つけたことがあるんだ",
  "How scandalous.": "なんと破廉恥な。",
  "Mantizi Bowl": "マンティジボウル",
  "A simple wooden bowl.": "シンプルな木製ボウル",
  "Observation. A simple bowl. Likely made from wood.": "観察。シンプルな器。おそらく木製だ",
  "A little bowl, it feels like wood.": "小さなボウルだ。木でできてるみたいだな",
  "A simple, clean bowl.": "シンプルで清潔なボウルだ",
  "Food appears to be eaten from this.": "これで食事をするようだ",
  "What do the Mantizi eat, I wonder?": "マンティジは何を食べるのじゃろうか？",
  "Mantizi Fruit Bowl": "マンティジフルーツボウル",
  "A simple wooden bowl. There are strange fruits in it.": "シンプルな木のボウル。奇妙な果物が入っている",
  "It seems the Mantizi eat fruit.": "マンティジは果物を食べるようだ。",
  "A simple, clean bowl, with... is that a purple banana?": "シンプルで清潔なボウル...あれは紫色のバナナか？",
  "Floran deeply offended.": "フローランは深く傷ついた",
  "Observation. This fruit is not edible.": "観察。この果物は食用ではない",
  "Hey, these are plastic!": "おい、これプラスチックじゃないか！",
  "You'd figure this fruit would be in distilled form by now.": "そろそろこの果実は蒸留されておってもよさそうなものじゃがのう。",
  "Mantizi Bucket": "マンティジバケツ",
  "Smells like ripe fruit.": "熟した果物の匂いがする",
  "A nice wooden bucket.": "素敵な木製バケツだ",
  "Educate. The Mantizi use these buckets to transport fruits from barrels to casks.": "教示。マンティジはこれらのバケツを使って果物を樽から桶に運ぶ",
  "Do the Mantizi obtain water by hand? I can't imagine a world in which water is lacking.": "マンティジは手で水を汲んでおるのじゃろうか？水が不足する世界など、わしには想像できぬのじゃ。",
  "Mantizi Cabinet": "マンティジキャビネット",
  "An attractive cabinet made of wood.": "木で作られた美しいキャビネットじゃ",
  "With hidden compartments for valuables.": "貴重品用の隠し区画付き",
  "A well-made wooden cabinet. Imposing.": "よく作られた木製キャビネット。堂々としている",
  "Observation. A wooden cabinet. Likely belongs to a commoner.": "観察。木製のキャビネット。おそらく平民の所有物だ",
  "An roomy cabinet. Not to be mistaken for an outhouse.": "広々としたキャビネットだ。屋外トイレと間違えないように",
  "Mantizi Chair": "マンティジチェア",
  "A wooden dining room chair.": "木製のダイニングチェアだ",
  "A comfortable wooden seat.": "快適な木製の椅子",
  "Comfy ssseat make poor weapon.": "快適な椅子は武器には向かない",
  "A nice wooden stool with a soft cushion.": "柔らかいクッション付きの素敵な木製スツール",
  "Observe. A common dining room chair. The cushion bears an ornate design.": "観察。一般的なダイニングチェア。クッションには華やかなデザインが施されている",
  "A Mantizi chair. It's comfortable.": "マンティジの椅子だ。座り心地がいい",
  "The Mantizi seem to like simple furniture.": "マンティジは質素な家具を好むようじゃな。",
  "Mantizi Tall Chair": "マンティジ背の高いチェア",
  "A nice wooden stool with a soft cushion and a tall back.": "柔らかいクッションと背もたれ付きの素敵な木製スツール",
  "Mantizi Chest": "マンティジチェスト",
  "A fancy wooden chest.": "装飾的な木製チェスト",
  "A Mantizi chest. It looks strong.": "マンティジのチェスト。頑丈そうだ",
  "Worry. The Mantizi often store strange objects in these. Is there something in here?": "心配。マンティジはよくこの中に奇妙な物を保管する。何か入っているのだろうか？",
  "The kind of chest you'd expect to find in a villa.": "別荘にありそうなチェストだ",
  "Mantizi Couch": "マンティジカウチ",
  "Simple design, with room to lounge.": "シンプルなデザインで、くつろぐ余裕がある",
  "A simple, aesthetically pleasing sofa.": "シンプルで美しいソファ",
  "A couch built from wood and cloth.": "木と布で作られたソファだ",
  "Like Mantizi chair, but big.": "マンティジの椅子みたいだけど大きい",
  "Inspect. Sturdy construction with artistic flourishes in the cloth": "検査。布地に芸術的な装飾を施した頑丈な構造",
  "The couch smells of wine.": "このソファはワインの匂いがするな",
  "Looks comfortable.": "快適そうじゃな。",
  "Mantizi Cup": "マンティジカップ",
  "A little clay cup.": "小さな粘土のカップだ",
  "A goblet made of fired clay.": "焼き粘土でできたゴブレットだ",
  "A round, fired clay cup.": "丸い焼き物の陶器カップ",
  "A clay cup, round and sturdy.": "丸くて頑丈な陶器のカップだ",
  "Floran drink blood from sssuch cupss.": "フローランはこういうカップで血を飲む",
  "Identify. A common fired clay goblet.": "識別。一般的な焼成粘土のゴブレット",
  "A stained clay goblet.": "染みのついた陶器の杯じゃ。",
  "Imperial Curtain": "Imperialカーテン",
  "Draw back to reveal the truth.": "引き戻して真実を明らかにせよ",
  "Floran hide behind sssheet then ssstab!": "フローランはシーツの後ろに隠れて刺す！",
  "Mantizi Door": "マンティジドア",
  "A sturdy, simple wooden door.": "頑丈でシンプルな木製ドア",
  "Educate. The Mantizi reinforce their doors to secure their valuables.": "教示。マンティジは貴重品を守るためにドアを補強する",
  "A heavy, imposing door.": "重厚で威圧感のあるドアだ",
  "A great door for a defensive structure.": "防御施設にふさわしい立派な扉じゃ。",
  "Tough to get past, like the bugs themselves.": "虫そのものと同じくらい突破しにくいぜ",
  "Mantizi Dresser": "マンティジドレッサー",
  "A sturdy wooden dresser.": "頑丈な木製のドレッサーだ",
  "A simple chest of drawers.": "シンプルなチェスト",
  "An attractive dresser made of wood.": "木で作られた美しいドレッサーじゃ",
  "For storing silks and other expensive fabrics.": "絹やその他の高級布地を保管するため",
  "Does it contain weapons?": "武器が入ってる？",
  "Observation. The Mantizi seem to wear clothing purely for aesthetics.": "観察。マンティジは純粋に美観のために衣服を着用するようだ",
  "There doesn't seem to be an underwear drawer.": "下着の引き出しがないみたいだな",
  "Mantizi Hanging Light": "マンティジHangingライト",
  "A nice light.": "素敵なライト",
  "A bronze, electric chandelier.": "青銅の電気シャンデリア",
  "A hanging lantern.": "吊り下げ式のランタンだ",
  "Kindness. I wish to donate a lampshade.": "親切。ランプシェードを寄付したい",
  "Lightly decorated.": "控えめな装飾じゃ。",
  "Mantizi Display Shields": "マンティジディスプレイシールド",
  "A beautiful set of shields.": "美しい盾のセットだ",
  "Sturdy shields for sturdy man.": "頑丈な盾は頑丈な者のため",
  "A rack of shields, ready for war.": "戦争準備の盾のラック",
  "It appears to be Mantizi shields.": "マンティジの盾のようだ",
  "Educate. These shields are built purely for decoration. Real battle shields are far more rugged.": "教示。これらの盾は純粋に装飾用だ。実戦用の盾ははるかに頑丈だ",
  "An attractive set of shields.": "魅力的な盾のセットだ",
  "These shields look as if they've never been used.": "これらの盾は一度も使われたことがないようじゃな。",
  "Mantizi Table": "マンティジテーブル",
  "A solid dining room table.": "頑丈なダイニングルームテーブル",
  "A nice, if basic table. Smooth and elegant wood.": "基本的だが良いテーブル。滑らかで上品な木材だ",
  "A table of high quality.": "高品質なテーブルだ",
  "Table not have woodworm, bad.": "テーブルにキクイムシがいない、残念",
  "Inspect. A very sturdy table, likely built by an expert.": "検査。非常に頑丈なテーブル。おそらく熟練者の作だ",
  "This table is in good condition.": "このテーブルは状態がいいな",
  "This table looks like it could support a lot of weight.": "このテーブルはかなりの重量を支えられそうじゃな。",
  "Mantizi Short Table": "マンティジ短いテーブル",
  "A solid end table.": "頑丈なend テーブル",
  "A nice, if basic table. Rough and elegant wood.": "基本的だが良いテーブル。粗削りだが上品な木材だ",
  "Large Sectioned Vase": "大型Sectioned花瓶",
  "Avians often store trinkets in pots. Perhaps Mantizi do the same.": "エイビアンはよく壺に小物を保管する。マンティジもそうかもしれない。",
  "SSsmash it and tear out its insides!": "叩き壊して中身を引き裂くのだ！",
  "A large decorative glazed vase.": "大きな装飾的な釉薬花瓶",
  "Antiquated Blue Vase": "アンティークブルー花瓶",
  "A decorative vase.": "装飾的なvase",
  "Antiquated White Vase": "アンティークホワイト花瓶",
  "Small Pot Vase": "小型Pot花瓶",
  "Small Wide Vase": "小型Wide花瓶",
  "Mantizi Wall Light": "マンティジウォールライト",
  "A small lantern.": "小さなlantern",
  "A simple bronze lantern.": "シンプルな青銅のランタン",
  "Identify. An electric lantern made of bronze.": "識別。ブロンズ製の電気ランタン",
  "A small lantern that emits bright light.": "明るい光を放つ小さなランタンだ",
  "A bright lantern.": "明るいランタンじゃ",
  "A bronze lantern.": "青銅のランタン",
  "No flame inssside.": "中に炎がない",
  "Mantizi Shield Display": "マンティジシールドディスプレイ",
  "Blood red sshield!": "血のように赤い盾！",
  "Evaluate. A purely decorative shield. A single heavy blow would shatter it completely.": "評価。純粋に装飾用の盾。一撃の強打で完全に粉砕される",
  "Sandwich Painting": "サンドイッチ絵画",
  "The pinnacle of handheld, organically-wrapped, carbohydrate-rich lunchfoods.": "手持ち・有機包装・炭水化物豊富なランチフードの頂点",
  "The Mantizi's love for their food is rather odd.": "マンティジの食への愛着はかなり独特だ",
  "Food designed for the beak-less.": "くちばしのない者向けに作られた食べ物だ",
  "Why bread around meat? Why not jusst meat?": "なぜ肉の周りにパン？肉だけでいいのに？",
  "Observant. It appears to be a sandwich.": "観察。サンドイッチのようだ",
  "Man, I'm hungry.": "ああ、腹減ったな",
  "Such devotion to a pedestrian meal.": "平凡な食事にこれほどの献身とはのう。",
  "Mantizi Ship Locker": "マンティジシップロッカー",
  "It's an industrial looking ship locker.": "工業的な見た目の船のロッカーだ",
  "A secure storage solution you can hang on a wall.": "壁に掛けられる安全な収納ソリューション",
  "Neutral. A metallic ship locker.": "中立。金属製の船舶用ロッカー",
  "Imperial Basin": "インペリアル洗面器",
  "A ceramic basin produced in the Mantizi style.": "マンティジスタイルの陶器の洗面器",
  "I doubt that most Apex could afford to buy something like this just to wash themselves.": "大半のエイペックスがただ身体を洗うためにこれを買う余裕があるとは思えない",
  "By Kluex, this is one sumptuous basin.": "クルエックスよ、何と豪華な洗面台だ",
  "Floran no need to wash in bassssin!": "フローランは洗面台で洗う必要ない！",
  "Disappointed. As beautiful as this basin is, Glitch won't need to wash in it.": "失望。この洗面器がいかに美しくとも、グリッチには洗う必要がない",
  "I'm sure our forefathers produced something like this once ...": "昔の人たちもこういうのを作ってたに違いないな...",
  "This basin is clearly not Hylotl, for it is insufficiently subtle.": "この洗面台は明らかにハイロトル製ではないのじゃ。繊細さが足りぬのじゃ。",
  "Nothin' to see here, just a plain ol' foot-tub.": "ここに見るもんはねえ、ただの足湯桶だ",
  "Imperial Bowl": "インペリアルボウル",
  "A small bowl meant for serving food.": "食事を盛るための小さなボウル",
  "A fancy means of enjoying one's midnight pot noodle feast.": "真夜中のカップ麺をおしゃれに楽しむための道具だ",
  "An alien bowl of elegant design.": "エレガントなデザインのエイリアンのボウルだ",
  "A bowl suitable for Kluex Himself.": "クルエックス御自身にふさわしいボウルだ",
  "Eat food fresh from kill! no butchering!": "獲物から直接新鮮に食べる！解体なし！",
  "Stumped. Only Glitch lords and ladies would think of eating from something like this.": "困惑。こんなもので食事しようと考えるのはグリッチの領主と貴婦人だけだ",
  "Even in simple objects like these there can be absolute harmony.": "このような素朴な品にさえ、完全なる調和が宿り得るのじゃ。",
  "Bows are for suppin' from, not gawpin'.": "ボウルは飲むためのもんであって、じろじろ見るもんじゃねえ",
  "A large ceramic food bowl, ideal for hosting grand parties.": "グランドパーティーに最適な大きなセラミック食器",
  "What a feast for the eyes this bowl would be, it'd be the life of any party.": "このボウルは目の保養だな。どんなパーティーでも主役になれるぞ",
  "For putting thingssss in.": "ものを入れるためなのだ",
  "Big isn't always better, this bowl is without subtlety.": "大きければ良いというものではない。この鉢には繊細さが欠けておるのじゃ",
  "An even larger ceramic bowl decorated in Mantizi fashion.": "マンティジ風に装飾されたさらに大きな陶器のボウル",
  "A multipurpose bowl that is both useful and pleasing to look at.": "実用的で見た目も美しい多目的ボウルだ",
  "Eager. A luxury must-have for any Glitch lord's feast.": "熱望。グリッチの領主の宴には欠かせない贅沢品",
  "This bowl looks far more elaborate than the others I've seen.": "このボウルは他のより遥かに手が込んでるな",
  "Imperial Jar": "インペリアルの瓶",
  "A jar made to suit Mantizi tastes.": "マンティジの好みに合わせて作られた瓶",
  "A mysterious-looking striped jar.": "神秘的な見た目の縞模様の瓶",
  "It's a bit too small to place anything of worth inside, but it's still pretty.": "中に価値のあるものを入れるには小さすぎるが、綺麗ではある。",
  "Curious. These look a bit like jars for storing condiments.": "興味深い。調味料を入れる瓶のように見える。",
  "Just the gift for that celebrity chef wannabe friend that always pesters you about food.": "料理のことでいつもうるさいシェフ気取りの友人への贈り物にぴったりだ。",
  "A jar that would seem cultured and refined. But not to us.": "上品で洗練されているように見える瓶。だが私たちにはそう見えない。",
  "Nothin' to see here, just a plain ol' jar.": "何でもないぜ、ただの古い瓶だ",
  "Imperial Pitcher": "インペリアルピッチャー",
  "It's a pitcher.": "ピッチャーだ",
  "An elegantly modelled ceramic pitcher. Perfect for one with imperial inclinations.": "優雅な造りの陶器の水差し。帝国的趣味の方に最適",
  "Ideal for serving out an oculemonade on a hot day.": "暑い日にオキュレモネードを出すのに最適だ",
  "Pitcher isssss empty.": "ピッチャーが空っぽ",
  "Miserable. There's no pozest in this pitcher!": "惨め。このピッチャーにポゼストが入っていない！",
  "Is this how the 1% or Class A individuals engage in tipples?": "上流階級の人たちはこうやって酒を楽しむのか？",
  "It strikes me that almost all sentient species have used for the same utensils.": "ほぼすべての知的種族が同じ食器を使っておるとは、興味深いことじゃ。",
  "A common sight in any given taproom, I'll wager.": "どこの酒場にもありそうな光景だな",
  "An elegantly modelled ceramic pitcher, small but serviceable.": "優雅な造りの陶器の水差し。小さいが実用的",
  "An overglorified means of having one's creamer at breakfast.": "朝食にクリーマーを使うための大げさな装置だ",
  "Imperial Pot": "Imperialポット",
  "A large ceramic vessel, fit for decorating Mantizi villas.": "マンティジの別荘を飾るのに適した大きなセラミック容器",
  "It's not what you think it is -- it's meant to contain stuff other than just THC.": "お前が思ってるようなもんじゃない──THC以外のものも入れるためのやつだ",
  "An elegantly glazed pot.": "上品な釉薬がかかった鉢だ",
  "This pot's dull opaque glaze does little to whet my appetite.": "この鉢の鈍い不透明な釉薬は食欲をそそらない",
  "Usssse large pot to sssstore sssstuff!": "大きな壺で物を保管する！",
  "Intrigued. We Glitch had no idea of the diversity of glazing techniques in ceramic production.": "興味。我々グリッチは陶磁器生産における釉薬技法の多様性を知らなかった",
  "Vast stripes, immense patterning - not the Hylotl way.": "大胆な縞模様に壮大な紋様。ハイロトルの流儀ではないのじゃ。",
  "Some massive pot that's dolled up appearance.": "おめかしした見た目の巨大な壷だ",
  "Imperial Vase": "Imperial花瓶",
  "A beautiful shade that reminds me of Ocean planets.": "海洋惑星を思い起こさせる美しい色合いじゃ",
  "A ceramic vase, made to suit Mantizi tastes. Luxury!": "マンティジの趣味に合わせた陶器の花瓶。贅沢！",
  "A ceramic vase, made by infusing glass with clay.": "ガラスに粘土を融合させた陶磁器の花瓶だ",
  "Such an ornate vase!": "何と華麗な花瓶だ！",
  "Floran can't ssee own face!": "フローランは自分の顔が見えない！",
  "Neutral. A vase of alien manufacture.": "中立。異星人製の花瓶",
  "An alien vase. But why does it feel and look so familiar?": "エイリアンの花瓶だ。でもなんでこんなに見覚えがあるんだろう？",
  "A vase. What do we do with these, anyway?": "花瓶だ。こういうの、何に使うんだっけ？",
  "Mech Repair Pod": "メック修復ポッド",
  "Periodically releases restorative nanites. ^cyan;Requires 20J^reset; per 3.5s if a mech is nearby.": "定期的に回復ナナイトを放出。近くにメックがいれば^cyan;3.5秒毎に20J必要^reset;",
  "Alien Desert Microformer": "エイリアンDesertマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into an alien desert.": "惑星のエリアをalien desertに変換する",
  "Alien Forest Microformer": "エイリアンフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into an alien forest.": "惑星のエリアをalien forestに変換する",
  "Badlands Microformer": "Badlandsマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into dry badlands.": "惑星のエリアをdry badlandsに変換する",
  "Birch Microformer": "Birchマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a birch forest.": "惑星のエリアをbirch forestに変換する",
  "Black Slime Microformer": "ブラックスライムマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a black slime bog.": "惑星のエリアを黒スライム沼地に変換する",
  "Blister Microformer": "Blisterマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a blister bush field.": "惑星のエリアをブリスターブッシュの野に変換する",
  "Blood Gulch Microformer": "ブラッドガルチマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a blood gulch.": "惑星のエリアをblood gulchに変換する",
  "Bloodstone Microformer": "ブラッドストーンマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a bloodstone field.": "惑星のエリアをブラッドストーンの野に変換する",
  "Cactus Microformer": "Cactusマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a cactus field.": "惑星のエリアをcactus fieldに変換する",
  "Caliche Microformer": "Calicheマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into rich caliche stone.": "惑星のエリアを豊かなカリーチェ石に変換する",
  "Cellular Microformer": "Cellularマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a cellular wonderland.": "惑星のエリアを細胞のワンダーランドに変換する",
  "Cloud Microformer": "クラウドマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a cloud forest.": "惑星のエリアをcloud forestに変換する",
  "Corrupted Microformer": "Corruptedマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into corruption.": "惑星のエリアをcorruptionに変換する",
  "Corrupt Forest Microformer": "Corruptフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into corrupt forest.": "惑星のエリアを汚染された森に変換する",
  "Corrupt Moon Microformer": "コラプトムーンマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into corrupt moon.": "惑星のエリアをcorrupt moonに変換する",
  "Crystal Desert Microformer": "クリスタルDesertマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into crystalline desert.": "惑星のエリアをクリスタルの砂漠に変換する",
  "Crystal Plains Microformer": "クリスタルPlainsマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into crystalline plain.": "惑星のエリアをクリスタルの平原に変換する",
  "Crystal Swamp Microformer": "クリスタルスワンプマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into crystalline swamp.": "惑星のエリアをクリスタルの沼地に変換する",
  "Dead Woods Microformer": "DeadWoodsマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a dead forest.": "惑星のエリアをdead forestに変換する",
  "Oasis Microformer": "Oasisマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a desert oasis.": "惑星のエリアをdesert oasisに変換する",
  "Dry Riverbed Microformer": "ドライリバーベッドマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a dry riverbed.": "惑星のエリアをdry riverbedに変換する",
  "Unknown Microformer": "Unknownマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into...something.": "惑星のエリアを…何かに変換する",
  "Energy Orb Microformer": "エネルギーOrbマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a field of energy orbs.": "惑星のエリアをエネルギーオーブの野に変換する",
  "Hive Microformer": "ハイブマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a hive.": "惑星のエリアをhiveに変換する",
  "Gore Forest Microformer": "Goreフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a bloody forest.": "惑星のエリアをbloody forestに変換する",
  "Haunted Wood Microformer": "Hauntedウッドマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a haunted wood.": "惑星のエリアをhaunted woodに変換する",
  "Haunted Graveyard Microformer": "ホーンテッドグレイヴヤードマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a haunted graveyard.": "惑星のエリアを呪われた墓地に変換する",
  "Hellfire Microformer": "Hellfireマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into hellfire.": "惑星のエリアをhellfireに変換する",
  "Hell-Hive Microformer": "Hell-Hiveマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a hellish hive.": "惑星のエリアをhellish hiveに変換する",
  "Hotsprings Microformer": "ホットスプリングスマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a hotspring.": "惑星のエリアをhotspringに変換する",
  "Ice-Fire Microformer": "Ice-炎マイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into ice-fire.": "惑星のエリアをice-fireに変換する",
  "Irradiated Microformer": "イラジエイテッドマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into irradiated waste.": "惑星のエリアを放射線汚染地帯に変換する",
  "Snowland Microformer": "雪landマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a magical snowland.": "惑星のエリアを魔法の雪原に変換する",
  "Meadow Microformer": "蜂蜜酒owマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a meadow.": "惑星のエリアをmeadowに変換する",
  "Steel Hive Microformer": "スチールハイブマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a steel hive.": "惑星のエリアをsteel hiveに変換する",
  "Steel Jungle Microformer": "スチールジャングルマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a steel jungle.": "惑星のエリアをsteel jungleに変換する",
  "Pine Microformer": "Pineマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a pine forest.": "惑星のエリアをpine forestに変換する",
  "Pitch Microformer": "Pitchマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a tar-covered waste.": "惑星のエリアをタールに覆われた荒地に変換する",
  "Primeval Forest Microformer": "Primevalフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a primeval forest.": "惑星のエリアを原始の森に変換する",
  "Rainbow Forest Microformer": "レインボーフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a rainbow forest.": "惑星のエリアを虹の森に変換する",
  "Red Desert Microformer": "RedDesertマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a red desert.": "惑星のエリアをred desertに変換する",
  "Snow Forest Microformer": "スノーフォレストマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a snow forest.": "惑星のエリアをsnow forestに変換する",
  "Volcanic Sulphur Microformer": "ヴォルカニックSulphurマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a volcanic-sulphuric waste.": "惑星のエリアを火山性硫黄荒地に変換する",
  "Erchius Microformer": "Erchiusマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into an Erchius Crystal field.": "惑星のエリアをエルキウスクリスタルの野に変換する",
  "Taiga Microformer": "Taigaマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a frosty taiga.": "惑星のエリアをfrosty taigaに変換する",
  "Warty Microformer": "Wartyマイクロフォーマー",
  "Transforms an area of a planet into a warty, repulsive field.": "惑星のエリアをイボだらけの嫌悪的な野に変換する",
  "Fireflies": "炎flies",
  "Fireflies.": "蛍",
  "Frozen creature": "凍結 creature",
  "Some sort of long-frozen creature trapped within the ice.": "氷の中に閉じ込められた長く凍った何らかの生物",
  "Geyser (Small)": "間欠泉（小）",
  "Cute. A tiny little geyser.": "かわいい。小さな小さな間欠泉",
  "Strange Monument": "ストレンジモニュメント",
  "What manner of abomination is this carved to represent? More importantly...who carved it?": "これはどんな忌まわしき存在を彫ったのか？更に重要なのは…誰が彫った？",
  "Even looking at this makes me feel nauseous and wrong.": "見るだけで吐き気がして何かが間違っていると感じる",
  "A dark and strangely shaped monolith of indeterminate age.": "暗くて奇妙な形のモノリス。年齢不詳",
  "Who could have built this?": "誰がこれを建てたのだろう？",
  "Insect Mound": "昆虫塚",
  "I should stick my @#$@ing hand in there!": "あそこに手を突っ込むべきだ！",
  "Monolith": "モノリス",
  "Whatever made this structure is likely lost to history.": "この構造物を作ったものは歴史の中に失われたのだろう",
  "Glowing Monolith": "発光するモノリス",
  "How does it glow? I see no power source. Yep, that's creepy.": "なぜ光る？電源が見当たらない。うん、不気味だ",
  "Ancient Statue": "古代の像",
  "A massive statue, likely depicting the reach of the Ruin. Extremely rare and expensive.": "ルインの影響を描いた大きな像。極めて希少で高価",
  "This relic tantalizes you with its potential value. Take it!": "この遺物はその潜在的な価値であなたを誘惑する。手に入れろ！",
  "Ancient Artefact": "古代の遺物",
  "Carcass": "死骸",
  "This was probably something tasty.": "おそらく美味しいものだったのだろう",
  "Dinosaur Carcass": "恐竜の死骸",
  "Hope you're hungry...": "お腹が空いているといいけど…",
  "Shim Bush": "シムブッシュ",
  "Organic Oddity": "有機的な奇妙なもの",
  "What the? This is just too strange.": "何だって？これはあまりにも奇妙だ",
  "Atropus Chest": "アトロプスチェスト",
  "A bit gross, but useful.": "ちょっと気持ち悪いが便利",
  "Kluex Statue": "Kluex像",
  "A large statue of the Avian god Kluex.": "エイビアンの神クルエックスの大きな像",
  "A broken statue of the Avian god Kluex.": "エイビアンの神クルエックスの壊れた像",
  "A battered statue of the Avian god Kluex.": "ボロボロのエイビアンの神Kluexの像",
  "A battered and broken statue of Kluex.": "ボロボロに壊れたKluexの像",
  "A holy statue of Kluex.": "Kluexの聖なる像",
  "Kluex Statue Head": "クルーエクス像の頭部",
  "A gold-rendered head of Kluex.": "金で描かれたKluexの頭部",
  "Large Stone": "大型ストーン",
  "A large slab of stone.": "大きな石板",
  "Desert rock": "砂漠の岩",
  "A striated, eroded desert rock.": "縞模様の侵食された砂漠の岩",
  "Small dune": "小さな砂丘",
  "A tiny little sand dune.": "とても小さな砂丘",
  "Bioluminescent Shroom": "バイオルミネッセントシュルーム",
  "This stuff glows. Nifty.": "これは光るぞ。なかなかいい",
  "Experimental Plant": "実験植物",
  "Proto Plant": "プロト植物",
  "Bloodstone Anemone": "ブラッドストーンアネモネ",
  "That's not very attractive.": "あまり魅力的ではない",
  "Bloodstone flower": "ブラッドストーンフラワー",
  "Heart Bush": "Heart低木",
  "Is that a bush or an organ?": "あれは茂みか臓器か？",
  "A crystalline bush. Shiny.": "結晶の茂み。キラキラ",
  "A beautiful crystal bush.": "美しいクリスタルの茂み",
  "A bush of shiny crystals.": "キラキラしたクリスタルの茂み",
  "Ssshiny bush.": "キラキラの茂みなのだ",
  "Shrewd. This bush could be worth a lot on certain black markets.": "抜け目ない。この茂みは闇市場で高値がつくかもしれない。",
  "This crystal bush reminds me of coral.": "このクリスタルの茂みは珊瑚を思い出させる。",
  "Cyclopean Torch Stand": "サイクロピアントーチスタンド",
  "A bizarre specimen out of some sort of nightmare. What could possibly evolve this way?": "悪夢から出てきたような奇妙な標本。こんな進化をする生物がいるのか？",
  "Enormous Warrior Statue": "巨大ウォーリアー像",
  "A huge statue, most likely some sort of Deity of whoever built it.": "建造者の何らかの神を表す大きな像",
  "Catacombs Tomb": "カタコンベの墓",
  "These have stood the test of time. For a long, long time.": "これらは時の試練に耐えた。長い、長い間",
  "Structurally sound, though the material is unknown to me.": "構造的には健全だが、素材は私には不明",
  "The edges are...amazingly precise. And looking closer...tiny glyphs adorn the surface.": "端は…驚くほど精確だ。そしてよく見ると…小さな紋章が表面を飾っている",
  "Tiny, almost microscopic glyphs tell an ancient story I cannot read.": "微小な紋章が私には読めない古代の物語を語る",
  "I wonder what sort of things lived here?": "どんな生物がここに住んでいたのだろう？",
  "A sturdy and ancient tomb.": "頑丈で古代の墓",
  "My Little Cthulhu": "MyLittleクトゥルフ",
  "Adorable monster from your nightmares.": "悪夢から来たかわいいモンスター",
  "Elder Bed": "エルダーベッド",
  "You could sleep on it. If you're brave enough.": "寝られるかも。勇気があれば",
  "Elder Bookcase": "エルダー本棚",
  "A bookcase for storing flesh-bound hellish tomes.": "肉装丁の地獄の書物を保管するための本棚",
  "Elder Cabinet": "Elderキャビネット",
  "Perfect craftsmanship by some sort of fish-man-thing.": "何らかの魚人が作った完璧な職人技",
  "Ancient Carvings": "古代の彫刻",
  "I can only guess at the potential meaning of these glyphs.": "これらの紋章の意味は推測するしかない",
  "I'm absolutely positive these bear no semblance to any recorded language.": "これは記録されたどの言語にも似ていないと確信している",
  "Never have I seen such craftsmanship.": "このような職人技は見たことがない",
  "I postulate that whoever built this place had an advanced culture.": "ここを建てた者は高度な文化を持っていたと推測する",
  "I wonder what stories these hieroglyphs tell?": "この象形文字はどんな物語を語っているのだろう？",
  "Something seems off when I look at it. As if its shaking too fast to really see...or something.": "見ると何かがおかしい。速すぎて見えないほど震えているような…",
  "Elder Chair": "Elderチェア",
  "A malignant stone chair.": "不吉な石の椅子",
  "Elder Chest": "エルダーチェスト",
  "An ancient chest.": "古いchest",
  "Altar to Cthulhu": "Altartoクトゥルフ",
  "A putrid idol of a horrific deity-like creature.": "恐ろしい神のような生物の腐った偶像",
  "Elder Pedestal": "エルダー台座",
  "A pedestal for putting your fanciness on display.": "お洒落を披露するための台座",
  "Cyclopean Pillar": "サイクロピアン柱",
  "Ruins of some cyclopean structure": "巨大な構造物の遺跡",
  "Cthulhu Statue": "Cthulhu像",
  "Even looking at this feels unclean. Whatever being this represents, it violates the senses.": "見るだけで穢れた気分になる。これが何を表していようと、感覚を侵害する",
  "Elder Table": "エルダーテーブル",
  "A lovely, insanity-causing table.": "素敵で、狂気を引き起こすテーブル",
  "Elder Statue": "Elder像",
  "What hellish evolution could bring about such wretched countenance? What nameless, hate-fueled abyss could expunge such horror?": "どんな地獄の進化がこんな惨めな容貌を生み出したのか？どんな名もなき憎悪に満ちた深淵がこの恐怖を吐き出したのか？",
  "Mysterious Machine": "ミステリアスマシン",
  "The purpose of this machine is unclear. I am most certain, however, that it would result in no good were I to strap myself to it.": "この機械の目的は不明だ。しかし自分をこれに縛り付けても良いことはないだろう。",
  "Horrid Statue": "Horrid像",
  "Some strange creature out of a nightmare.": "悪夢から出てきた奇妙な生物",
  "A large and dominating presence clings to this statue like film.": "大きくて威圧的な存在感がフィルムのようにこの像にまとわりつく",
  "I am reminded of how insignificant my place in the cosmos really is...": "宇宙における自分の存在がいかに取るに足らないか思い知らされる…",
  "Strange Device": "奇妙な装置",
  "This strange machine appears to be...actually, I can't even imagine what is within.": "この奇妙な機械は…実際、中に何があるか想像もつかない",
  "Abhorrent Statue": "Abhorrent像",
  "My very being aches to caress every perfect curve and smooth edge of this wonderful carving.": "この素晴らしい彫刻の完璧な曲線と滑らかな縁を撫でたくてたまらない",
  "Statue of the Old One": "旧き者の像",
  "Devote worship to the things that lurk beyond our reality.\n^red;-20 Happiness^reset;": "我々の現実の向こうに潜むものへの崇拝を捧げる\n^red;-20 幸福度^reset;",
  "Crew Quarters": "クルー居住区",
  "One of the staff members lived in this little room.": "スタッフの一人がこの小さな部屋に住んでいた",
  "Bloodied Transport": "血まみれの輸送車",
  "Someone tried to escape. They almost made it, too.": "誰かが逃げようとした。もう少しで成功だったのに",
  "Ancient human corpse": "古代の人間の死体",
  "It looks like this man died in extreme pain.": "この男は極度の苦痛の中で死んだようだ",
  "Ancient mangled corpse": "古代の損壊した死体",
  "This body looks to have been torn to shreds prior to death": "この体は死ぬ前にズタズタに引き裂かれたようだ",
  "Horrifying Device": "恐ろしいデバイス",
  "I don't even want to contemplate what this did to him.": "これが彼に何をしたかなど考えたくもない",
  "Well isn't that lovely. Blood.": "素敵だこと。血だ",
  "Wonderful. Should I turn back?": "素晴らしい。引き返すべきか？",
  "That's unsettling. Maybe it's ketchup?": "不穏だ。ケチャップかもしれない？",
  "Yea, definitely not ketchup. That's worrisome.": "うん、確実にケチャップではない。心配だ",
  "Looks like some dude just...exploded. Gross.": "誰かが…爆発したようだ。気持ち悪い",
  "I really shouldn't touch this blood. Something is moving inside.": "この血に触れるべきではない。中で何かが動いている",
  "Writing of some sort, etched in blood.": "血で刻まれた何らかの文字",
  "Blood Symbol": "血のシンボル",
  "Some sort of complex symbol drawn in human blood.": "人間の血で描かれた何らかの複雑なシンボル",
  "At this point it's probably safe to assume everyone is dead.": "この時点で全員死んだと考えて間違いないだろう",
  "^orange;Torture Cage^reset;": "^orange;拷問檻^reset;",
  "An ancient cage used for unfathomable purpose.": "計り知れない目的に使われた古い檻",
  "This poor soul suffered long before death. Now he decays in solitude.": "この哀れな魂は死のずっと前から苦しんでいた。今は孤独に朽ちている",
  "An ancient yet perfectly preserved cage.": "古いが完璧に保存された檻",
  "A cage filled with rotting remains.": "腐った遺体で満たされた檻",
  "^orange;Odd formation^reset;": "^orange;奇妙な形成物^reset;",
  "This creature appears to care about nothing at all. Strange.": "この生物は何も気にしていないようだ。奇妙",
  "What the hell is this thing?": "これは一体何だ？",
  "A bloody severed leg from a hapless scientist.": "不運な科学者の血まみれの切断された脚",
  "Very dead scientist": "完全に死んだ科学者",
  "I'm feeling sick to my stomach...": "吐き気がする…",
  "Dead scientist": "死んだ科学者",
  "It seems this poor person was vivisected.": "この不幸な人物は生体解剖された",
  "Elder Artifact": "エルダーアーティファクト",
  "This abhorrent statue grips some sort of glowing artifact in its inhuman claw.": "この忌まわしい像が人間離れした爪で光る遺物を握っている",
  "I don't want to think about what happened to whoever sat here.": "ここに座っていた人に何が起きたかは考えたくない",
  "MacReady's Desk": "MacReady'sデスク",
  "A pile of lab notes and some sort of...strange experiment gone wrong.": "研究ノートの山と…失敗した奇妙な実験の何か",
  "Wagner": "ワーグナー",
  "What the hell happened to this man? Something is sticking out of his pocket...": "この男に一体何が起きた？ポケットから何か飛び出している…",
  "I don't even know what I am looking at. This is ghastly beyond words. Something is his pocket is shining...": "何を見ているのかさえ分からない。言葉にできないほどおぞましい。ポケットで何かが光っている…",
  "^#86a84a;Elder Altar^reset;": "^#86a84a;エルダー祭壇^reset;",
  "An altar dedicated to some unspeakable horror. I wonder what function it serves?": "言語に絶する恐怖に捧げられた祭壇。どんな機能があるのだろう？",
  "Compel entities beyond understanding to gift you with knowledge.": "理解を超えた存在に知識を授けさせる",
  "Seek answers for the present from the past.": "過去から現在の答えを探せ",
  "Secrets can be gleaned from lost knowledge.": "失われた知識から秘密を見出せる",
  "Knowledge thought lost, ancient beyond reckoning.": "失われたと思われていた知識。計り知れないほど古い",
  "Elder Door": "エルダードア",
  "Unknown element. Fascinating.": "未知の元素。魅力的だ",
  "A malignant and unsettling door.": "不吉で不安にさせるドア",
  "Some sort of horrible light.": "何かの恐ろしい光",
  "This makes me uncomfortable.": "不安にさせる。",
  "Ssshiny light! Floran not ssscared, honessst...": "キラキラの光なのだ！フローランは怖くない、ほんとだ…",
  "Wary. This light makes my circuits shake.": "警戒。このライトは回路を震わせる。",
  "This light gives me the creeps!": "このライトは不気味だ！",
  "A wall light. It is functional... but very unpleasant.": "壁掛けライト。機能的だが…非常に不快だ",
  "This light ain't right.": "この照明はおかしいぜ",
  "A floating orb. It's extremely unsettling to look at.": "浮遊する球体。見ると非常に不安になる",
  "Elder Rune Orb": "Elder走りe Orb",
  "Ancient Pedestal": "エンシェント台座",
  "Ancient and strange, its stone almost seems to sweat.": "古くて奇妙で、石がほぼ汗をかいているように見える",
  "This ancient piece of sculpture makes you uneasy.": "この古代の彫刻は不安にさせる",
  "A spiky, creepy-assed table.": "トゲトゲで不気味なテーブル",
  "A great place to sit down and uncover the blasphemous truths of the cosmos.": "座って宇宙の冒涜的な真実を解き明かすのに最適な場所",
  "A good place to sit and translate unknown languages.": "座って未知の言語を翻訳するのに最適な場所",
  "Translate texts, or use the Velbex to Snarsh Garflipps.": "テキストを翻訳、またはヴェルベクスでスナーシュ・ガルフリップスを使用",
  "Whatever this says, it's probably not a greeting.": "何と書いてあろうと、挨拶ではなさそうだ",
  "An ornate and ancient switch.": "装飾的で古代のスイッチ",
