  "An urn. Adorably smashable.": "壺。愛らしく壊しやすい",
  "Autopsy Table": "Autopsyテーブル",
  "Primarily for investigating (or experimenting on) the deceased. Has other lab applications.": "主に故人の調査（または実験）用。他の研究用途もある",
  "Mysterious Lectern": "ミステリアスな書見台",
  "A horrifying book rests upon the altar.": "恐ろしい本が祭壇の上に置かれている",
