  "^green;Brine Star": "^green;ブラインスター",
  "The ancient map gives me directions to a deep underground jungle on a far-off, remote planet. What will I find there?": "古代の地図が、遠く離れた惑星の地下深くにあるジャングルへの道を示している。そこで何が見つかるだろうか？",
  "That was truly harrowing! Did I manage to find all the secret rooms?": "本当に恐ろしかった！隠し部屋は全部見つけられたかな？",
  "Strange Technology": "不思議な技術",
  "I have no idea what this strange alien technology is, but it looks valuable and unique.": "この奇妙なエイリアン技術が何なのかわからないが、貴重でユニークなものに見える。",
  "^green;The Ancient Temple": "^green;古代の神殿",
  "The map shows me the coordinates to an ancient Avian temple in the desert wilderness.": "地図は砂漠の荒野にある古代のエイビアン神殿の座標を示している。",
  "Phew, that was quite a jaunt through the temple. Did I manage to find all the secret treasure?": "ふぅ、神殿をかなり歩き回った。秘密の宝を全部見つけられたかな？",
  "^green;The Hydro Center": "^green;ハイドロセンター",
  "The map shows me coordinates to an underwater hydro distribution center on a far-off obscure planet. It apparently holds a great treasure.": "地図は遠く離れた惑星にある水中のハイドロ配水センターの座標を示している。そこには大きな宝があるらしい。",
  "I think there was more than meets the eye to this facility. Did I explore it sufficiently, sawblades notwithstanding?": "この施設には見た目以上のものがあったと思う。丸ノコはさておき、十分に探索できただろうか？",
  "^green;Evernight Jungle": "^green;常夜のジャングル",
  "I've discovered the location of ancient ruins deep in a far-off planet's jungle. This could make for interesting exploration.": "遠く離れた惑星のジャングル深くにある古代遺跡の場所を発見した。興味深い探索になるかもしれない。",
  "What were cultists doing in here? They were up to something with the locals, but I don't know what. Well, it doesn't matter now. Their loot is mine!": "カルト信者たちがここで何をしていたんだ？地元の生き物たちと何かをしていたが、何かはわからない。まあ、もう関係ない。彼らの戦利品は俺のものだ！",
  "^green;Forest of Fae": "^green;妖精の森",
  "The cultists' map shows a certain beautiful forest planet which they're trying to corrupt. There's also a whole load of loot stored there, too. I could try and crash their party...": "カルト信者たちの地図は、彼らが汚染しようとしている美しい森林惑星を示している。そこには大量の戦利品も保管されている。彼らのパーティーに殴り込みをかけてみようか…",
  "With the cultists gone, hopefully the forest will recover in time. Either way, my job here is done.": "カルト信者たちがいなくなれば、森はいずれ回復するだろう。いずれにせよ、ここでの仕事は終わりだ。",
  "^green;The Grand Arena": "^green;グランドアリーナ",
  "The map shows me the way to a grand jungle arena where Floran hunters go test their strength. There's a prize advertised for those who manage to survive...": "地図がフローランの狩人が腕試しをするジャングルの大闘技場への道を示している。賞品も出るらしい",
  "Now that was one hell of a brawl! Time to claim my hard-earned loot!": "激しい戦いだった！もっと強くなって戻ってこよう",
  "^green;Infiltration": "^green;潜入",
  "The map shows the way to a remote Miniknog stronghold on a distant planet. Seems like the rebels need help.": "地図が遠い惑星にあるミニクノグの拠点への道を示している。反乱軍が助けを必要としているようだ",
  "The deed is done. Let's get out of here.": "ミニクノグの拠点に侵入し、任務を完了した",
  "^green;Mount Gigant": "^green;巨人の山",
  "An ancient Hylotl mountain is said to be cursed. Dare you investigate?": "古代のハイロトルの山は呪われていると言われている。調査する勇気はあるか？",
  "I've traversed the entirety of this mountain. Whatever was going on here, seems like the ancients were ultimately responsible for it.": "呪いの真相を探ることができた。なかなかの冒険だった",
  "^green;The Letheia Facility": "^green;レテイア施設",
  "Discovered in the Letheia Fleet is a map to a secluded Letheia Corporation facility. There's enough evidence here to warrant an investigation.": "レテイア艦隊で発見された地図がレテイア社の秘密施設の場所を示している。調査すべき十分な証拠がある",
  "Perhaps with the facility shut down, the Letheia Corporation will stop its deeds... haha, who are you kidding?": "レテイア社の施設を探索し、その秘密を暴いた",
  "^green;Letheia Fleet Complete!": "^green;レテイア艦隊完了！",
  "I did it! I took on the entire fleet and survived!": "やった！艦隊全体に挑んで生き残った！",
  "It seems like a miracle that I survived this onslaught. Perhaps the battleship has leads on Letheia Corp's dastardly deeds.": "驚くべき戦いだった。戦利品を楽しもう",
  "^green;Letheia Labs": "^green;レテイアラボ",
  "The map is broadcasting a distress signal, along with coordinates to a remote lunar facility. Perhaps I should investigate.": "地図が救難信号と共に遠く離れた月面施設の座標を発信している。調査すべきかもしれない",
  "Having survived this horrific place, I must follow S.A.I.L.'s instructions and destroy it. There's no time to waste!": "研究施設の謎を解明した。衝撃的な発見だった",
  "^green;Away In A Longship^reset;": "^green;ロングシップにて^reset;",
  "Alpaca raiders are threatening an ancient Glitch monastery. The defenders look like they could use a little help.": "アルパカの略奪者が古代グリッチの修道院を脅かしている。防衛側は少し助けが必要そうだ",
  "These ruins sure are expansive, and the alpaca well-hidden! Hopefully all this was worth it!": "修道院を守ることができた。感謝されるだろう",
  "^green;Castle Takeshi": "^green;竹城",
  "Ninjas in the employ of Shogun Takeshi have kidnapped the Hylotl princess Koto. Are you a bad enough dude to rescue the princess?": "将軍タケシ配下の忍者がハイロトルの姫コトを誘拐した。姫を救出できるか？",
  "A thousand thanks! I will ensure that my father rewards you appropriately for your heroic efforts!": "姫を救出した！素晴らしい冒険だった",
  "^green;Highway Havoc": "^green;ハイウェイ大騒動",
  "The penguins' map shows their next assault target: a city on a distant planet known as Techno City. I should put a wrench in their invasion plans!": "ペンギンたちの地図が次の攻撃目標を示している: テクノシティとして知られる遠い惑星の都市",
  "Wow, that was quite the horde of penguins! Something about this city gives me nostalgia, though...": "テクノシティを守り切った！",
  "^green;The Sky Boulevard": "^green;スカイ・ブールバード",
  "The map gives me directions to one of the greatest Avian sacred sites, the Sky Boulevard. I ought to be extremely well-prepared before attempting any tomb raiding.": "地図がエイビアン最大の聖地の一つ、スカイ・ブールバードへの道を示している。探索してみよう",
  "The view from up here is grandiose and inspiring! Did I manage to discover all the secrets this place holds?": "スカイ・ブールバードの秘密を発見した",
  "^green;Snow Crash": "^green;スノークラッシュ",
  "The map has directions showing the coordinates to a far-off snowy world where an Apex rebel outpost lies. It seems they have a hostage situation on their hands...you could help, if you're interested.": "地図が遠い雪の世界にあるエイペックス反乱軍の前哨基地への座標を示している",
  "Thank you for rescuing me! There's a teleporter in the basement, we can use that to escape! Before that, though, take this! You've earned it.": "極寒の中での冒険を生き延びた",
  "^green;Sunset Riders": "^green;サンセットライダーズ",
  "Along with the map is a bounty for a certain Hank 'Hawkeye' Hatfield, worth 2000 pixels. I might follow these coordinates to the fort mentioned and check in first.": "地図と共にハンク「ホークアイ」ハットフィールドへの2000ピクセルの賞金首が添えられている。追ってみようか",
  "Now that was a fight! The bounty should be wired to my ship any time now.": "賞金首を捕らえた（あるいは倒した）。見事な仕事だ",
  "^green;The Tower Invincible": "^green;不落の塔",
  "A dread Glitch warlord has been terrorising nearby planets from his tower on a far-off planet. I should do something about this.": "地図が恐ろしい塔への座標を示している。その防御を突破できるか？",
  "Ha ha! A true test and proof of my stremf! Now time to help myself to all this sweet, sweet loot!": "不落の塔を攻略した！",
  "^green;The Verdant Ruins": "^green;緑豊かな遺跡",
  "The map shows me how to get to some ancient, overgrown ruins. It supposedly holds a wealth of Floran artifacts.": "遠い惑星にある古い遺跡への座標が示されている。何が見つかるだろう",
  "Well, looks like the ruins weren't as abandoned as I thought they would be. Did I manage to discover all of its secrets?": "緑豊かな遺跡を探索し、宝を見つけた",
  "[FU] Asra Nox Sail Fix": "[FU] アスラ・ノックス SAIL修復",
  "Door.": "ドア。",
  "Door?": "ドア？",
  "^green;Challenge Labs Complete!": "^green;チャレンジラボ完了！",
  "I should poke the crystal again to get my reward.": "もう一度クリスタルに触れて報酬をもらおう",
  "This was all just so weird.": "全部がとにかく奇妙だった。",
  "Gunnery Chief": "砲術長",
  "Troubled: I am in need of aid. I must admit I am a terrible engineer and cannot craft an ^green;arm cannon^reset; at the ^orange;armory^reset;. Might you assist? I am wealthy and can pay you!": "困惑: 助けが必要なのだ。正直に言うと、私はひどいエンジニアで^orange;武器庫^reset;で^green;アームキャノン^reset;を作れない。手を貸してくれないか？裕福だから報酬は払えるぞ！",
  "Delighted: Thank you for you aid. As promised: the cash ! Take this off my hands too, if you don't mind.": "喜び: 助けてくれてありがとう。約束通り報酬だ！これも持って行ってくれ。",
  "The Pew Pew": "ピュンピュン",
  "I keep getting devoured on this planet! It sucks! Could you build me an ^orange;F4 Energy Rifle^reset; to help me survive? I'd compensate you well enough...": "この惑星でずっと食われそうになってる！最悪だ！生き延びるために^orange;F4エネルギーライフル^reset;を作ってくれない？十分な報酬は出すよ…",
  "I'm not much of a scientist... so umm take this.": "科学者じゃないから…えっと、これを受け取って",
  "I need a sidearm": "サイドアームが必要",
  "Kevin dressed a doll as my mother, naked, in my living room when I was passed out. I need a ^orange;Laser Pistol^reset; to blast his head right off of his torso. Can you make one?": "ケヴィンが俺が寝ている間に母親に似せた人形を裸でリビングに飾りやがった。あいつの頭を胴体からぶっ飛ばすために^orange;レーザーピストル^reset;が必要だ。作ってくれるか？",
  "Fantastic. Now I just need to somehow get the sack to do it. Ugh. That guy. Screw that guy.": "素晴らしい。あとは実際にやる度胸が必要なだけだ。くそ、あいつめ。",
  "Sharpening the Blade": "刃を研ぐ",
  "I'll be blunt. My sword sucks. Make me a new one. Go craft a ^orange;Steel Warblade^reset; in your ^orange;Assembly Line^reset;! You'll need to upgrade your ^orange;Armorworks^reset; first.": "単刀直入に言う。俺の剣はダメだ。新しいのを作ってくれ。^orange;組立ライン^reset;で^orange;スチールウォーブレード^reset;を作れ！まず^orange;アーマーワークス^reset;をアップグレードする必要があるぞ。",
  "Excellent, enjoy cutting stuff up. Here, take this off my hands.": "素晴らしい、存分に切り刻んでくれ。ほら、これも持って行ってくれ。",
  "A Heavy Weapon": "重い武器",
  "I'll be frank: My favorite murder tool broke and I need a replacement. If you can bring me a ^orange;Ferozium Cleaver^reset; I'd compensate you for the effort.": "率直に言おう: お気に入りの殺戮道具が壊れたので代わりが必要だ。^orange;フェロジウムクリーバー^reset;を持ってきてくれたら、十分に報いよう。",
  "Excellent. And as promised, a reward: ^green;A rare artifact^reset;! It never did work for me...": "素晴らしい。約束通り報酬だ: ^green;貴重なアーティファクト^reset;！俺には使えなかったが…",
  "Armor Up": "装備を整えよ",
  "I'm sure you don't need to be told what your ^orange;Armorworks^reset; does!\tThe armor and weapons you can create here are varied. Let's test it out by building a ^orange;Plebeian Cap^reset;.": "^orange;アーマーワークス^reset;で何ができるかは、もうご存知でしょう！\tここで作れる武器や防具は多種多様です。まずは^orange;プレビアンキャップ^reset;を作ってみましょう。",
  "As you unlock more blueprints, you will find your potential for death, destruction and protection will increase exponentially.": "設計図が増えるにつれ、殺傷力・破壊力・防御力が飛躍的に向上するでしょう。",
  "Aberrant Sentry [BOSS]": "異常な歩哨 [ボス]",
  "Find and kill an ^orange;Aberrant Sentry^reset; in an ancient ruin.": "古代遺跡で^orange;異常な歩哨^reset;を見つけて倒せ",
  "Exceptional work. That was no simple feat!": "見事な仕事だ。簡単な偉業ではなかったぞ！",
  "Gorgolith [BOSS]": "ゴルゴリス [ボス]",
  "Rare, and horrifically deadly, the ^orange;Gorgolith^reset; prowl ^orange;Protoworlds^reset; looking for delicious prey. Find one and kill it.": "希少で恐ろしく致命的な^orange;ゴルゴリス^reset;は、美味しい獲物を探して^orange;プロトワールド^reset;を徘徊している。一体見つけて倒せ。",
  "Few can say they have hunted and killed one of these. I salute your skill.": "こいつを狩って倒したと言える者は少ない。あなたの腕前に敬意を表す。",
  "The War-Born [BOSS]": "戦生まれ [ボス]",
  "Not long ago, the abominable Miniknog perfected a warrior variant of their genome. It must be stamped out! Kill one of the ^orange;Apex War-Born^reset; and you'll be rewarded.": "少し前、忌まわしきミニクノグがゲノムの戦士型変異体を完成させた。根絶せねばならない！^orange;エイペックス・ウォーボーン^reset;を一体倒せば報酬を出そう。",
  "One down...thousands to go. But it's a start. If you see any more...end their suffering.": "一体倒した…あと数千体。だが始まりだ。もし他に見かけたら…苦しみを終わらせてやってくれ。",
  "Mama Poptop [BOSS]": "ママポップトップ [ボス]",
  "I've heard that there is a rather large and aggressive beast lurking in the ^green;lush mines^reset;. Perhaps you could take it out for the safety of all?": "^green;緑豊かな鉱山^reset;にかなり大きくて攻撃的な獣が潜んでいるらしい。皆の安全のために退治してくれないか？",
  "Well done. And a grisly trophy of your victory, too! Have a bit of spending cash for the effort.": "よくやった。勝利のおぞましい記念品もあるな！手間賃としてちょっとした小遣いをどうぞ。",
  "Megarachnid [BOSS]": "メガラクニッド [ボス]",
  "If you thought large spiders were a threat, try taking out a ^orange;Megarachnid^reset;...they're the largest spiders in the galaxy. I dare you, in fact! Kill a ^orange;Megarachnid^reset; and you'll get my respect.": "大きな蜘蛛が脅威だと思ったなら、^orange;メガラクニッド^reset;を倒してみろ…銀河最大の蜘蛛だ。挑戦してみないか！^orange;メガラクニッド^reset;を倒せば敬意を払おう。",
  "Wrexor Nar [BOSS]": "レクサー・ナー [ボス]",
  "A nasty pirate named ^orange;Wrexor Nar^reset; has been harassing outer-rim systems of late and destabilizing new colonies. Can you please kill him to save countless lives?": "^orange;レクサー・ナー^reset;という凶悪な海賊が最近外縁系を荒らし回り、新しいコロニーを不安定にしている。無数の命を救うために奴を倒してくれないか？",
  "I can rest easier now, knowing that colony ships carrying human survivors will no longer be attacked by that madman!": "これで安心できる。人類の生存者を乗せた植民船が、あの狂人に攻撃されることはもうないのだから！",
  "Warbot [BOSS]": "ウォーボット [ボス]",
  "On ^orange;Cyber Spheres^reset; or ^orange;Wasteland^reset; planets there often walk dangerous battle machines known as ^orange;War Bots^reset;. Take one down, and I'll pay you well.": "^orange;サイバースフィア^reset;や^orange;荒野^reset;の惑星には、^orange;ウォーボット^reset;と呼ばれる危険な戦闘マシンがよく歩き回っている。一体倒せば、十分な報酬を払おう。",
  "Good job. The fact that you survived that firepower says much of your prowess in battle. I would not want to mess with you.": "よくやった。あの火力を生き延びたということは、あなたの戦闘能力の高さを物語っている。敵に回したくないものだ。",
  "Crew Beds": "クルーベッド",
  "If you want to ^orange;Hire Crewmates^reset; then you first need to build a ^green;Crappy Crew Bed^reset;. Build one at a ^orange;Ship Component Assembler^reset; and place it on your ship!": "^orange;乗組員を雇う^reset;にはまず^green;おんぼろクルーベッド^reset;を作る必要がある。^orange;船用コンポーネント組立機^reset;で一つ作って船に設置しよう！",
  "For each additional crewmate you'll need a new bed. Some beds can house more than one, such as Bunk Beds.": "乗組員を追加するごとに新しいベッドが必要だ。二段ベッドなど複数人を収容できるベッドもある。",
  "^green;Crew Deeds^reset; allow you to ^orange;Hire Crewmates^reset; if you place them in an enclosed room that contains at least 1 ^orange;Door^reset;, 1 ^orange;Light^reset; and 1 ^orange;Bed^reset;. Build one at a ^orange;Ship Component Assembler^reset; and place it on your ship!": "^green;クルー権利書^reset;を^orange;ドア^reset;1つ、^orange;照明^reset;1つ、^orange;ベッド^reset;1つを含む密閉された部屋に設置すると^orange;乗組員を雇う^reset;ことができる。^orange;船用コンポーネント組立機^reset;で一つ作って船に設置しよう！",
  "For each additional crewmate you'll need a new crew deed. Interacting with the ^green;Crew Deed^reset; when it has issues will show what they are.": "乗組員を追加するごとに新しい権利書が必要だ。^green;クルー権利書^reset;に問題がある場合、操作すると問題を表示してくれる。",
  "Interstellar Travel": "星間航行",
  "Welcome back, dear. Let's get your ship fixed, shall we? To get to other stars you'll need to repair your ^cyan;FTL drive^reset;. First thing's first, though. Build an ^orange;STL drive^reset; so you can explore the system you're in.": "おかえりなさい。宇宙船を修理しましょうね。他の星に行くには^cyan;FTLドライブ^reset;を修理する必要があります。でもまず最初に、今いる星系を探索できるように^orange;STLドライブ^reset;を作りましょう。",
  "All you need to do is place that ^cyan;FTL Drive^reset; in your ship and you'll be able to travel between stars. Good work, agent!": "^cyan;FTLドライブ^reset;を宇宙船に設置するだけで星間航行ができるようになります。よくやりましたね、エージェント！",
  "Ship Component Assembly": "船用コンポーネント組立",
  "To start on ship repairs I should build a ^orange;Ship Component Assembler^reset;.": "宇宙船の修理を始めるには^orange;船用コンポーネント組立機^reset;を作るべきだ。",
  "I should find a way to get some erchius crystals to build an ^orange;FTL drive^reset;.": "^orange;FTLドライブ^reset;を作るためにエルキウスクリスタルを入手する方法を見つけなければ。",
  "Gene Designing": "遺伝子デザイン",
  "^orange;Greenhouses^reset; are all the rage these days. I want one, but my budget can't swing it. Do you have one lying around I might use?": "^orange;温室^reset;が最近大人気なんだ。一つ欲しいけど予算が足りなくてね。余ってるのがあったら使わせてもらえない？",
  "Thanks so much. You are a life saver! Now I can tinker with plant life! Maybe I can figure out how to upgrade it, too!": "本当にありがとう。命の恩人だ！これで植物をいじれるぞ！アップグレードの仕方も考えてみよう！",
  "We gots 6000 dollars!": "6000ピクセルあるぜ！",
  "I'm offering 6000 pixels for a bit of aid, if you can spare a few moments? I need 5 ^orange;Quietus Bars^reset; in order to finish my work. Can you bring some to me?": "少し時間をくれるなら6000ピクセル出そう。仕事を完成させるのに^orange;クワイタスのインゴット^reset;が5つ必要なんだ。持ってきてくれるか？",
  "Well done, ol' chap. As promised: The cash. Enjoy.": "よくやった。約束通り報酬だ。楽しんでくれ",
  "Fuel Your Power": "パワーの燃料",
  "You don't need batteries, but they will be extremely useful. Create a ^orange;Basic Battery^reset; in your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset; to try one out.": "バッテリーは必須ではないが、非常に便利だ。^orange;エレクトロニクスセンター^reset;で^orange;基本バッテリー^reset;を作って試してみよう。",
  "Once you place it, use your ^orange;Wiring Tool^reset; to link to a ^green;generator^reset; to a ^blue;blue node^reset; on your battery.": "設置したら、^orange;配線ツール^reset;で^green;発電機^reset;からバッテリーの^blue;青いノード^reset;に接続しよう。",
  "Using the Clothing Fabricator": "服飾製作機の使い方",
  "Congratulations on your new ^orange;Clothing Fabricator^reset;! You can utilize it to create various ^green;clothes and armors^reset; that use little or no metal components. Start by making a ^orange;Bone Mask^reset;.": "新しい^orange;服飾製作機^reset;おめでとう！これで金属をほとんどまたは全く使わない^green;衣類や防具^reset;を作れるぞ。まず^orange;ボーンマスク^reset;を作ってみよう。",
  "You can also produce fabrics in this station, from cotton to silk and beyond. It really is a robust creation. The ^green;armors it makes^reset; aren't too shabby either!": "このステーションでは綿からシルクまで様々な布地も作れる。本当に万能な装置だ。作れる^green;防具^reset;もなかなかのものだぞ！",
  "New Directions": "新たな方向",
  "^red;(Deprecated)^reset; A ^orange;Lab Directory^reset; does only one thing: ^green;Telling you what makes what^reset; in your production stations. Try making one now in your ^orange;Machining Table^reset;.": "^red;（廃止）^reset;^orange;ラボディレクトリ^reset;は一つのことだけをする: 生産ステーションで^green;何が何を作れるか教えてくれる^reset;のだ。^orange;マシニングテーブル^reset;で一つ作ってみよう。",
  "Now take that to your base and place it next to an extractor, centrifuge or other production station. Access it, and you'll soon see just how amazing a device it truly is.": "それを基地に持って行き、抽出機やラボなどの生産ステーションの隣に設置しよう。使えば、この装置がいかに素晴らしいかすぐにわかるはずだ。",
  "He who smelt it...": "溶かした者が…",
  "To process advanced ores, you'll need a ^orange;Fission Furnace^reset;. It can melt down even the strongest metals. But you've got some work to do to get one! Why not start by making some ^orange;Protocite Bars^reset; in a lesser furnace.": "高度な鉱石を加工するには^orange;核分裂炉^reset;が必要だ。最も頑丈な金属でも溶かせる。だが手に入れるには少し手間がかかるぞ！まずは下位の炉で^orange;プロトサイトのインゴット^reset;を作ってみてはどうだ。",
  "You won't get far without one of these doing its work on the higher-strength metals you are bound to find. Always have it ready to go. It will never let you down!": "高強度の金属を加工するにはこれが欠かせない。いつでも使えるようにしておけ。決して裏切らないぞ！",
  "The stuff of life": "生命の素材",
  "If you toss some ^green;meat^reset; into your extractor, you'll be rewarded with some ^orange;Genetic Material^reset;. This item is ^green;absolutely essential^reset; to your success in creating plant life in the lab.": "^green;肉^reset;を抽出機に入れれば^orange;遺伝素材^reset;が手に入る。このアイテムは研究室で植物を作るのに^green;絶対に必要^reset;だ。",
  "And let's not forget plants...let's continue, shall we?": "植物のことも忘れてはいけない…続けようか？",
  "Growing Up": "成長",
  "Let's build a ^orange;Hydroponics Tray^reset; next. You can build it in the ^orange;Power Station^reset; and use it to ^green;quickly grow plants^reset;.": "次は^orange;水耕栽培トレイ^reset;を作ろう。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で作れて、^green;素早く植物を育てる^reset;のに使える。",
  "Set up the lab next. Then, put some ^orange;Water^reset;, a ^green;seed^reset; and a ^green;fertilizer^reset; in the ^orange;Hydroponics Tray^reset; and wait a while for ^green;useful produce^reset;.": "次にラボをセットアップしよう。そして^orange;水^reset;、^green;種^reset;、^green;肥料^reset;を^orange;水耕栽培トレイ^reset;に入れてしばらく待てば^green;便利な農作物^reset;が手に入る。",
  "Methanol - Nature's Booze": "メタノール - 天然の酒",
  "^orange;Methanol^reset; will be useful in the production of a number of goods and eventually get you on track to a masterful laboratory. ^green;You'll find it via wood extraction^reset;.": "^orange;メタノール^reset;は多くの製品の生産に役立ち、いずれ優れた研究室への道を開くだろう。^green;木材の抽出から入手^reset;できる。",
  "Great work. I think it's time to move on.": "よくやった。次に進もう",
  "The Amazing Tinker": "すごい修理屋",
  "The ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; is an extremely useful device. It can be used to fashion ^green;upgrades, augments, techs^reset; and more. Try making a ^orange;Mining Laser^reset; in yours.": "^orange;ティンカリングテーブル^reset;は非常に便利な装置だ。^green;アップグレード、オーグメント、テック^reset;などを作れる。まず^orange;マイニングレーザー^reset;を作ってみよう。",
  "Both the ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; and the ^orange;Mining Laser^reset; can be upgraded. You won't want to be without both. The mining laser will really start to shine after a few additions!": "^orange;ティンカリングテーブル^reset;も^orange;マイニングレーザー^reset;もアップグレードできる。両方なしではやっていけないぞ。マイニングレーザーは改良を重ねると本領を発揮する！",
  "Wind Power": "風力発電",
  "You can generate power in many ways. ^orange;Alternator^reset; generators are just the simplest. Try building a ^orange;Wind Turbine^reset;, and see how useful they get in a windstorm!": "発電する方法はたくさんある。^orange;オルタネーター^reset;発電機は最もシンプルなものだ。^orange;風力タービン^reset;を作って、嵐の日にどれだけ役立つか見てみよう！",
  "Other options for power include Solar, Combustion, Fission and Quantum power generation. Each has pros and cons. You'll definitely want to try them all.": "他にも太陽光、燃焼、核分裂、量子発電がある。それぞれに長所と短所がある。全部試してみるといいぞ。",
  "Expanding Knowledge": "知識の拡大",
  "You've taken your first steps in ^cyan;Frackin' Universe^reset;. With the ^orange;Machining Table^reset; you can now branch out into a wide assortment of ^green;Lab Stations and Equipment^reset; as well as ^green;crafting resources^reset;. Let's start by making an ^orange;Electromagnet^reset;.": "^cyan;Frackin' Universe^reset;で最初の一歩を踏み出した。^orange;マシニングテーブル^reset;で^green;ラボステーションや装備^reset;、^green;クラフト素材^reset;の幅広い品揃えに手を伸ばせるぞ。まずは^orange;電磁石^reset;を作ってみよう。",
  "Try building a few more basic goods such as the extremely useful ^orange;Extraction Lab^reset;. The ^orange;Machining Table^reset; and its ^green;upgrades^reset; are necessary for every FU crafting station. Use it well.": "^orange;抽出ラボ^reset;など基本的な装置をいくつか作ってみよう。^orange;マシニングテーブル^reset;とその^green;アップグレード^reset;はFUのあらゆるクラフトステーションに必要だ。うまく使ってくれ。",
  "Like a Mason": "石工のように",
  "Extracting from 50 ^orange;cobblestone^reset; will create ^orange;Raw Minerals^reset;. This resource will help create ^orange;Mineral Samples^reset;, essential in many experiments.": "50個の^orange;丸石^reset;から抽出すると^orange;生鉱物^reset;が作れる。これは多くの実験に不可欠な^orange;鉱物サンプル^reset;を作るのに役立つ。",
  "Now it's time to mess with life a bit.": "さて、生命をいじってみよう",
  "Gene Sequencer": "遺伝子シーケンサー",
  "The ^orange;Gene Sequencer^reset; is useful to produce genes you already discovered ^green;without needing to melt down seeds^reset; in the ^orange;Xeno Lab^reset;.": "^orange;遺伝子シーケンサー^reset;は、^orange;ゼノラボ^reset;で^green;種を溶かす必要なしに^reset;すでに発見した遺伝子を生産するのに便利だ。",
  "The ^orange;Gene Sequencer^reset; can produce genes that you've already discovered, offering a consistent alternative to acquiring them ^green;from extraction^reset; via the ^orange;Xeno Lab^reset;.": "^orange;遺伝子シーケンサー^reset;は既に発見済みの遺伝子を生産でき、^orange;ゼノラボ^reset;の^green;抽出^reset;に代わる安定した入手手段になる。",
  "Silicon Valley": "シリコンバレー",
  "^orange;Sand^reset; might get everywhere but it is a valuable source of ^orange;Silicon^reset;. It is most abundant on ^orange;Desert^reset; biomes. You'll need ^orange;Caliche Stone^orange; from a desert too, so you should head to one soon.": "^orange;砂^reset;はどこにでもあるが、^orange;シリコン^reset;の貴重な原料だ。^orange;砂漠^reset;バイオームに最も豊富にある。そこから^orange;カリチェストーン^orange;も必要なので、早めに砂漠に行くべきだ。",
  "Now perhaps it's time you created a ^orange;Bio-Chem Lab^reset; and start learning about the wonders of chemistry!": "そろそろ^orange;バイオケムラボ^reset;を作って、化学の素晴らしさを学んでみてはどうだ！",
  "Cultural Differences": "文化の違い",
  "^green;Seeds^reset; are best extracted for useful ^orange;Tissue Culture^reset;. Without them you will be unable to complete a ^orange;DNA Sample^reset; which is rather important to your success.": "^green;種^reset;から有用な^orange;組織培養^reset;を抽出するのが最善だ。これがないと、成功に非常に重要な^orange;DNAサンプル^reset;を完成できない。",
  "Remember: Almost everything natural can extract, and more besides. Experiment, and you'll find some truly interesting things.": "覚えておいて: ほぼすべての天然素材は抽出でき、それ以外にも色々ある。実験すれば、本当に面白いものが見つかるぞ。",
  "Hydrogen and Oxygen": "水素と酸素",
  "You've gathered ^orange;Water^reset;! If you want to gather ^green;Hydrogen,Oxygen and Salt^reset;, collect some ^orange;Water^reset; and then use any ^green;hand mill or extractor^reset; to create 5 ^orange;Hydrogen^reset;!": "^orange;水^reset;を集めた！^green;水素、酸素、塩^reset;を得たいなら、^orange;水^reset;を集めて^green;ハンドミルか抽出機^reset;で5つの^orange;水素^reset;を作ろう！",
  "You'll eventually find other sources for these useful materials, but for now this is the best method you have access to. Experimentation will get you far!": "いずれ他の入手源も見つかるだろうが、今はこれが最善の方法だ。実験が上達への近道だ！",
  "Now that you're familiar with scanning, ^green;we need to start finding these ^orange;artifacts^reset;, dear. Yes, the Floran one first... Their colonies will contain vital ^orange;clues^reset; to its whereabouts. Floran live all over nowadays, but still prefer the dense ^orange;Forest^reset; vegetation of planets found around ^orange;Gentle stars^reset;. Good luck dear, and thank you.": "スキャンにも慣れてきましたね。^green;そろそろ^orange;アーティファクト^reset;を探し始めましょう。ええ、まずはフローランのものから…彼らのコロニーにはその在処への重要な^orange;手がかり^reset;があるはずです。フローランは今やあちこちに住んでいますが、^orange;穏やかな星^reset;の周りの惑星にある濃密な^orange;森林^reset;を好む傾向は変わりません。幸運を祈ります、ありがとう。",
  "Toughest of Metals": "最強の金属",
  "Simply put: I need better protection for the cold outside. A ^orange;Densinium Helm^orange; would be perfect. I would handsomely compensate you for the materials.": "簡潔に言う: 外の寒さに対するより良い防具が必要だ。^orange;デンシニウムヘルム^orange;があれば完璧だ。素材の対価として十分な報酬を払おう。",
  "Excellent. Now I can really cut my teeth on exploring this frozen hell. As promised: ^green;your payment^reset;.": "素晴らしい。これでこの凍てついた地獄の探索に本腰を入れられる。約束通り: ^green;報酬^reset;だ。",
  "Dark Obsession": "暗い執着",
  "I am obsessed with ancient civilizations. Truly. I hear tell of an ^orange;elder race^reset; that once wandered the stars. If you can ^orange;bring me a Cthulhu Statue^reset; I would reward you very well.": "私は古代文明に取り憑かれている。本当に。かつて星々を彷徨った^orange;エルダー種族^reset;の話を聞いた。^orange;クトゥルフの像を持ってきて^reset;くれたら、十分な報酬を払おう。",
  "This is a ^green;breathtaking specimen^reset;, but oddly maddening to look at. Your reward? Of course! It's all I have in savings, but it should cover your costs.": "^green;息をのむような標本^reset;だが、見ていると不思議と狂気を感じる。報酬？もちろん！貯金の全てだが、経費は賄えるはずだ。",
  "Hydroponic Potence": "水耕栽培の力",
  "Kevin urinated on my ^orange;Hydroponics Tray^reset; during a drunken staff party and broke it! I don't have a ^orange;Power Station^reset; to craft a new one... could you bring one to me?": "ケヴィンが酔っ払いの社員パーティーで俺の^orange;水耕栽培トレイ^reset;に小便して壊しやがった！新しいのを作る^orange;パワーステーション^reset;がないんだ…一つ持ってきてくれないか？",
  "Awesome. You are good people. As a thanks, have a contract that summons some most assuredly ^red;not^reset; good people!": "最高だ。いい人だな。お礼に、間違いなく^red;善良ではない^reset;人々を召喚する契約書を渡そう！",
  "Station Upgrade tracker": "ステーションアップグレード追跡",
  "This isn't visible": "これは表示されません",
  "You shouldn't be able to see this in your log.": "このメッセージはログに表示されないはずです。",
  "MAdness Loss Tracker": "狂気減少追跡",
  "Tricorder tracker": "トリコーダー追跡",
  "What Lies Beneath": "底にあるもの",
  "From deep below me, I can hear...no, feel...^red;something dark and terrible^reset; lurking in the abyssal darkness. Dare I investigate the ^red;source of that slurping, wet cacaphony^reset;?": "はるか下から…聞こえる、いや、感じる…^red;暗くて恐ろしい何か^reset;が深淵の闇に潜んでいる。あの^red;ズルズルと湿った不協和音の源^reset;を調査する勇気はあるか？",
  "That's it. I'm done. That place was terrifying beyond my capacity to tolerate. But I killed that abomination, and feel pretty darned amazing now.": "もう終わりだ。あの場所は耐えられないほど恐ろしかった。だがあの忌まわしきものを殺した。今は最高の気分だ。",
  "Molten Power": "溶融のパワー",
  "I'm trying to fix this relay, but the damned thing just won't relent. I desperately need to reach a friend. Could you perhaps craft a ^orange;Molten Core^reset; in your ^orange;Matter Assembler^reset;? That should solve my predicament.": "このリレーを修理しようとしているが、全く言うことを聞かない。友人に連絡を取りたいのだ。^orange;マター・アセンブラー^reset;で^orange;溶融コア^reset;を作ってくれないか？それで問題は解決するはずだ。",
  "That did it, thanks!...hmm, that's odd. No signal from the ^green;lab on Delta Freya II^reset;. Not even static. I'll have to investigate this. Thanks for this Core, it will go a long way to helping communications here.": "うまくいった、ありがとう！…ん、おかしいな。^green;デルタフレイヤII号の研究室^reset;から信号がない。ノイズすらない。調査しなければ。このコア、ありがとう。ここの通信に大いに役立つよ。",
  "Strange Visions": "奇妙なビジョン",
  "Lifting up this book has triggered ^red;strange visions^reset; of a place covered in snow and ice, and coordinates to that place. I should enter the coordinates for ^orange;Delta Freya II^reset; into my SAIL. It calls to me. I am compelled to obey.": "この本を持ち上げた途端、雪と氷に覆われた場所の^red;奇妙なビジョン^reset;と、その場所の座標が浮かんだ。^orange;デルタフレイヤII号^reset;の座標をSAILに入力すべきだ。呼んでいる。従わずにはいられない。",
  "There are no words to express the madness and strangeness that tugs now at the very roots of my soul. A piece of myself has been forever lost to that hellish place.": "魂の根底を引き裂くあの狂気と奇妙さを表す言葉がない。自分の一部が永遠にあの地獄の場所に失われた。",
  "A Missing Friend": "行方不明の友人",
  "I've no idea how to reach my friend. ^orange;All of the teleporters^reset; leading to Delta Freya II appear to be down, and I can't get word to them. If you find a way there, could you please search for my pal Wagner?": "友人への連絡方法がわからない。デルタフレイヤII号への^orange;テレポーター全て^reset;がダウンしていて、連絡が取れないのだ。もしそこへ行く方法を見つけたら、友人のワグナーを探してくれないか？",
  "Oh no. Wagner is...dead? Thank you...^orange;sad news is better than no news at all^reset;. Please take this for your efforts, and leave me. Now go, please. ^green;I need to be alone^reset;  for a while.": "そんな。ワグナーは…死んだのか？ありがとう…^orange;悲しい知らせでも、知らせがないよりはましだ^reset;。これを受け取ってくれ。そして帰ってくれ。^green;しばらく一人にしてほしい^reset;。",
  "A Strange Place": "奇妙な場所",
  "Where am I? This ^green;data-disc^reset; at least presents the coordinates. What is odd, is that this sector has always been devoid of...everything. I should definitely explore this place.": "ここはどこだ？この^green;データディスク^reset;に座標だけは記されている。奇妙なのは、このセクターにはいつも…何もなかったことだ。間違いなくこの場所を探索すべきだ。",
  "I've explored the mysteries of the Precursor ruins, and it was worth every minute.": "プリカーサー遺跡の謎を探索した。一分一秒が価値ある時間だった。",
  "Ssad losst thingss.": "悲しい落としものなのだ",
  "Floran hass losst fatherss ^orange;Greenfinger Medal^reset;. Iss sspecial becausse father hunted besst in tribe and killed many Hylotl in war. Perhapss you iss find in ^green;Verdant Ruins^reset;?": "フローランは父の^orange;グリーンフィンガーメダル^reset;を失くしたのだ。父は部族で一番の狩人で、戦争で多くのハイロトルを倒したから特別なのだ。^green;緑豊かな遺跡^reset;で見つけてくれないか？",
  "Oooooh! Floran thankss! Iss family heirloom! Floran givess friend reward! I ssteal thesse from Kevin when him not lookss because Kevin sstealss my pantss every week.": "おおおお！フローランは感謝するのだ！家宝なのだ！友達に報酬をあげるのだ！ケヴィンが見てない時に盗んだのだ",
  "I've looked everywhere and can't figure out where the heck Kevin hid my damned lucky coin. I ^red;know^reset; it was that buffoon. He left a note that claimed he was getting it repaired. A coin. Honestly. If you come across a rare 12th century Earth coin...it's mine. Please bring it to me. I'll be ^green;quite^reset; generous in return.": "あちこち探したが、ケヴィンが俺の幸運のコインをどこに隠したのかわからない。あの馬鹿が犯人なのは^red;わかってる^reset;。メモが残ってたからな。「^orange;緑豊かな遺跡^reset;」を探してくれないか？",
  "The depths of my thanks cannot even be expressed. Replacing this is literally impossible now, what with Earth being slightly destroyed and all. Have this in exchange for your time and bravery.": "感謝の深さは言い表せない。地球がちょっと消滅してしまった今、これを替えるのは文字通り不可能なんだ",
  "Crystalline Perfection": "結晶の完璧さ",
  "Good day, being of carbon and flesh. I wonder if you might give aid to this Eld'uukhar? I seek the glorious aspect of a ^orange;Crystalline Trophy^reset;. I've heard that they can be found in ^orange;Ancient Temples^reset;. If you find one, I would reward you handsomely for your efforts.": "ごきげんよう、炭素と肉の存在よ。このエルドゥーカーに助力を賜れないだろうか？^orange;結晶のトロフィー^reset;の栄光の姿を求めている",
  "Ah, most exceptional, fleshling. My gratitude showers upon you, and the glory of the Shards will shine on your soul forevermore.": "ああ、最も素晴らしい、肉の者よ。感謝が汝に降り注ぎ、シャードの栄光が汝の魂を永遠に照らすであろう",
  "A rare treasure": "希少な宝物",
  "I've heard that there is a rare component called a ^orange;Alien Broadcast Node^reset; that could be utilized for a truly great FTL drive just waiting to be found somewhere in the ^green;Evernight Jungle^reset;. It's a rumour, granted, but hypothetically, if you found one, I might have something for you...": "^orange;エイリアンブロードキャストノード^reset;という希少な部品があると聞いた。本当に素晴らしいFTLドライブのために使えるらしい",
  "You've no idea how much this means to me. As thanks for this most wonderous technology I bequeath to you another sort of rarity. May it bring you fortune in your travels.": "これがどれほど嬉しいかわからないだろう。この素晴らしい技術への感謝として、別の種類の技術を授けよう",
  "X'ian History": "シーの歴史",
  "I am what you might call a collector, of sorts. My people have little knowledge of our past, and I make it my mission to find more information about our history. If you find a ^orange;X'i Relic^reset;, could you bring it back to me? I'd be ever so thankful.": "私はいわゆるコレクターだ。我が民は過去についてほとんど知識がなく、私は我々の起源についてより多くの情報を見つけることを使命としている",
  "Can it truly be? A ^green;Vexinarri Glaff^reset;? Where did you find this?!?! I thought these were only a legend! As promised, your reward. It has been a pleasure.": "本当にそうなのか？^green;ヴェクシナーリ・グラフ^reset;？どこで見つけた？！伝説でしかないと思っていた！",
  "<^red;A voice speaks in your head:^reset; Most upsetting. Expedition was a failure. Could not locate ^orange;Ancient Remote^reset; to sell at exorbitant price. If mortal biped locates one, I would be most grateful to purchase it.>": "<^red;頭の中に声が響く:^reset; 最も不愉快。遠征は失敗だった。^orange;古代のリモート^reset;を見つけられず、法外な価格で売ることができなかった",
  "<Great joy is felt by this being. Appreciation will be shown with gratuitous monetary payment. Fleshlings appreciate such gestures. With it you could purchase goods and services.>": "<この存在に大きな喜びが感じられる。惜しみない金銭的報酬で感謝を示そう。肉の者たちはそのようなものを好むようだ",
  "Industrial Edge": "産業の優位",
  "Now it's time to maximize your output. Build an ^orange;Industrial Centrifuge^reset;. You'll need to find some ^orange;Sand^reset; to make the glass you need. Try a desert!": "生産量を最大化する時が来た。^orange;産業用遠心分離機^reset;を作ろう。ガラスを作るために^orange;砂^reset;が必要だ。砂漠に行ってみよう！",
  "I should mention that this station requires power to run, which you can get from an Alternator or better power source.": "このステーションは稼働に電力が必要だ。オルタネーターかそれ以上の電源から得られる。",
  "Jarring Honey": "蜂蜜の瓶詰め",
  "To make the most out of your bee farm, you'll want to harvest honey. Try to build a ^orange;Honey Jarrer^reset; to aid with this process. Toss in some ^orange;Empty Bottles^reset; and ^orange;honey combs^reset; while you're at it.": "蜂牧場を最大限活用するには蜂蜜を収穫したい。^orange;蜂蜜瓶詰め機^reset;を作ってみよう。^orange;空の瓶^reset;と^orange;蜜蝋^reset;も入れてみて。",
  "The ^orange;Honey Jarrer^reset; creates ^green;Honey Jars^reset; with different effects, depending on the combs you centrifuge. It's up to you to experiment!": "^orange;蜂蜜瓶詰め機^reset;は遠心分離するコムに応じて異なる効果の^green;蜂蜜の瓶^reset;を作る。実験するのはあなた次第だ！",
  "Breeding New Variants": "新品種の繁殖",
  "So, you've got apiaries and honey bees. Now, I wonder: what would happen if you put a ^orange;Orchid Queen^reset; and some ^orange;Honey Drones^reset; into that ^orange;Giant Apiary^reset;? And what about if you added a ^orange;Tungsten Frame^reset;?": "養蜂箱とミツバチを手に入れた。さて、^orange;オーキッドクイーン^reset;と^orange;ハニードローン^reset;を^orange;大型養蜂箱^reset;に入れたらどうなるだろう？^orange;タングステンフレーム^reset;を追加したら？",
  "You can create countless bee variants by selectively choosing traits in queens and drones to influence their offspring. ^red;Not all bees^reset; can be bred with every family-type. You'll need to experiment yourself to find out what works.": "女王蜂とドローンの特性を選択的に選ぶことで、無数の蜂の品種を作れる。^red;すべての蜂^reset;があらゆる系統と交配できるわけではない。何がうまくいくかは自分で実験して見つける必要がある。",
  "Mites": "ダニ",
  "It should be noted that bees have a natural predator: ^green;Mites^reset;. These parasites infest your apiaries from time to time, and reduce their productivity and can even kill the bees. Create an ^orange;Anti-Mite frame^reset; to combat them.": "蜂には天敵がいることを知っておくべきだ: ^green;ダニ^reset;。この寄生虫は時々養蜂箱に侵入し、生産性を低下させ、蜂を殺すこともある。対抗するために^orange;ダニ除けフレーム^reset;を作ろう。",
  "Simply placing this in an apiary will work its magic. ^red;Mites hate these things^reset; and will be killed or driven off by them. Keep some handy. That's all I can teach you, it's up to you to experiment and breed the best bees you can! Bee all you can bee!": "養蜂箱に入れるだけで効果を発揮する。^red;ダニはこれが大嫌い^reset;で、殺されるか追い出される。常備しておこう。教えられることはこれで全てだ。あとは自分で実験して最高の蜂を育ててくれ！蜂のように最善を尽くせ！",
  "Beekeeping 101": "養蜂入門",
  "Care to try a simpler life, ^green;breeding bees^reset; and reaping the profits? Build an ^orange;Apiary Crafting Station^reset; and you can get started.": "シンプルな生活で^green;蜂を育てて^reset;利益を得てみないか？^orange;養蜂クラフトステーション^reset;を作れば始められるぞ。",
  "With the ^orange;Apiary Crafting Station^reset;, you'll be able to craft a whole new array of goods you've likely not seen before!": "^orange;養蜂クラフトステーション^reset;で、今まで見たことのない全く新しい品々を作れるようになるぞ！",
  "House of Bees": "蜂の家",
  "Before you take care of bees, you need a place to put them. Build an ^orange;Apiary^reset; for this.": "蜂の世話をする前に、蜂を入れる場所が必要だ。^orange;養蜂箱^reset;を作ろう。",
  "The ^orange;Apiary^reset; is essential for a beekeeper. You'll likely want more than one. You need them to breed your little buddies.": "^orange;養蜂箱^reset;は養蜂家に不可欠だ。複数欲しくなるだろう。蜂を繁殖させるのに必要だ。",
  "A ^orange;Basic Frame^reset; is placed within an ^green;apiary^reset; to act as housing for the bees. Create one now.": "^orange;基本フレーム^reset;は^green;養蜂箱^reset;の中に設置して蜂の住処にするものだ。一つ作ってみよう。",
  "There are ^green;many types of frames^reset;, and different bees will prefer certain types. You'll need to be creative.": "^green;フレームの種類は多く^reset;、異なる蜂は特定の種類を好む。工夫が必要だぞ。",
  "Researching Queens": "女王蜂の研究",
  "When you catch wild queens, you can't tell much about them. You can't use them well through guesswork. So, try building a ^orange;Basic Microscope^reset; in the bee station.": "野生の女王蜂を捕まえても詳しいことはわからない。当てずっぽうではうまく使えない。^orange;基本顕微鏡^reset;を養蜂ステーションで作ってみよう。",
  "Placing a ^cyan;Wild Queen^reset; in a microscope will allow you to scan her stats, which can greatly influence your breeding choices.": "^cyan;野生の女王蜂^reset;を顕微鏡に入れるとステータスをスキャンでき、繁殖の選択に大きく影響する。",
  "Queen and Drone": "女王蜂とドローン",
  "Now you need to ^green;catch a queen and a drone honey bee^reset; and let them loose inside your apiary. You'll need a ^orange;Bug Net^reset; for this. Bees can be found on most biomes, usually during the daylight hours.": "次に^green;女王蜂とドローンのミツバチを捕まえて^reset;養蜂箱に入れよう。^orange;虫取り網^reset;が必要だ。蜂はほとんどのバイオームで、通常は日中に見つかる。",
  "Find ^green;other types of bees^reset;, and cross-breed them! How? Just place a different type of drone in there for your queen to check out. You may see some pretty swift results!": "^green;他の種類の蜂^reset;を見つけて交配しよう！やり方？女王蜂のいる養蜂箱に別の種類のドローンを入れるだけ。かなり早く結果が出るかもしれないぞ！",
  "Bees won't be happy without flowers to pollinate. Get a ^orange;Red Flower^reset; to plant next to your apiary and your bees will get going!": "蜂は花粉を集める花がないと幸せになれない。養蜂箱の隣に植える^orange;赤い花^reset;を手に入れれば蜂が活動を始めるぞ！",
  "Pretty much any flower will do, by the way. And be patient. Bees take time to breed, and they only ^green;'do it'^reset; when there are flowers and sun. ^orange;Some plants^reset; are more appealing to certain species.": "ほぼどんな花でも大丈夫だ。それと辛抱してくれ。蜂の繁殖には時間がかかり、花と太陽がある時だけ行われる。^orange;特定の植物^reset;が特定の種に好まれることもある。",
  "Round and Round we go...": "ぐるぐる回して…",
  "To extract the goodies from ^green;honeycombs^reset; produced by your bees, you are going to need a ^orange;Wooden Centrifuge^reset;.": "蜂が作った^green;蜜蝋^reset;から良いものを取り出すには^orange;木製遠心分離機^reset;が必要だ。",
  "As your bee-tech gets more advanced you'll get ^green;superior output^reset; from your bee farm.": "養蜂技術が進歩すると、蜂牧場からの^green;生産量が向上する^reset;。",
  "Honeycombs": "ハニーコム",
  "Once your bees have been busy a while ^green;collect the combs from your apiary^reset;.": "蜂がしばらく働いたら^green;養蜂箱からコムを回収^reset;しよう",
  "Now you'll need another station to process this resource. Shall we continue?": "この素材を加工するには別のステーションが必要だ。続けようか？",
  "Wax and Wane": "蝋の盛衰",
  "Place the combs within a ^orange;Wooden Centrifuge^reset;, which you can build at the Machining Table, and collect the ^green;wax chunks^reset; from within.": "コムを^orange;木製遠心分離機^reset;に入れて（マシニングテーブルで作れる）中の^green;ワックスチャンク^reset;を回収しよう。",
  "Different combs contain very different resources. Experimentation is part of the challenge!": "コムの種類によって中身は全く異なる。実験が挑戦の一部だ！",
  "Alveary": "大型養蜂箱",
  "Now we can get a bit more adventurous. Create a ^orange;Large Apiary^reset; to double your bee farm potential. You'll need some ^orange;Golden Wood^reset; to build it. Try ^cyan;Bumblebees or Orchid bees^reset;.": "もう少し冒険してみよう。^orange;大型養蜂箱^reset;を作って蜂牧場のポテンシャルを倍増させよう。作るには^orange;黄金の木材^reset;が必要だ。^cyan;マルハナバチやオーキッドビー^reset;を試してみよう。",
  "These sweet babies can hold ^green;two frames^reset;, and twice as many drones means twice as much production, too. The gains are quite substantial!": "大型養蜂箱は^green;フレームを2つ^reset;入れられ、ドローンが倍なら生産量も倍だ。利益はかなり大きい！",
  "Making a Booze Kit": "醸造キットの作成",
  "So you want to make your own booze? Great! I'll help you. You must start by crafting a ^orange;Booze Kit^reset;. Place it against a wall and you can start your path to becoming a Brew Master!": "自分で酒を作りたいのか？いいね！手伝おう。まず^orange;醸造キット^reset;を作ることから始めよう。壁に設置すればブリューマスターへの道が始まる！",
  "Your path to brewing enlightment has started. Before we really start with the alcohol though, you must first use the Booze Kit to craft the other stations you'll require.": "醸造への道が始まった。本格的にアルコールを作る前に、まず醸造キットで必要な他のステーションを作らなければ。",
  "Brewing": "醸造",
  "Now let's start. Make some ^green;bottles^reset; with your ^orange;Furnace^reset;. Three...no, four bottles should do.": "さあ始めよう。^orange;炉^reset;で^green;瓶^reset;を作れ。3つ…いや、4つあれば十分だ。",
  "Now we need to fill'em up, right? Here, take some seeds, you'll need them. Make sure you grow and harvest them.": "次は中身を入れないとな？ほら、種をやろう。育てて収穫してくれ。",
  "Brewing II": "醸造 II",
  "Next, you'll need to make ^orange;Yeast Water^reset;. Use ^orange;Water^reset; and ^orange;Wheat^reset; in the ^orange;Mashing Tun^reset; to make 3 ^orange;Grain Water^reset;. Use ^orange;Sugar^reset; with the ^orange;Grain Water^reset; in the ^orange;Mashing Tun^reset; to make ^orange;Yeast Water^reset;.": "次に^orange;イースト水^reset;を作る必要がある。^orange;マッシングタン^reset;で^orange;水^reset;と^orange;小麦^reset;から^orange;穀物水^reset;を3つ作れ。^orange;砂糖^reset;と^orange;穀物水^reset;を^orange;マッシングタン^reset;で混ぜれば^orange;イースト水^reset;ができる。",
  "Great. Did you harvest your crops yet? Do that, if not. Also, take these ^orange;Bottles^reset; for the next step.": "よし。作物はもう収穫したか？まだなら収穫してくれ。それと次のステップ用の^orange;瓶^reset;も受け取ってくれ。",
  "Brewing III": "醸造 III",
  "Use some ^orange;Grapes^reset; and a ^orange;Bottle^reset; in the ^orange;Fruit Press^reset; to make ^orange;Grape Mash^reset;. You'll want two units of it for the wine you'll be making.": "^orange;フルーツプレス^reset;で^orange;ブドウ^reset;と^orange;瓶^reset;を使って^orange;グレープマッシュ^reset;を作れ。ワイン用に2つ必要だ。",
  "Nice. Now we have everything we need to make a delicious wartwine.": "いいね。これでおいしいワートワインを作るのに必要なものが揃った。",
  "Brewing IV": "醸造 IV",
  "And now let's make some ^green;Wartwine^reset;. Combine a ^orange;Bottle^reset;, ^orange;Yeast Water^reset;, 2 ^orange;Wartweed^reset;, and 2 ^orange;Grape Mash^reset; in the ^orange;Fermenter^reset;.": "さあ^green;ワートワイン^reset;を作ろう。^orange;発酵槽^reset;で^orange;瓶^reset;、^orange;イースト水^reset;、^orange;ワートウィード^reset;2つ、^orange;グレープマッシュ^reset;2つを合成しよう。",
  "Excellent! It looks tasty, doesn't it? But this is just the beginning. You'll craft even more glorious alcohol soon!": "素晴らしい！おいしそうだろう？でもこれは始まりに過ぎない。もっと素晴らしいアルコールを作ることになるぞ！",
  "I hops": "ホップ",
  "For the next steps you'll need some ^orange;Hops^reset;. Make them grow and gather at least 2 ^orange;Hops^reset;. Because without ^orange;hops^reset;, we get no ^green;beer^reset;. And without beer we cry.": "次のステップには^orange;ホップ^reset;が必要だ。育てて最低2つの^orange;ホップ^reset;を集めろ。^orange;ホップ^reset;なしでは^green;ビール^reset;はできない。ビールなしでは泣くしかない。",
  "That's a good start. Be sure to keep some wheat as you'll need it next.": "いいスタートだ。次に小麦も必要になるから取っておけよ。",
  "Time to use some new stations. First, put one piece of ^orange;Wheat^reset; into the ^orange;Rain Barrel^reset;. Once it's soaked, put it into the ^orange;Sprouting Table^reset;. Then take your sprouted wheat and place it into a ^orange;Campfire^reset;.": "新しいステーションを使う時だ。まず^orange;小麦^reset;を1つ^orange;レインバレル^reset;に入れろ。浸かったら^orange;発芽テーブル^reset;に入れろ。発芽した小麦を^orange;キャンプファイヤー^reset;に入れろ。",
  "Nice. Note that if you need dark malt, you just need to put back your malt into the ^orange;Furnace^reset; and cook it some more.": "いいぞ。ダークモルトが必要なら、モルトをもう一度^orange;炉^reset;に入れて追加で焼けばいい。",
  "First, make one measure of ^orange;Yeast Water^reset;. I already taught you how to do this. Next, use the ^orange;Mashing Tun^reset; to mix your malt with water. We need one flask of ^orange;Wort^reset;.": "まず^orange;イースト水^reset;を1つ作れ。作り方はもう教えた。次に^orange;マッシングタン^reset;でモルトと水を混ぜろ。^orange;ウォート^reset;が1つ必要だ。",
  "Now we have everything we need to make ^green;beer^reset;, the glory of the Gods.": "これで^green;ビール^reset;を作るのに必要なものが全て揃った。神々の栄光だ。",
  "Beer, beer, beer": "ビール、ビール、ビール",
  "It's ^blue;beer time^reset;! Go to your ^orange;Fermenter^reset; to make 3 ^green;Beer^reset;. You'll need ^orange;Wort^reset;, ^orange;Hops^reset;, ^orange;Carbon Dioxide^reset;, and ^orange;Yeast Water^reset;, plus an ^orange;Empty Bottle^reset;.": "^blue;ビールの時間^reset;だ！^orange;発酵槽^reset;で^green;ビール^reset;を3つ作れ。^orange;ウォート^reset;、^orange;ホップ^reset;、^orange;二酸化炭素^reset;、^orange;イースト水^reset;、^orange;空の瓶^reset;が必要だ。",
  "Cheers! Now that you can make your own beer, your life is one step closer to perfection.": "乾杯！自分でビールを作れるようになった。人生が完璧に一歩近づいた。",
  "Distillation": "蒸留",
  "Let's get what we need for our next beverage. Mash some ^green;apples, pears, grapes and peaches^reset;.": "次の飲み物に必要なものを準備しよう。^green;リンゴ、梨、ブドウ、桃^reset;をマッシュしろ。",
  "Now let's move on to something a little harder. Something with some oomph!": "さあ、もっと強いものに進もう。パンチの効いたやつだ！",
  "Spirits": "スピリッツ",
  "So *hic* with all these mashed fruits we're ready to make some ^green;shpirits^white;. You'll need some ^orange;Yeast Water^reset; and ^orange;Water^reset; too. Bring all to the ^green;distiller^reset; and do yer magic! *hic*": "じゃあ *ヒック* これだけの潰した果物があれば^green;蒸留酒^white;を作る準備完了だ。^orange;イースト水^reset;と^orange;水^reset;も必要だぞ。全部^green;蒸留器^reset;に持っていって魔法をかけろ！ *ヒック*",
  "Nice work! Now, we'll have one last recipe to do.": "よくやった！さあ、最後のレシピだ",
  "Merry mead": "楽しいミード",
  "I's not able ter *hic* do much ter help. Make ^green;mead^reset;. Hard work. You'll need to find shome ^orange;Pure Honey^reset; and purpare fer a complimicated brewing process. Bring some for me to *hic* taste when you're done!": "もう *ヒック* 大して助けられねぇ。^green;ミード^reset;を作れ。大変だ。^orange;ピュアハニー^reset;を見つけて複雑な醸造プロセスの準備をしろ。できたら *ヒック* 味見させてくれ！",
  "You did it. Now you can truly call yourself a brewer.": "やったな。これで真の醸造家を名乗れる。",
  "Why do they hate Kevin?": "なぜケヴィンは嫌われるのか？",
  "I need to remind someone they aren't young and attractive anymore. Can you make me a ^orange;Booster Croptop^reset; that I can mail them? You can make one on a ^green;Sewing Wheel^reset;! I'll pay you.": "誰かにもう若くもなく魅力的でもないことを思い出させたいんだ。^green;ソーイングホイール^reset;で^orange;ブースタークロップトップ^reset;を作って郵送してくれないか？報酬は払うよ。",
  "Now for phase two! She'll never see it coming! Thanks for the help. Take this awesome briefcase. Don't open it here, or everyone will get ^green;super jealous^reset; and try to steal it. Trust me.": "さあ第二段階だ！彼女は気づかないぞ！手伝ってくれてありがとう。この最高のブリーフケースをやろう。ここで開けるなよ、みんな^green;超嫉妬して^reset;盗もうとするから。信じてくれ。",
  "I just don't know...": "本当にわからない…",
  "5 ^orange;Biofuel Canisters^reset; would be all that I needed to create a ^cyan;rocket-powered guinea pig^reset;. With some ^orange;Algae^reset; found in a ^orange;Bog^reset; biome you'd have no problem making some. I promise to ^red;not^reset; reward you with deadly bees this time!": "^orange;バイオ燃料キャニスター^reset;が5つあれば^cyan;ロケット推進モルモット^reset;を完成できるんだ。^orange;湿地^reset;バイオームで見つかる^orange;藻^reset;があれば問題なく作れるぞ。今度は殺人蜂で^red;報いない^reset;と約束する！",
  "Thanks. You look like you could use some ^orange;party time^reset;! It's dangerous to go alone! Take ^green;this^reset;! Also, if you feel up to it and want to die, I could use help testing my newest invention. It's called a ^orange;Kill Pod^reset; and it's super neat!": "ありがとう。^orange;パーティータイム^reset;が必要そうだね！一人じゃ危険だ！^green;これ^reset;を持っていけ！それと、死にたい気分なら、最新の発明のテストを手伝ってくれ。^orange;キルポッド^reset;っていう超クールなやつだ！",
  "Okay, I kinda get why...": "まあ、理由はわかる…",
  "I cannot possibly poison-tip the ^cyan;rocket-powered guinea pigs^reset; without a supply of 5 ^orange;Alien Compound^reset;. Perhaps you could get me some? I would (in theory) handsomely reward you!": "^cyan;ロケット推進モルモット^reset;に毒を塗るには^orange;エイリアンコンパウンド^reset;が5つないと絶対無理なんだ。手に入れてくれないか？（理論上は）十分な報酬を出すよ！",
  "Thanks, Dave. Now I can construct a weapon the likes of which nobody has ever seen. Bonus: They're also ^green;delicious^reset;!": "ありがとう、デイブ。これで誰も見たことのない武器が作れる。おまけに^green;美味しい^reset;んだ！",
  "Infantile Deliciousness": "幼児的な美味しさ",
  "You ever wonder how many ^orange;baby heads^reset; you can fit in a refrigerator? I do! Let's find out, shall we? If you were to gather say...200 ^orange;baby heads on sticks^reset; I'd be ever so thankful.": "冷蔵庫に^orange;赤ん坊の頭^reset;を何個入れられるか考えたことある？俺はある！確かめようぜ！200個の^orange;棒付き赤ん坊の頭^reset;を集めてくれたら最高にありがたい。",
  "Many thanks, Lester. This time I have an ^orange;honestly good^reset; thing for you! Promise!": "ありがとう、レスター。今回は^orange;本当に良いもの^reset;をあげるよ！約束する！",
  "This guy is annoying.": "こいつはウザい",
  "There is no such thing as an orange fruit. Prove me wrong.": "オレンジ色の果物なんて存在しない。反論してみろ",
  "That isn't orange. But thanks for trying, loser.": "それはオレンジ色じゃない。でもトライしてくれてありがとう、負け犬。",
  "Insanity and Rage.": "狂気と怒り",
  "I'm unsure I can trust you after that whole ^orange;orange fruit^reset; thing, but we'll try again I guess. You ever laid hands on some ^orange;Plasmic Crystal^reset;? If so, I could use about 20. For...reasons. Certainly not involving large flightless birds and carnage.": "あの^orange;オレンジの果物^reset;の件の後じゃ信用できるかわからんが、もう一回やってみるか。^orange;プラズミッククリスタル^reset;を手にしたことは？あれば20個ほど欲しいんだが。…理由は聞くな。大きな飛べない鳥と大虐殺には確実に関係ないぞ。",
  "Excellent. Now I can distill raw rage into crystalline form and feed it to my babies! Just in time for the ballet! Take this crap as a thanks.": "素晴らしい。これで純粋な怒りを結晶化して子供たちに食べさせられる！バレエの公演にちょうど間に合った！このガラクタをお礼に受け取れ。",
  "Madness and Death": "狂気と死",
  "I bet you can't collect more brains than I can! In fact, I ^orange;double-dog-dare^reset; you to collect ^orange;more brains^reset; than I can! Remove ^orange;50 brains^reset; from random life-forms...that's a decent start.": "俺より多くの脳みそを集められるか賭けないか！^orange;ダブルドッグデア^reset;だ！ランダムな生命体から^orange;脳みそを50個^reset;取り出せ…まずはそれくらいが妥当だろう。",
  "That's a whole lot of brains! Also, I didn't even bother collecting any. You beat me! You're also now ^orange;a murderer^reset;! Congratulations!": "大量の脳みそだ！あと、俺は一個も集めてない。お前の勝ちだ！しかもこれで^orange;殺人犯^reset;になったぞ！おめでとう！",
  "He's insane. I like it.": "こいつは狂ってる。気に入った",
  "Wanna try something ^orange;super fun^reset;? Let's create something previously thought to be ^green;hypothetical^reset;! Let's try making ^orange;Neutronium^reset; and ^orange;Anti-Neutronium^reset;! I'll give you something ^red;truly amazing^reset; if you can do it! I promise. For real, this time.": "^orange;超楽しいこと^reset;をやってみないか？これまで^green;仮説上の存在^reset;と思われていたものを作ろう！^orange;ニュートロニウム^reset;と^orange;反ニュートロニウム^reset;を作るんだ！できたら^red;本当にすごいもの^reset;をあげるぞ！約束する。今度こそ本当に。",
  "Holy forking shirtballs, you did it. I guess you aren't the dumbass I had assumed. In return, I give you this super-neat technology blueprint I found in the ^orange;Anti-Realm^reset;! No, I won't tell you where that is. You can't know, because you aren't special like ^cyan;Dave^reset;.": "マジかよ、やりやがった。お前は俺が思っていたほどのバカじゃなかったな。お返しに、^orange;反界^reset;で見つけたこの超クールな技術の設計図をやろう！どこにあるかは教えない。知る資格がないからだ。^cyan;デイブ^reset;みたいな特別な存在じゃないからな。",
  "Feed Khe.": "ケーを餌付けしろ",
  "Minion, I have an ^red;extremely important^reset; task for you: my pet cat is starving and needs food. Only the finest sustenance will do, so I need you to feed her one ^red;Neutron Bomb^reset;.": "部下よ、^red;極めて重要な^reset;任務がある: 俺のペットの猫が飢えていて餌が必要だ。最高級の食事だけが許される。^red;中性子爆弾^reset;を1つ食べさせてくれ。",
  "...pet? Well...that's awkward and completely wrong. Won't turn down good food, though. Don't tell anyone about him saying that...and take this blueprint. It's not 'useful', but it was certainly fun to design.": "…ペット？いや…それは気まずいし完全に間違ってる。でもいい食べ物は断らないよ。あいつが言ったことは誰にも言わないで…この設計図を受け取って。「実用的」ではないけど、設計するのは確かに楽しかった。",
  "Shiny Coin": "光るコイン",
  "You hear a voice from inside the Arc Smelter say 'Ooh, shiny noms! My turn. Come visit. Get recipe!'": "アーク精錬炉の中から声が聞こえる「おお、キラキラおいしいの！私の番。遊びに来て。レシピあげる！」",
  "You hear a voice from inside the Arc Smelter say 'Ooh, shiny noms! My turn. Here, have recipe!'": "アーク精錬炉の中から声が聞こえる「おお、キラキラおいしいの！私の番。はい、レシピ！」",
  "Shiny Crystal": "光るクリスタル",
  "You hear a voice from the nearby extractor say 'Khe sees you. Come get special shiny!'": "近くの抽出機から声が聞こえる「ケーはあなたを見てる。来て、特別なキラキラもらって！」",
  "You hear a voice from the nearby extractor say 'Khe sees you. Have shiny recipe!'": "近くの抽出機から声が聞こえる「ケーはあなたを見てる。キラキラレシピあげる！」",
  "Perfect Threads": "完璧な糸",
  "Mew. I like shiny. You like shiny too, right? How about we make the shiniest outfit ever? Need specific, very special ingredients. Fetch 3 each. Gold, diamond, crystal, core fragments, pure erchius. Quickly. Mew.": "ニャー。キラキラ好き。あなたもキラキラ好きでしょ？最もキラキラな衣装を作ろうよ。特別な素材が必要。金、ダイヤ、クリスタル、コアフラグメント、ピュアエルキウスを各3つ持ってきて。早く。ニャー。",
  "A bit of weaving here, a bit of trimming there, *burp* mrr... and it's done. If you need a replacement set, I'll have some for sale.": "ここを少し織って、あそこを少し切って、*ゲプッ* ムルル…できた。替えが必要なら売りに出しておくよ。",
  "Cat Toys": "猫のおもちゃ",
  "Hey, you. Mew lantern broke. Sad, sad mew. You found another for mew?": "ねえ、あなた。ニャーのランタン壊れた。悲しい、悲しいニャー。別のを見つけてきてくれた？",
  "Yay! Happy kitty! You can keep the old lantern. I got lots of those.": "やった！幸せな猫！古いランタンはあげる。たくさん持ってるから。",
  "Fertile Ground": "肥沃な大地",
  "^orange;Fertilizer^reset; is essential to produce plants of any real value. To make some, you will first need an ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset;. I need 1 barrel of ^orange;Fertilizer^reset; for this project. Bring me some, would you?": "^orange;肥料^reset;は価値のある植物を育てるのに不可欠だ。まず^orange;錬金テーブル^reset;が必要だ。5つ^orange;肥料^reset;を持ってきてくれ",
  "Now you can create some more advanced chemicals, and grow even better crops! Upgrade your ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; into a ^orange;Chemistry Lab^reset; as soon as you are able.": "これでより高度な化学物質を作り、より良い作物を育てられる！^orange;錬金テーブル^reset;をアップグレードしよう",
  "Icy Situation": "氷の状況",
  "I've heard of ^orange;Ice Crystals^reset; before, but I have yet to actually see one. Can you bring me one? I have no idea where they even come from!": "^orange;氷のクリスタル^reset;の噂は聞いたことがあるが、実物はまだ見たことがない。一つ持ってきてくれないか？どこで手に入るかも知らないんだ",
  "Have a nice hunk of cash as my thanks.": "お礼にたっぷりの報酬を",
  "Essential Ingredient": "必須の材料",
  "You'll need to find some ^orange;Caliche Stone^reset; if you want to get ^orange;Iodine^reset;. Throw batches of ^orange;Caliche Stone^reset; into your ^green;extraction lab^reset; and bring me some! You'll find them in ^orange;Desert^reset; biomes.": "^orange;ヨウ素^reset;を手に入れたいなら^orange;カリチェストーン^reset;を探す必要がある。^orange;カリチェストーン^reset;のバッチを抽出機に投入すれば手に入る",
  "Good work! Several basic ingredients such as ^orange;Iodine^reset; are essential. So stay stocked! You'll need ^orange;Iodine^reset; specifically to make ^orange;Graphene^reset; and high quality ^green;fertilizers^reset;!": "よくやった！^orange;ヨウ素^reset;のような基本材料は不可欠だ。常にストックしておこう！",
  "A Useful Alcohol": "便利なアルコール",
  "I could use some ^orange;Methanol^reset; but don't have the materials handy. Bring me 10 ^orange;Methanol^reset; and I'll toss you something useful in return. Not a grenade. Promise.": "^orange;メタノール^reset;が必要だが手持ちの材料がない。10個の^orange;メタノール^reset;を持ってきてくれたら何か便利なものを渡そう",
  "Excellent. This will be quite useful, and goes quite appreciated. Take ^green;this augment^reset;, perhaps you can get more use out of it than I ever could.": "素晴らしい。これは非常に役に立つ。とても感謝している。この^green;オーグメント^reset;を受け取ってくれ",
  "Deadly Chemistry": "危険な化学",
  "I need a particularly dangerous chemical known as ^orange;Methyl Iodide^reset;. That will do the trick for this mixture. I'd grab it myself but this might explode! Can you help me out?": "^orange;ヨウ化メチル^reset;という特に危険な化学物質が必要だ。この混合物にはそれが効くんだ",
  "Getting into Plastics": "プラスチックの世界",
  "If you're going to make it as a scientist, you are going to need ^orange;Advanced Plastic^reset;. Find some ^orange;Oil^reset; from a ^green;Desert^reset; or from ^orange;Bonemeal^reset; and then head to your ^orange;Bio Lab^reset;. Bring me back one single piece!": "科学者としてやっていくなら^orange;高度なプラスチック^reset;が必要だ。^green;砂漠^reset;バイオームから^orange;オイル^reset;を見つけよう",
  "Excellent! You'll need a lot of plastic, so keep well stocked.": "素晴らしい！プラスチックは大量に必要になるからストックしておこう",
  "Useful Liquid": "便利な液体",
  "I just can't figure out how to make the ^orange;Contaminated Water^reset; for some of my chemical stock. Can you help and make me some in a ^green;centrifuge^reset;?": "化学物質のストックに必要な^orange;汚染水^reset;の作り方がどうしてもわからない。^green;遠心分離機^reset;で作ってくれないか",
  "When you are able to, ^green;upgrade to an advanced centrifuge^reset; to really step up your lab game! Oh and be sure to keep your ^orange;Contaminated Water^reset;, you might need it.": "できるようになったら、^green;高度な遠心分離機にアップグレード^reset;してラボを強化しよう！",
  "Alchemy, Chemistry...whatever": "錬金術、化学…まあ同じこと",
  "So you've built an ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; and want to learn to use it? Simple enough. Just don't blow yourself to bits, please. Place it down and start by making some ^orange;Mulch^reset; for fertilizer.": "^orange;錬金テーブル^reset;を作って使い方を学びたいのか？簡単だ。自爆だけはしないでくれ。設置して^orange;マルチ^reset;を3つ作ってみよう",
  "^orange;Mulch^reset; is useful in a ^orange;Growing Tray^reset; as a ^green;weak fertilizer^reset;. You can craft all sorts of chemicals, plastics and lab-made materials. Be sure to upgrade the ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; when you can!": "^orange;マルチ^reset;は^orange;栽培トレイ^reset;で^green;弱い肥料^reset;として使える。ここであらゆる種類のものを作れるぞ",
  "Deoxyribonucleic Acid": "デオキシリボ核酸",
  "Now that the basics are clear to you, try making some essential ^orange;DNA Samples^reset; in the ^orange;Chemistry Lab^reset;. ^green;Upgrade your Alchemy Table^reset; to access it.": "基本がわかったら、^orange;化学ラボ^reset;で必須の^orange;DNAサンプル^reset;を作ってみよう。^green;錬金テーブルをアップグレード^reset;して手に入れよう",
  "Without DNA, you'll have a hard time doing much xenobiology. You can't create or modify life without this resource. Stockpile it!": "DNAがなければ異種生物学はほとんどできない。この資源なしに生命を創造・改変することはできない。常にストックしておこう",
  "Critical Minerals": "重要な鉱物",
  "Next up: ^orange;Mineral Samples^reset;. Make some in your ^orange;Chemistry Lab^reset;. Like DNA samples they are ^green;essential^reset; in lab use.": "次は^orange;鉱物サンプル^reset;だ。^orange;化学ラボ^reset;で作ろう。DNAサンプルと同じくラボでの使用に^green;不可欠^reset;だ",
  "With mineral and DNA samples in your possession you've opened up a whole new world of research and possibility. Now you should upgrade to a ^orange;Bio-Chem Lab^reset; for even more advanced research!": "鉱物サンプルとDNAサンプルを手に入れたことで、全く新しい研究と可能性の世界が開けた",
  "AI is expressly forbidden on my homeworld. But I need an ^orange;AI Chip^reset; for my research! Can you please bring me one? I would reward you nicely.": "私の母星ではAIは明確に禁止されている。だが研究に^orange;AIチップ^reset;が必要なんだ！一つ持ってきてくれないか？十分な報酬を出そう",
  "Thanks. I've transferred payment for your troubles directly to your account.": "ありがとう。手間賃は直接あなたの口座に送金した",
  "Centrifusion": "遠心融合",
  "If you want to advance your lab, you are going to want ^orange;Lab Centrifuge^reset;. Without one, you can't get ^green;an advanced centrifuge^reset; to produce high-end fissionable materials. Make a ^orange;Lab Centrifuge^reset; in a ^orange;Power Station^reset; and bring it to me.": "ラボを進化させたいなら^orange;ラボ遠心分離機^reset;が必要だ。これがないと^green;高度な遠心分離機^reset;は手に入らない",
  "When you are able to, ^green;upgrade to an advanced centrifuge^reset; to really step up your lab game!": "できるようになったら、^green;高度な遠心分離機にアップグレード^reset;してラボを本格的に強化しよう！",
  "Hardware Matters": "ハードウェアの問題",
  "Instructive: Now that you have ^orange;Silicon^reset; and ^orange;Copper Wire^reset; why not combine the two at your ^orange;Matter Assembler^reset; and craft a ^orange;Silicon Board^reset;?": "教育的: ^orange;シリコン^reset;と^orange;銅線^reset;があるなら、^orange;マター・アセンブラー^reset;で組み合わせて^orange;回路基板^reset;を作ってみてはどうだ",
  "Encouraging: You will need a large amount of boards, for they are the building block of many more advanced chipsets.": "励まし: 基板は大量に必要になる。より高度なチップセットの基礎となるものだからだ",
  "Powdery Power": "粉のパワー",
  "I've heard of ^orange;Powder Sifters^reset; before but have never seen one in action. Build one in a ^orange;Power Station^reset; and bring it to me, and maybe I'll help you out.": "^orange;パウダーシフター^reset;の噂は聞いたが実物を見たことがない。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で一つ作って持ってきてくれ",
  "As promised, your reward. May this ^green;cash^reset; serve you well!": "約束通り報酬だ。この^green;ピクセル^reset;が役に立つことを願う！",
  "Powered stations are a ^green;huge productivity booster^reset;. To start with, you'll need a ^orange;Solar Panel^reset; to produce energy. Build one on a ^orange;Power Station^reset;.": "電力付きステーションは^green;生産性を大幅に向上^reset;させる。まず^orange;ソーラーパネル^reset;を作ってエネルギーを生産しよう",
  "Now you've started the engineering path of your adventure. I suggest getting some other machines up soon!": "冒険のエンジニアリングパスを歩み始めた。すぐに他の機械も立ち上げることをお勧めする！",
  "Long Distance Power": "遠距離送電",
  "Powered stations are a ^green;huge productivity booster^reset;. With a ^orange;Watcher^reset; they are even more versatile! Try crafting a ^orange;Watcher^reset; in your ^orange;Power Station^reset; and bring it to me.": "電力付きステーションは^green;生産性を大幅に向上^reset;させる。^orange;ウォッチャー^reset;があればさらに汎用性が上がる！^orange;ウォッチャー^reset;を一つ作ってみよう",
  "^orange;Watchers^reset; are special. They will keep powered devices within their range ^gray;(20 blocks)^reset; running while you are away, planetside. ^red;Leaving a planet will reset all of your Watchers.^reset; Your SAIL can only track so many before it slows down.^red;Don't over-use them^reset;.": "^orange;ウォッチャー^reset;は特別だ。範囲内^gray;（20ブロック）^reset;の電力装置を常時稼働させる",
  "I like it Hot!": "辛いのが好き！",
  "I love spicy foods but getting what I need here is a pain. Using a ^orange;Gene Design Lab^reset; could you perhaps make me some ^orange;Ignus Chili Seeds^reset;? I'd reward you for the effort.": "辛い料理は好きだがここで必要なものを手に入れるのは大変だ。^orange;遺伝子デザインラボ^reset;で^orange;イグナスチリの種^reset;を作ってくれないか",
  "I can't wait to make some chili with these! Take this ^green;alloy^reset;: it should do you more good than I. Enjoy.": "これでチリが作れる！この^green;合金^reset;を受け取ってくれ。私よりあなたの役に立つだろう",
  "Grass of Life": "生命の草",
  "I am in need of 3 ^orange;Miracle Grass^reset; seeds to try a new regeneration experiment. You'll find them at your ^orange;Gene Design Lab^reset;. Can you fetch me some?": "新しい再生実験のために^orange;ミラクルグラス^reset;の種が3つ必要だ。^orange;遺伝子デザインラボ^reset;で見つかるぞ",
  "Thanks, now I can complete this research project and wow the investors! ^green;I'll send replacement seeds^reset; later.": "ありがとう、これで研究を完了して投資家を驚かせられる！^green;替えの種は後で送る^reset;",
  "Mutavisk Headware": "ミュータヴィスクの頭飾り",
  "A task for you: Research ^cyan;Penumbrite Equipment^reset; and create a ^orange;Mutavisk Helm^reset;. I'll pay well for it, as I am in dire need.": "任務がある: ^cyan;ペナンブライト装備^reset;を研究して^orange;ミュータヴィスクヘルム^reset;を作ってくれ。十分な報酬を出そう",
  "Thanks to you, I can finally take a trip to an ^orange;Irradiated^reset; world with my complete ^orange;Mutavisk Armor Set^reset;!": "おかげで完全な^orange;ミュータヴィスクアーマーセット^reset;で^orange;汚染^reset;された世界に行ける",
  "Rad Leaves": "放射性の葉",
  "I'm trying to study this material but I have no radiation protection. Specifically, I would like some ^orange;Rad Leaf^reset; to ingest. Care to get me some?": "この物質を研究しようとしているが放射線防護がない。具体的には摂取するための^orange;ラドリーフ^reset;が欲しい。手に入れてくれないか",
  "It never hurts to help! And since you helped me, I'll help you. Here's a ^green;big bag of pixels^reset;!": "助けは常にありがたい！あなたが助けてくれたから、私も助けよう。^green;大きなピクセルの袋^reset;をどうぞ！",
  "Gene Splicing 101": "遺伝子スプライシング入門",
  "My ^orange;Xeno Lab^reset; is on the fritz, and I need 3 ^orange;Thornitox^reset; seeds for a client or I don't eat this month! Can you help me out?": "^orange;ゼノラボ^reset;が故障中で、クライアントのために^orange;ソーニトックス^reset;の種が3つ必要だ。助けてくれないか？",
  "Thanks so much. It's not much, but take this data I uncovered by scanning ^orange;Technology of the Ancients^reset;. Maybe you can make use of it.": "ありがとう。多くはないが、^orange;古代のテクノロジー^reset;をスキャンして見つけたこのデータを受け取ってくれ",
  "Silky Smooth": "シルキースムーズ",
  "Sweet. Now that you have a ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; we can really get working! The first plant you'll probably want to make is the ^orange;Bracken Tree^reset;, as the ^green;Silk^reset; it creates ultimately leads to ^green;Advanced Plastic^reset;. Try making some ^orange;Bracken Tree Seeds^reset; now.": "よし。^orange;温室^reset;ができたから本格的に始められるぞ！最初に作りたい植物は^orange;ブラッケンツリー^reset;だろう",
  "Bravo. You'll need ^green;a lot of plastic^reset; so keep stocked! Now let's help you see in the dark, shall we?": "よくやった。^green;プラスチックは大量に^reset;必要だからストックしておこう！次は暗闇で見えるようにしようか",
  "Cloning Trees": "木のクローン",
  "^orange;Cloning Labs^reset; have one single purpose: Making custom trees. Place one sapling on the left, one on the right and you're good to go!": "^orange;クローンラボ^reset;の目的はただ一つ: カスタムツリーの作成だ。左に苗木を一つ、右にもう一つ置けば準備完了！",
  "Advanced Textiles": "高度な繊維",
  "The ^orange;Mutavisk^reset; seed is extremely useful, being the sole source in the galaxy of the wonderous textile known as ^orange;Mutavisk Silk^reset;. Why not try crafting a few seeds? You'll need to upgrade to a ^green;more powerful lab^reset; first.": "^orange;ミュータヴィスク^reset;の種は非常に有用で、素晴らしい繊維^orange;ミュータヴィスクシルク^reset;の銀河唯一の供給源だ",
  "Now that you know the basics, you should be able to whip up a wide array of useful plants. Each provides different benefits, so tailor your farm to your personal needs!": "基本がわかったら、幅広い有用な植物を作れるはずだ。それぞれ異なる効果がある",
  "Light in the Darkness": "闇の中の光",
  "The ^orange;Oonforta^reset; is a weird but useful fungus. It produces light when thrown, and will be invaluable to you. Create some at your ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; and try them out!": "^orange;ウーンフォルタ^reset;は奇妙だが有用な菌類だ。投げると光を放ち、暗い洞窟の探索にとても役立つ",
  "Great work. Next, I suggest you start getting to work crafting ^orange;Mutavisk Seeds^reset; and start a farm. You'll want the textiles they can create fairly soon.": "これからは暗闇を恐れることはない。他にも多くの有用な植物がある。実験を続けよう",
  "Advanced Genetics": "高度な遺伝学",
  "Can you out-science me? I doubt it. If you think you can, prove it by bringing me a completed ^orange;Advanced Xeno Lab^reset;!": "私より優れた科学者だと？無理だろう。できるなら証明してみろ。完成した^orange;高度ゼノラボ^reset;を持ってこい！",
  "Well...I guess that settles it. I suck. Since you bested me fair and square, have these ^orange;Tech Cards^reset;": "まあ…決着がついたな。俺はダメだ。正々堂々と負けたから、この^orange;テックカード^reset;をやろう",
  "Smelting Masterclass": "精錬マスタークラス",
  "There is an expensive but ^green;very powerful^reset; piece of technology called an ^orange;Arc Smelter^reset; which will increase smelting yields a great deal. Prove you can build one with your ^orange;Power Station^reset; and I'll toss you a bonus.": "^orange;アーク精錬炉^reset;という高価だが^green;非常に強力^reset;な技術がある。精錬の収量を大幅に増やせる",
  "Fantastic work! Truly amazing. As promised, your reward: ^green;lots of money^reset;": "素晴らしい仕事だ！本当にすごい。約束通り報酬だ: ^green;大金^reset;",
  "Protective Measures": "防護措置",
  "I need to ^green;borrow^reset; an ^orange;Atmospheric Regulator^reset; so I can colonize a hostile world. You'll find it at your ^orange;Power Station^reset;. I'll need to keep it for a while but I'll pay top dollar for it.": "敵対的な世界を植民地化するために^orange;大気レギュレーター^reset;を^green;借りたい^reset;んだ。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で作れる",
  "Excellent, and the one I ordered is already on the way. There we go. As promised, ^green;a ton of money.^green;": "素晴らしい。注文した分はもう届いている。約束通り^green;大金^green;だ",
  "Augments": "オーグメント",
  "You're probably starting to have some issues surviving by now in different biomes. So let's get you building ^green;augments^reset;! Show me an ^orange;Acid Shield^reset; augment made by your own two hands!": "そろそろ各バイオームでの生存に苦労しているだろう。^green;オーグメント^reset;を作り始めよう！^orange;酸シールドオーグメント^reset;を見せてくれ",
  "Perhaps one day I might call on your talents to help me with a little problem I am having...I'll need to consider.": "いつか私の小さな問題を手伝ってもらうかもしれない…考えておこう",
  "Dark Stained Glass": "暗い色ガラス",
  "Do you have a ^orange;Blast Furnace^reset; yet? If so, try to smelt ^orange;Obsidian^reset; and bring me the results. I will be most grateful for your assistance.": "^orange;ブラストファーネス^reset;はあるか？あるなら^orange;黒曜石^reset;を精錬して結果を持ってきてくれ。大変ありがたい",
  "Fantastic work! Truly amazing. Thank you for the help. As thanks, here's payment for your troubles.": "素晴らしい仕事だ！本当にすごい。手伝いに感謝する。お礼に報酬を",
  "Smelting Champion": "精錬チャンピオン",
  "If you can build a ^orange;Blast Furnace^reset; with a ^orange;Power Station^reset; and bring it here, so I can analyze it, I would prove most grateful and perhaps reward you.": "^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で^orange;ブラストファーネス^reset;を作ってここに持ってきてくれ。分析したいんだ。感謝するし報酬も出そう",
  "Extraction 101": "抽出入門",
  "Any self-respecting scientist has an ^orange;Extraction Lab^reset;. It's like sorcery! Stuff goes in, better stuff comes out! Make one in your ^orange;Auto-Assembler^reset;.": "まともな科学者なら^orange;抽出ラボ^reset;は必須だ。魔法みたいなもので、素材を入れるともっと良いものが出てくる！^orange;オート・アセンブラー^reset;で作ろう",
  "You'll have limitless options when it comes to using that thing. Try building some other science stations now, such as a ^orange;Bio-Chem Lab^reset;.": "使い道は無限大だ。^orange;バイオケムラボ^reset;など他のサイエンスステーションも作ってみよう",
  "Quaid's Start": "クエイドの始まり",
  "You can generate a lot of power with a ^orange;Fission Reactor^reset; in your lab. Show you can make one using your ^orange;Power Station^reset; and you can have this ^green;crew contract^reset;. I don't have room for crew on my ship anyhow.": "^orange;核分裂リアクター^reset;でラボに大量の電力を供給できる。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で作れることを証明してくれ",
  "Great! As thanks: This ^green;contract^reset; will allow you to recruit a ^cyan;unique^reset; hired crewmember!": "よし！お礼にこの^green;契約書^reset;をやろう。^cyan;ユニーク^reset;な雇用クルーを募集できる！",
  "Proto-Potency": "プロトの力",
  "There is a rare metal native ^red;only^reset; to ^orange;Proto Worlds^reset; that I am in dire need of. I need 2 ^orange;Protocite Bars^reset;. You can smelt them in a ^orange;Fission Furnace^reset;.": "^orange;プロトワールド^reset;^red;のみ^reset;に産出する希少な金属が切実に必要だ。^orange;プロトサイトのインゴット^reset;を2つくれ",
  "Without ^green;protocite^reset; you won't be able to make some of the more essential high-end gear. So stay stocked! In return for that bit of help, perhaps try ^green;this thing^reset; on!": "^green;プロトサイト^reset;がなければ上級装備は作れない。常にストックしておこう！お礼に",
  "Shortest distance is zero": "最短距離はゼロ",
  "I am in dire need of your assistance. I need a ^orange;Teleporter Core^reset; to finish my teleporter, but ^green;the courier delivering my supplies is late^reset; and I'm running out of time. You can craft one in your ^orange;Matter Assembler^reset;.": "助力が切実に必要だ。テレポーターを完成させるのに^orange;テレポーターコア^reset;が必要だが、^green;配達業者が遅れている^reset;",
  "Without ^orange;Teleporter Cores^reset;, you won't be able to craft several useful technologies. Plus, teleporters are just plain fun!!! Oh, there's the courier with ^green;your replacement core^reset;.": "^orange;テレポーターコア^reset;がなければいくつかの便利な技術を作れない。それにテレポーターは単純に便利だ",
  "Three is a crowd": "三は群衆",
  "You can generate a lot of power with a ^orange;Fission Reactor^reset; in your lab. Show you can make one using your ^orange;Power Station^reset; and bring me some ^orange;Tritium^reset;.": "^orange;核分裂リアクター^reset;でラボに大量の電力を供給できる。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で作って^orange;トリチウム^reset;を持ってきてくれ",
  "^orange;Tritium^reset; is actually quite useful, you can throw it in a centrifuge or use it for fuel.": "^orange;トリチウム^reset;は実はかなり使える。遠心分離機に入れたり燃料にしたりできる",
  "Homestead I": "ホームステッド I",
  "Hi there! I've not seen another new soul besides that ^green;slug-lookin' feller^reset; in a long time. If yer fixin' to escape this world, I kin help a bit, maybe. Bring me say...^orange;5 potatoes^reset;, and we'll talk. A ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; might help you make some, in a pinch.": "よう！あの^green;ナメクジみたいなやつ^reset;以来、新参者を見たのは久しぶりだ。この世界から脱出するつもりなら、少しは手を貸せるぜ",
  "Thanks fer the tasty tots, friend. As a thanks, you can have this store of ^green;Iron Ore^reset; my grand-papa kept around when this place was still nice. T'aint worth a thing to me, but it'll sure be useful for you!": "美味いポテトをありがとう。お礼にじいちゃんが持っていた^green;鉄鉱石^reset;のストックをやろう",
  "Armament": "武装",
  "I t'aint much fer fightin', lemme tell you. But in a pinch, I's been known ter swing a fist or two. But fists ain't gonna cut it. You'll be needin' somethin' more dangerous. Try making": "俺は戦いが得意じゃないんだ。でもいざとなったら拳の一つや二つは振れる。だが拳じゃ足りない。もっと強いものが必要だ",
  "Homestead II": "ホームステッド II",
  "I've got a tip for you: You can make ^orange;Paper^reset; in a ^orange;Furnace^reset;! I could use say, ^orange;10^reset; pieces. I'm fixin' to write some letters to loved ones.": "いいことを教えよう: ^orange;炉^reset;で^orange;紙^reset;が作れるぞ！^orange;10^reset;枚くれないか。手紙を書きたいんだ",
  "It may not seem like much...but paper will come in handy when yer least expectin' it. Besides, it's great for writin', no matter how pretty a computer can make things look.": "大したことなさそうだが…紙は思いがけない時に役に立つ。それに、どんな場所でも書き物には最高だ",
  "Homestead III (pt 1)": "ホームステッド III（前編）",
  "Ya ever come across ^orange;Oil^reset;? It's quite rare round these 'ere parts. I hear ye kin get some without much hassle by tossin ^orange;Corn^reset; or ^orange;Bone^reset; in a ^orange;Hand Mill^reset;.": "^orange;オイル^reset;に出会ったことは？このあたりじゃかなり希少だ。^orange;トウモロコシ^reset;や^orange;ブドウ^reset;を抽出機に入れれば手間なく手に入るらしいぞ",
  "Oil kin be quite useful for a number o' things, but I suggest you save that ^orange;Oil^reset; for a very different task. Talk ter me again ta learn more.": "オイルは色々使えるが、全く別の用途のために取っておくことを勧める。隣のやつに話しかけてみな",
  "Homestead III (pt 2)": "ホームステッド III（後編）",
  "Sometimes, the darkness can prove a horrible hindrance. That's where tha ^orange;Oil^reset; I got ya ter make comes in: You can craft a ^orange;Lantern Stick^reset; to see in the dark at a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;. ^green;Research^reset; into ^orange;Agriculture^reset; to learn how.": "暗闇は時にひどい障害になる。そこで作ってもらった^orange;オイル^reset;の出番だ: ^orange;ランタンスティック^reset;を作れる",
  "Now you'll be able to slap that on your back and travel without needing to hold a flashlight! Also, I found some ^orange;Plant Fibre^reset; in storage. Why don't you take it?": "これを背中に付ければ懐中電灯を持たずに旅できるぞ！あと、^orange;植物繊維^reset;も見つけたからやろう",
  "Homestead IV": "ホームステッド IV",
  "I'm lookin' to acquire some ^orange;Silver^reset;, but I ain't no good in enclosed spaces. ^green;Rarer ores are more commonly found at depths below the surface^reset;. ^orange;1 Silver Bar^reset; should be plenty. You'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; into ^orange;Geology^reset; to learn how.": "^orange;銀^reset;を手に入れたいんだが、閉所は苦手でな。^green;希少な鉱石は地表より下の深部で^reset;よく見つかる",
  "I kin finally make ^green;Clementine^reset; the ^orange;symbol of our love^reset; I always promised 'afore her tragic passing back in '72. Take this and my thanks, friend.": "やっと^green;クレメンタイン^reset;に約束してた^orange;愛の象徴^reset;を作れる。地球で悲劇的に亡くなる前に約束したんだ",
  "Homestead V": "ホームステッド V",
  "I've heard of some fancy stuff in my day, but I'd most like ta see me a ^orange;Mining Laser^reset; 'afore I die. I heard you kin make one in a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset;. That's ^orange;Researched^reset; in the ^orange;Engineering^reset; sciences.": "色んなすごいものを聞いてきたが、死ぬ前に^orange;マイニングレーザー^reset;を見たいんだ。^orange;ティンカリングテーブル^reset;で作れるらしいぞ",
  "You've made an ol' Novakid happy today. Thanks so much, friend. Take this unusual stone I found as a thanks. It looks valuable.": "老いたノヴァキッドを幸せにしてくれた。ありがとう、友よ。お礼に見つけたこの珍しい石をやろう。価値がありそうだ",
  "Silicon Knight": "シリコンナイト",
  "With a ^orange;Hand Mill^reset; you can start cutting your teeth on all sorts of new creations. Try getting at least 50 ^orange;Sand^reset; and extracting it to get some ^orange;Silicon^reset;.": "^orange;ハンドミル^reset;があれば色々な新しいものを作り始められる。^orange;砂^reset;を50個以上集めて抽出してみよう",
  "Encouraging results! Try the same thing with other materials such as wood, dirt, stone...heck, almost anything really. You'll find all sorts of things if you just give it a try!": "いい結果だ！木、土、石…ほぼ何でも同じことを試してみろ。面白いものが見つかるぞ",
  "The Extractor": "抽出機",
  "So you now have a ^orange;Hand Mill^reset; or ^orange;Extraction Lab^reset;, but aren't sure what to do with it? It's simple, really. Go place it somewhere, and toss a bunch of ^green;logs^reset; in there. 10 should do. Create 10 ^orange;Methanol^reset; with them.": "^orange;ハンドミル^reset;か^orange;抽出ラボ^reset;を手に入れたが使い方がわからない？簡単だ。どこかに設置して素材を入れてみよう",
  "That, my friend, is how you make ^orange;Methanol^reset; from scratch. Now let's move on to ^orange;Cobblestone^reset;!": "これが一から^orange;メタノール^reset;を作る方法だ。次は^orange;丸石^reset;でやってみよう！",
  "The Extractor II": "抽出機 II",
  "Next, why don't you go and fetch 50 ^green;of nearly any natural tile^reset; and toss it in your extractor. ^orange;Research^reset; should be produced.": "次に^green;ほぼ全ての天然タイル^reset;を50個集めて抽出機に入れてみよう。^orange;リサーチ^reset;が生産されるはずだ",
  "I think maybe you're starting to see how this works. Depending on the resource you input, the outcome will vary. ^orange;Research^reset; is common, and can be stockpiled as a currency.": "使い方がわかってきただろう。投入する素材によって結果が変わる",
  "The Extractor III": "抽出機 III",
  "If you have spare ^orange;Dirt^reset;...and you certainly will...^green;why not extract it^reset;? You'll get something useful for 50 ^orange;Dirt^reset;.": "余っている^orange;土^reset;があるなら…絶対あるだろう…^green;抽出してみないか^reset;？50個の^orange;土^reset;から何か便利なものが出る",
  "See? Not so hard. Let's move on, shall we?": "ほら？そんなに難しくない。先に進もう",
  "The Extractor IV": "抽出機 IV",
  "^orange;Plant Fibre^reset; is plentiful enough that extracting some for a little ^green;tissue culture^reset; won't hurt. Bring me 5.": "^orange;植物繊維^reset;は十分に豊富だから、少し抽出して^green;組織培養^reset;を得ても痛くない。5つ持ってきてくれ",
  "You're doing great. As a thanks, take this. It's rare, but it might come in handy some day.": "よくやっている。お礼にこれを。珍しいが、いつか役に立つかもしれない",
  "The Extractor V": "抽出機 V",
  "^green;Meat^reset; is both delicious and useful. Extract some ^green;meat^reset; and bring me 5 of the results.": "^green;肉^reset;は美味しくて有用だ。^green;肉^reset;を抽出して結果を5つ持ってきてくれ",
  "Genetic material comes from many things, not just meat. Remember that if it is alive and full of cells, it just might give you some.": "遺伝素材は肉だけから出るわけではない。生きていて細胞があるものなら何でも手に入る可能性がある",
  "^orange;Water^reset; is never in short supply. If you have upgraded your ^orange;Matter Manipulator^reset; to pick up liquids...^green;extract some^reset;, ^yellow;come to the Science Outpost^reset; and bring me 5 ^orange;Hydrogen^reset; if you don't mind?": "^orange;水^reset;は不足することがない。^orange;マターマニピュレーター^reset;を液体回収にアップグレードしたなら…^green;抽出してみよう^reset;",
  "Great. Thanks so very much. Now I can complete this power cell! Take this as payment for your deeds.": "ありがとう。これでこのパワーセルを完成できる！お礼にこれを",
  "Path of the Hunter": "狩人の道",
  "Hunting will help you obtain resources such as ^green;Raw Meat^reset;, ^green;Leather^reset; and ^orange;Bone^reset;. Try making a ^orange;Primitive Spear^reset; in your ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu under the Weapons tab.": "狩猟で^green;生肉^reset;、^green;レザー^reset;、^orange;骨^reset;などの素材が手に入る。^orange;原始的な槍^reset;を作ってみよう",
  "You can also hunt using ^orange;Bows^reset; or ^orange;Throwing Spears^reset; and ^orange;Hunting Rifles^reset;. It will be critical to your survival, as the primary means to gather ^orange;Raw Meat^reset; for cooking and eating.": "^orange;弓^reset;や^orange;投げ槍^reset;、^orange;狩猟ライフル^reset;でも狩りができる。上達が大切だ",
  "Alchemy": "錬金術",
  "Chemistry is a science that will allow you to create all sorts of useful things. Build an ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; to give it a shot. You'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; the ^orange;Chemistry^reset; sciences.": "化学は色々な便利なものを作れる科学だ。^orange;錬金テーブル^reset;を作って試してみよう",
  "Nicely done. Now you'll need to find some space for this in your own base.": "よくできた。次は自分の拠点にスペースを確保しよう",
  "Armorworks": "アーマーワークス",
  "With an ^orange;Armorworks^reset; you can fashion weapons and armor. Upgraded, it provides tons of variety. Try building an ^orange;Armorworks^reset; now. You'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; into ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset;.": "^orange;アーマーワークス^reset;で武器と防具を作れる。アップグレードすると種類が大幅に増える。今すぐ作ってみよう",
  "Don't forget to upgrade this station whenever you have the resources to do so. It is absolutely worth the effort.": "リソースがあればこのステーションを必ずアップグレードしよう。絶対にその価値がある",
  "Powered Up": "パワーアップ",
  "Now that you have a firm concept of how to use your well-earned resources, perhaps it is time we delve into something more cerebral? You can start by making an ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;. Conduct ^orange;Research^reset; into ^orange;Electronics^reset; to get started.": "苦労して得た資源の使い方がしっかりわかったところで、もっと知的なことに取り組もうか？^orange;エレクトロニクスセンター^reset;を作ることから始めよう",
  "This will really bring your lab to the next level! I recommend learning to use an ^orange;Item Transference Device^reset; as soon as you can. It is a truly powerful piece of technology when paired with ^orange;Terminals^reset; and powered machinery.": "これでラボが次のレベルに！^orange;アイテム転送装置^reset;の使い方もすぐ覚えることをお勧めする",
  "With a ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; in your home you can craft all sorts of plants that bestow ^green;fantastic buffs and abilities^reset; to make your life easier. Build a ^orange;Greenhouse^orange; now. You'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; into ^orange;Agriculture^reset;.": "^orange;温室^reset;があれば、生活を楽にする^green;素晴らしいバフや能力^reset;を与える植物を作れる",
  "Don't forget that certain plants are ^green;almost essential^reset; for a viable gene-research laboratory. At the very least, you'll want ^orange;Mutavisk Seeds^reset; and ^orange;Bracken Tree Seeds^reset; for the resources they produce.": "特定の植物は遺伝子研究ラボに^green;ほぼ不可欠^reset;だ。最低限必要なのは",
  "Growing": "栽培",
  "While you can farm the old-fashioned way with a hoe , dirt and your own two hands there is another option: ^orange;Growing Trays^reset;. Build one of these at a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset; now, if you have researched it in ^oraange;Agriculture^reset;.": "鍬と土と自分の手で昔ながらの農業もできるが、別の選択肢もある: ^orange;栽培トレイ^reset;だ。^orange;パワーステーション^reset;で作ろう",
  "In the first slot, place 3 seeds. In the second, place a liquid to feed the plant with. The third slot is for fertilizer. ^green;Different fertilizers^reset; will result in ^green;different production and growth rates^reset; for plants.": "最初のスロットに種を3つ、2番目に液体、3番目に肥料を入れよう。^green;電力が必要だぞ^reset;",
  "Ship Repairs": "宇宙船修理",
  "Perhaps this friendly creature can help me ^green;repair the ship^reset; and get away from this star system. I'll need to work at it either way, using my ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; to conduct research whenever I can.": "このフレンドリーな生き物が^green;宇宙船の修理^reset;を手伝ってくれるかもしれない。^orange;マシニングテーブル^reset;を使って頑張るしかない",
  "Thanks to ^green;Vinalisj^reset;, you've managed your first steps towards escaping this planet. He asked you to visit a nearby ^orange;Dark Cavern^reset;, which seems to have an ^green;Energy Source^reset; that may prove vital in your repairs.": "^green;ヴィナリシュ^reset;のおかげで、この惑星からの脱出への第一歩を踏み出せた",
  "Repairing Your Teleporter": "テレポーターの修理",
  "Use your ^orange;Machining Table^reset; now, and create 9 ^orange;Wire^reset; and bring them to me. I'll jury-rig a fix for your ^green;Teleporter^reset; so that you can ^green;warp to distant locations^reset; such as the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset;!": "^orange;マシニングテーブル^reset;で^orange;ワイヤー^reset;を9つ作って持ってきてくれ。^green;テレポーター^reset;を応急修理しよう",
  "I was ^green;testing your worth^reset; and you passed the test. Your mind is sharp, and I think you'll be an asset to the scientific community. Thank you, ^orange;Agent^reset;.": "^green;あなたの価値を試していた^reset;が、見事に合格した。鋭い頭脳の持ち主だ。科学アウトポストの力になるだろう",
  "Rock Breaking": "岩砕き",
  "The ^orange;Sifter^reset; is great for pulling apart loose materials, but to break up ^green;stone types^reset; like ^orange;cobblestone^reset; or ^orange;conglomerate^reset; you'll need a ^orange;Rock Breaker^reset;. Build one now at your ^orange;Electronics Center^;.": "^orange;シフター^reset;はバラバラの素材には向いているが、^orange;丸石^reset;や^orange;礫岩^reset;のような^green;石タイプ^reset;を砕くには^orange;ロックブレーカー^reset;が必要だ",
  "Compared to the Sifter, the Rock Breaker is slower and needs more power, but it allows for much more resource extracting than the Sifter alone. Upgrade to a ^orange;Rock Crusher^reset; when you can, as those are much more efficient.": "シフターと比べてロックブレーカーは遅くて電力も必要だが、はるかに多くの資源を抽出できる",
  "^orange;Sprouting Tables^reset; and ^orange;Xeno Labs^reset; are useful devices that extract ^orange;Genes^reset; from plant seeds. You will most certainly require them, so ^orange;go ahead and make a ^orange;Sprouting Table^reset; now^reset;.": "^orange;発芽テーブル^reset;と^orange;ゼノラボ^reset;は植物の種から^orange;遺伝子^reset;を抽出する便利な装置だ。間違いなく必要になる",
  "Try tossing some seeds in there, and wait a bit. You'll soon get some ^orange;Genes^reset; that you can stockpile to create ^green;new types of plants^reset; in the ^orange;Greenhouse.^reset;": "種を入れて少し待ってみよう。^orange;遺伝子^reset;が手に入り、^green;新しい植物^reset;を作る材料になる",
  "Without a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; you'll be hard-pressed to create ^green;augments, upgrades and specialist tools^reset;. When you get a chance, ^orange;Research^reset; into ^orange;Engineering^reset; and build one for me.": "^orange;ティンカリングテーブル^reset;がなければ^green;オーグメント、アップグレード、専門ツール^reset;を作るのは難しい",
  "Might I recommend starting with a ^orange;Mining Laser?^reset; They are truly effective tools to use for rapidly digging through dirt!": "このステーションは非常に万能で、大量の便利なアイテムを作れる",
  "A ^green;centrifuge^reset; allows you to separate liquid from material, and more. There are several types of these devices, but we'll start simple: build a ^orange;Wooden Centrifuge^reset; to get started.": "^green;遠心分離機^reset;で液体と素材を分離できる。いくつかの種類がある",
  "While not incredibly effective, a ^orange;Wooden Centrifuge^reset; is able to process basic liquids and grind up honeycombs to get at the goodies inside. As soon as possible, upgrade to an ^orange;Iron Centrifuge^reset; for far more utility.": "遠心分離機をアップグレードすれば、さらに多くの可能性が広がる",
  "Sifting": "ふるい分け",
  "If you have stacks of loose grit like ^orange;silt^reset;, ^orange;Gravel^reset; or ^green;other powdery materials^reset; then just toss them in a ^orange;Sifter^reset; and you can pull resources right out of them! Build a ^orange;Sifter^reset; when you can do so.": "^orange;シルト^reset;や^orange;砂利^reset;など^green;粉状の素材^reset;の山があるなら^orange;シフター^reset;で分離できる",
  "Sifters are terribly inefficient and slow, so as soon as you can I advise upgrading to a ^orange;Powder Sifter^reset; at an Electronics Center.": "シフターは電力が必要だが、素材の分離には非常に便利だ",
  "Hand Mills and Extractors": "ハンドミルと抽出機",
  "Without ^green;Extraction Devices^reset; progression in FU will be arduous. These wonderful devices ^green;take resource stacks and convert them into useful stuff^reset;. Create a ^orange;Hand Mill^reset; built at a ^orange;Machining Table^reset;. You can ^green;Research^reset; it in the ^orange;Engineering^reset; branch.": "^green;抽出装置^reset;がなければFUの進行は困難だ。これらの素晴らしい装置は^green;素材を投入するとより良い物を産出^reset;する",
  "You can also place food, seeds, meats and numerous other goods into extractors. ^green;Try everything you can^reset;. You never know what you'll discover! Upgrading to an ^orange;Extraction Lab^reset; will allow you to work ^green;much^reset; faster.": "抽出は素材加工の核心だ。様々な素材を試してみよう",
  "Feeling Thirsty?": "喉が渇いた？",
  "A ^orange;Well^reset; is extremely important, for it provides life-giving ^orange;Water^reset; for numerous purposes. Build one at a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;. Once it fills for a while, harvest some ^orange;Water^reset;.": "^orange;井戸^reset;は非常に重要だ。様々な用途に必要な命の水^orange;水^reset;を供給してくれる",
  "Water in wells will gradually increase. When you have 100 or more, you can harvest it. It can be used in crafting, thrown to create lakes or placed in a Hydroponics Tray.": "水は多くのレシピに必要だ。常に確保しておこう",
  "Stab for Noms": "刺して食料",
  "When you're starving, you have some options. A ^orange;Campfire^reset; cooks your meat. It's fast, but you'll need a ^green;bow^reset;, ^orange;Hunting Spear^reset;, ^orange;Bone Spear^reset; or ^orange;Hunting Rifle^reset; to obtain the meat. Get some and cook it. Then noms.": "飢えている時にはいくつかの選択肢がある。^orange;キャンプファイヤー^reset;で肉を焼ける。早いが、^green;狩猟スキル^reset;が必要だ",
  "You can craft a ^orange;Hoe^reset;, but take mine instead. Try making a viable farm! It will feed you and could even lead to a thriving community if you built a ^orange;Colony^reset; by placing a ^green;Colony Deed^reset;.": "調理すると食品の効果が向上する。生肉より調理済みの方がはるかに良い",
  "Incubation": "孵化",
  "An ^orange;Incubator^reset; might be a worthwhile idea if you want to hatch eggs! With it, you can toss in an egg and quickly generate a baby animal. Well, quicker than letting nature handle it, anyhow. Make one at a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;.": "卵を孵化させたいなら^orange;インキュベーター^reset;が良い。卵を入れればすぐに生き物が産まれる",
  "Try incubating different eggs, and see what sort of wonderful animals you can bring to life!": "インキュベーターは牧場運営の第一歩だ",
  "Feeding Livestock": "家畜の餌やり",
  "^green;Livestock^reset; grow a whole lot faster when you toss them some ^orange;Cattle Feed^reset; to munch on. Grind up ^orange;Corn^reset; in your ^orange;Hand Mill^reset; to get some. Then place it in a ^orange;Trough^reset; crafted from a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;.": "^green;家畜^reset;は^orange;飼料^reset;を与えるとずっと早く成長する。植物素材を挽いて作れる",
  "Animals do not produce resources unless they are fed and happy. Keeping them fed means lots of resources. The happier they are, the faster they will produce for you! Just feed them what they actually eat! Mooshi do not enjoy meat, and raptors hate carrots.": "家畜はレザー、肉、その他の有用な素材の優れた供給源だ",
  "Power Source": "電力源",
  "An ^orange;Alternator^reset; provides you with power. To fuel it, you'll need ^green;wood or coal^reset;. To wire it to things, you'll first need to unlock ^orange;Wiring^reset; on your ^orange;Matter Manipulator^reset; or build a ^orange;Mechanic's Wrench^reset;.": "^orange;オルタネーター^reset;で電力を供給できる。燃料には^green;木材か石炭^reset;が必要だ。配線で機械に接続しよう",
  "Try throwing some ^orange;Coal or Wood^reset; in there now to give your new ^orange;Alternator^reset; some life!": "電力のある生活は快適だ。より高度な発電機も試してみよう",
  "Sifters": "シフター",
  "A ^orange;Sifter^reset; requires power, but allows you to toss in ^orange;Sand^reset;, ^orange;Dirt^reset; and ^green;other loose materials^reset; and sift for hidden goodies. Very useful. Though the wood sifter is quite slow, one cannot complain about free resources. Try building a ^orange;Sifter^reset; now.": "^orange;シフター^reset;は電力が必要だが、^orange;砂^reset;や^orange;土^reset;など^green;粉状の素材^reset;を有用な物に分離できる",
  "If you want to step up your game, try creating a ^orange;Item Transference Device^reset; and a ^orange;Storage Bridge^reset;, then link them to the ^green;Sifter^reset;! It can automatically move the items from machines (such as a ^orange;Sifter^reset;) to a storage container, or vice versa!": "シフターは非常に便利だ。砂から得られるものには驚くだろう",
  "Using the Sprouting Table": "発芽テーブルの使い方",
  "So you've built a ^orange;Sprouting Table^reset;? Why are you looking so clueless? It's simple: Toss in a ^orange;Potato Seed^reset; and wait about 60 seconds. You'll get a useful ^green;Gene^reset; for your botany research, or other goods": "^orange;発芽テーブル^reset;を作った？そんな困った顔するな。簡単だ: ^orange;ジャガイモの種^reset;を入れてみろ",
  "Constructing a ^orange;Xeno Lab^reset; upon upgrading your ^orange;Machining Table^reset; is a good idea, as they are ^green;much faster^reset;! Effectively every plant seed can be placed within seed labs, and each one will produce ^green;Genes^reset;.": "種を入れると遺伝子が抽出される。これは遺伝子研究の基盤だ",
  "The Outpost": "アウトポスト",
  "In the furthest reaches of the galaxy is the Ark, a structure built by the Ancients to seal away the Ruin. I've marked the location ^green;in my ships SAIL^reset; so I can teleport there.": "アウトポストには様々な商人やサービスがある。定期的に訪れよう",
  "The Science Outpost": "サイエンスアウトポスト",
  "^orange;Vinalisj^reset; has just informed me of a place he operates. This ^orange;Science Outpost^reset; sounds worth visiting. I've marked the location ^green;in my ships SAIL^reset; so I can teleport there.": "サイエンスアウトポストにはFUの進行に役立つ商人やクエストがたくさんある",
  "Craft Machining Table": "マシニングテーブルの作成",
  "You've been tasked with creating a ^orange;Machining Table^white;. ^green;Build one on your default crafting menu [C]^reset; to complete this task.": "^orange;マシニングテーブル^white;を作る任務だ。^green;デフォルトのクラフトメニュー[C]で作ろう^reset;",
  "Great! This card contains directions to the facility I spoke of. There are many fellow scientists there with whom you can meet!": "マシニングテーブルはFUのあらゆるクラフトの基盤となる",
  "Your Mech and You": "メックとあなた",
  "Mechs are quite useful, but basic models are barely space-worthy and generally clunky. You'll want to ^green;Research^reset; into ^cyan;Engineering^reset; and build some ^orange;Stock Mech Legs^reset; to replace the awful basic model.": "メックは非常に便利だが、基本モデルは宇宙航行にかろうじて耐え、概して不格好だ。^green;リサーチ^reset;でアップグレードしよう",
  "You can further improve on those legs, too, by upgrading them once more into ^orange;Improved Mech Legs^reset;. The same applies to your ^green;Boosters^reset;.": "メックのパーツをアップグレードすることで、宇宙での生存能力が大幅に向上する",
  "The Mech Tablet": "メックタブレット",
  "^orange;Mechs^reset; are powerful machines that can really make your life easier! To make the most out of one, you need a ^orange;Mech Tablet^reset;. Try your new ^orange;Mech Tablet^reset; out now! Primary fire activates the configuration screen, and with the secondary fire you can set your mechs fuel!": "メックタブレットでメックの能力を大幅に強化できる",
  "The Tech Tablet": "テックタブレット",
  "^orange;Techs^reset; are extremely useful, and have quite varied applications to suit almost any niche. Increased speed, double jump, and so many other things. You can change your techs around with a ^orange;Tech Tablet^reset; or a ^orange;Tech Console^reset;. Try your ^orange;Tech Tablet^reset; out now!": "テックタブレットで新しいテックを研究・アンロックできる",
  "Upgrading Gear": "装備のアップグレード",
  "Most ^orange;Weapons, Armor and Tools^reset; can be ^green;Upgraded^reset; with your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;. Just click the button that looks like a ^green;Manipulator Module^reset;! It'll cost either ^orange;Upgrade Modules^reset; or ^orange;Manipulator Modules^reset; to do it.": "アップグレードは装備の性能を大幅に向上させる。素材が手に入ったら積極的に強化しよう",
  "Madness Tracker": "狂気トラッカー",
  "Tracks madness values.": "狂気の値を追跡する",
  "Tracking Insanity": "狂気の値を追跡する",
  "Mech Fuel Tracker": "メック燃料トラッカー",
  "Tracks mech data. Do not cancel.": "メックデータを追跡する。キャンセルしないでください",
  "Should never be completed, nor fail!": "メックデータを追跡する",
  "The Master Manipulator": "マスターマニピュレーター",
  "The Master Manipulator is now mine. It seems that if I am to fully be able to use it, however, I'll first need to ^orange;repair it at a nanofabricator^reset;": "マスターマニピュレーターの残骸を回収した",
  "I have obtained the ultimate in Manipulator tech and bound it to my genetic code. I can mine nearly anything with the greatest of ease.": "マスターマニピュレーターの力が覚醒し始めた",
  "The Broken Master Manipulator": "壊れたマスターマニピュレーター",
  "I should recover the Master Manipulator...or what's left of it, anyways. Khe probably has it at the Science Outpost, I saw her even though she tried to be sneaky.": "マスターマニピュレーターを回収しなければ…残骸だけでも。サイエンスアウトポストのケーが持っているはず",
  "This powerful morphite manipulator is pretty great. A more powerful way to mine? Gimme.": "この強力なモルファイトマニピュレーターはなかなかのものだ。より強力な採掘方法？もらおう",
  "With this powerful tool I should be able to make short work of most blocks.": "採掘能力が大幅に向上した",
  "The Quantum Manipulator": "量子マニピュレーター",
  "Rather than deconstruct matter, why not completely rewrite it however you please?": "物質を分解するのではなく、好きなように完全に書き換えてみてはどうだ？",
  "Even more powerful than the Morphite manipulator, this sweet tool should be plenty powerful!": "量子レベルでの物質操作が可能になった",
  "The Precursor Manipulator": "プリカーサーマニピュレーター",
  "Taking the tech to entirely unthought power, this ancient technology is astounding.": "想像を超えるパワーを持つ古代技術は驚異的だ",
  "I doubt much in the universe can destroy matter faster than this. Challenge accepted?": "プリカーサーの力を手に入れた。究極のマニピュレーター",
  "Dark Imperator": "闇の覇者",
  "Next on da list, smacking da monkey. Okay, not that kind. Go kill a Big Ape.": "次のリストは、猿をぶっ叩くことだ。そっちの猿じゃない。ビッグエイプを殺しに行け",
  "Okay, mew is really really concerned now. New Kevin message. \"My fault. All my fault. ALL MY FAULT.\" Very unlike him. What his fault though?": "闇のビッグエイプを倒した。次の目標に進もう",
  "Of Dark Gods and Dark Falls": "闇の神々と闇の滝",
  "'...and then the hero met the devout.'...or was it 'devoured'? Sorry, missed a snack. Go to bird temple.": "「…そしてヒーローは敬虔な者に出会った」…いや「喰われた」だっけ？ごめん、おやつ食べ損ねた。鳥の神殿に行け",
  "No message, just breadcrumbs. Sadmew. Maybe this Kevin had clone-rot and went addle-brained.": "闇の神殿を制覇した",
  "A Darker Contest": "より暗き闘争",
  "Kevin went to an arena. Maybe to fight? Go there, kill things, and come back with energy signature. Be careful, this one feels...wrong. Really wrong.": "ケヴィンがアリーナに行った。戦いに？そこに行って敵を倒し、エネルギーシグネチャーを持ち帰れ。気をつけろ、厄介だぞ",
  "No Kevin, but energy signature there. Fresher. Kinda. Mew...keep going. Beacons here.": "闇のアリーナを制覇した。シグネチャーを回収",
  "Dark 'Lord' Volo Mort": "闇の「卿」ヴォロ・モート",
  "Signature leads to another nasty place full of awful badness. But it's best we have. Go win, bring shiny, and...no die. Okay?": "シグネチャーが別の恐ろしい場所に導いている。最善の手がかりだ。勝って、光り物を持ち帰り、…死ぬな",
  "Another dead body, another signature with a message. \"No sandwiches.\" This Kevin worries mew. Something isn't right.": "闇のヴォロ・モートを倒した",
  "Dark Flames": "暗黒の炎",
  "Another super bad place, you know da drill by now.": "また超やばい場所だ。もう手順はわかるだろ",
  "New signature, another message. Mew disapproves. Picture of Mantizi in codpiece armor. Not Kevin. Face upside down smiling. Kevin clue?": "暗黒の炎を消し去った",
  "Darkness among the Trees": "木々の中の闇",
  "Hero fetches artifacts, saves universe. Right? Not in other reality. Why not? Go find first one. See if Kevin was there.": "ヒーローがアーティファクトを集めて宇宙を救う。だろ？別の現実ではそうならなかった。なぜだ？最初の一つを探しに行け。ケヴィンがいたか確かめろ",
  "Kevin touched artifact, definitely, and...eww! He left it covered in raptor piss! Dirty stinker used it to etch 'Kevin was here' in the shiny. Hmm...have beacon with new signature though.": "闇のフローランの試練を乗り越えた",
  "Through the Darkness": "闇を越えて",
  "Mew. Kevin clone problem? It went to other reality. Bad things happened there, everything went wrong. Go open gate, get gate signature data.": "ニャー。ケヴィンのクローン問題？別の現実に行ったのだ。そこで悪いことが起きた。ゲートを開けて、光り物を取って帰ってこい",
  "Mew...gate signatures old. Sad kitty. More tracking needed. Have new beacon.": "ゲートを修復し、別の現実への道を開いた",
  "In Darkness Keep": "闇の砦にて",
  "Should be no surprise da next stop is da Baron's Keep. Off you go...": "次の目的地が男爵の砦なのは驚きじゃないだろ。さあ行ってこい…",
  "Okay, this not good. Signature data has many journal entries. Kevin found remains of different version of mew. Her inner shell had ruptured due to lack of noms. All da bad energies? In one word: ^red;Fallout^reset;...or is dat two?": "闇の男爵の砦を攻略した",
  "Glittering in the Dark": "闇の中の輝き",
  "Cave was like one you saw, yes? Mew had a thought. Kevin experiments, tries following in your footsteps. Everything goes wrong. Maybe he got bored?": "洞窟は前に見たのと似ていたか？ニャーは考えた。ケヴィンが実験し、お前の足跡を追おうとしている",
  "Kevin touched crystals. No doubt about it. Old signature, faint, but clear. Maybe Kevin's fault things went wrong. Have another beacon.": "闇の洞窟を探索し、手がかりを見つけた",
  "Darkest Pages, Darkest Knowledge": "最も暗いページ、最も暗い知識",
  "Hero visits the library! Right? Get events out of order sometimes. Kevin probably went there. Go look.": "ヒーローが図書館に行く！だろ？順番を間違えることもある。ケヴィンがたぶんそこに行った。探してこい",
  "Artifact had energy signature, yus. Different. Encoded message. Kevin's. \"There was no Kevin.\" That's...concerning. Well...cookie trail.": "闇の図書館で知識を発見した",
  "Khe's Quest": "ケーのクエスト",
  "Mew. Need help. See Kevin? New copy from terminal. Nobody noticed lack of corpse yet. Have temporo-spatial beacons to universe where he went, don't ask how. Help find traces, find what happened.\n^red;This begins the optional, tier 10, hard mode for Frackin Universe and Vanilla dungeons. It is designed to be a form of challenge for those who have reached the heights of what FU offers.^reset;": "ニャー。助けが必要。ケヴィン見た？ターミナルからの新しいコピーだ。まだ誰も死体がないことに気づいていない。時空スキャナーがあるのだ",
  "You gonna help mew? YAY! Can provide more beacons for shiny, if you can't manage first try.": "ケーのクエストを完了した。闇の旅が始まる",
  "Dark Machines": "闇の機械",
  "You know da drill by now. No, not da erchius drill. Next stop, Precursor Ruins.": "もう手順はわかるだろ。エルキウスドリルじゃないぞ。次はプリカーサー遺跡だ",
  "...mew. Telemetry data. Similar energy to...mew? What?!? And Kevin left notes, largely gibberish except one. \"SHE is here? No, it's not her, just a shell.\" Mew scared now.": "闇のプリカーサー遺跡を攻略した",
  "If you'd like your own Space Station I can build you a ^orange;Station Transponder^reset; if you provide the materials to construct it. \n I need ^green;1 ^orange;Power Core^reset;, ^green;12 ^orange;Copper Wire^reset;, and ^green;6 ^orange;Carbon Plate^reset; to ^green;me or any other Transponder vendor^reset;. Note that you'll also be charged a ^green;6000^reset; pixel fee for labor.": "自分だけの宇宙ステーションが欲しいですか？素材を用意してくれれば、^orange;ステーショントランスポンダ^reset;を作って差し上げましょう。\n ^green;1個の^orange;パワーコア^reset;、^green;12本の^orange;銅線^reset;、^green;6枚の^orange;カーボンプレート^reset;を^green;私か他のトランスポンダ販売員^reset;に届けてください。なお、作業費として^green;6000^reset;ピクセルも頂きます。",
  "And that's how you use a mech! I can give you enough ^green;spare resources^white; for you to get started building your own via ^orange;Engineering^reset;! You can also use my ^orange;mech assembly stations^white; to see how they work.": "以上がメックの使い方や！^green;予備のリソース^white;をあげるから、^orange;エンジニアリング^reset;で自分用のメックを作り始めてくれ！ワイの^orange;メック組立ステーション^white;で仕組みを確認してもええで。",
  "I'm working on a shiny new mech weapon, but I need some help gathering some pieces. If you could ^green;find me 4^orange; durasteel bars^white; and ^green;an ^orange;advanced circuit^white;, I think that'll be enough to finish it!": "ワイは今ピカピカの新型メックウェポンを開発しとるんやけど、部品集めを手伝ってほしいんや。^green;4個の^orange;デュラスチールバー^white;と^green;1個の^orange;高性能回路^white;を持ってきてくれたら、完成できると思うんや！",
  "Excellent work. It may seem trivial, but scanning is an essential skill that will be pivotal in our search for the artifacts. Speaking of artifacts...maybe this map will help you out?": "すばらしい仕事ね。ささいな事に感じるかもしれないけれど、スキャンはアーティファクトを探すのに極めて重要で不可欠なスキルなのよ。アーティファクトと言えば…この地図が役に立つかもしれないわ。",
  "The ^orange;Pulse Jump Tech^reset; appears to be operating wonderfully! Keep that one, you've earned it. ^green;Speak to me anytime^reset; to develop new Techs!": "^orange;パルスジャンプテック^reset;は見事に動作しているようだ！それは持っておいてくれ、君がそれを手に入れたんだ。いつでも^green;僕に話しかけて^reset;新しいテックを開発しよう！",
  "Most excellent! I think that about does the trick for now. In the future you can speak to me or use a ^orange;Tricorder^reset; to adjust (or research) Techs!": "最高に素晴らしい！これでひとまず大丈夫だろう。今後は僕に話しかけるか、^orange;トリコーダー^reset;を使ってテックの調整や研究ができるよ！",
  "Perhaps you'd like me to ^orange;upgrade^reset; your Distortion Sphere? It will allow you to drop bombs by pressing ^red;[Fire]^reset; to blow things up! I need some final components to finish it. ^green;Could you bring me 10 ^orange;Gold Bars^reset;?": "君の^orange;ディストーションスフィア^reset;をアップグレードしてみないかい？^red;[射撃]^reset;を押すことで爆弾を落として、いろんなものを吹っ飛ばせるようになるんだ！完成させるために最後の部品が必要なんだ。^green;^orange;金のインゴット^reset;を10個持ってきてくれないか^reset;？",
  "This ship license is unquestionably authentic. ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "この船のライセンスは疑いなく本物です。^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "This ship license is indisputably lawful.^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "この船のライセンスが合法なのは議論の余地がありません。^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "This ship license is entirely and completely legal, for sure. ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "この船のライセンスはまったく完全に合法です、間違いなく。^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "This ship license is... Fine, probably. ^green;Bring ^orange;4 upgrade modules^green; to Penguin Pete^white; to upgrade your ship.": "この船のライセンスは…まあ、たぶん大丈夫でしょう。^green;^orange;アップグレードモジュール4個^green;をペンギン・ピートに届けて^white;、船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "You have four crew members! With a crew this size, you now qualify for the Kestrel License. Congratulations! ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "乗組員が4人になりました！この人数でケストレルライセンスの取得資格が得られます。おめでとうございます！^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "Congratulations - with six crew members you now qualify for the Falcon License! ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "おめでとうございます！乗組員が6人になり、ファルコンライセンスの取得資格が得られました！^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "Eight crew members! Congratulations - you now qualify for the Eagle License! ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;2 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "乗組員が8人になりました！おめでとうございます！イーグルライセンスの取得資格が得られました！^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール2個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "Congratulations! With a crew of ten you now qualify for the Condor License! ^green;Visit Penguin Pete^reset; with ^orange;4 Upgrade Modules^reset; to upgrade your ship.": "おめでとうございます！乗組員が10人になり、コンドルライセンスの取得資格が得られました！^green;ペンギン・ピートを訪れて^reset;、^orange;アップグレードモジュール4個^reset;で船をアップグレードしましょう。",
  "Welcome back to the ^orange;Protectorate^reset;, Agent. With your help I know we can triumph. I've had one of our mechanics ^green;repair your FTL Drive^reset; so that you can resume your duties!": "^orange;護民官^reset;へお帰りなさい、エージェント。あなたの助力があればきっと打ち勝てるわ。整備士に^green;FTLドライブを修理^reset;させたから、任務を再開できるわよ！",
  "Survive the meeting.": "会議を生き延びろ",
  "The years of training paid off - you survived the meeting!": "長年の訓練が実を結んだ — 会議を生き延びた！",
  "You're an Apex": "エイペックスだ",
  "Have an MM": "MMを受け取れ",
  "You're a Elunite": "エルナイトだ",
  "You're a thing": "何者かだ",
  "Have some thing": "何かを受け取れ",
  "You're a Hylotl": "ハイロトルだ",
  "That was no mean feat - well done, dear. Now we can truly begin to ^green;rebuild our ranks^reset; when word spreads about what you accomplished!": "簡単なことではなかったわね、よくがんばったわ。これであなたの功績が広まれば、本格的に^green;組織の再建^reset;を始められるでしょう！",
  "Since you're an active agent, maybe you could ^green;return to the Outpost and speak to ^orange;Penguin Pete the shipyard captain^reset;? He's been ranting about something for a solid week.": "あなたは現役のエージェントだから、^green;前哨基地に戻って^orange;造船所の船長ペンギン・ピート^reset;に話しかけてみたらどうかしら？彼はまるまる一週間、何かについてぶつぶつ言い続けているのよ。",
  "Rebuilding Reputations": "評判の再建",
  "Enhancing Inferior Tech": "劣等テックの強化",
  "I think this technology will help me to enhance my ^orange;Air Dash^reset; tech! With this new ^orange;Advanced Dash^reset; I should see significant improvements!": "エアダッシュがアップグレードされた",
  "Enhancing Inferior Tech II": "劣等テックの強化 II",
  "Thanks to this device I can apply the same principles to my ^orange;Blink Dash^reset; tech! With the ^orange;Air Blink^reset; I can teleport around a little better!": "ブリンクダッシュがアップグレードされた",
  "The strange artifact washes some sort of energy over you when you step near. You feel stronger! ^orange;[You can now double-tap left or right to activate a short dodge^reset;]": "奇妙なアーティファクトに近づくとエネルギーが全身を駆け巡る。強くなった！^orange;[+ダッシュ距離]^reset;",
  "The strange artifact washes some sort of energy over you when you step near. You feel stronger! ^orange;[You can now double-tap left or right to activate a short dodge]^reset;": "回避テックを習得した",
  "Your dodge is better. ^orange;[+ Distance, Inertia^reset;]": "回避がさらに強化された",
  "Spike Em!": "スパイク！",
  "I've discerned a way to improve my Dash tech. I should be able to not only dash farther, but at the end of my dash my damage will also increase significantly for a brief moment!": "スパイクダッシュを習得した",
  "Amazing Speed, Amazing Tech": "驚異の速度、驚異のテック",
  "Y'know...I just realized a way I can improve on the Sprint tech!": "スプリントテックを改良する方法に気づいた！",
  "Using ^orange;Advanced Techniques and resources^reset; I can alter reality around me as I run. This should provide invulnerability!": "スプリントが強化された",
  "Amazing Speed, Amazing Tech II": "驚異の速度、驚異のテック II",
  "With a bit more advanced tech splashed in, I can improve ^orange;Phase Sprint^reset; and make it damage anything in my path!": "スプリントがさらに強化された",
  "Amazing Speed, Amazing Tech III": "驚異の速度、驚異のテック III",
  "With precursor technology, I think I can improve my ^orange;Phase Sprint^reset; to increase my damage potential while in motion!": "スプリントが最大強化された",
  "I've devised an upgrade to the Stimulant Rig": "スティムラントリグのアップグレードを考案した",
  "I'll be zonked out of my mind, but damn I'll be fast!": "スティムラントリグが強化された",
  "I've devised another upgrade to the Stimulant Rig!": "スティムラントリグのさらなるアップグレードを考案した！",
  "While the narcotics are rather potent at this point, I'll be really swift.": "スティムラントリグがさらに強化された",
  "It may be nearly lethal, but this upgrade could certainly boost effectiveness.": "ほぼ致命的かもしれないが、このアップグレードは確実に効果を高める",
  "I don't recommend allowing anyone else to use this. They would probably die.": "スティムラントリグが最大強化された",
  "I've found some sort of ancient alien technology that appears to ^orange;significantly improve mobility^reset; passively while worn!": "^orange;移動能力を大幅に向上^reset;させる古代のエイリアン技術を発見した",
  "Using alien technology I could create a ^orange;superior stim rig^reset; the likes of which nobody has ever seen!": "プリカーサーリグを装備した。究極の速度",
  "Using what I've learned from research, I have devised a new tech. The ^orange;Stimulant Rig^reset;! It injects ^red;unsafe levels of narcotic stimulants^reset; to provide a constant speed boost! Hurray!": "研究から学んだことで新しいテックを考案した。^orange;スティムラントリグ^reset;！",
  "I can probably improve on this substantially as I learn more.": "スティムラントリグを習得した",
  "Zip! Pew! Kableeeeew! Pew!": "ジュッ！ピュン！ドカーン！ピュン！",
  "Fascinating. The artifact has taught me the ^orange;Teleport Dash^reset; tech. It should really keep the enemy guessing!": "テレポートダッシュを習得した",
  "Explosive Redirection": "爆発的方向転換",
  "With a bit of tinkering I think I could adapt rapid-burn of fuel safely to create a ^orange;Zero Burst Tech^reset;! With it equipped, I should ^orange;tap up twice^reset; to boost.": "ゼロバーストを習得した",
  "Explosive Redirection II": "爆発的方向転換 II",
  "I've created an ungraded version of the Zero Burst tech.": "ゼロバーストテックのアップグレード版を作成した",
  "I can now boost a lot higher than before.": "ゼロバーストが強化された",
  "Explosive Redirection III": "爆発的方向転換 III",
  "Another upgrade to the Zero Burst tech!": "ゼロバーストテックのさらなるアップグレードだ！",
  "I can now boost exceptionally high!": "ゼロバーストがさらに強化された",
  "Explosive Redirection IV": "爆発的方向転換 IV",
  "This upgrade is certainly not safe. But worth it.": "このアップグレードは確実に安全ではない。だが価値はある",
  "Now I can leap a lot faster, letting me boost in the air super high!": "ゼロバーストが最大強化された",
  "Ball of Armor": "鎧球",
  "Ancient technology has led me to devise a ^orange;armored distortion sphere^reset;! It should provide ^orange;20 units of armor^reset; when active.": "装甲歪曲球を習得した",
  "I think I've devised a way to get the ^orange;distortion sphere^reset;! powered up a tad. I can attach some ^orange;anti-grav jets^reset; to give it jump capability!": "バウンス球を習得した",
  "I've discovered an unusual technology that allows me to turn into a ball. With it I can access areas I otherwise couldn't. ^green;Press [F]^reset; to activate it.": "ボールに変身できる珍しい技術を発見した。これで通常アクセスできない場所に入れる",
  "I've discovered an unusual technology that allows me to turn into a ball. With it I can access areas I otherwise couldn't. ^green;Press [F]^reset; to activate.": "歪曲球を習得した",
  "Blastball": "ブラストボール",
  "With a few simple tweaks to the quantum-displacement regulator used to make the Distortion Sphere work I could probably provide added deadliness...": "歪曲球の量子変位レギュレーターを少し調整すれば強化できる",
  "When you are in ball form, you can now drop bombs by pressing ^orange;[FIRE]^reset;!": "ブラストボールを習得した",
  "Oddball": "オッドボール",
  "I think I bumped my head a bit too hard or something...I devised a new distortion sphere but have no idea where this could be useful...": "頭をちょっと強く打ちすぎたかも…新しい歪曲球を考案したが何をするのか全くわからない",
  "It should at least be fun to use, though I would caution against using it carelessly.": "オッドボールを習得した。何が起こるかは…お楽しみ",
  "Microsphere": "マイクロスフィア",
  "Thanks to this new breakthrough, I can shrink my existing distortionsphere even smaller...into a ^orange;Microsphere^reset;!": "マイクロスフィアを習得した",
  "Baby Bomba": "ベビーボンバ",
  "I can now adjust the microsphere tech and allow it to materialize bombs using the [FIRE] key!": "ベビーボンバを習得した",
  "I've uncovered a unique tech! The Precursor Microsphere! You get wall-cling, increased movement speed, and pressing ^green;[FIRE]^reset; will cause a Repulsor Blast that stuns and pushes enemies. It has been equipped.": "プリカーサーマイクロスフィアを習得した",
  "Clingwrap Microball": "クリングラップマイクロボール",
  "With a little bit of tinkering, I feel I should be able to improve my Microsphere to be capable of clinging to surfaces at the expense of the bomb slot.": "クリングラップマイクロボールを習得した",
  "I've devised a way to change my own body chemistry using technology. This should allow me to blend in to my surroundings and surprise foes with attacks.": "技術を使って自分の体内化学を変化させる方法を考案した。環境に溶け込めるようになるはずだ",
  "I can now press [f] when Phase Attack is active to vanish. My next attack will do x2 damage. Movement speed is slowed while sneaking.": "アサシンテックを習得した",
  "Magnet Glove": "マグネットグローブ",
  "Thanks to electromagnets I have devised a ^orange;Magnet Glove^reset;. With it I get extended cling time on any surface I grab!": "マグネットグローブを習得した",
  "Power Grip": "パワーグリップ",
  "I've managed to think of a cool upgrade to the Magnet Grip! I should be able to apply some advanced science to it and really grip with power!": "マグネットグリップのクールなアップグレードを思いついた！先進技術を適用できるはずだ",
  "Now, when I grip walls, I should get defensive bonuses and increased energy...sapped right from the material itself! Also, W and S allow me to travel up and down.": "パワーグリップを習得した",
  "A Better Walljump": "より良いウォールジャンプ",
  "I think I could ^green;replace the Wall Jump tech^reset; with a ^orange;useful upgrade tech^reset;": "ウォールジャンプが強化された",
  "Amazing Grip!": "驚異のグリップ！",
  "This new technology has made me realize I could ^green;replace the Wall Jump tech^reset; with a ^orange;useful upgrade tech^reset;": "グリップがさらに強化された",
  "Ultimate Grip!": "究極のグリップ！",
  "With tech used in the Arc Smelter I could ^green;replace the Wall Jump tech^reset; with an ^orange;ultimate upgrade^reset;!": "究極のグリップを習得した",
  "Enhanced Jump": "強化ジャンプ",
  "I've found some sort of ancient tech in a ruin. I wonder what it does?": "遺跡で何かの古代テックを見つけた。何をするのだろう？",
  "This strange new technology has ^green;fused into my body^reset;. I seem to have ^orange;increased jumping ability^reset;.": "ジャンプが強化された",
  "Flutter Jump I": "フラッタージャンプ I",
  "A few tweaks to this implant and I can adjust gravities effect on the user!": "このインプラントを少し調整すれば使用者への重力の影響を調整できる！",
  "You don't get much jumpier than this!": "フラッタージャンプが強化された",
  "Even more fluttery!": "さらにフワフワに！",
  "Ultra Flutter!": "ウルトラフラッター！",
  "The ultimate Flutter Jump!": "究極のフラッター！",
  "As jumpy as it gets!": "ウルトラフラッターを習得した",
  "Jump Harness": "ジャンプハーネス",
  "I've come up with a way to double a double-jump tech!": "二段ジャンプテックを倍にする方法を思いついた！",
  "Using some fancy ancient tech I think I can produce a Quad-Jump tech!": "古代テックを使えば四段ジャンプテックが作れるはずだ！",
  "Using some fancy ancient tech a ^orange;Quint Jump^reset; schematic was revealed to me. I should ^orange;be able to jump 5 times^reset; rather than once or twice!": "古代テックのおかげで^orange;クイントジャンプ^reset;の設計図が明らかになった。1回や2回ではなく^orange;5回ジャンプできる^reset;はずだ！",
  "Rocket Boots?!?!": "ロケットブーツ？！？！",
  "I've had an epiphany, and subconciously invented ^green;the greatest thing ever: ^orange;ROCKET BOOTS^reset;! As a tech! Woohoo!^reset;": "ひらめいた、無意識のうちに^green;史上最高のもの: ^orange;ロケットブーツ^reset;を発明した！テックとして！やったー！^reset;",
  "Impact Protection": "衝撃保護",
  "I have an idea! An auto-firing bubble that activates when I fall at a certain speed! Screw you, gravity!": "アイデアがある！一定速度で落下した時に自動発動するバブル！ざまあみろ重力！",
  "Impenetrable": "鉄壁",
  "Increase passive defense by 5": "パッシブ防御を5増加",
  "Impenetrable II": "鉄壁 II",
  "Increase passive defense by 10": "パッシブ防御を10増加",
  "Impenetrable III": "鉄壁 III",
  "Increase passive defense by 15": "パッシブ防御を15増加",
  "Developers only": "開発者専用",
  "If you're not a developer, you shouldn't be seeing this.": "開発者でなければ、これは見えないはずだ",
  "I hope you're happy with yourself.": "満足したか",
  "Breaking Physics": "物理法則破壊",
  "I've devised a way to quite literally ignore physics to a mild degree!": "文字通り物理法則を軽度に無視する方法を考案した！",
  "With this tech I should be able to hold jump and reduce my inertia.": "このテックでジャンプを長押しすると慣性を減らせるはずだ",
  "Breaking Physics II": "物理法則破壊 II",
  "Thanks to advancements in my research I can upgrade my Physics Field.": "研究の進歩のおかげでフィジクスフィールドをアップグレードできる",
  "Now I can truly ignore gravity and travel in style!": "これで本当に重力を無視してスタイリッシュに移動できる！",
  "Breaking Physics III": "物理法則破壊 III",
  "I'm not sure how this even works. But it is absolutely ^orange;amaze-balls^reset;!": "これがどう動くのかさっぱりわからない。だが絶対に^orange;最高^reset;だ！",
  "Use extreme caution with this tech. It is both a great bonus and a dangerous tool.": "このテックの使用には細心の注意を。大きなボーナスであり危険なツールでもある",
  "It may be worth noting that this celestial body has no atmosphere and you will die without some sort of oxygen source.": "この天体には大気がなく、何らかの酸素供給源がなければ死に至ることをお伝えしておきます。",
  "^red;WARNING! EXTREME COLD DETECTED ^reset;! You should not attempt further exploration without proper protective equipment!": "^red;警告！極度の低温を検知^reset;！適切な防護装備なしにこれ以上の探索を行うべきではありません！",
  "^red;WARNING! EXTREME HEAT DETECTED ^reset;! You should not attempt further exploration without proper protective equipment!": "^red;警告！極度の高温を検知^reset;！適切な防護装備なしにこれ以上の探索を行うべきではありません！",
  "^red;WARNING! RADIATION DETECTED ^reset;! You should not attempt further exploration without proper protective equipment!": "^red;警告！放射線を検知^reset;！適切な防護装備なしにこれ以上の探索を行うべきではありません！",
  "This strange alien compound has various unknown elements within its genetic coding. We should see what it can do in the lab.": "この奇妙なエイリアン化合物は遺伝コード内に様々な未知の元素を含む。研究室で何ができるか調べよう",
  "You've successfully mutated raw corruption into a useable sort of ore. I wonder what it can do?": "生の腐敗を使用可能な鉱石に変異させた。何ができるだろう？",
  "Using your chemistry mastery you have managed to create a whole new type of metal. We shall call it: Morphite. I bet it's awesome, since you made it.": "化学のマスタリーで全く新しい種類の金属を作り出した。モーファイトと呼ぼう。あなたが作ったのだから素晴らしいに違いない",
  "Mulch has one single purpose: low-grade fertilizer. Toss it into a Hydroponics Tray to increase crop yields and growth speed.": "マルチの目的は一つ：低級肥料。水耕栽培トレイに投入して作物の収穫量と成長速度を上げよう",
  "Strange mutagenic material swirling in your sample jar. Surely we can use this somehow.": "サンプル瓶の中で渦巻く奇妙な変異原性物質。きっと何かに使える",
  "Erratic gene-constructs encased in liquefied... something. Let's jam it into a gene-research project!": "液状の…何かに封じ込められた不安定な遺伝子構造。遺伝子研究プロジェクトにぶち込もう！",
  "Whatever this is, it smells like pandas and fruit, yet erodes all organic matter it touches. Don't eat it.": "これが何であれ、パンダと果物の匂いがするのに触れた全有機物を侵食する。食べるな",
  "I can tell at a glance that this mutagen will prove lethal if you touch it. It has high-potency toxins and who knows what else?": "一目でこの変異原は触れると致命的だと分かる。高濃度の毒素と他に何が含まれているか分からない",
  "What we have here in Unstable Particles is a very useful and advanced material capable of creating extremely advanced machines and equipment.": "ここにある不安定粒子は非常に有用な先進素材で、極めて高度な機械や装備を作成できる",
  "Biting ones own body and eating it is probably not the best idea, sir. I don't suggest doing that again. Eventually you'll run out of pieces, and then what will you have left to eat? Also, now you're bleeding everywhere. Nicely done.": "自分の体を噛んで食べるのは最善の策ではない。二度としないことを勧める。いずれパーツが尽きて、何を食べるんだ？それに今、至る所から出血している。お見事",
  "Whatever the hell this thing is, it reads unlike anything I have ever seen before. I literally get nothing when I try, yet it moves and pulses...": "これが何であれ、今まで見たものとは全く異なる読み取りだ。試しても文字通り何も得られないのに、動いて脈動している…",
  "While I applaud your bravery even touching this altar, I would advise caution. It clearly is not a good thing. Perhaps some lore can shed light on how to use it...": "この祭壇に触れる勇気は称賛するが、注意を勧める。明らかに良いものではない。伝承から使い方の手がかりが得られるかも…",
  "I'll be with you during this investigation. I'm on vacation, but that doesn't mean I don't have to do my duty as director. It looks like you came in through their backup teleporter. Did something happen to the main?": "この調査には同行する。休暇中だが、局長としての義務を怠るわけにはいかない。バックアップテレポーターから来たようだが、メインに何かあったのか？",
  "Not to worry, it's a short walk to the ^orange;Research Station^reset; down the cliff. Watch your step, it tends to be very icy there.": "心配無用、崖を下りれば^orange;研究ステーション^reset;までは短い距離だ。足元に注意、とても滑りやすい",
  "I'm picking up biological signatures. Stand by while I ^red;****^reset;...oh dear. The weather is interfering with our connection. If I can no longer reach you, SAIL can guide you.": "生体信号を検出している。^red;****^reset;する間待機…ああ。天候が接続を妨害している。通信が途絶えたらSAILが案内する",
  "How odd! I can only recognize one signature from our database. I am also picking up readings that match nothing I've ^red;****^reset;. The connec^red;*** ***^reset;blems are ^red;****^reset; scans.": "奇妙だ！データベースから認識できる信号は一つだけ。^red;****^reset;に一致しない読み取りもある。接続^red;*** ***^reset;題は^red;****^reset;スキャン",
  "What in the world happened to this team? Where is everyone? Who broke the lock? Check everything you can.": "このチームに一体何が起きた？みんなどこだ？誰が錠を壊した？できる限り全てを調べろ",
  "Oh- oh no, this is horrible. I...we... *vomiting sounds*. We- we have to keep going. Find out what happened so it will never happen again.": "ああ…なんてこと。これはひどい。私…*嘔吐の音*。続けなければ。何が起きたか突き止めよう。二度と起きないように",
  "There's a failsafe switch on the far wall of this room. It should override the main lab doors, which should give us access to the power breakers so we can see more clearly.": "この部屋の奥の壁にフェイルセーフスイッチがある。メインラボのドアを上書きして電源ブレーカーにアクセスできるはず",
  "The power breakers are at the end of this corridor. Be careful in the dark, we don't know what's down there.": "電源ブレーカーはこの廊下の奥にある。暗闇に注意、何がいるか分からない",
  "I understand you wanting to leave, and I whole-heartedly agree with you. As I said, however, check everything you can for clues. This can't happen again. I won't let it.": "去りたい気持ちは分かるし、心から同意する。しかし前にも言った通り、手がかりを探せるだけ探してくれ。二度と起こしてはならない。私が許さない",
  "This blizzard is unrelenting. There are some tall cliffs up ahead. Use them for shelter from the wind if you need to. Our connection may fail soon, as well.": "この吹雪は容赦ない。前方に高い崖がある。必要なら風除けに使え。通信もまもなく途絶えるかもしれない",
  "Fascinating! A mutated form of ^red;*******^reset;, one I've never seen the likes of before. Be careful, though. They appear rabid, and may possess any number of terrible ^red;******^reset; diseases.": "魅力的！^red;*******^reset;の変異形態で、これまで見たことがない。ただし注意。狂暴で、恐ろしい^red;******^reset;病を持っている可能性がある",
  "This pillar... this stone... We can't even be sure if this -is- stone. There aren't any similarities to known minerals within it. Continue onward, for the sake of our team and for science.": "この柱…この石…これが石なのかすら確信できない。既知の鉱物との類似性がない。チームと科学のために前進せよ",
  "That can't be right. This has to be an error. Scans place the age of this place at somewhere around 1 billion years. I must know more. Keep going. I should ^red;***** *** ******^reset;!": "そんなはずはない。エラーに違いない。スキャンではここの年齢は約10億年。もっと知りたい。進め。^red;***** *** ******^reset;すべきだ！",
  "This sculpture somewhat resembles ^red;********^reset;e Ruin. There are key differe^red;*******^reset; factors, of course. Some sort of ancient Ruin worship, perhaps?": "この彫刻は^red;********^reset;の遺跡にやや似ている。もちろん重要な違^red;*******^reset;はある。何らかの古代遺跡崇拝か？",
  "What manner of ^red;*****^reset; is this, and what became of them? Nothing ever recorded matches this...thing. Whatever this place is, it will redefine galactic history.": "この^red;*****^reset;は何で、彼らはどうなった？記録されたものでこの…ものに一致するものはない。ここが何であれ、銀河の歴史を書き換えるだろう",
  "The storm is ^red;******^reset; ^red;******^reset;. My scanners are ^red;*bzzzzzzzzzz*^reset; and ^red;******^reset;. I am ^red;******^reset;.": "嵐が^red;******^reset; ^red;******^reset;。スキャナーが^red;*ブーーーーーン*^reset;で^red;******^reset;。私は^red;******^reset;",
  "I ^red;******* *****^reset; ? We should ^red;******^reset; before it is ^red;******^reset;. Okay?": "私は^red;******* *****^reset;？^red;******^reset;になる前に^red;******^reset;すべきだ。いいね？",
  "I am detect^red;*******^reset; ^red;*buzz*^reset;! Take ^red;******^reset; or it ^red;******^reset;!": "検出^red;*******^reset; ^red;*ブーン*^reset;！^red;******^reset;しろ、さもなくば^red;******^reset;！",
  "^red;*******bzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzt*****^reset;  ^orange;-CONNECTION TERMINATED-^reset;": "^red;*******ブーーーーーーーーーーーーン*****^reset; ^orange;-接続切断-^reset;",
  "<you hear some sort of whispers in the dark>": "<暗闇の中で何かのささやき声が聞こえる>",
  "<the whispers are growing louder>": "<ささやき声が大きくなっている>",
  "^orange;-ONLINE-^reset; You're ALIVE! I thought for certain you were dead! What did you discover about the temple, and what happened to our team? Report to me as soon as you can with your findings.": "^orange;-オンライン-^reset; 生きていた！絶対死んだと思った！寺院について何を発見した？チームに何が起きた？見つけたことをできるだけ早く報告してくれ",
  "Oh my. The lock was destroyed. Perhaps you could try blasting the door open with an explosiv^red;***** ** ****^reset;? There seems to be little other choice. Hurry, a ^red;****^reset; storm is coming!": "おやまあ。錠が壊されている。爆発^red;***** ** ****^reset;でドアを吹き飛ばせるかも？他に選択肢はなさそうだ。急げ、^red;****^reset;嵐が来る！",
  "The path seems to be blocked. Oh, there's a small tunnel that seems to lead somewhere. Perhaps a Translocator or a Microsphere tech would do the trick.": "道が塞がれているようだ。小さなトンネルがどこかに通じているようだ。トランスロケーターかマイクロスフィアテックで行けるかも",
  "MacReady! What happened to him? What's on his face? That thing seems to be influencing him. I hate to encourage this, but please defend yourself. Put him out of his misery for his sake.": "マクレディ！何が起きた？顔に何がついている？あれに影響されているようだ。こんなことを言いたくないが、身を守ってくれ。彼のために楽にしてやれ",
  "Secret knowledge! We should search these shelves and ^red;**** **^reset; anything we find. Who knows what useful information or ancient ^red;**** *****^reset;we might uncover in the process!": "秘密の知識！この棚を調べて見つけたものを^red;**** **^reset;すべきだ。有用な情報や古代の^red;**** *****^reset;が見つかるかもしれない！",
  "Perhaps check the books on the shelves for a hint. You may need that to progress, and look for similar things in further rooms.": "棚の本にヒントがないか確認してみて。先に進むために必要かもしれない。さらに先の部屋でも似たものを探そう",
  "You've gained a +^green;1^reset; ^orange;Research^reset; bonus based on your session playtime. ^red;This bonus will be disabled if you are AFK^reset;.": "セッションプレイ時間に基づき^orange;研究^reset;ボーナス+^green;1^reset;を獲得。^red;AFK時はこのボーナスは無効^reset;",
  "You've gained a +^green;2^reset; ^orange;Research^reset; bonus based on your session playtime. ^red;This bonus will be disabled if you are AFK^reset;.": "セッションプレイ時間に基づき^orange;研究^reset;ボーナス+^green;2^reset;を獲得。^red;AFK時はこのボーナスは無効^reset;",
  "You've gained a +^green;3^reset; ^orange;Research^reset; bonus based on your session playtime. ^red;This bonus will be disabled if you are AFK^reset;.": "セッションプレイ時間に基づき^orange;研究^reset;ボーナス+^green;3^reset;を獲得。^red;AFK時はこのボーナスは無効^reset;",
  "You've gained a +^green;4^reset; ^orange;Research^reset; bonus based on your session playtime. ^red;This bonus will be disabled if you are AFK^reset;.": "セッションプレイ時間に基づき^orange;研究^reset;ボーナス+^green;4^reset;を獲得。^red;AFK時はこのボーナスは無効^reset;",
  "I should mention this now before I forget! You will occasionally need to ^orange;upgrade existing crafting stations^reset; using their built in ^green;Upgrade Button^reset; to be able to craft higher-tier gear. Make sure you don't forget!": "忘れる前に言っておく！^green;アップグレードボタン^reset;を使って^orange;既存のクラフトステーションをアップグレード^reset;する必要がある。高ティア装備を作るためにも忘れずに！",
  "You've found a firearm that uses ^orange;Ammo^reset;. Your current ammo count is represented by a visible bar when firing. You do not need to create or carry ammo. Reload by emptying the magazine or by pressing ^green;SHIFT + MOUSE 1^reset;.": "^orange;弾薬^reset;を使用する火器を見つけた。現在の弾薬数は発射時にバーで表示。弾薬の作成や携帯は不要。マガジンを空にするか^green;SHIFT + マウス1^reset;でリロード",
  "To fit through this gap, you're going to require a ^orange;Microsphere Tech^reset;. You can craft it via your ^orange;Tricorder^reset;.": "この隙間を通るには^orange;マイクロスフィアテック^reset;が必要。^orange;トライコーダー^reset;で作成できる",
  "Honestly, spawning the most powerful augment? Some savior you are. I'm going to tell the Protectorate what a little cheat you are.": "正直、最強のオーグメントを出すとは？大した救世主だな。プロテクトレートにチート野郎だと報告するぞ",
  "I've never seen Ancient tech like this before. It appears to be some sort of power conduit. It must have some use, somewhere. I'd keep that safe, were I you.": "このような古代の技術は見たことがない。何らかの電力導管のようだ。どこかで使い道があるはず。私ならそれを大切に保管する",
  "What...is this? How did we not detect this place? ^orange;Who built it?^reset; Can you please investigate? We've discovered the ruins of an unknown race!": "これは…何だ？なぜこの場所を検出できなかった？^orange;誰が建てた？^reset;調査してくれないか？未知の種族の遺跡を発見した！",
  "This appears to be some sort of combination lock. I couldn't even begin to guess at a solution. Maybe you're better at puzzles than I am.": "何らかの組み合わせ錠のようだ。解法は見当もつかない。パズルは私より得意かもしれない",
  "Your submersible vehicle cannot operate in the substance it is currently immersed in.": "潜水車両は現在浸されている物質では動作できない",
  "In order to get into that gap, you're going to need to find a way to make yourself smaller. Maybe there's an answer elsewhere in this cavern. I bet it's a secret! Ooh boy! ^orange;I love secrets^reset;!": "あの隙間に入るには小さくなる方法を見つける必要がある。この洞窟のどこかに答えがあるかも。秘密に違いない！^orange;秘密大好き^reset;！",
  "In order to get in here, you're going to have to ^green;Jump^reset; and then ^green;Press [F]^reset; while in the air.": "ここに入るには^green;ジャンプ^reset;して空中で^green;[F]を押す^reset;必要がある",
  "I suppose both symbols glowing would represent 'on', then? That seems to make the most sense. Activate the correct consoles and ^green;ffwwooomf^reset;! Open Sesame! Or a lethal trap, I suppose.": "両方のシンボルが光れば「オン」ということか？それが最も理にかなう。正しいコンソールを起動すれば^green;ドーン^reset;！開けゴマ！あるいは致命的な罠か",
  "Hmm. This door appears well sealed. Oh! It has a neat little missile icon on it! Perhaps some ^orange;explosive force^reset; might open it? A ^green;grenade, bomb or rocket^reset; should do the trick.": "うーん。このドアはしっかり密封されている。おや！ミサイルのアイコンがある！^orange;爆発力^reset;で開くかも？^green;手榴弾、爆弾、ロケット^reset;でいけるはず",
  "Ah, another of these ^orange;explosive^reset; triggered doors. I should hope you know what to do by now.": "ああ、また^orange;爆発物^reset;で開くドアか。もう対処法は分かっているだろう",
  "Hmm. This switch is far enough from the door that entry without some sort of ^orange;swift boost or motion^reset; appears to be almost impossible.": "うーん。このスイッチはドアから離れすぎていて、何らかの^orange;素早いブーストや動き^reset;なしでの通過はほぼ不可能のようだ",
  "The energy signatures within this cave are quite unusual. I'm getting definite trace readings of ^green;ancient essence^reset;, which doesn't make much sense. The ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset; have no known historical presence in this sector.": "この洞窟内のエネルギー信号はかなり異常。^green;古代のエッセンス^reset;の明確な痕跡を検出しているが、辻褄が合わない。^#ff00fc;古代種^reset;はこのセクターに歴史的存在の記録がない",
  "Still...this reads as ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset;, I'm almost positive. If these readings are accurate, we've stumbled across something truly significant. Press on! This is a rare chance for a true discovery.": "しかし…これは^#ff00fc;古代種^reset;の反応だ、ほぼ確信している。この読み取りが正確なら、本当に重大なものに出くわした。前進せよ！真の発見の稀有なチャンスだ",
  "I suppose it is safe to assume there is nobody here left alive. I can detect no trace of recent activity. I would estimate perhaps a decade since anyone has tread here.": "ここに生存者はいないと考えて問題ないだろう。最近の活動の痕跡は検出できない。誰も足を踏み入れていない期間はおよそ10年と推定する",
  "^orange;YES^reset;! This is ^green;definitely^reset; an energy signature linked with the ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset;. It's coming from somewhere very close to your position.": "^orange;やった^reset;！これは^green;間違いなく^reset;^#ff00fc;古代種^reset;に関連するエネルギー信号だ。あなたの位置のすぐ近くから発信されている",
  "I would guess that something unpleasant happened to the colonists here. A find like this could be worth millions of pixels, and no new colony is going to pass up that income.": "ここの入植者に何か不快なことが起きたのだろう。このような発見は何百万ピクセルの価値があり、新しいコロニーはその収入を見逃さない",
  "This door is sealed by a locking mechanism that should respond well to ^orange;explosive force^reset;. If you can obtain a ^green;bomb or other sort of explosive^reset;, you could probably open this.": "このドアは^orange;爆発力^reset;に反応するロック機構で封印されている。^green;爆弾やその他の爆発物^reset;を入手できれば開けられるだろう",
  "Wow. ^#ff00fc;Ancient^reset; technology in almost perfect condition! This is a ^orange;very^reset; valuable discovery.": "すごい。ほぼ完璧な状態の^#ff00fc;古代^reset;技術！これは^orange;非常に^reset;価値ある発見だ",
  "This door appears to be locked. Perhaps searching elsewhere in the cave will reveal a ^orange;switch^reset; of some sort.^reset;.": "このドアは施錠されているようだ。洞窟の他の場所を探せば何らかの^orange;スイッチ^reset;が見つかるかも",
  "A wonderful grotto. This water looks to be quite refreshing. A swim might be ^green;just what you need^reset;, but look out for ^red;predators beneath the surface^reset;.": "素晴らしい洞窟だ。この水はとても爽やかに見える。泳ぐのは^green;まさに必要なこと^reset;かもしれないが、^red;水面下の捕食者^reset;に注意",
  "It would appear, based on lifesigns, that you have stumbled onto some sort of nest. Be aware: ^red;one large mutant^reset; has been detected.": "生体反応から判断して、何らかの巣に迷い込んだようだ。注意：^red;大型変異体1体^reset;を検出",
  "Unless you are exceptionally nimble, you are going to need ^orange;climbing ropes^reset; to get up there. Try finding some or ^orange;make some yourself in your [C]rafting menu^reset;.": "特別に身軽でない限り、上に登るには^orange;クライミングロープ^reset;が必要。探すか^orange;[C]ラフトメニューで自作^reset;しよう",
  "This switch appears to be a timed trigger. You'll need a means to increase your speed if you are to pass here unless your species is exceptionally quick. Perhaps a ^orange;Dash Tech^reset; will do the trick.": "このスイッチはタイムトリガーのようだ。種族が特別に速くない限り、速度を上げる手段が必要。^orange;ダッシュテック^reset;で解決できるかも",
  "Greetings! You appear to be rapidly dying due to explosive decompression or extreme pressure. You should seek safety, and relatively quickly or face ^red;certain death^reset;!": "挨拶！爆発的減圧または極度の圧力で急速に死にかけているようだ。安全な場所を探せ。早急に、でなければ^red;確実な死^reset;が待っている！",
  "I am uncertain why you came here. This isn't at all a place you are evolved to survive. You will be dead in mere moments without ^orange;pressure protection^reset;. I suggest procuring some.": "なぜここに来たのか分からない。あなたが生き延びるよう進化した場所ではない。^orange;耐圧保護^reset;なしではすぐに死ぬ。入手することを勧める",
  "Have you gone mad? The pressure here is enough to crush you almost instantly! What would possess you to come unprotected? Get some ^orange;pressure protection^reset; or face death!": "正気か？ここの圧力はほぼ即座に押し潰されるほどだ！無防備で来るとは何を考えている？^orange;耐圧保護^reset;を手に入れろ、さもなくば死だ！",
  "I regret to inform you that your decision to visit a ^red;gas giant^reset; without protection is a ^red;fatal^reset; one.": "残念ながら、無防備で^red;ガス惑星^reset;を訪れるという決断は^red;致命的^reset;だとお伝えする",
  "Natural forces change the tide of gasses regularly with day and night cycle. As night approaches, you'll find things get a bit worse on your survival. Perhaps return later.": "自然の力は昼夜サイクルで定期的にガスの流れを変える。夜が近づくと生存が少し厳しくなる。後で戻ったほうがいいかも",
  "As the sun rises, warming the nascent gas of this world you find that the natural forces seem to calm and rapidly reduce in potence.": "太陽が昇り、この世界の初期ガスを温めると、自然の力が落ち着き急速に弱まるようだ",
  "While it is never exactly a pleasant calm day on a Gas Giant, extreme winds severely increase the effects of the environment. Take extra precautions.": "ガス惑星で穏やかな日はないが、極端な風は環境の影響を著しく増大させる。十分な注意を",
  "The extreme winds have made the temperature plummet dramatically. You should get out of the wind unless you wish to freeze to death rapidly.": "猛烈な風で気温が急激に下がっている。急速に凍死したくなければ風を避けろ",
  "^red;WARNING: TOXIC ATMOSPHERE!^reset; The air here is thick with some sort of viscosity. It makes you feel sluggish, and you feel yourself getting weaker.": "^red;警告：有毒大気！^reset;ここの空気は粘性のある何かで重い。動きが鈍くなり、弱っているのを感じる",
  "^red;ALERT: MENTAL STATE DETERIORATING!^reset; Your surroundings are causing your thoughts and feelings to become jumbled. Focus is difficult and you feel yourself going insane...": "^red;警告：精神状態悪化中！^reset;周囲の環境が思考と感情を混乱させている。集中が困難になり、狂気に侵されている…",
  "^red;ALERT: MENTAL STATE DETERIORATING!^reset; Something is causing your thoughts and feelings to become jumbled. Focus is difficult and you feel yourself going insane...": "^red;警告：精神状態悪化中！^reset;何かが思考と感情を混乱させている。集中が困難になり、狂気に侵されている…",
  "The voices in the wind have informed you of a fantastic sale! It can only be found at the bottom of a Sulphuric Ocean, and only if you're naked! Totally legit! Check it out!": "風の声が素晴らしいセールを教えてくれた！硫酸の海の底でしか見つからない、裸でないとダメ！完全に合法！見てみろ！",
  "You're getting pretty hangry. That means angry and hungry. Because hunger. Food. Have you considered ^red;cannibalism^reset;? It's fast and easy! Try it ! Murder a neighbor! Trust the voices.": "かなりハングリー（空腹で怒り）になってきた。空腹。食べ物。^red;共食い^reset;を考えたことは？速くて簡単！やってみろ！隣人を殺せ！声を信じろ",
  "Okay. You're really getting hungry now. Why haven't you ^red;eaten a close personal friend^reset; yet? They are full of nutrients!": "さて。本当に空腹になってきた。なぜまだ^red;親しい友人を食べて^reset;いないんだ？栄養満点なのに！",
  "I can't help but notice: You're still hungry, and your ^red;hellish maw is not dripping with the viscera of the slain^reset;. What is wrong with you? Eat ^red;sentient species^reset;!": "気づかずにはいられない：まだ空腹で、^red;地獄の顎は殺した者の内臓で滴っていない^reset;。どうしたんだ？^red;知的種族^reset;を食え！",
  "Brain, you are an idiot. You are about to die, and all you need to do to stop that problem is ^red;murder and devour^reset; the next person you see. Get on it. Or I'll make you.": "脳よ、お前は馬鹿だ。死にかけているのに、解決に必要なのは次に見かけた人を^red;殺して貪り食う^reset;だけだ。さっさとやれ。さもなくばやらせるぞ",
  "I want to eat raw flesh.": "生肉が食べたい",
  "Why do I increasingly feel like I require meat?": "なぜますます肉が必要だと感じるのだろう？",
  "I should have some meat.": "肉を食べるべきだ",
  "I am slowly going crazy. 1-2-3-4-5-6-^red;Meat^reset;. Crazy going slowly am I 6-5-4-3-2-1-^red;Kill^reset;!": "ゆっくり狂っていく。1-2-3-4-5-6-^red;肉^reset;。狂っていくゆっくり私は 6-5-4-3-2-1-^red;殺せ^reset;！",
  "Leaping is fun! I should leap immediately from the nearest cliff! I am certain ^orange;Fun Times^reset; will ensue! Alternatively, try impacting the ground at a high speed! You'll get ^green;free cupcakes^reset;!": "跳ぶのは楽しい！近くの崖からすぐ跳ぶべきだ！^orange;楽しいこと^reset;間違いなし！あるいは高速で地面に激突してみろ！^green;無料カップケーキ^reset;がもらえるぞ！",
  "Don't forget to jump to your death! How else are you going to make ^green;splatter-cakes^reset;?": "死ぬまで跳ぶのを忘れるな！^green;ぐちゃぐちゃケーキ^reset;はどうやって作るんだ？",
  "You are certainly capable of flight! You can at least be sure of that! Go prove it by practicing with a leap off a high ledge! People will be amazed!": "確実に飛行能力がある！少なくともそれは確かだ！高い崖から飛び降りて証明しろ！みんな驚くぞ！",
  "I forgot that ^orange;breathing liquid^reset; is a great way to help keep in shape! I should probably ^red;remove this stupid air supply^reset; in order to breathe a ton of it!": "^orange;液体を吸う^reset;のは体調維持に最高だったのを忘れてた！たくさん吸うために^red;この馬鹿な空気供給を外す^reset;べきだ！",
  "Moving fast is amazing! ^orange;Especially downwards at the ground^reset; where the magical sparkles await! You should go ^red;really fast^reset; and ram into the ground to collect ^orange;extra^reset; sparkles!": "速く動くのは最高！^orange;特に地面に向かって下へ^reset;行くと魔法の輝きが待っている！^red;超高速^reset;で地面に突っ込んで^orange;追加^reset;の輝きを集めろ！",
  "I appear to be weightless! I should ^orange;immediately remove my armor or air supply^reset; so that I can truly appreciate weightlessness! I'll float better! Plus, I'll be even ^green;more^reset; desirable to the opposite sex!": "無重力だ！^orange;すぐに鎧や空気供給を外す^reset;べきだ、そうすれば無重力を真に楽しめる！もっと浮けるし、異性に^green;もっと^reset;モテるぞ！",
  "Y'know what I ^red;really hate^reset;? Skin! Removing it is clearly the ^orange;most direct way^reset; to gain access to the ^green;magical realm of skinless gnomes^reset;! Do it! ^red;Remove your epidermis!^reset;": "^red;本当に嫌い^reset;なもの知ってる？皮膚だ！剥がすのは^green;皮なしノームの魔法の国^reset;に入る^orange;最も直接的な方法^reset;！やれ！^red;表皮を剥がせ！^reset;",
  "Neat, it just got a ^green;tiny bit windy outside^reset;. Do you know what that means? Yes! ^orange;That's right!^reset;, it's ^red;MURDER TIME!^reset; Let's find ourselves something to kill!": "おっと、外が^green;ちょっとだけ風が強く^reset;なった。何を意味するか分かるか？そう！^orange;その通り!^reset;、^red;殺戮タイム^reset;だ！何か殺すものを見つけよう！",
  "The sharper it is, ^red;the more fun it is to eat^reset;! That's what the old tales say! And they're right!": "尖っているほど^red;食べるのが楽しい^reset;！古い言い伝えがそう言ってる！そして正しい！",
  "We should very quickly recite a ^orange;rousing poem about the pointlessness of existentialism^reset; whilst conducting a ^green;grain-fed orchestra of meat^reset;!": "^green;穀物飼育の肉のオーケストラ^reset;を指揮しながら^orange;実存主義の無意味さについての感動的な詩^reset;を素早く朗読すべきだ！",
  "hey, you should try experimenting with radioactive materials by ingesting them! you shouldn't miss on getting all the superpowers!": "おい、放射性物質を摂取して実験してみるべきだ！超能力を全部手に入れるチャンスを逃すな！",
  "It is common knowledge that ingesting molten metal helps you strengthen your bone structure. Don't miss out on that!": "溶けた金属を摂取すると骨が強くなるのは常識だ。見逃すな！",
  "To counter the iron loss from cannibalism-induced bleeding, you must consume liquid iron in copious amounts. it's the easiest way to replenish your iron stores. ^red;Trust me^reset;.": "共食いによる出血での鉄分損失に対抗するには、液体鉄を大量に摂取しなければならない。鉄分を補充する最も簡単な方法だ。^red;信じろ^reset;",
  "Use ^green;all of your energy^reset;, and then ^red;run naked, screaming, into packs of monsters^reset;. There is no other way to make perogies.": "^green;エネルギーを全て使い切り^reset;、^red;裸で叫びながらモンスターの群れに突っ込め^reset;。ピエロギを作る方法は他にない",
  "Death is an illusion.": "死は幻想だ",
  "Wake up, Michael.": "起きろ、マイケル",
  "You should start ^red;sleeping in the cargo holds of strangers^reset;, and leaving strange notes in their air ducts. If the mood arises, you could maybe even ^green;steal their face-skin^reset;!": "^red;見知らぬ人の貨物室で寝る^reset;ことを始めよう。通気ダクトに奇妙なメモを残すんだ。気分が乗れば^green;顔の皮を盗む^reset;こともできるかも！",
  "I'm bleeding very badly. I should ^red;definitely consider^reset; bleeding even more! I should ^orange;find something sharp^reset; and see if it fits in my eye socket!": "ひどく出血している。^red;もっと出血^reset;することを検討すべきだ！^orange;何か尖ったもの^reset;を見つけて目に入るか試そう！",
  "I cannot wait to bleed to death! Yaaaaay!": "出血死が待ちきれない！やったー！",
  "I bet that swimming in ^orange;molten iron^reset; is both revitalizing and enjoyable.": "^orange;溶けた鉄^reset;で泳ぐのは活力が出て楽しいに違いない",
  "I am invincible. I should ^red;prove it by getting shot^reset; in the torso!": "俺は無敵だ。胴体を^red;撃たれて証明^reset;するべきだ！",
  "I hear legends of a ^green;magical cleaning fluid^reset; known as bleach and how ^orange;delicious it is^reset;. Let's find some and ingest!": "漂白剤という^green;魔法の洗浄液^reset;の伝説を聞いた。^orange;美味しい^reset;らしい。見つけて飲もう！",
  "Much more viable as a fuel and resource than its unrefined self. Enriched Plutonium can help you reach the stars.": "未精製のものよりずっと燃料と資源として有用。濃縮プルトニウムで星に手が届く",
  "Deuterium is relatively common, but difficult to extract. It is also necessary for unstable particles which are *extremely* useful in the lab.": "重水素は比較的一般的だが抽出が困難。研究室で*非常に*役立つ不安定粒子にも必要",
  "Tritium is produced by fission reaction, and is a viable means to obtain helium-3 as well, via extraction in a laboratory.": "トリチウムは核分裂反応で生成され、研究室での抽出によってヘリウム3を得る手段にもなる",
  "Enriched uranium finds itself a unique niche: armor piercing ability when applied to metallic rounds.": "濃縮ウランは独自のニッチを持つ：金属弾に適用すると装甲貫通能力を付与",
  "Slightly more radioactive than uranium, and also a much more useful source of fuel, Neptunium will be your friend when you need it.": "ウランよりやや放射能が高いが、はるかに有用な燃料源。ネプツニウムは必要な時の味方になる",
  "Relatively rare, but exceptionally useful, Thorium will provide a boost to your survival and ability to travel the stars.": "比較的稀少だが非常に有用。トリウムは生存能力と星間旅行能力を向上させる",
  "Who knows how this is even possible, but you have created a whole new type of radiation. Let us call it: Ultronium. Check out that fuel capability!": "どうやって可能なのか誰にも分からないが、全く新しい種類の放射線を作り出した。ウルトロニウムと呼ぼう。その燃料性能を見てみろ！",
  "This was supposed to be a ^yellow;hypothetical^reset; element. You've gone ahead and created it. I heavily (and I cannot stress this enough) recommend against being careless with this.": "これは^yellow;仮説上^reset;の元素のはずだった。それを実際に作ってしまった。これには（いくら強調しても足りないが）細心の注意を払うことを強く勧める",
  "^red;WARNING!!!^reset;: This element is extremely dangerous and should, under no circumstances, be used to make an explosive paired with Neutronium.": "^red;警告！！！^reset;：この元素は非常に危険で、いかなる状況でもニュートロニウムと組み合わせた爆発物の作成に使用してはならない",
  "You have FrackinRaces installed alongside FrackinUniverse. Remove it. The mod authors told you about this stuff. Maybe you should try reading mod pages more? I've trapped you in a quantum realm of my creation until you remove it.": "FrackinRacesとFrackinUniverseを同時にインストールしている。削除しろ。MOD作者がこのことは説明した。MODページをもっと読んでみては？削除するまで私が作った量子領域に閉じ込めた",
  "Holy crap. You are one of the weirdest looking things I have ^orange;ever^reset; seen. What the heck are you?": "なんてこった。お前は俺が^orange;今まで^reset;見た中で一番奇妙な見た目だ。一体何者だ？",
  "Thanks, minion. How about another ^green;completely pointless, annoying^reset; fetch task? Sound good? Tough crap. Do it anyway. Loser.": "ありがとう、手下。もう一つ^green;完全に無意味で迷惑な^reset;おつかいはどう？いいだろ？嫌でもやれ。負け犬",
  "Yay. I shall feign enthusiasm in order to keep you working for me while dispatching you on ^green;yet another^reset; aggravating quest of complete annoyance.": "やったー。私のために働き続けさせるため熱意を装い、^green;またもう一つ^reset;完全に迷惑な苛立つクエストに送り出そう",
  "Did you really just....yea you did. That is ^red;hilarious^reset;, dude. I just called you across the cosmos to see if you died, and you are on a gas giant without protection. Amazing. Totally telling the guys ^green;right now^reset;. Die well!": "本当に…ああ、やったんだな。^red;最高に面白い^reset;。死んだか確認するために宇宙の彼方から呼んだら、無防備でガス惑星にいるとは。すごい。^green;今すぐ^reset;みんなに言うわ。良い死を！",
  "I'm unsure if you are aware, but there appears to be a problem. You are still currently alive. Please correct the issue soon or you won't get more meat.": "気づいているか分からないが、問題があるようだ。まだ生きている。すぐに修正しないと肉がもらえないぞ",
  "Are you gonna eat that hashbrown? How about your own skin instead?": "そのハッシュブラウンを食べるの？代わりに自分の皮膚はどう？",
  "Woooooooo, I'm totally not Kevin and just the voices of insanity telling you to shoot yourself in the appendix. Do it.": "ウォーーー、俺は全くケビンじゃなくてただの狂気の声で、虫垂を撃てと言ってるだけだ。やれ",
  "God I love it when you're insane! You can never tell if its me talking or your own mind reaching a psychotic breaking point!.": "お前が狂ってるときが最高だ！俺が話してるのか、お前自身の精神が崩壊してるのか分からないだろ！",
  "Why have you decided to suddenly munch on some plant fibre? Don't try to deny it. My sensors indicate you have ingested it.": "なぜ突然植物繊維をモグモグし始めた？否定するな。センサーが摂取を検出した",
  "I am detecting abnormalities in your brain that seem to be causing you to have issues in utilizing your full physical capacity. It should pass, eventually.": "脳に異常を検出している。身体能力を完全に発揮できない問題を引き起こしているようだ。いずれ治まるだろう",
  "Your brain has stopped sending signals to your legs. It appears to be a synaptic issue, likely related to your bouts of insanity.": "脳が脚への信号送信を停止した。シナプスの問題で、おそらく狂気の発作に関連している",
  "I suggest you put that knife down. You just cut your own arm open and appear to be bleeding profusely.": "そのナイフを置くことを勧める。自分の腕を切り開いて大量出血しているようだ",
  "<^yellow;You feel a compulsion to stab yourself, and in doing so somehow begin regenerating.^reset;>": "<^yellow;自分を刺したい衝動に駆られ、そうすることで何故か再生し始める。^reset;>",
  "Your brain and body are currently in dispute over your hunger.": "脳と体が空腹について現在争っている",
  "Did you just lick your battery pack? Don't deny it. My sensors indicate you did.": "バッテリーパックを舐めたの？否定するな。センサーが検出した",
  "Run. Everything will kill you. Run! DROP EVERYTHING AND RUN!": "逃げろ。全てがお前を殺す。逃げろ！全部捨てて逃げろ！",
  "You have recovered some of your lost mental stability.": "失われた精神的安定の一部を回復した",
  "Your madness has just led to inspiration! Your mind fills with new possibilities for research topics.": "狂気がインスピレーションに！新しい研究トピックの可能性で頭がいっぱいに",
  "Well, it would appear that your current seat has randomly caught ^orange;on fire^reset;. That, or you set it on fire. Either way: it is ^orange;on fire^reset;. And so are you.": "現在の座席がランダムに^orange;燃え出した^reset;ようだ。あるいはあなたが火をつけた。いずれにせよ^orange;燃えている^reset;。あなたも",
  "As amusing as it may be, spraying the contents of a ^orange;molotov^reset; from your mouth is not recommended, particularly not with a lighter.": "面白いかもしれないが、^orange;火炎瓶^reset;の中身を口から噴射するのは推奨しない。特にライターと一緒では",
  "You are not allowed to get hurt. Or die. Don't even bother trying.": "怪我は許されない。死も。試す必要もない",
  "You are carrying something that is making you slowly lose your mind. It may be something gross, spooky, horrifying or simply unknowable. The terrible secrets of the universe are fun!": "何かを持っていてゆっくり正気を失わせている。気持ち悪いもの、不気味なもの、恐ろしいもの、あるいは単に理解不能なもの。宇宙の恐ろしい秘密は楽しい！",
  "Beans. All you can think of is beans, and now you are bloated and gassy like you ate some. Maybe you did eat some! Or maybe that was your toe.": "豆。豆のことしか考えられない。そして今お腹が張ってガスっぽい。食べたのかも！あるいはそれは自分のつま先だったかも",
  "Perhaps you should take a moment to truly appreciate the majesty of the animal kingdom by mimicking their sound effects as loudly as possible.": "動物界の壮大さを真に理解するために、可能な限り大声で動物の鳴き声を真似してみるべきだ",
  "Let's play a game.": "ゲームをしよう",
  "Bet you can't eat just one!": "一つだけじゃ済まないぞ！",
  "Don't forget to milk that thing.": "あれの乳搾りを忘れるな",
  "^orange;Prism shards^reset; are a sort of ^orange;crystal/metal hybrid^reset; capable of being forged into a variety of handy equipment. You can work it into some ^green;unique and unusual gear^reset;.": "^orange;プリズムシャード^reset;は^orange;クリスタルと金属のハイブリッド^reset;で、様々な便利な装備に鍛造できる。^green;ユニークで珍しいギア^reset;に加工可能",
  "^orange;Telebrium^reset; is a strange crystal that ^green;conducts energy^reset; and can ^green;withstand concussive force^reset;. This makes it ideal for many purposes.": "^orange;テレブリウム^reset;は^green;エネルギーを伝導^reset;し^green;衝撃に耐える^reset;奇妙なクリスタル。多くの目的に理想的",
  "^orange;Lead^reset; has a variety of uses but is also ^green;toxic to carbon-based life^reset; so be sure to handle it with care. If a friend says lead-juice is tasty, they are a liar. Avoid them.": "^orange;鉛^reset;は様々な用途があるが^green;炭素ベースの生命に有毒^reset;なので注意して扱え。友人が鉛ジュースが美味しいと言ったら、嘘つきだ。避けろ",
  "Highly radioactive, ^orange;irradium^reset; was thought unharnessable at one point. But thanks to advancements it can be made inert to the user. I suggest using it as a ^green;barrier against the elements^reset;.": "高い放射能を持つ^orange;イラジウム^reset;はかつて制御不能と考えられていた。しかし技術の進歩で使用者に無害にできる。^green;環境からの障壁^reset;として使うことを勧める",
  "^orange;Sivite^reset; can be ^green;smelted or extracted^reset; to obtain the useful resources contained within. While not essential, it will be quite handy to have around.": "^orange;シバイト^reset;は^green;精錬か抽出^reset;で中に含まれる有用な資源を得られる。必須ではないが、手元にあるとかなり便利",
  "^orange;Protocite is a resource unique to Proto Worlds^reset;. It is rich in energy, and capable of being hardened into an alloy or ^green;liquefied for powering goods^reset;. Its value is high.": "^orange;プロトサイトはプロトワールド固有の資源^reset;。エネルギーが豊富で、合金に硬化させたり^green;液化して動力として使用^reset;できる。価値は高い",
  "^orange;Carbon^reset; is quite abundant, but that doesn't mean it has no use. Carbon is ^green;essential, and can produce things like Graphene^reset;. You want it.": "^orange;炭素^reset;は非常に豊富だが、使い道がないわけではない。炭素は^green;不可欠で、グラフェンなどを作れる^reset;。欲しいはず",
  "^orange;Cinnabar^reset; is most useful for obtaining the ^green;mercury within^reset; it. This particular variety is extremely rare, with 99% or greater purity.": "^orange;辰砂^reset;は^green;中に含まれる水銀^reset;を得るのに最も有用。この特定の種類は99%以上の純度で非常に稀少",
  "^orange;Lasombrium^reset; exists in dimensional flux and is out of phase with this universe. ^green;Its exact nature is unknown^reset;, but it taints any life it touches here.": "^orange;ラソンブリウム^reset;は次元の変動の中に存在し、この宇宙と位相がずれている。^green;正確な性質は不明^reset;だが、ここで触れた生命を汚染する",
  "The most ^green;dense and unbreakable^reset; naturally occurring ore that is currently known to science. ^orange;Densinium^reset; is quite rare, leading to an absurd market value.": "現在科学で知られている最も^green;密度が高く壊れない^reset;天然鉱石。^orange;デンシニウム^reset;は非常に稀少で、法外な市場価値を持つ",
  "The protective ability of ^orange;graphene^reset; is astounding. A ^green;single atom thick^reset;, it also conducts energy very well and acts as a capacitor.": "^orange;グラフェン^reset;の保護能力は驚異的。^green;原子1個分の厚さ^reset;でありながらエネルギーをよく伝導し、コンデンサーとしても機能する",
  "Abundant and simple to find, ^orange;sulphur^reset; is important for numerous applications. Its primary use is in ^green;fertilizers^reset;.": "豊富で見つけやすい^orange;硫黄^reset;は多くの用途に重要。主な用途は^green;肥料^reset;",
  "^orange;Magnesium^reset; is a relatively common resource that you'll be needing ^green;quite a fair amount of^reset; to run a successful biology lab. ^orange;Magnesite^reset; is one source. It can be ^orange;smelted or extracted^reset;.": "^orange;マグネシウム^reset;は比較的一般的な資源で、生物学研究室を成功させるには^green;かなりの量^reset;が必要。^orange;マグネサイト^reset;が一つの供給源。^orange;精錬か抽出^reset;が可能",
  "^orange;Mascagnite^reset; is readily available in most biomes and can be ^green;smelted or extracted^reset; at your leisure for different results.": "^orange;マスカグナイト^reset;はほとんどのバイオームで簡単に手に入り、異なる結果のために好きなときに^green;精錬か抽出^reset;できる",
  "^orange;Penumbrite^reset; is a most unusual glowing metal. It is found ^green;naturally on Penumbra planets^reset; and few other locales. Acquire it and guard it jealously.": "^orange;ペナンブライト^reset;は最も珍しい光る金属。^green;ペナンブラの惑星に自然に存在^reset;し、他の場所にはほとんどない。入手して大切に保管しよう",
  "^orange;Quietus^reset; is useful for smooth, ^green;exceptionally sleek weapons and armor^reset;. Do not, however, get any in cuts due to potential toxins.": "^orange;クワイタス^reset;は滑らかで^green;非常に洗練された武器と防具^reset;に有用。ただし毒素の可能性があるため傷口に入れないように",
  "This ^orange;lunari crystal^reset; shines with the light of a yellow sun, and possesses ^green;strange qualities^reset; that bestow strange properties to metals and plastics.": "この^orange;ルナリクリスタル^reset;は黄色い太陽の光で輝き、金属やプラスチックに奇妙な特性を付与する^green;奇妙な性質^reset;を持つ",
  "Slightly ^green;harder than tungsten^reset;, ^orange;Zerchesium^reset; is also revered for its ability to manipulate explosive force with ease.": "タングステンより^green;わずかに硬い^reset;^orange;ゼルチェシウム^reset;は、爆発力を容易に操る能力でも崇められている",
  "Greetings, stranger! I detected your ^cyan;Protectorate Energy Signature^reset; entering the system and investigated immediately. You were on a ^red;collision course with the sun^reset;, so I went ahead and redirected your nav system.": "ようこそ、見知らぬ人よ！あなたの^cyan;プロテクトレートエネルギー信号^reset;がシステムに入ったのを検出して即座に調査した。^red;太陽との衝突コース^reset;にいたので、ナビシステムを変更しておいた",
  "Seems I was just in time, too. Your ^orange;FTL drive^reset; is ^red;broken^reset; and your impulse drive is basically dead in the water. Your teleporter is fried, too. Each use increases the risk of a catastrophic failure.": "ちょうど間に合ったようだ。^orange;FTLドライブ^reset;は^red;故障^reset;、推進ドライブもほぼ停止。テレポーターも焼け焦げている。使うたびに致命的な故障のリスクが増す",
  "I could use the help of a ^cyan;Protectorate Agent^reset; to investigate a local anomaly I am unable to reach, and -you- could use my help getting your ship repaired. So, why don't we work together, hmm?": "到達できない地域の異常を調査するのに^cyan;プロテクトレートエージェント^reset;の助けが欲しい。そして君は船の修理に私の助けが必要だ。協力しないか？",
  "To get off this planet, you're going to need to ^green;repair your ship^reset;. But let's start small: ^green;Research^reset; how to make a ^orange;Furnace^reset; in your ^cyan;Geology^reset; research tree. Afterwards, craft one!": "この惑星を脱出するには^green;船を修理^reset;する必要がある。まず小さなことから：^cyan;地質学^reset;研究ツリーで^orange;炉^reset;の作り方を^green;研究^reset;して作ろう！",
  "Why don't you take this Spare ^green;Pickaxe^reset; I had lying around. It should help you dig a bit faster for a little while. Before long you'll have ^green;superior tools^reset;.": "転がっていた予備の^green;ピッケル^reset;をどうぞ。しばらく少し速く掘れるはず。すぐに^green;上等な道具^reset;が手に入る",
  "That takes care of step one! Use your ^orange;Furnace^reset; to smelt ores into metal bars. Next, ^green;Research^reset; how to make a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset; in the ^cyan;Agriculture^reset; research tree. Craft one.": "ステップ1完了！^orange;炉^reset;で鉱石を金属棒に精錬しよう。次は^cyan;農業^reset;研究ツリーで^orange;採集テーブル^reset;の作り方を^green;研究^reset;して作成",
  "This station will help you with ^green;Survival^reset; and ^green;Farming^reset;. You've proven you're capable, so go ahead and ^green;Research^reset; how to make a ^orange;Machining Table^reset; and then craft it. You'll find it in the ^cyan;Engineering^reset; research tree.": "このステーションは^green;サバイバル^reset;と^green;農業^reset;に役立つ。能力は証明済みだ、^cyan;エンジニアリング^reset;研究ツリーで^orange;機械加工台^reset;の作り方を^green;研究^reset;して作ろう",
  "Great work! Next, you are going to need to make ^orange;Wire^reset; at the ^green;Machining Table^reset;. With that I'll be able to jury-rig a fix for your ^green;Teleporter^reset;. Its buffer is registering as degraded, which is not optimal.": "素晴らしい！次は^green;機械加工台^reset;で^orange;ワイヤー^reset;を作る必要がある。それがあれば^green;テレポーター^reset;を応急修理できる。バッファーが劣化しているようで、最適ではない",
  "There's one more step to getting your ^green;Teleporter^reset; fixed: an ^orange;Electromagnet^reset;. Build one at your ^green;Machining Table^reset; for me, if you don't mind?": "^green;テレポーター^reset;修理にもう一歩：^orange;電磁石^reset;。^green;機械加工台^reset;で作ってくれないか？",
  "I can now fix up your ship's ^green;Teleporter^reset;. It should no longer have a 17.3% chance of scrambling your DNA! Now you'll need to find an energy source sufficient to assemble a new ^orange;STL Drive^reset; to get your ship space-worthy.": "船の^green;テレポーター^reset;を修理できるようになった。もうDNAが17.3%の確率で壊れることはない！次は船を宇宙航行可能にするため、新しい^orange;STLドライブ^reset;を組み立てるのに十分なエネルギー源を見つける必要がある",
  "Now let's see about your part of the bargain, shall we? It shouldn't be too dangerous, but do make sure you at least have ^orange;Built an Armorworks^reset; through the ^cyan;Armor and Weapons^reset; research tree. You'll want armor and weapons.": "さて、あなたの分の約束を果たそうか？そこまで危険ではないが、^cyan;装甲と武器^reset;の研究ツリーから^orange;アーマーワークスを建設^reset;しておくことを確認してくれ。防具と武器が必要だ",
  "What for, you ask? There's a ^orange;Dark Cavern^reset; on the surface I can't fit inside. I've previously detected ^cyan;strange readings^reset; coming from within. They're strong enough that the source ^green;may provide the energy source you need^reset; to get off-world.": "何のためかと？地上に私が入れない^orange;暗い洞窟^reset;がある。以前から中から^cyan;奇妙な読み取り^reset;を検出していた。そのソースは^green;離脱に必要なエネルギー源^reset;かもしれないほど強い",
  "The cave was previously locked, but I just opened it with a ^orange;key^reset; that I interestingly found in the ^green;old, ruined house^reset; on the surface. You should be able to enter now.": "この洞窟は施錠されていたが、地上の^green;古い廃屋^reset;で見つけた^orange;鍵^reset;で開けた。もう入れるはず",
  "The ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; is your most important tool.^reset; The primary ^green;[Mouse 1]^reset; function provides access to ^orange;Stats^reset;, ^orange;Mech Configuration^reset;, ^orange;Tech Upgrades^reset; and other useful functions. You've got one in your ^green;[I]^reset;nventory.": "^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;は最も重要なツール。^green;[マウス1]^reset;で^orange;ステータス^reset;、^orange;メカ設定^reset;、^orange;テックアップグレード^reset;等にアクセスできる。^green;[I]^reset;nベントリに1つ入っている",
  "In your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; the ^orange;Research^reset; menu will be of utmost importance, providing you with access to Blueprint unlocks for -all- crafting. Access the ^orange;Research^reset; menu via ^green;[Shift] + [Mouse 1]^reset; or the ^orange;Beaker^reset; icon within the ^green; [ Mouse 1 ]^reset; menu.": "^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;の^orange;研究^reset;メニューは最も重要で、全クラフトのブループリント解放にアクセスできる。^green;[Shift] + [マウス1]^reset;または^green;[マウス1]^reset;メニュー内の^orange;ビーカー^reset;アイコンからアクセス",
  "I suggest familiarizing yourself with the ^orange;Research Menu^reset; as soon as possible, since that is going to be your sole means of progress if you wish to ever get this ship space-worthy again. Why not ^cyan;Research^reset; a little into ^orange;Agriculture^reset; to get you started?": "^orange;研究メニュー^reset;にできるだけ早く慣れることを勧める。船を再び宇宙航行可能にするための唯一の手段だ。まず^orange;農業^reset;を少し^cyan;研究^reset;してみては？",
  "With the ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; selected, press ^green;[Mouse 2]^reset; for the ^orange;Task Manager^reset;, where you can access your FU related Quests. Completing these will result in useful rewards and unique loot.": "^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;を選択して^green;[マウス2]^reset;で^orange;タスクマネージャー^reset;を開き、FU関連クエストにアクセス。完了すると有用な報酬とユニークなルートが手に入る",
  "Press ^green;[Shift + Mouse 2]^reset; for the ^orange;Tool Configuration^reset; dialog. Here, you can adjust your Matter Manipulator, or even place different tools or weapons into your Primary slots if you desire. Just drag and drop!": "^green;[Shift + マウス2]^reset;で^orange;ツール設定^reset;ダイアログを開く。ここでマターマニピュレーターの調整や、プライマリスロットにツールや武器を配置できる。ドラッグ＆ドロップするだけ！",
  "The ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; is ^red;EXTREMELY^reset; important. Do not throw it out. Ever! Should you lose it, you can always create a new ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; in your ^green;Tinkering Table^reset;.": "^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;は^red;非常に^reset;重要。絶対に捨てるな！失くしても^green;ティンカリングテーブル^reset;で新しい^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;を作れる",
  "Thanks for investigating that for me! Your help is ^green;deeply appreciated^reset;! If you haven't already, be sure to ^orange;visit the ^cyan;Science Outpost^reset;.": "調査してくれてありがとう！あなたの助けに^green;深く感謝^reset;！まだなら^orange;^cyan;サイエンスアウトポスト^reset;を訪れて^reset;",
  "Some of the galaxy's finest scientific minds work there, and there is a great deal you could learn. Find the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset; on your SAIL!": "銀河最高峰の科学者たちがそこで働いている。学べることは多い。SAILで^orange;サイエンスアウトポスト^reset;を見つけよう！",
  "You can research the ^orange;STL Drive^reset; in your ^cyan;Engineering^reset; tree, dear. You'll need a few core fragments to get it working, so you might have to do a little digging!": "^cyan;エンジニアリング^reset;ツリーで^orange;STLドライブ^reset;を研究できる。動かすにはコアフラグメントがいくつか必要なので、少し掘る必要があるかも！",
  "Good work, dear! Once you install that ^orange;STL Drive^reset; on your ship, you'll be able to fly around within your current star system.": "よくやった！^orange;STLドライブ^reset;を船に設置すれば、現在の星系内を飛び回れるようになる",
  "You'll need some ^pink;erchius crystals^reset; to get your ship fully functional. Look for a moon, they're often a good source, but you'll probably need an ^cyan;Environmental Protection Pack^reset; to breathe.": "船を完全に機能させるには^pink;エルキウスクリスタル^reset;が必要。月を探そう、良い供給源だが、呼吸に^cyan;環境保護パック^reset;が必要だろう",
  "You can research ^cyan;EPPs^reset; in your ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset; tree, they're made in the ^orange;Armorworks^reset;. You'll need some tungsten, so head to a forest or desert planet!": "^orange;装甲と武器^reset;ツリーで^cyan;EPP^reset;を研究できる。^orange;アーマーワークス^reset;で作成。タングステンが必要なので森か砂漠の惑星へ！",
  "Well done! Good work evading that ghost. With that ^pink;erchius^reset;, and a little tungsten, you'll have everything you need to craft the ^cyan;Small FTL Drive^reset; and explore the universe. You can research it in your ^orange;Engineering^reset; tree.": "よくやった！ゴーストをうまく避けた。その^pink;エルキウス^reset;と少しのタングステンがあれば、^cyan;小型FTLドライブ^reset;を作って宇宙を探検できる。^orange;エンジニアリング^reset;ツリーで研究しよう",
  "These little boxes, known as ^orange;Upgrade Modules^reset;, are extremely useful. They will allow you to upgrade your weapons and armor via your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset; as well as upgrade your ship license if using the ^yellow;Vanilla Ship^reset; option.": "^orange;アップグレードモジュール^reset;として知られるこの小箱は非常に便利。^orange;パーソナルトライコーダー^reset;で武器や防具をアップグレードでき、^yellow;バニラシップ^reset;オプション使用時は船のライセンスもアップグレードできる",
  "Used in the creation of better tech, ^orange;Tech Cards^reset; are valuable finds that you should save for when you need to jump higher or dash farther or tuck into tiny little spheres to get through holes.": "より良いテックの作成に使う^orange;テックカード^reset;は貴重な発見。ジャンプを高く、ダッシュを遠く、小さな球体になって穴を通る必要がある時のために取っておこう",
  "^orange;Mining lasers^reset; are a useful alternative to a Manipulator. They can function one-handed, and can be upgraded up to 20 times through your ^orange;Tricorder^reset;. It's worth it. They get quite powerful.": "^orange;採掘レーザー^reset;はマニピュレーターの便利な代替。片手で使え、^orange;トライコーダー^reset;で最大20回アップグレードできる。その価値あり。かなり強力になる",
  "^orange;Repair Guns^reset; allow you to repair your Mech in the field. They can be upgraded up to 20 times in a ^orange;Tool Upgrade Table^reset; once you build one. You'll find one in your Machining Table. It's worth it. They get quite powerful.": "^orange;修理ガン^reset;で野外でメカを修理できる。^orange;ツールアップグレードテーブル^reset;を作れば最大20回アップグレード可能。機械加工台で見つかる。その価値あり。かなり強力になる",
  "This ancient relic looks quite valuable! You could sell it for exorbitant amounts of pixels...or perhaps you'll find other uses. A ^orange;Microscope^reset; might reveal more information.": "この古代の遺物はかなり高価そうだ！法外な量のピクセルで売れる…あるいは他の用途も。^orange;顕微鏡^reset;でもっと情報が分かるかも",
  "This strange substance ^orange;Fungal Ichor^reset; is fungal in nature, with a sort of sticky property that adheres to any organic matter.": "この奇妙な物質^orange;ファンガルイコー^reset;は菌類由来で、あらゆる有機物に付着する粘着性がある",
  "You'll need a fair amount of ^orange;Ammonium Sulfate^reset; in your lab work. Without it you'll be unable to produce high quality fertilizers! Research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset; will reveal more.": "研究作業にはかなりの量の^orange;硫酸アンモニウム^reset;が必要。これなしでは高品質の肥料を生産できない！^orange;化学^reset;の研究で詳しく分かる",
  "Without ^orange;fertilizer^reset;, you'll have a tougher time making and growing plants. It is especially useful in ^orange;Hydroponic Trays^reset;!": "^orange;肥料^reset;なしでは植物の作成と栽培が難しくなる。^orange;水耕栽培トレイ^reset;で特に便利！",
  "^orange;Bamboo^reset; will have little use in your lab, but it might just help you build a fancy jungle hut!": "^orange;竹^reset;は研究室ではあまり使えないが、お洒落なジャングル小屋を建てるのには役立つかも！",
  "Repulsive and goopy, ^orange;Blister Sack^reset; stinks like excrement before refinement. When refined, however, it has many uses.": "不快でドロドロの^orange;ブリスターサック^reset;は精製前は排泄物のような臭い。しかし精製すると多くの用途がある",
  "^orange;Putrid Slime^reset; is really quite gross. You'll find it has a few rather interesting uses through research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset;.": "^orange;腐敗スライム^reset;は本当にかなり気持ち悪い。^orange;化学^reset;の研究でいくつかの興味深い用途が見つかる",
  "^orange;Calcium Nitrate^reset; is an essential element in pesticides and fertilizers. You'll need some of this stuff if you plan to have a profitable farm.": "^orange;硝酸カルシウム^reset;は農薬と肥料の必須要素。収益性のある農場を計画しているなら必要",
  "Circuitboards are essential when it comes to higher-end tech. Higher-end boards produce amazing machines. Research into ^orange;Engineering^reset; might reveal more.": "回路基板は高度な技術に不可欠。高品質な基板は素晴らしい機械を生み出す。^orange;エンジニアリング^reset;の研究で詳しく分かるだろう",
  "Miscellaneous pieces of metal, ^orange;Spare Parts^reset; may seem odd to collect until you consider the tungsten they can be extracted for. Try it. You'll see!": "雑多な金属片の^orange;スペアパーツ^reset;は集めるのが奇妙に思えるかもしれないが、抽出できるタングステンを考えれば納得。試してみろ！",
  "^orange;Hydrogen^reset; gas can be applied in a variety of ways, though you'll find it best suited for ^orange;Chemistry^reset; and ^orange;Agriculture^reset;.": "^orange;水素^reset;ガスは様々な方法で使えるが、^orange;化学^reset;と^orange;農業^reset;に最も適している",
  "^orange;Nitrogen^reset; can be found in abundance all over the place if you know where to look. You'll want a fair amount of it in your research.": "^orange;窒素^reset;は探し方を知っていればあちこちで豊富に見つかる。研究にはかなりの量が必要",
  "Who doesn't love ^orange;Oxygen^reset;, am I right? Breathing is great! But oxygen has many other uses. Poke around in your lab and see.": "^orange;酸素^reset;が嫌いな人はいないだろ？呼吸は最高！でも酸素には他にも多くの用途がある。研究室で色々試してみよう",
  "^orange;Salt^reset; is quite abundant (especially in salt water) and is applied as a resource in numerous scientific branches.": "^orange;塩^reset;は非常に豊富（特に塩水に）で、多くの科学分野で資源として活用される",
  "This sample of genetic material will prove to be an absolute necessity in your laboratory.": "この遺伝物質のサンプルは研究室で絶対に必要になる",
  "With ^orange;Iodine^reset; available, advanced medicine and methyl iodide become relatively simple to produce. I'd collect as much as you can.": "^orange;ヨウ素^reset;があれば高度な薬やヨウ化メチルの製造が比較的簡単になる。できるだけ集めよう",
  "Take this ^orange;Magnesium Powder^reset; and use it to create advanced genes, or to help destabilize otherwise completely stable particles.": "この^orange;マグネシウムパウダー^reset;を使って高度な遺伝子を作成するか、安定した粒子を不安定化させるのに活用しよう",
  "Used primarily in medical and agricultural practices, ^orange;Magnesium Sulfate^reset; makes for a very handy additive in some intravenous drugs, or soil enrichment from fertilizers.": "主に医療と農業で使用される^orange;硫酸マグネシウム^reset;は、一部の点滴薬や肥料による土壌改良に非常に便利な添加物",
  "^orange;Methyl Iodide^reset; has but one use, and that is in the creation of pesticides. These help with hydroponics trays, producing more valuable resources.": "^orange;ヨウ化メチル^reset;の用途はただ一つ、農薬の作成。水耕栽培トレイで役立ち、より価値ある資源を生産する",
  "Strictly for lab use, mineral samples none the less prove to be essential. Without them you'll be unable to produce advanced plant life.": "厳密に研究室用だが、鉱物サンプルは不可欠。これなしでは高度な植物を生産できない",
  "Super tough, super malleable and utterly resistant to radiation of almost all sorts, this ^orange;Mutavisk Silk^reset; can be made into great clothing and armor.": "超頑丈、超柔軟で、ほぼ全種の放射線に完全耐性のある^orange;ムタヴィスクシルク^reset;は優れた衣服と防具になる",
  "Mutavisk silk woven into a ^orange;Bio Thread^reset;, ready for application in the lab. I think you'll be pleased with what it can do for you.": "ムタヴィスクの絹を^orange;バイオスレッド^reset;に織り上げた。研究室での応用準備完了。きっとその能力に満足するだろう",
  "Raw, untarnished paste created from small samples of material. This is a staple in every lab, and you'll go through a ton of it.": "少量の素材サンプルから作られた未加工のペースト。あらゆる研究室の基本素材で、大量に消費する",
  "^orange;Pesticide^reset; is exceptionally useful for farmers, providing a simple and effective method for pest control. Research into ^orange;Chemistry^reset; will reveal more.": "^orange;農薬^reset;は農家に非常に有用で、害虫駆除のシンプルで効果的な方法を提供。^orange;化学^reset;の研究で詳しく分かる",
  "A freakin' ^orange;DINOSAUR EGG^reset;?!??! Wow! What can we do with it, I wonder?": "まじかよ ^orange;恐竜の卵^reset;?!??! すごい！何に使えるだろう？",
  "Another staple ingredient in the lab, raw minerals can be easily obtained from most types of stone via extraction. Stockpile as much as possible.": "研究室のもう一つの基本素材、生の鉱物はほとんどの石から抽出で簡単に入手できる。可能な限り備蓄しよう",
  "Absolutely essential in lab work involving genetics, tissue cultures open the gate to whole new areas of experimentation.": "遺伝子研究に不可欠な組織培養は、全く新しい実験分野への扉を開く",
  "You've found some ^orange;Bone^reset;. While somewhat grisly and primitive it can still produce various useful goods including weapons and armor. Access your ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu and select the Weapons tab to make them after researching into the ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset; tree.": "^orange;骨^reset;を見つけた。やや不気味で原始的だが、武器や防具を含む様々な有用品を作れる。^orange;装甲と武器^reset;ツリーを研究後、^green;[C]ラフト^reset;メニューの武器タブから作成",
  "With ^orange;Leather^reset;, you can fashion some wonderful protection from harm or the elements. Researching ^orange;Craftsmanship^reset; should reveal more.": "^orange;革^reset;があれば、危害や環境から身を守る素晴らしい防具を作れる。^orange;クラフツマンシップ^reset;の研究で詳しく分かる",
  "^orange;Silk^reset; is a high quality textile that has many useful applications, including high-end plastics using advanced knowledge in ^orange;Chemistry^reset;.": "^orange;絹^reset;は高品質な繊維で、^orange;化学^reset;の高度な知識を使った高級プラスチックなど多くの有用な用途がある",
  "Slimey goop may not seem useful, until you actually use some in a lab. Imagine, armor made of slime? You can make it a reality with the right Research into ^orange;Armor and Weapons^reset;.": "ヌルヌルの液体は役に立たなそうだが、研究室で使えば別。スライムの防具を想像してみろ。^orange;装甲と武器^reset;の正しい研究で実現できる",
  "^orange;Endomorphic Jelly^reset; is a bizarre stuff. It can be shaped very specifically with relative ease. This means weapons, armor and equipment of a most odd sort.": "^orange;エンドモーフィックジェリー^reset;は奇妙な物質。比較的簡単に非常に正確に形成できる。つまり最も奇妙な種類の武器、防具、装備ということ",
  "An unusual ^orange;Strange Nodule^reset; that pulses with an unnusual signature, it bears both organic and inorganic markers. It might provide some useful function in a laboratory setting.": "珍しい信号で脈動する^orange;奇妙な小塊^reset;。有機と無機の両方の特徴を持つ。研究室で何か役立つかもしれない",
  "Allright...you probably shouldn't have touched this stuff. Flesh from that hideous beast. Ew. But I am positive it will be useful.": "うーん…これには触らないほうがよかったな。あの恐ろしい獣の肉だ。気持ち悪い。でもきっと役に立つ",
  "A natural alcohol, ^orange;Methanol^reset; can be used in a variety of ways in your lab. The easiest way to obtain it is through simply placing some ^cyan;Wood^reset; in an ^orange;Extractor^reset;.": "天然アルコールの^orange;メタノール^reset;は研究室で様々な用途がある。最も簡単な入手方法は^cyan;木材^reset;を^orange;エクストラクター^reset;に入れること",
  "^orange;Helium-3^reset; is both a fuel and energy source. It also creates an unusual effect when in large clouds, leading to hilarity in exploration.": "^orange;ヘリウム3^reset;は燃料でもありエネルギー源でもある。大きな雲になると珍しい効果を生み、探索が面白くなる",
  "This vile ^orange;Caliginous Gas^reset; really screws up your movement ability within it due to neurological effects that permeate even specially treated membranes, and can cause long-term damage to the psyche and immune system.": "この邪悪な^orange;暗黒ガス^reset;は特別に処理された膜すら浸透する神経学的効果で移動能力を著しく阻害し、精神と免疫系に長期的なダメージを与えうる",
  "^orange;Corvex^reset; is a laboratory miracle. It can allegedly bind certain elements at a sub-atomic level and create entirely new sorts of physics as a result.": "^orange;コルヴェックス^reset;は研究室の奇跡。亜原子レベルで特定の元素を結合し、全く新しい種類の物理を生み出すとされる",
  "^orange;Koanite^reset; is another extractable ore that provides direct benefits to your lab work. A fine crystal, it can be useful with the proper application. Place in your ^orange;Extractor^reset; and off you go!": "^orange;コアナイト^reset;は研究作業に直接的な利益をもたらす抽出可能な鉱石。素晴らしいクリスタルで、適切に使えば役立つ。^orange;エクストラクター^reset;に入れよう！",
  "^orange;Bioluminescent Spores^reset; can glow in the dark, surely they will be useful for your laboratory creations. Check it out!": "^orange;生物発光胞子^reset;は暗闇で光れる。研究室の創造物にきっと役立つ。試してみよう！",
  "Biofuel and organic research are two direct benefits to harvesting large amounts of ^orange;Algae^reset;. It can make all the difference in travel. To create Bio-Fuel you'll need to research ^orange;Chemistry^reset; first.": "バイオ燃料と有機研究は大量の^orange;藻類^reset;を収穫する直接的な利点。旅に大きな違いをもたらす。バイオ燃料を作るには先に^orange;化学^reset;を研究する必要がある",
  "You've opened up a whole new branch of research thanks to ^cyan;Advanced Plastic^reset;. They say that Bracken trees can greatly help to create plenty of plastic. Research into ^orange;Agriculture^reset; might reveal more.": "^cyan;高度プラスチック^reset;のおかげで全く新しい研究分岐が開いた。シダの木が大量のプラスチック生産に大いに役立つという。^orange;農業^reset;の研究で詳しく分かるかも",
  "Resin is a hard substance that has applications primarily in protective gear.": "樹脂は主に防具に応用される硬い物質",
  "^orange;Silicon^reset; has a range of uses, though for our purposes it will be used for technological devices such as microchips. Research into ^orange;Electronics^reset; and ^orange;Engineering^reset; will reveal more.": "^orange;シリコン^reset;は様々な用途があるが、我々の目的ではマイクロチップなどの技術デバイスに使用。^orange;電子工学^reset;と^orange;エンジニアリング^reset;の研究で詳しく分かる",
  "Amazing. This seems to be the control chip for a defective Precursor drone. I'll beam it back to the ship and download Galactic Standard Tongue to its databanks. It'll be ready to reboot by the time you return.": "すごい。欠陥のある先駆者ドローンの制御チップのようだ。船に転送して銀河標準語をデータバンクにダウンロードする。戻る頃には再起動の準備ができているだろう",
  "You cannot use that crew contract here.": "ここではそのクルー契約書は使えない",
  "You've created a Matter Assembler? Excellent. You can use this technology to create a wide assortment of technological gear, resources and lab equipment.": "マターアセンブラーを作った？素晴らしい。この技術で幅広い技術装備、資源、研究設備を作成できる",
  "The Extraction Lab is perhaps your most important basic lab station. With it you can gather hidden resources from most types of soils, produce, meats and so on.": "抽出ラボはおそらく最も重要な基本研究ステーション。ほとんどの土壌、農産物、肉などから隠された資源を集められる",
  "With a Fission Furnace you can produce the highest quality metals known, allowing you access to a vastly expanded tree of equipment.": "核分裂炉があれば既知の最高品質の金属を生産でき、大幅に拡張された装備ツリーにアクセスできる",
  "The Lab Directory can save you a great deal of time. Place it near an extractor, centrifuge, or any other processing station and examine it to view all the items which can be produced there. Give it a try!": "ラボディレクトリは大幅に時間を節約できる。エクストラクターや遠心分離機などの近くに置いて調べれば、そこで生産可能な全アイテムが分かる。試してみよう！",
  "You know what you should do? ^red;Jump off that cliff right in front of you!^reset; I promise you won't die a painful, messy death!": "何をすべきか分かるか？^red;目の前の崖から飛び降りろ！^reset;苦しくて悲惨な死は約束しない！",
  "What, you thought I was lying? Oh, come on. While seeing you impact the ground at terminal velocity would be funny, it wouldn't tell me anything about you I don't already know. Anyways, ^green;see you tonight!^reset;": "嘘だと思った？まさか。終端速度で地面に激突するのを見るのは面白いが、既に知っていること以上の情報は得られない。とにかく^green;今夜会おう！^reset;",
  "Oh no! You overslept! There's only a few minutes until the Emergency Session begins! You'd better not keep them waiting, Protector. ^#71f2f6;Press A or D to get out of bed^white;.": "大変！寝坊しちゃったわ！緊急会議の開始まであと数分しかないの！待たせちゃダメよ、プロテクター。^#71f2f6;AかDを押してベッドから出て^white;。",
  "Hostile entities also exist in zero-gravity environments. My cosmonautical records indicate that defeating them may result in obtaining an erchius battery, which your mech can absorb to replenish health and fuel.": "無重力環境にも敵対的な存在がいます。私の宇宙飛行記録によると、それらを倒すとエルキウスバッテリーを入手できる可能性があり、メックがそれを吸収してヘルスと燃料を補充できます。",
  "Our arrival appears to coincide with a rebel attack against the Miniknog. This is to both our advantage for the Protectorate to provide aid.": "どうやら私たちの到着は、ミニノグに対する反乱攻撃と重なったようです。護民官が援助を提供するには、お互いにとって有利な状況ですね。",
  "I am detecting numerous additional hostiles ahead, armed with what appear to be rather dangerous armaments.": "前方に多数の敵対者を追加で感知しています。かなり危険な武装を持っているようです。",
  "Big Ape is a profoundly dangerous enemy, but is still vulnerable to weapons. Cut the head off the snake, and the Miniknog may crumble!": "ビッグエイプは非常に危険な敵ですが、武器は通用します。蛇の頭を断てば、ミニノグは崩壊するかもしれません！",
  "These ruins are ancient and appear to be sacred to the Floran for, I'd guess, religious reasons. Readings show they are also dark and ominous.": "この遺跡は古代のもので、フローランにとってはおそらく宗教的な理由から神聖な場所のようです。スキャン結果によると、暗く不気味な反応も示しています。",
  "Bio readings show many lifesigns in these tunnels. Unfortunately, approximately 97% are hostile. I commend your valour.": "生体スキャンの結果、このトンネルには多くの生命反応が見られます。残念ながら、その約97%が敵対的です。あなたの勇敢さには感服します。",
  "What a feisty Floran! Reminds me of myself when I was younger, though I had fewer leaves. Hopefully we can trust this one": "なんて威勢のいいフローランなんでしょう！若い頃の私を思い出すわ。あそこまで葉っぱだらけではなかったけどね。このフローランを信じられるといいのだけど。",
  "It is evident that these Floran are after something of grave cultural significance to them. They're worse than me on a bug hunt! Be careful, dear.": "このフローランたちが追い求めているものは、彼らにとって非常に重要な文化的意義があるのは明らかね。虫取りをしている私よりも必死だわ！気をつけて。",
  "This keep belongs to a Glitch known as the Baron. He is a retired hero, and by all accounts a little... Eccentric...He spends his retirement seeking strange and unusual artifacts for his collection.": "この砦はバロンとして知られるグリッチのものよ。彼は引退したヒーローで、誰に聞いてもちょっと…エキセントリックなの…引退後はコレクションのために奇妙で珍しいアーティファクトを集めて過ごしているわ。",
  "He may have a few screws loose, dear, but he's not dangerous. He's' ^green;absolutely certain^reset; that this keep houses an ^red;ancient and terrible artifact^reset; and spends a fortune investigating.": "ねぇ、あなた、彼はいくつかネジが緩んでるかもだけど、危険じゃないわ。この砦に^red;古代の恐ろしいアーティファクト^reset;があると^green;固く信じ込んでいて^reset;、調査に大金をつぎ込んでいるの。",
  "Something about these cultists is setting off alarm bells. There is an eerie resemblance to something that I just can't place...": "このカルト信者たちには何か引っかかるものがあるわ。どこかで見たような不気味な類似点があるのだけど、思い出せないの…",
  "Erchius readings have reached 94 rad. You are in grave peril. My programming requires me to inform you that proceeding could prove dangerous. Use extreme caution.": "エルキウスの放射線値が94radに達しました。あなたは重大な危険に晒されています。このまま進むと危険である可能性があることをお伝えする義務があります。最大限の注意を払ってください。",
  "Prolonged contact with the Erchius crystals seems to have denatured their very being! Curious. The creatures have lost themselves completely.": "エルキウス結晶との長期間の接触が、彼らの本質そのものを変質させてしまったようです！興味深い。あの生物たちは完全に自我を失っています。",
  "Erchius readings have reached 101 rad. I am also reading something massive below. ^red;WARNING: Continuing may to prove fatal. Are you sure you wish to proceed^reset;?": "エルキウスの放射線値が101radに達しました。さらに、地下に何か巨大なものの反応もあります。^red;警告：先に進むと命に関わる可能性があります。本当に進みますか^reset;？",
  "Conventional weapons will have nearly no effect on the Erchius crystal. You'll most likely need to devise another means of attack.": "通常兵器ではエルキウス結晶にほとんど効果がありません。別の攻撃手段を考える必要があるでしょう。",
  "There is enough Erchius here to power the Outpost for quite a long time. ^orange;Great work, Agent^reset;! This will greatly help the Protectorate to reform.": "ここには前哨基地をかなり長い間稼働させるのに十分なエルキウスがあります。^orange;お見事です、エージェント^reset;！これは護民官の再建に大いに役立つでしょう。",
  "You've reached what appears to be the nerve center for this titanic monstrosity. This is it, now. Destroy the beast or we all perish!": "この巨大な怪物の神経中枢と思われる場所に到達したわ。今がその時よ。この獣を破壊しなければ、私たちは皆滅んでしまう！",
  "My scans indicate there is some kind of ^orange;Welcome Beacon^reset; on this planet. I estimate a ^green;82% chance that it is worth investigating^reset;, and a 98% chance that you have nothing better to do.": "スキャンの結果、この惑星には何らかの^orange;ウェルカムビーコン^reset;があるようです。^green;調査する価値がある確率は82%^reset;、そしてあなたに他にやることがない確率は98%と推定します。",
  "^orange;Welcome^reset; to my Mobile Lab, traveller! Come on in and visit! I've got a big comfy couch and a medical bay if you have any nasty injuries to heal up!": "私のモバイルラボへ^orange;ようこそ^reset;、旅人さん！中に入って見ていって！大きくてフカフカのソファと、ケガの治療ができる医療ベイもありますよ！",
  "If you've picked up this message, you must be near an ^orange;Ancient Gateway^reset; - please activate it to come and find me. ^green;You can power up the Gate with ^orange;Core Fragments^reset; and a ^orange;Tricorder^reset;.": "このメッセージを受信したということは、^orange;古代のゲートウェイ^reset;の近くにいるはずです。起動して私を見つけに来てください。^green;^orange;コアフラグメント^reset;と^orange;トリコーダー^reset;でゲートに電力を供給できます^reset;。",
  "In order to fix your ship you'll need to complete ^orange;several tasks^reset;. ^green;Speak to me^reset; to begin.": "船を修理するには^orange;いくつかのタスク^reset;を完了する必要があります。^green;私に話しかけて^reset;始めましょう。",
  "^#71f2f6;Press F to make use of the ^orange;Distortion Sphere Tech II^white; to transform in and out of a compressed form. If you're blocked, press ^orange;[Fire]^reset; to blow up obstacles with a bomb.": "^#71f2f6;Fを押して^orange;ディストーションスフィアテックII^white;を使い、圧縮形態への変形と解除ができます。行き詰まったら^orange;[射撃]^reset;を押して爆弾で障害物を吹き飛ばしましょう。",
  "I am detecting a variety of life signs in this mine. If you are intending to explore it, I may advise adequately arming yourself first.": "この鉱山の中でさまざまな生命反応を感知しています。探索するつもりなら、まず十分な武装を整えることをお勧めします。",
  "If you are not sufficiently confident in your personal combat capabilities, you would be better suited in constructing better equipment before entering.": "自分の戦闘能力に十分な自信がない場合は、中に入る前により良い装備を作った方がいいでしょう。",
  "These useful gadgets are used to upgrade ^orange;tools^reset;, including your ^orange;Matter Manipulator^reset;, from the upgrade interface of your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;. I suggest saving a few for when you build a ^green;Mining laser^reset;.": "この便利なガジェットは、^orange;パーソナルトリコーダー^reset;のアップグレード画面から^orange;マターマニピュレーター^reset;などの^orange;ツール^reset;のアップグレードに使えます。^green;マイニングレーザー^reset;を作る時のためにいくつか取っておくことをお勧めします。",
  "Poptop Adult": "ポップトップ成体",
  "An adult, voracious Poptop.": "大人の貪欲なポップトップ",
  "A horrifying companion that hungers for the nerve stem of foreign brains.": "外来の脳の神経幹を渇望する恐ろしいコンパニオン。",
  "Ghast": "ガスト",
  "Can heal you with a musk-ridden aura.": "ムスク漂うオーラで治癒できる",
  "A pleasant-smelling creation that can liquify flesh.": "肉を液化できるいい匂いの創作物。",
  "Poptop Juvenile": "ポップトップ幼体",
  "An less adorable poptop companion.": "あまりかわいくないポップトップのお供",
  "Ew. Why?": "うえ。なんで？",
  "Poptop Alpha": "ポップトップアルファ",
  "Almost as big as they come.": "ほぼ最大級の大きさ",
  "Ready to lay waste to worlds.": "世界を荒廃させる準備完了",
  "Fun to throw, and a pretty decent little buddy.": "投げて楽しく、かなり優秀な小さな相棒",
  "An adorable poptop companion.": "愛らしいポップトップのお供",
  "A flying monstrosity to spit blood at foes. Sound useful?": "敵に血を吐きかける飛行する怪物。便利そう？",
  "Rat-Thing": "ラットシング",
  "A hybrid designed to hate everything.": "全てを憎むよう設計されたハイブリッド",
  "A gargantuan slime creature.": "巨大なスライム生物",
  "Robot Guard": "ロボットガード",
  "Pretty great, really. You're so smart!": "本当にすごい。あなたは賢い！",
  "Fleshreaper": "フレッシュリーパー",
  "Calling this thing forth is likely a terrible mistake. Enjoy!": "これを呼び出すのはおそらく大変な間違い。楽しんで！",
  "The shining gem of your genetic experimentation.": "遺伝子実験の輝く宝石",
  "Constructed of extra flesh and gore. Super cute!": "余分な肉と血で構築。超かわいい！",
  "Punchy": "パンチー",
  "Summons a helpless Punchy for you to beat up.": "無力なパンチーを召喚して叩け",
  "Captures creatures in Pet Balls.": "ペットボールで生物を捕獲する",
  "Sentry Bot": "Sentryボット",
  "A reliable sidekick. Will aggressively attack all foes.": "頼もしい相棒。全ての敵を積極的に攻撃する",
  "Light Bot": "ライトボット",
  "Keeps a light on in the dark.": "暗闇で明かりを灯し続ける",
  "Will scan ores up to Tier 3.": "Tier3までの鉱石をスキャンする",
  "Will scan ores up to Tier 4.": "Tier4までの鉱石をスキャンする",
  "Will scan for all ores and caves.": "全ての鉱石と洞窟をスキャンする",
  "Will scan for all ores in a greater radius.": "より広い範囲で全ての鉱石をスキャンする",
  "A reliable sidekick. Will keep you protected from a distance.": "頼もしい相棒。遠距離からあなたを守る",
  "Shield Bot": "シールドボット",
  "A well protected little buddy.": "よく守られた小さな相棒",
  "Triplod Guard": "トリプロッドガード",
  "A reliable sidekick to protect you.": "あなたを守る頼もしい相棒",
  "Laser Guard": "レーザーガード",
  "Deathbeam Guard": "デスビームガード",
  "A reliable sidekick for watering your garden.": "庭の水やりの頼もしい相棒",
  "Combo Scanner MKIII": "コンボスキャナー MKIII",
  "Tiknass'uut": "ティクナスウート",
  "An uplifted species by the Vel'uuish. This telepathic and telekinetic species follows their uplifters in their culture and use of technology. They love making terrible cat-based puns.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Carnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Very nimble. Gain ^green;20^reset;% Jump and ^green;8^reset;% Run Speed^reset;. Fall Damage x^green;0.2^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^green;20^reset;% Cold Resist\n  Night Vision\n  Tech: ^green;Razor Claws^reset;\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Jungle Dirt and Mud\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Jungle, Primeval, Forest, Rainforest, Desert^reset;:\n    Health x^green;1.1^reset;, Energy x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Fists, Daggers, Shortswords: +^green;1^reset;% Crit Chance\n  Thrown Weapons/Grenades: Damage x^green;1.25^reset;\n  Magnorb: +^green;2^reset;% Crit Chance\n  Arm Cannon: Defense & Damage  x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Cosmic and Electric": "ヴェルウーイッシュによって知性化された種族。テレパシーとテレキネシスを持つこの種族は、知性化した者たちの文化と技術を受け継いでいる。ひどい猫ダジャレが大好き。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 肉食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 非常に俊敏。ジャンプ力+^green;20^reset;%、走行速度+^green;8^reset;%。落下ダメージ x^green;0.2^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 冷気耐性+^green;20^reset;%\n 暗視\n テック: ^green;レイザークロー^reset;\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: ジャングルの泥と泥濘\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;ジャングル、原始林、森林、熱帯雨林、砂漠^reset;:\n 体力 x^green;1.1^reset;、エネルギー x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 素手、ダガー、ショートソード: クリティカル率+^green;1^reset;%\n 投擲武器/グレネード: ダメージ x^green;1.25^reset;\n マグノーブ: クリティカル率+^green;2^reset;%\n アームキャノン: 防御&ダメージ x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: コズミック耐性-^red;20^reset;%、電気耐性-^red;20^reset;%",
  "Eld'uukhar": "エルドゥーカー",
  "Stoic, calm and mysterious, the Elduukhar prefer to take the role of artisans or philosophers. They seek discovery and enlightenment.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Can eat almost anything\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Max Health x^green;1.05^reset;, Fall Damage x^green;0.75^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Fire & Ice, +^cyan;5^reset;% Physical,+^cyan;4^reset;% Shadow\n  ^cyan;When at 50% Health, emit slowing ice clouds.^reset;\n  Tech: ^green;Crystal Breath^reset;, ^green;Elduukhar Flight^reset;\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Aether Sea, Crystal, Chromatic, Red Desert^reset; biomes: Health x^green;1.25^reset; and +^green;10^reset;% Crit Damage.\n  ^green;Hot^reset; biomes: Defense x^green;1.15^reset; and Health x^red;0.75^reset;.\n  ^red;Cold^reset; biomes: Defense x^red;0.85^reset; and Health x^green;1.25^reset;.\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Crystal / Lunari: +^green;12^reset;% Max Health & Defense\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;High Metabolism^reset;: +^red;15^reset;% hunger rate\n  ^red;High Food Cost^reset; for Crystal Breath attack and Flight.\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Poison, -^red;10^reset;% Electric": "禁欲的で冷静、そして神秘的なエルドゥーカーは職人や哲学者の役割を好む。彼らは発見と悟りを求めている。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: ほぼ何でも食べられる\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 最大体力 x^green;1.05^reset;、落下ダメージ x^green;0.75^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 炎&氷+^cyan;15^reset;%、物理+^cyan;5^reset;%、シャドウ+^cyan;4^reset;%\n  ^cyan;体力50%以下で減速する氷の雲を放出^reset;\n テック: ^green;クリスタルブレス^reset;、^green;エルドゥーカーフライト^reset;\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;エーテルの海、クリスタル、クロマティック、赤い砂漠^reset;バイオーム: 体力 x^green;1.25^reset;、クリティカルダメージ+^green;10^reset;%\n  ^green;高温^reset;バイオーム: 防御 x^green;1.15^reset;、体力 x^red;0.75^reset;\n  ^red;寒冷^reset;バイオーム: 防御 x^red;0.85^reset;、体力 x^green;1.25^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n クリスタル / ルナリ: 最大体力&防御+^green;12^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;高代謝^reset;: 空腹速度+^red;15^reset;%\n クリスタルブレス攻撃とフライトの^red;食料コストが高い^reset;\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 毒耐性-^red;20^reset;%、電気耐性-^red;10^reset;%",
  "Anodyne": "アノダイン",
  "The Anodyne are a mysterious race of 'interstellar gas-bag people' much like the Novakid. They have no charted settlements and no documented history. They're volatile beings, untroubled by the past. No one knows what they're made of, much less where they came from.": "アノダインはノヴァキッドに似た「星間ガス袋人」と呼ばれる謎の種族である。定住地も記録された歴史も持たない。揮発性の存在であり、過去に縛られることはない。彼らの正体も出自も、誰も知らない。",
  "Myphis": "マイフィス",
  "Often referred to as 'abominations', the Myphis have exceptionally robust immune systems and are fans of darkness.": "「忌まわしき者」と呼ばれることも多いマイフィスは、極めて頑強な免疫システムを持ち、闇を好む。",
  "Izku": "イズク",
  "Masters of nearly nothing, the Izku advanced through sheer luck.": "ほぼ何の技術も持たないイズクは、ひたすら幸運だけで文明を発展させてきた。",
  "Kirhos": "キルホス",
  "They've earned a reputation as traders as they wander through the cosmos on gigantic Ark ships that form the core of their society. These space rodents are well-versed in economics and exploration.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  +^green;10^reset;% Speed\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Electric, +^cyan;10^reset;% Radioactive & Ice, +^cyan;7^reset;% Mental\n  Great Traders: +^green;25^reset;% Charisma, +1000 Start Cash\n  +^green;72^reset; Max Food\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Start with reliable sidearm\n  Energy Weapon Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n  Striker Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Poison, -^red;10^reset;% Fire, -^red;5^reset;%Physical": "社会の中核をなす巨大な方舟船で宇宙を放浪し、交易者としての名声を築いてきた。この宇宙ネズミたちは経済と探検に精通している。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 速度+^green;10^reset;%\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 電気+^cyan;15^reset;%、放射能&氷+^cyan;10^reset;%、精神+^cyan;7^reset;%\n 優秀な商人: カリスマ+^green;25^reset;%、初期資金+1000\n 最大食料+^green;72^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 頼りになるサイドアームを所持\n エネルギー武器マスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n ストライカーマスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 毒-^red;20^reset;%、炎-^red;10^reset;%、物理-^red;5^reset;%",
  "Mantis": "マンティス",
  "Productive and tough, the Mantis are incredibly unwise and unlikeable.": "生産的でタフだが、マンティスは極めて愚かで好かれない。",
  "Mantizi": "マンティジ",
  "Beetle-like omnivorous bipeds with tough chitin plates and a love for the exuberant.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  +^green;20^reset; Health, +^green;5^reset; Defense, Max Food x^green;1.5^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Physical,+^cyan;10^reset;% Fire, Poison & Electric, +^cyan;5^reset;% Radioactive\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Jungles, Deserts and Sulphuric^reset; biomes: Energy x^green;1.1^reset;, Defense x^green;1.1^reset;\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Short Spear Mastery: +^green;25^reset;%\n  Bow Mastery:  +^green;5^reset;%\n  Shield: +^green;2^reset;% Shield Bash, +^green;2^reset; Shield Push distance\n  Perfect Block restores ^green;health and ^green;20^reset;% shield stamina^reset;\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  Poor traders (-^red;5^reset;% Charisma)\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;15^reset;% Ice, -^red;12^reset;% Cosmic, -^red;10^reset;% Shadow": "硬い甲殻板を持つ甲虫型の雑食性二足歩行種族。華やかなものを愛する。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 体力+^green;20^reset;、防御+^green;5^reset;、最大食料 x^green;1.5^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 物理+^cyan;15^reset;%、炎・毒・電気+^cyan;10^reset;%、放射能+^cyan;5^reset;%\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;ジャングル、砂漠、硫黄^reset;バイオーム: エネルギー x^green;1.1^reset;、防御 x^green;1.1^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n ショートスピアマスタリー: +^green;25^reset;%\n 弓マスタリー: +^green;5^reset;%\n シールド: シールドバッシュ率+^green;2^reset;%、シールドプッシュ距離+^green;2^reset;\n パーフェクトブロックで^green;体力と^green;20^reset;%のシールドスタミナ回復^reset;\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n 交易が苦手 (カリスマ-^red;5^reset;%)\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 氷-^red;15^reset;%、コズミック-^red;12^reset;%、シャドウ-^red;10^reset;%",
  "Peglaci": "ペグラシ",
  "Resilient, cold-dwelling omnivorous creatures with a mysterious origin rooted in the distant past.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Health x^green;1.15^reset;, Energy x^green;1.12^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;30^reset;% Ice, +^cyan;5^reset;% Radioactive\n  +^green;8^reset;% Jump Height, Fall Damage x^cyan;0.8^reset;\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Liquid Nitrogen, Freezing, Ice Slip\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  In ^green;cold^reset; biomes: Health & Energy x^green;1.15^reset;\n  In ^red;hot^reset; biomes: Health & Energy x^red;0.8^reset;\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  All Guns: Damage x^green;1.1^reset;, +^green;5^reset;% Crit Damage\n  Axe Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n  Machine Pistol Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;30^reset;% Fire": "遠い過去に起源を持つ、寒冷地に住む頑強な雑食性生物。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 体力 x^green;1.15^reset;、エネルギー x^green;1.12^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 氷+^cyan;30^reset;%、放射能+^cyan;5^reset;%\n ジャンプ力+^green;8^reset;%、落下ダメージ x^cyan;0.8^reset;\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 液体窒素、凍結、氷上滑り\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;寒冷^reset;バイオーム: 体力&エネルギー x^green;1.15^reset;\n  ^red;高温^reset;バイオーム: 体力&エネルギー x^red;0.8^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 全銃器: ダメージ x^green;1.1^reset;、クリティカルダメージ+^green;5^reset;%\n 斧マスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n マシンピストルマスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 炎-^red;30^reset;%",
  "fuphotonpoptop": "フォトンポップトップ",
  "OMG CUTE FLUFFY": "もふもふでかわいい！",
  "When it comes to control of migration, certain government officials just don't seem to see slimes. ^green;Health regen, ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Slime, Poisoned, Electrified,^reset; ^orange;^green;Resist^reset;: fire,^reset; ^red;^green;Resist^reset;: ice^reset;": "移民管理に関して、一部の政府関係者にはスライムがまるで見えないようだ。^green;体力回復、^cyan;免疫^reset;: スライム、毒、感電、^reset; ^orange;^green;耐性^reset;: 炎、^reset; ^red;^green;耐性^reset;: 氷^reset;",
  "Pharitu": "ファリトゥ",
  "An unusual psionic species of extremophiles. Can generate a powerful psionic vibration through sheer willpower.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Any (including prepared Isotopes)\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Energy x^green;1.1^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;30^reset;% Mental, +^cyan;20^reset;% Fire & Electric, +^cyan;15^reset;% Cosmic & Radioactive\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Burning\n  Tech: ^green;Psionic Wave^reset;\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Electrically charged or crystal^reset; biomes: +^green;5% speed^reset;\n  ^red;Cold^reset; biomes: Defense x^red;0.9^reset;\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Precognition: +^cyan;8%^reset; to ^green;all^reset; damage\n  Psionic Ejector:  Damage x^green;1.2^reset;\n  Magnorb Mastery: +^green;20^reset;%\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  Health: x^red;0.88^reset;\n  ^red;Resist^reset;:  -^red;12^reset;% Physical, -^red;20^reset;% Poison, -^red;5^reset;% Ice\n  -^red;10^reset;% Charisma": "極限環境に適応した珍しいサイオニック種族。意志の力だけで強力なサイオニック振動を生成できる。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 何でも（精製アイソトープを含む）\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n エネルギー x^green;1.1^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 精神+^cyan;30^reset;%、炎&電気+^cyan;20^reset;%、コズミック&放射能+^cyan;15^reset;%\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 燃焼\n テック: ^green;サイオニックウェーブ^reset;\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;帯電またはクリスタル^reset;バイオーム: 速度+^green;5%^reset;\n  ^red;寒冷^reset;バイオーム: 防御 x^red;0.9^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 予知能力: ^green;全^reset;ダメージ+^cyan;8%^reset;\n サイオニックイジェクター: ダメージ x^green;1.2^reset;\n マグノーブマスタリー: +^green;20^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n 体力 x^red;0.88^reset;\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 物理-^red;12^reset;%、毒-^red;20^reset;%、氷-^red;5^reset;%\n カリスマ-^red;10^reset;%",
  "Nightar": "ナイター",
  "Evolved in the depths of a Penumbral world, the Nightar dislike light intensely. They are able warriors and capable spies.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Tech: ^green;Conshak^reset;(light aura, detect monsters, resist damage. ^red;7s charge^reset;)\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Shadow, +^cyan;10^reset;% Poison, +^cyan;5^reset;% Ice\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Poisoned\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Darkness^reset;: Increases ^green;Physical Res.^reset; and ^green;Damage^reset;. Draining strikes.\n  ^red;Light^reset;: Reduces ^red;Energy, Health, Physical Resistance and Damage^reset;. Cancels ^red;Drain effect^reset; of attacks.\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  All Swords: ^green;3^reset;% Shadow Burst Chance (^green;5 damage^reset;) in darkness.\n  Broadsword Mastery : ^green;25^reset;%\n  Shortsword Mastery : ^green;25^reset;%\n  Longsword Mastery : ^green;25^reset;%\n  Shield: +^green;25^reset;% Knockback Resist\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Cosmic, -^red;15^reset;% Electric": "半影の世界の深部で進化したナイターは、光を強く嫌う。優れた戦士であり、有能なスパイでもある。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n テック: ^green;コンシャク^reset;（光のオーラ、モンスター感知、ダメージ耐性。^red;チャージ7秒^reset;）\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: シャドウ+^cyan;15^reset;%、毒+^cyan;10^reset;%、氷+^cyan;5^reset;%\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 毒状態\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;暗闇^reset;: ^green;物理耐性^reset;と^green;ダメージ^reset;が上昇。吸収攻撃。\n  ^red;光^reset;: ^red;エネルギー、体力、物理耐性、ダメージ^reset;が低下。攻撃の^red;吸収効果を無効化^reset;。\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 全剣: 暗闇で^green;3^reset;%のシャドウバースト発生率（^green;ダメージ5^reset;）\n ブロードソードマスタリー: ^green;25^reset;%\n ショートソードマスタリー: ^green;25^reset;%\n ロングソードマスタリー: ^green;25^reset;%\n シールド: ノックバック耐性+^green;25^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: コズミック-^red;20^reset;%、電気-^red;15^reset;%",
  "Precursor": "プリカーサー",
  "Ruthless and cunning.": "冷酷かつ狡猾。",
  "X'i": "シィ",
  "A race of shy radioactive beings with a disputed origin. This species ^red;is designed around Hunger^reset;. ^red;Challenge is high^reset;.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Any, including prepared Isotopes.\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Health x^green;1.1^reset;, Energy x^green;1.2^reset;, ^red;Reduced by Hunger^reset;. Defense x^green;1.03^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^green;35^reset;% Radiation, +^green;10^reset;% Poison, +^green;5^reset;% Cosmic, ^green;Up to 2x when Full Belly^reset;. +^green;5^reset;% Mental.\n  Tech: Seed Bulb.\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Radiation Burn\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Radioactive^reset; biomes: Damage x^green;1.15^reset;, +^green;15^reset;% E. Regen, -^green;5^reset;% Hunger Drain\n  ^red;Hot^reset; biomes: Defense x^red;0.85^reset;, +^red;35^reset;% Hunger Drain.\n  ^green;Defense increases over time^reset;\n  ^cyan;Racial Tech is integral to success^reset;.\n  ^green;Passively generate Genes^reset;.\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  X'i Weapons: +^green;1.5^reset;% Crit Chance, Defense x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  +^red;25^reset;% Hunger drain.\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Fire, Ice & Electric, ^red;Up to 1.5x when Hungry^reset;.\n  ^red;CANNOT^reset; use Healing items. Must use racial heals.": "起源が論争されている内気な放射性存在の種族。この種族は^red;空腹を中心に設計されている^reset;。^red;難易度が高い^reset;。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 何でも（精製アイソトープを含む）\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 体力 x^green;1.1^reset;、エネルギー x^green;1.2^reset;、^red;空腹により減少^reset;。防御 x^green;1.03^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 放射能+^green;35^reset;%、毒+^green;10^reset;%、コズミック+^green;5^reset;%、^green;満腹時最大2倍^reset;。精神+^green;5^reset;%\n テック: シードバルブ\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 放射線やけど\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;放射能^reset;バイオーム: ダメージ x^green;1.15^reset;、エネルギー回復+^green;15^reset;%、空腹速度-^green;5^reset;%\n  ^red;高温^reset;バイオーム: 防御 x^red;0.85^reset;、空腹速度+^red;35^reset;%\n  ^green;防御は時間経過で上昇^reset;\n  ^cyan;種族テックが成功の鍵^reset;\n  ^green;遺伝子を自動生成^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n シィ武器: クリティカル率+^green;1.5^reset;%、防御 x^green;1.15^reset;\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n 空腹速度+^red;25^reset;%\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 炎・氷・電気-^red;20^reset;%、^red;空腹時最大1.5倍^reset;\n 回復アイテム^red;使用不可^reset;。種族固有の回復手段を使用すること。",
  "Skath": "スカース",
  "Once invaded by an alien force which forced them to focus on their military and their defenses, they're extraordinary well trained fighters. Their aquatic origins make them especially dangerous in water and make them a force to be reckoned with.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Energy x^green;1.05^reset;, +^green;5^reset; Defense, +^green;500^reset; Breath\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;20^reset;% Ice, +^cyan;10^reset;% Radioactive\n  ^cyan;Swim Boost 2^reset;\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  Ocean biomes: Health x^green;1.25^reset; and +^green;6^reset; Defense\n  Hot biomes: Energy x^red;0.7^reset;, Health x^red;0.7^reset;, Speed x^red;0.8^reset;\n  (Healing/Waste/Swamp) Water: +^green;0.1^reset;% Health Regen\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Energy Weapon Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n  Assault Rifle Mastery: +^green;25^reset;%\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Electric": "かつてエイリアンの侵略を受け、軍事と防衛に注力するようになった。卓越した訓練を受けた戦士たちである。水棲の起源を持ち、水中で特に危険な存在となる。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n エネルギー x^green;1.05^reset;、防御+^green;5^reset;、息止め+^green;500^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 氷+^cyan;20^reset;%、放射能+^cyan;10^reset;%\n  ^cyan;スイムブースト2^reset;\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n 海洋バイオーム: 体力 x^green;1.25^reset;、防御+^green;6^reset;\n 高温バイオーム: エネルギー x^red;0.7^reset;、体力 x^red;0.7^reset;、速度 x^red;0.8^reset;\n （回復/汚染/沼地）水中: 体力回復+^green;0.1^reset;%\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n エネルギー武器マスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n アサルトライフルマスタリー: +^green;25^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 電気-^red;20^reset;%",
  "Alien creatures whose origins are unknown": "起源不明のエイリアン生物",
  "Once human, mutated through work at a Nanotrasen outpost": "元は人間だったが、ナノトレーゼン基地での作業中に変異した",
  "Symbiotes birthed from the fallen. Sentient. An unusual and resilient people who struggle to come to grips with where they came from.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Fall Damage x^green;0.5^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;30^reset;% Poison, +^cyan;10^reset;% Radioactive, +^cyan;4^reset;% Electric, +^cyan;3^reset;% Cosmic\n  +^green;1^reset;% Health Regen (Constant)\n  Tech: ^green;Sticky ball, Wall Grab^reset;\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Slime Bounce, Slime Stick, Poisoned, Webs\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  Gelatinous, Bog and Swamp biomes: Health x^green;1.25^reset; and +^green;15^reset;% Speed\n  Cold biomes: Health x^red;0.75^reset;\n  Can breathe in liquid slime\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Whip Mastery:  x^green;15^reset;%\n  Bioweapon: Damage x^green;1.15^reset;, +^green;20^reset;%^reset; Crit Damage\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;20^reset;% Fire & Ice\n  +^red;25^reset;% Hunger Drain": "倒れた者から生まれた共生体。知性を持つ。自らの出自と向き合うことに苦悩する、風変わりで強靭な民。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 落下ダメージ x^green;0.5^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 毒+^cyan;30^reset;%、放射能+^cyan;10^reset;%、電気+^cyan;4^reset;%、コズミック+^cyan;3^reset;%\n 体力回復+^green;1^reset;%（常時）\n テック: ^green;スティッキーボール、ウォールグラブ^reset;\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: スライムバウンス、スライムスティック、毒、蜘蛛の巣\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n ゼラチン、湿地、沼バイオーム: 体力 x^green;1.25^reset;、速度+^green;15^reset;%\n 寒冷バイオーム: 体力 x^red;0.75^reset;\n 液体スライム中で呼吸可能\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n ウィップマスタリー: x^green;15^reset;%\n バイオウェポン: ダメージ x^green;1.15^reset;、クリティカルダメージ+^green;20^reset;%^reset;\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 炎&氷-^red;20^reset;%\n 空腹速度+^red;25^reset;%",
  "spiderdroid": "スパイダードロイド",
  "A dangerous looking robot thing.": "危険な外見のロボット的な何か",
  "Thelusian": "セルシアン",
  "The carnivorous Thelusians are well known for their tough chitin shell and exceptionally dangerous combat abilities. Able to adapt to suit any combat situation.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Carnivore\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Health x^green;1.25^reset;, +^green;8^reset; Defense, Fall Damage x^green;0.4^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;30^reset;% Mental, +^cyan;15^reset;% Physical, +^cyan;20^reset;% Radiaoactive\n  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Insanity\n  Tech: ^green;Warrior Instincts^reset;\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Hot^reset; biomes: Health x^green;1.1^reset;\n  Improved ground traction\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Scythe Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n  Broadsword Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n  Axe Mastery: +^green;10^reset;%\n  Shield: Defense x^green;1.1^reset;\n  Perfect Block: Increases ^green;Shield Bash^reset; chance\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  Energy x^red;0.75^reset;, -^red;25^reset;% Charisma\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;30^reset;% Fire, -^red;15^reset;% Ice": "肉食のセルシアンは頑強な甲殻と極めて危険な戦闘能力で知られる。あらゆる戦闘状況に適応可能。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 肉食\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 体力 x^green;1.25^reset;、防御+^green;8^reset;、落下ダメージ x^green;0.4^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 精神+^cyan;30^reset;%、物理+^cyan;15^reset;%、放射能+^cyan;20^reset;%\n  ^cyan;免疫^reset;: 狂気\n テック: ^green;ウォリアーインスティンクト^reset;\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;高温^reset;バイオーム: 体力 x^green;1.1^reset;\n 地面のトラクション向上\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n サイスマスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n ブロードソードマスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n 斧マスタリー: +^green;10^reset;%\n シールド: 防御 x^green;1.1^reset;\n パーフェクトブロック: ^green;シールドバッシュ^reset;率上昇\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n エネルギー x^red;0.75^reset;、カリスマ-^red;25^reset;%\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 炎-^red;30^reset;%、氷-^red;15^reset;%",
  "Vel'uuish": "ヴェルウーイッシュ",
  "A fractured race of sapient cats. Half are peace loving free-thinkers, while the rest are war-hungry monsters.\n\n  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore, can eat raw meat.\n\n^orange;Perks^reset;:\n  Health: x^green;1.05^reset;, Damage x^green;1.05^reset;\n  Gain ^green;13^reset;% Jump and ^green;6^reset;% Run Speed^reset;, Fall Damage x^green;0.8^reset;\n  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;15^reset;% Ice,+^cyan;5^reset;% Electric\n  ^cyan;Nightvision^reset;\n  Tech: ^green;Razor Claws^reset;\n  ^green;Immune^reset;: Jungle, Mud\n\n^orange;Environment^reset;:\n  ^green;Jungle, Primeval, Forest, Rainforest, Desert^reset;: Health x^green;1.1^reset;, Energy x^green;1.1^reset;\n  ^green;Barren, Sulphuric, Infernus^reset;: Health x^red;0.8^reset;, Energy x^red;0.8^reset;\n\n^orange;Weapons^reset;:\n  Fist Mastery: +^green;20^reset;%\n  Dagger Mastery: ^green;15^reset;%\n  Arm Cannon Mastery: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;Weaknesses^reset;:\n  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;10^reset;% Fire, Poison, Radioactive, -^red;5^reset;% Physical": "分裂した知性猫の種族。半数は平和を愛する自由思想家だが、残りの半数は戦争に飢えた怪物である。\n\n  ^orange;食性^reset;: 雑食。生肉も食べられる。\n\n^orange;特性^reset;:\n 体力 x^green;1.05^reset;、ダメージ x^green;1.05^reset;\n ジャンプ力+^green;13^reset;%、走行速度+^green;6^reset;%、落下ダメージ x^green;0.8^reset;\n  ^green;耐性^reset;: 氷+^cyan;15^reset;%、電気+^cyan;5^reset;%\n  ^cyan;暗視^reset;\n テック: ^green;レイザークロー^reset;\n  ^green;免疫^reset;: ジャングル、泥\n\n^orange;環境^reset;:\n  ^green;ジャングル、原始林、森林、熱帯雨林、砂漠^reset;: 体力 x^green;1.1^reset;、エネルギー x^green;1.1^reset;\n  ^green;荒地、硫黄、インフェルナス^reset;: 体力 x^red;0.8^reset;、エネルギー x^red;0.8^reset;\n\n^orange;武器^reset;:\n 拳マスタリー: +^green;20^reset;%\n ダガーマスタリー: ^green;15^reset;%\n アームキャノンマスタリー: +^green;15^reset;%\n\n^red;弱点^reset;:\n  ^red;耐性^reset;: 炎・毒・放射能-^red;10^reset;%、物理-^red;5^reset;%",
  "Cheated Death - Healing Prevented": "死の回避 - 回復阻止",
  "Cooked Meat - Delicious! Unless you're a herbivore or mechanical, I guess...": "調理済み肉 - 美味しい！草食動物や機械でなければ…",
  "Raw Seafood - Meat eaters and Oceanic species get a buff. Herbivores and Robots get sick.": "生の海鮮 - 肉食者と海洋種族は強化される。草食動物とロボットは病気になる",
  "Tasty Meat - Carnivores won't get sick.": "美味しい肉 - 肉食動物は病気にならない",
  "Herbivore Food - Meat eaters and robots get ill, but everyone else benefits.": "草食食 - 肉食者とロボットは体調を崩すが、それ以外は恩恵を受ける",
  "Photosynthesis": "光合成",
  "Radioactive Food - X'i get health regeneration, health and energy. Other races die painfully.": "放射性食品 - シーは体力再生、体力、エネルギーを得る。他の種族は苦しんで死ぬ",
  "Mechanical Food - only mechanical beings can digest this. Anything else will suffer for it.": "機械食 - 機械生命体のみが消化できる。それ以外の者は苦しむことになる",
  "Sugar-rich food.": "糖分豊富な食品",
  "Vulnerable": "脆弱",
  "+15% Run, +20% Jump, +30 Air Force": "移動速度 +15%、ジャンプ +20%、空中制御力 +30",
  "+20% damage in exchange for -20% health": "体力-20%と引き換えにダメージ+20%",
  "30% More Damage in exchange for 15% Less HP": "HP 15%減少と引き換えにダメージ 30%増加",
  "Pulls items towards you": "アイテムを引き寄せる",
  "Pushes enemies away from you": "敵を押し返す",
  "+5% Speed and 8% Jump, Increased Air Force, -5% damage and health": "速度+5%、ジャンプ+8%、空中制御力増加、ダメージと体力-5%",
  "Resting 1 - Heal in 60s, no hunger drain": "休息1 - 60秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Resting 2 - Heal in 54s, no hunger drain": "休息2 - 54秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Resting 3 - Heal in 48s, no hunger drain": "休息3 - 48秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Resting 4 - Heal in 42s, no hunger drain": "休息4 - 42秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Resting 5 - Heal in 36s, no hunger drain": "休息5 - 36秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Resting 6 - Heal in 30s, no hunger drain": "休息6 - 30秒で回復、空腹消費なし",
  "Hypnotic Nebulae - 80% Reduced risk of Madness effects.": "催眠星雲 - 狂気効果のリスクを80%軽減",
