  "Genesiberry: -40% Hunger Drain": "ジェネシベリー: 空腹消費-40%",
  "Rooted": "束縛",
  "Frost Burn": "凍傷",
  "Self-Cannibalism": "自食",
  "Flight fully recharged.": "飛行完全充電",
  "To use your tech, hold the [Down] key.": "テックを使うには[下]キーを長押し",
  "Those weird foods you're carrying look both tasty and horrifying.": "持っているあの奇妙な食べ物は美味しそうでもあり恐ろしくもある",
  "Something you are carrying is unsettling you...": "持っている何かが不安にさせている…",
  "You're suffering from Madness. Visit a Counsellor or Insta-Freud to lower your madness level safely.": "狂気に苦しんでいる。カウンセラーかインスタフロイトを訪れて安全に狂気レベルを下げよう",
  "Cannot use Miracle Ambrosia": "ミラクルアンブロシアを使用不可",
  "More Defense, Less Damage and Energy. Very Slow.": "防御増加、ダメージとエネルギー減少。超低速",
  "Higher Jumps, Less Defense and Energy. Fast.": "高いジャンプ、防御とエネルギー減少。高速",
  "Faster Shield Regen, Improved Bashing, Less Energy. Slower.": "シールド再生増加、バッシュ強化、エネルギー減少。速度低下",
  "More Damage, Less Defense and Energy. Fast.": "ダメージ増加、防御とエネルギー減少。高速",
  "Warped - You feel strange": "歪曲 - 奇妙な感覚",
  "Bounce": "バウンス",
  "Devil's Bargain - Increases speed, damage and resistances. Saps health and energy. 2 minute duration.": "悪魔の取引 - 速度、ダメージ、耐性を増加。体力とエネルギーを消耗。持続2分",
  "Luck": "幸運",
  "Heal Region - Hear all nearby targets a small amount.": "回復領域 - 周囲のターゲットを少量回復する",
  "Heals 50 hp over 60 seconds": "60秒間で50HP回復",
  "Heals 80 hp over 60 seconds": "60秒間で80HP回復",
  "Heals 100 hp over 60 seconds": "60秒間で100HP回復",
  "Heals 115 hp over 60 seconds": "60秒間で115HP回復",
  "Heals 125hp over 60 seconds": "60秒間で125HP回復",
  "Icy Aura": "氷のオーラ",
  "Infection - Nearby creatures suffer the same poisonus agony.": "感染 - 周囲の生物も同じ毒の苦痛を受ける",
  "Intoxicated": "中毒",
  "Wretchel Toxicity (See FU Food and Armor Codex)": "レッチェル毒性（FU食事と装甲のコーデックスを参照）",
  "+25% Mental Protection": "精神防御 +25%",
  "Something is rattling your sense of sanity.": "何かが正気を揺さぶっている",
  "You're losing your mind just looking at this thing...": "これを見ているだけで正気を失いそうだ…",
  "All semblance of sanity is an afterthought for the moment.": "正気のかけらは今のところ二の次だ",
  "Shatters your psyche, but opens up new vistas of understanding...": "精神を砕くが、新たな理解の地平を開く…",
  "This art unsettles you. Something about it...": "この芸術品が不安にさせる。何かが…",
  "This art is pulling at the threads of your sanity.": "この芸術品が正気の糸を引いている",
  "This piece of art is abhorrent to your senses, and even a glance causes you distress.": "この芸術品は感覚を逆撫でし、一瞥するだけで苦痛を感じる",
  "Psychiatric Help - 20% Reduced risk of Madness effects.": "精神科治療 - 狂気効果のリスクを20%軽減",
