  "Bio-Ooze. Reduces all resistances except poison and shadow by ^red;30%^reset;. Increases Hunger rate. Resisted by Poison Resistance.": "バイオウーズ。毒と影以外の全耐性を^red;30%^reset;減少。空腹速度増加。毒耐性で軽減",
  "Bio-Ooze. Reduces all resistances except poison and shadow by ^red;60%^reset;. Increases Hunger rate. Resisted by Poison resistance.": "バイオウーズ。毒と影以外の全耐性を^red;60%^reset;減少。空腹速度増加。毒耐性で軽減",
  "Blood Poisoned! - This poison will last a long, long time. Reduces all resistances except poison and shadow by ^red;30%^reset;. Increases Hunger rate.": "血液中毒！ - この毒は非常に長く続く。毒と影以外の全耐性を^red;30%^reset;減少。空腹速度が増加",
  "Reduces all resistances except poison and shadow by ^red;40%^reset;. Increases Hunger rate. Resisted by Poison resistance.": "毒と影以外の全耐性を^red;40%^reset;減少。空腹速度増加。毒耐性で軽減",
  "Cattle Poison. Don't eat pet food, silly.": "家畜用毒。ペットフードを食べるな、バカ",
  "Nasty Toxin that lowers Physical and Radioactive Resistance by 40%. Resisted by Poison resistance.": "物理と放射能耐性を40%低下させる猛毒。毒耐性で軽減",
  "Darkwater Poison: ^red;-25%^reset; Shadow, Fire, Ice Resistance. ^red;20%^reset; move penalty. Resist with Poison Resistance": "ダークウォーター毒: 影・火・氷耐性^red;-25%^reset;。移動速度^red;20%^reset;減少。毒耐性で軽減",
  "Killpod! Death, Guaranteed! New from Kevin-Tek!": "キルポッド！死、確実！Kevin-Tekの新製品！",
  "Mercury Poison. ^red;0%^reset; Knockback Resistance, ^red;50%^reset; Fall Damage Resistance and ^red;25%^reset; Cosmic Resistance penalties. Resisted by Poison + Radioactive resistance.": "水銀中毒。ノックバック耐性^red;0%^reset;、落下ダメージ耐性^red;50%^reset;、宇宙耐性^red;25%^reset;のペナルティ。毒+放射能耐性で軽減",
