  "Water Weight": "水の重量",
  "Radioactive Plant I: Standing near the X'i bulbs is hazardous to carbon-based life. ^green;X'ians get Health and Hunger regeneration^reset;.": "放射性植物I: シーの球根の近くに立つと炭素生命体に有害。^green;シーは体力と空腹を再生^reset;",
  "Radioactive Plant II: Standing near the X'i bulbs is hazardous to carbon-based life. ^green;X'ians get Health and Hunger regeneration^reset;.": "放射性植物II: シーの球根の近くに立つと炭素生命体に有害。^green;シーは体力と空腹を再生^reset;",
  "Radioactive Plant III: Standing near the X'i bulbs is hazardous to carbon-based life. ^green;X'ians get Health and Hunger regeneration^reset;.": "放射性植物III: シーの球根の近くに立つと炭素生命体に有害。^green;シーは体力と空腹を再生^reset;",
  "Soaked In Gore": "血まみれ",
  "Coated in Chaos": "混沌に包まれた",
  "Dripping Pus": "膿の滴り",
  "Stronger Air Dash, Cooldown: 0.9s": "強化エアダッシュ、クールダウン: 0.9秒",
  "Blink Dash in the air! Cooldown: 2.0s": "空中ブリンクダッシュ！クールダウン: 2.0秒",
  "A short ^green;[Double-tap]^reset; Dodge with Defense boost.": "短い^green;[ダブルタップ]^reset;回避。防御力上昇付き",
  "Dodge a further distance. Keeps momentum.": "より遠くまで回避。勢いを維持する",
  "Improved dodge. Allows jumping mid-dodge.": "強化回避。回避中にジャンプ可能",
  "Your Dash now grants a short-term Damage bonus!": "ダッシュに短時間のダメージボーナスが付与！",
  "A Sprint that grants protection from harm": "ダメージから身を守るスプリント",
  "Phase Sprint that can damage enemies.": "敵にダメージを与えるフェイズスプリント",
  "Phase Sprint II, with a Damage boost! Havoc!": "フェイズスプリント II、ダメージ上昇付き！大混乱！",
  "I like fuel.": "燃料が好きだ",
  "Greatly increase Shielding abilities.": "シールド能力を大幅に向上させる",
  "^green;[Double-tap Up]^reset; to fire a sonic burst!": "^green;[上ダブルタップ]^reset;でソニックバーストを発射！",
  "More effective stims means faster speeds!": "より効果的な刺激剤でさらに高速に！",
  "These are some strong stimulants. Really fast.": "かなり強い刺激剤。本当に速い",
  "Superior narcotics provide insane speeds.": "上質な薬物がとんでもない速度を提供",
  "Advanced, ancient Stimulant Rig.": "高度な古代の刺激装置",
  "Speed and a Dash. Energy and Hunger penalties.": "速度とダッシュ。エネルギーと空腹にペナルティ",
  "The ultimate Blink Dash tech! Cooldown: 1.35s": "究極のブリンクダッシュテック！クールダウン: 1.35秒",
  "^green;[Double-tap Up]^reset; to explode upward! Harms foes!": "^green;[上ダブルタップ]^reset;で上方に爆発！敵にダメージ！",
  "Boostier than its lesser cousin!": "下位版よりさらにパワフル！",
  "Lift off like a rocket! Watch those landings.": "ロケットのように飛び上がれ！着地に注意",
  "Turn into a sphere and move quickly across liquids! ^green;[F]^reset;": "球体になり液体の上を高速移動！^green;[F]^reset;",
  "An armored Sphere ^green;[F]^reset;! Drop power-bombs with ^red;[Fire]^reset;.": "装甲スフィア^green;[F]^reset;！^red;[射撃]^reset;でパワーボム投下",
  "A mobile Sphere ^green;[F]^reset; capable of great jumping!": "高いジャンプ力を持つ移動スフィア^green;[F]^reset;！",
  "An adaptable slime variant of the Spike Sphere. ^green;[F]^reset;": "スパイクスフィアの適応型スライム変種。^green;[F]^reset;",
  "Now your Sphere ^green;[F]^reset; can drop bombs with ^red;[Fire]^reset;!": "スフィア^green;[F]^reset;で^red;[射撃]^reset;ボム投下が可能に！",
  "Places a large donkey in your inbox ^green;[F]^reset;": "受信箱に大きなロバを配置^green;[F]^reset;",
  "Nearly useless Sphere ^green;[F]^reset;, but fun!": "ほぼ役に立たないスフィア^green;[F]^reset;、でも楽しい！",
  "A Microsphere ^green;[F]^reset;! Fits in tiny holes!": "マイクロスフィア^green;[F]^reset;！小さな穴に入れる！",
  "A Microsphere ^green;[F]^reset;! ^red;[Fire]^reset; drops bombs.": "マイクロスフィア^green;[F]^reset;！^red;[射撃]^reset;で爆弾投下",
  "Fast Micro Spider Sphere ^green;[F]^reset;. ^red;[Fire]^reset; Repulsor Bursts.": "高速マイクロスパイダースフィア^green;[F]^reset;。^red;[射撃]^reset;でリパルサーバースト",
  "A slower Micro Sphere ^green;[F]^reset; that clings to walls.": "壁に張り付く低速マイクロスフィア^green;[F]^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Air Dash II^reset;": "^#77acc3;エアダッシュ II^reset;",
  "Dash further in the air.": "空中でさらに遠くダッシュ",
  "^#77acc3;Armor Sphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;アーマースフィア^reset;",
  "A heavily armored distortion sphere.": "重装甲の歪曲球",
  "^#77acc3;Air Blink^reset;": "^#77acc3;エアブリンク^reset;",
  "Blink in the air!": "空中でブリンク！",
  "^#77acc3;Bounce Sphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;バウンススフィア^reset;",
  "A bouncing distortion sphere. Quite useful.": "跳ねる歪曲球。かなり便利",
  "^#77acc3;Dodge^reset;": "^#77acc3;ドッジ^reset;",
  "Short-ranged double-tap dodge. Increases Shield Bash chance and Protection.\n^green;It's safe to sell this item, you won't lose the tech.^reset;\n^yellow;In multiplayer:^reset; giving this item to another player will teach them this tech.": "短距離ダブルタップ回避。シールドバッシュ発生率と防御を上昇\n^green;売却しても安全。テックは失われません^reset;\n^yellow;マルチプレイ:^reset;他プレイヤーに渡すとテックを習得できる",
  "^#77acc3;Dodge II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ドッジ II^reset;",
  "Improved dodge. Maintains inertia.": "改良ドッジ。慣性を維持",
  "^#77acc3;Dodge III^reset;": "^#77acc3;ドッジ III^reset;",
  "Dodge a further distance. Keeps momentum. Allows jumping mid-dodge.": "より遠くにドッジ。勢いを維持。ドッジ中にジャンプ可能",
  "^#77acc3;Lance Dash^reset;": "^#77acc3;ランスダッシュ^reset;",
  "End your dash with a damage boost!": "ダッシュの終わりにダメージブースト！",
  "Secret dev tech": "秘密の開発者テック",
  "I certainly hope you're a developer.": "開発者であることを願う",
  "^#77acc3;Distortion Sphere II^reset;": "^#77acc3;歪曲球 II^reset;",
  "Drop bombs while in ball form with [down]": "ボール形態で[下]を押して爆弾を投下",
  "^#77acc3;Emergency Bounce^reset;": "^#77acc3;エマージェンシーバウンス^reset;",
  "Auto-Protect against falls.": "落下からの自動保護",
  "^#77acc3;Emergency Bounce MK2^reset;": "^#77acc3;エマージェンシーバウンス MK2^reset;",
  "Auto-Protect against falls, holding [Space] will make you bounce.": "落下からの自動保護、[スペース]長押しでバウンス",
  "^#77acc3;Phase Sprint^reset;": "^#77acc3;フェイズスプリント^reset;",
  "Sprint without threat of harm.": "ダメージの脅威なくスプリント",
  "^#77acc3;Phase Sprint II^reset;": "^#77acc3;フェイズスプリント II^reset;",
  "Damage foes with your sprint.": "スプリントで敵にダメージ",
  "^#77acc3;Phase Sprint III^reset;": "^#77acc3;フェイズスプリント III^reset;",
  "The ultimate sprint.": "究極のスプリント",
  "^#77acc3;Shard Blast^reset;": "^#77acc3;シャードブラスト^reset;",
  "Fires shards of dangerous solid light.": "危険な固体ライトの破片を発射する",
  "^#77acc3;Defense Matrix I^reset;": "^#77acc3;ディフェンスマトリクス I^reset;",
  "Passive +5 bonus to defense.": "パッシブ防御+5ボーナス",
  "^#77acc3;Defense Matrix II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ディフェンスマトリクス II^reset;",
  "Passive +10 bonus to defense.": "パッシブ防御+10ボーナス",
  "^#77acc3;Defense Matrix III^reset;": "^#77acc3;ディフェンスマトリクス III^reset;",
  "Passive +15 bonus to defense.": "パッシブ防御+15ボーナス",
  "^#77acc3;Distortion Sphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;歪曲球^reset;",
  "Transform into a ball! ^green;Press [F]^reset;\n^green;It's safe to sell this item, you won't lose the tech.^reset;\n^yellow;In multiplayer:^reset; giving this item to another player will teach them this tech.": "ボールに変身！^green;[F]を押す^reset;\n^green;売却しても安全。テックは失われません^reset;\n^yellow;マルチプレイ:^reset;他プレイヤーに渡すとテックを習得できる",
  "^#77acc3;Regen Field^reset;": "^#77acc3;リジェネフィールド^reset;",
  "Heal within a radius.": "範囲内を回復",
  "^#77acc3;Oddball Sphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;オッドボールスフィア^reset;",
  "Well...I guess it could be useful. It sure is *fun*! ^red;Dangerous^reset;": "まあ…役に立つかも。確かに*楽しい*！^red;危険^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Magnet Grip I^reset;": "^#77acc3;マグネットグリップ I^reset;",
  "Latch onto walls for 8s.": "壁に8秒間貼り付く",
  "^#77acc3;Magnet Grip II^reset;": "^#77acc3;マグネットグリップ II^reset;",
  "Grip better, get buffs!": "グリップ向上、バフ獲得！",
  "^#77acc3;Triangle Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;トライアングルジャンプ^reset;",
  "Attach to walls and cross-jump.": "壁に付いてクロスジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Wall Jump II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ウォールジャンプ II^reset;",
  "A wall jump improvement. Double Jump!": "ウォールジャンプの改善。ダブルジャンプ！",
  "^#77acc3;Wall Jump III^reset;": "^#77acc3;ウォールジャンプ III^reset;",
  "Increases grip, leap and capability of Wall Jump.": "グリップ、跳躍、ウォールジャンプの能力を向上",
  "^#77acc3;Wall Jump IV^reset;": "^#77acc3;ウォールジャンプ IV^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Gravity Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;グラビティジャンプ^reset;",
  "Holy crap, that is a lot of jumpy goodness": "マジか、すごいジャンプ力",
  "^#77acc3;Power Jump I^reset;": "^#77acc3;パワージャンプ I^reset;",
  "A powerful boost to jumping instead of a double-jump.": "二段ジャンプの代わりにジャンプを強力にブースト",
  "^#77acc3;Boosted Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;ブーストジャンプ^reset;",
  "Increased jump ability.\n^green;It's safe to sell this item, you won't lose the tech.^reset;\n^yellow;In multiplayer:^reset; giving this item to another player will teach them this tech.": "ジャンプ能力が向上\n^green;売却しても安全。テックは失われません^reset;\n^yellow;マルチプレイ:^reset;他プレイヤーに渡すとテックを習得できる",
  "^#77acc3;Flutter Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;フラッタージャンプ^reset;",
  "A high-burst jump with a fluttery secondary jump. Useful!": "高バーストジャンプとフラッター二段ジャンプ。便利！",
  "^#77acc3;Flutter Jump II^reset;": "^#77acc3;フラッタージャンプ II^reset;",
  "Adds more jump, slower fall and more jumps!": "ジャンプ追加、落下減速、さらにジャンプ追加！",
  "^#77acc3;Flutter Jump III^reset;": "^#77acc3;フラッタージャンプ III^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Microsphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;マイクロスフィア^reset;",
  "A teency, tiny little distortionsphere.": "とっても小さな歪曲球",
  "^#77acc3;Bomb Microsphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;ボムマイクロスフィア^reset;",
  "A teency, tiny little distortionsphere. With a bomb in it.": "とっても小さな歪曲球。爆弾入り",
  "^#77acc3;Precursor Microsphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;プリカーサーマイクロスフィア^reset;",
  "Top of the line microsphere.": "最高級マイクロスフィア",
  "^#77acc3;Spider Microsphere^reset;": "^#77acc3;スパイダーマイクロスフィア^reset;",
  "A creepy-crawly microsphere.": "不気味に這うマイクロスフィア",
  "^#77acc3;Phase Attack^reset;": "^#77acc3;フェイズアタック^reset;",
  "Sneak attack, but with lower speed.": "スニークアタック、ただし速度低下",
  "^#77acc3;Physics Field I^reset;": "^#77acc3;フィジクスフィールド I^reset;",
  "Allows basic manipulation of physics when holding Jump.": "ジャンプ長押しで基本的な物理操作が可能",
  "^#77acc3;Physics Field II^reset;": "^#77acc3;フィジクスフィールド II^reset;",
  "This implant allows you to ignore the laws of physics in motion.": "このインプラントで運動中の物理法則を無視できる",
  "^#77acc3;Physics Field III^reset;": "^#77acc3;フィジクスフィールド III^reset;",
  "Gives an absolutely insane speed boost.": "とんでもない速度ブーストを付与",
  "^#77acc3;Quad Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;クアッドジャンプ^reset;",
  "Get up to four mid-air jumps.": "最大4回の空中ジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Quint Jump^reset;": "^#77acc3;クイントジャンプ^reset;",
  "Five jumps is best jumps.": "5回ジャンプが最高のジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Rocket Boots^reset;": "^#77acc3;ロケットブーツ^reset;",
  "Hold jump to blast off. Performs poorly in high gravity.": "ジャンプ長押しで発射。高重力下では性能低下",
  "^#77acc3;Rocket Boots II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ロケットブーツ II^reset;",
  "Precursor rocket boots. Obviously superior.": "プリカーサーロケットブーツ。当然ながら上位",
  "^#77acc3;Screw Attack^reset;": "^#77acc3;スクリューアタック^reset;",
  "Perform a super-awesome screw attack jump!": "超最高のスクリューアタックジャンプ！",
  "^#77acc3;Sonic Burst^reset;": "^#77acc3;ソニックバースト^reset;",
  "Emits a screeching wail across a wide area.": "広範囲に金切り声を放出する",
  "^#77acc3;Stimulant Rig II^reset;": "^#77acc3;スティムラントリグ II^reset;",
  "Higher dose. Now grants +25% speed and dash. Passive.": "高用量。速度とダッシュ+25%を付与。パッシブ",
  "^#77acc3;Stimulant Rig III^reset;": "^#77acc3;スティムラントリグ III^reset;",
  "Near lethal levels of drugs, superior speed and dash. Passive.": "致死量に近い薬物、優れた速度とダッシュ。パッシブ",
  "An implant that genetically alters your speed and reaction time. Passive.": "速度と反応時間を遺伝子的に変える。パッシブインプラント",
  "^#77acc3;Stimulant Rig IV^reset;": "^#77acc3;スティムラントリグ IV^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Precursor Rig^reset;": "^#77acc3;プリカーサーリグ^reset;",
  "Precursor Booster": "プリカーサーブースター",
  "^#77acc3;Stimulant Rig I^reset;": "^#77acc3;スティムラントリグ I^reset;",
  "Injects performance-enhancing drugs directly into your body. Grants speed and dash. Passive.": "パフォーマンス向上薬を直接体内に注射。速度とダッシュを付与。パッシブ",
  "^#77acc3;Blink Dash II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ブリンクダッシュ II^reset;",
  "Teleport 30 tiles away. Best across gaps.": "30タイル先にテレポート。隙間の横断に最適",
  "An explosive jump that blasts foes.": "敵を吹き飛ばす爆発ジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Zero Burst I^reset;": "^#77acc3;ゼロバースト I^reset;",
  "^#77acc3;Zero Burst II^reset;": "^#77acc3;ゼロバースト II^reset;",
  "An improved blast and jump.": "改良ブラストとジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Zero Burst III^reset;": "^#77acc3;ゼロバースト III^reset;",
  "A super blast jump.": "スーパーブラストジャンプ",
  "^#77acc3;Zero Burst IV^reset;": "^#77acc3;ゼロバースト IV^reset;",
  "The ultimate blast jump.": "究極のブラストジャンプ",
  "Allows you to grip onto walls and double jump.": "壁に掴まり、二段ジャンプが可能になる",
  "Greatly enhanced Magnet Grip, with increased Defense while gripping.": "大幅に強化されたマグネットグリップ。掴んでいる間は防御力上昇",
  "Wall Slide, Double and Triangle-Jump": "壁滑り、二段ジャンプ、三角ジャンプ",
  "Wall Jump with one more jump.": "壁ジャンプ+追加1段ジャンプ",
  "Wall Jump, with two more jumps": "壁ジャンプ+追加2段ジャンプ",
  "Wall Jump, with three more jumps.": "壁ジャンプ+追加3段ジャンプ",
  "Mega strength Flutter Jump with low-grav.": "低重力メガパワーフラッタージャンプ",
  "Jump height boost, lower fall damage, wall jump, wall slide.": "ジャンプ高度上昇、落下ダメージ軽減、壁ジャンプ、壁滑り",
  "Increased jumping capability.": "ジャンプ能力向上",
  "Stronger Power Jump with post-jump microbursts.": "ジャンプ後マイクロバースト付き強化パワージャンプ",
  "Upgraded Flutter Jump": "強化フラッタージャンプ",
  "Ultimate Flutter Jump": "究極フラッタージャンプ",
  "Now that is one helluva jump.": "とんでもないジャンプだ",
  "Four jumps for four times the Awesome!": "四段ジャンプで四倍の爽快感！",
  "Five jumps are possible with this bionic enhancer.": "バイオニック強化で五段ジャンプが可能",
  "Lets you stick to and jump off vertical walls!": "垂直の壁に張り付き、蹴ってジャンプできる！",
  "Press and hold jump while in the air to fly.": "空中でジャンプ長押しで飛行",
  "Stronger, more efficient Rocket Boots": "より強力で効率的なロケットブーツ",
  "Slowfall [Down], Glide [Up]. Activate with ^green;[F]^reset;": "緩降下[下]、滑空[上]。^green;[F]^reset;で起動",
  "Combat Stances. Hold ^green;[F]^reset; to swap (See Status). Hold 3s to reset.": "戦闘スタンス。^green;[F]^reset;長押しで切替（ステータス参照）。3秒長押しでリセット",
  "Breathe Fire! (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "火を吐け！（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Enables a protective bubble at high speeds.": "高速移動時に保護バブルを展開する",
  "Idiotically bouncy.": "バカみたいに弾む",
  "Reduced bouncyness. Quite useful.": "弾みを抑制。かなり便利",
  "Slowfall ^green;[Down]^reset;, Glide ^green;[Up]^reset;. Activate with ^green;[F]^reset;": "緩降下^green;[下]^reset;、滑空^green;[上]^reset;。^green;[F]^reset;で起動",
  "Glide as gracefully as you can. Use ^green;[F]^reset;.": "優雅に滑空しよう。^green;[F]^reset;で使用",
  "Draconic flight activated with ^green;[F]^reset;.": "^green;[F]^reset;で竜の飛行を起動",
  "Moth flight. Best in light.^green;[F]^reset;.": "蛾の飛行。明るい場所で最適。^green;[F]^reset;",
  "Moth flight. Best in darkness. ^green;[F]^reset;.": "蛾の飛行。暗闇で最適。^green;[F]^reset;",
  "Eject shards of solid energy. Use ^green;[F]^reset;.": "固体エネルギーの破片を射出。^green;[F]^reset;で使用",
  "Passive Defense Boost (+5)": "パッシブ防御上昇（+5）",
  "Passive Defense Boost (+10)": "パッシブ防御上昇（+10）",
  "Passive Defense Boost (+15)": "パッシブ防御上昇（+15）",
  "Generate a Regen Field ^green;[F]^reset;.": "リジェネフィールドを生成^green;[F]^reset;",
  "Claw slash. (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "爪斬り。（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Psionic blasts. (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "超能力ブラスト。（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Dig with claws. (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "爪で掘る。（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Hold [Down] to commune with your blade(7s). Activate with ^green;[F]^reset;": "[下]長押しで刀と交信(7秒)。^green;[F]^reset;で起動",
  "Stealth mode ^green;[F]^reset;. Slowly converts Energy to Damage.": "ステルスモード^green;[F]^reset;。エネルギーを徐々にダメージに変換",
  "Control with ^green;[Jump]^reset;. ^orange;[Move]^reset;. Negate Falls with ^green;[F]^reset;.": "^green;[ジャンプ]^reset;で操作。^orange;[移動]^reset;。^green;[F]^reset;で落下無効",
  "Control velocity! Activate: ^green;[Jump]^reset;. Move: ^green;[Direction]^reset;. Fall Negation: ^orange;[F]^reset;": "速度を制御！起動: ^green;[ジャンプ]^reset;。移動: ^green;[方向]^reset;。落下無効: ^orange;[F]^reset;",
  "Faster and more expensive Physics Field": "より高速で高コストの物理フィールド",
  "Tear apart reality to save time.": "時間節約のために現実を引き裂け",
  "Embrace your natural madness. Activate with ^green;[F]^reset;": "内なる狂気を解放せよ。^green;[F]^reset;で起動",
  "Fire a Shadow Burst! Use ^green;[F]^reset;.": "シャドウバーストを放て！^green;[F]^reset;で使用",
  "Spit Acid! (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "酸を吐け！（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Claw slash: (Read ^yellow;Core Guide^reset;: ^blue;Special Techs^reset;)": "爪斬り:（^yellow;コアガイド^reset;: ^blue;特殊テック^reset;参照）",
  "Toggle on with ^green;[F]^reset;, then hold ^green;[Down]^reset; to produce a Rad Bulb.": "^green;[F]^reset;でオンにし、^green;[下]^reset;長押しでラドバルブを生成",
  "Become invincible with this spinning jump technique!": "この回転ジャンプ技で無敵になれ！",
  "^orange;[ZB]^reset; Scan Interaction Handler": "^orange;[ZB]^reset; スキャンインタラクションハンドラー",
  "This quest (handles the scan interaction feature added by Ztarbound.\nJust accept it, and forget about its existence.": "このクエストはZtarboundが追加したスキャンインタラクション機能を処理します。\n承認して、その存在を忘れてください。",
  "Congratulations, you just broke something.\nBeam down/up so the scan interaction handler re-adds itself.\nIf this keeps happening, report it as a bug on the Steam page.": "おめでとう、何かを壊しました。\nビームダウン/アップしてスキャンインタラクションハンドラーを再追加してください。\nこれが繰り返し発生する場合は、Steamページでバグ報告してください。",
  "To select a task, click on its name on the left window, and relevant information will be displayed here.\n\nTasks also come with a color to represent your progress with them: \n^red;red^reset; : unavailable\n^yellow;yellow^reset; : available\n^cyan;cyan^reset; : in progress\n^green;green^reset; : complete.\n\nThere may be different task branches, which you can access by pressing the big image at the top of the window on the left. More become available as you unlock them.": "タスクを選択するには、左のウィンドウでその名前をクリックしてください。関連情報がここに表示されます\n\nタスクには進行状況を示す色が付いています: \n^red;赤^reset; : 利用不可\n^yellow;黄^reset; : 利用可能\n^cyan;シアン^reset; : 進行中\n^green;緑^reset; : 完了",
  "Learn the basics of Frackin Universe through this series of quests. You'll be guided through each of the initial stations and inform you of basic resource acquisition and mechanics.\n\n The focus is on getting you to use the ^orange;Research System^reset; first and foremost, so be sure to keep your Tricorder handy.": "このクエストシリーズでFrackin Universeの基本を学ぼう。最初の各ステーションを案内し、基本的な資源の入手方法やゲームの仕組みを説明する\n\nまず ^orange;研究システム^reset; の活用に集中するので、トレーニングの記録をしっかりつけておくこと",
  "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The topmost button at the right corner closes the research interface.\n\n- The second button opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The third button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The fourth button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.": "グリッド上のアイコンをクリックして研究を選択してください。\nマウスの左ボタンをドラッグしてグリッドをナビゲートできます。\n\n- 右上の一番上のボタンで研究インターフェースを閉じます。\n\n- 二番目のボタンで研究ツリーの一覧を開きます。\n\n- 三番目のボタンで",
  "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.": "グリッド上のアイコンをクリックして研究を選択してください。\nグリッドは左マウスボタンでドラッグして移動できます。\n\n- 画面上部左端のボタンで研究ツリーの一覧を開けます。\n\n- 2番目のボタンで非表示でない研究オプションの一覧を開けます。クリックすると...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to build a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset; which is the place to invest into agricultural pursuits and hunting. You also learn to make some simple farming tools and a means to capture useful wild bugs.\n\nInvesting into this tree will allow you to learn to create your own plant seeds to grow foodstuffs or useful effect-granting plants, how to raise farm beasts, how to hunt and fish, advanced farming techniques and how to raise bees.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n農業や狩猟に投資するための場所、^orange;採集テーブル^reset;の作り方を習得した。簡単な農作業道具と、役立つ野生の虫を捕まえる手段も学べる。\n\nこのツリーに投資することで、さらに多くのものを作れるようになる",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThough the universe is filled with many strange plants, the Protectorate academy taught you about quite a few. You've learned to start culvtivating these plants for yourself at a ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; which can be made at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset;. You can also (crudely) extract genetic material from plants for use in the creation of more complex plants at a ^cyan;Sprouting Table^reset;, also made at your Machining Table.\n\n^yellow;Tip:^reset; Grow lots of corn! Corn is an incredibly versatile crop, being a source of oil, cattle feed, and the basis of many more complex plants.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n宇宙には多くの奇妙な植物が溢れているが、プロテクトレート・アカデミーでその多くを学んだ。^orange;工作台^reset;で作れる^orange;温室^reset;で、これらの植物を自ら栽培し始める方法を習得した。また（",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've mastered all the plants the Protectorate Academy taught you about, allowing you to artificially create many more plants, including the all-important ^yellow;Cotton^reset;.\n\nYou're ready to start branching into making various medicinal plants that don't provide satiation, but don't spoil and provide useful buffs like environmental resistance, healing, increased stats, or even act as weapons!\n\nYou'll need ^orange;genes^reset; from this point on - found by processing seeds, saplings and some produce in the ^cyan;Sprouting Table^reset; or its upgrades. Some plants produce more seeds than others: flowers unsuited for dye-making are a good early source of seeds.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\nプロテクトレート・アカデミーで教わったすべての植物を習得し、重要な^yellow;綿^reset;を含む多くの植物を人工的に作れるようになった。\n\n満腹感を与えない各種の薬用植物の栽培にも着手する準備が整った",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe universe is a dangerous place, filled with many environments your physiology isn't equipped to handle. Your research has given you access to a number of plants that make the universe a little more forgiving, including plants that assist in traversing difficult terrain, produce natural antitoxins, and shore up your physiology from dangerous climates.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n宇宙は危険な場所であり、体が対応しきれない環境が数多く存在する。研究により、困難な地形の移動を助ける植物など、宇宙をもう少し生き延びやすくする植物が使えるようになった",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou're becoming especially adept at exploring alien worlds through the use of bioengineering, and have created several new plants protecting from more esoteric threats, including the crushing pressure of gas giants, eldritch ghosts, and even the poor mental health hours of slaving away over a gene lab results in.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\nバイオエンジニアリングを活用して異世界を探索する能力が特に高まり、ガス惑星の圧壊するような圧力、エルドリッチな幽霊、スラム街の劣悪な環境など、より不可思議な脅威から守る植物をいくつか生み出した",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYour latest plants are a thing of beauty, protecting you from even the most dangerous worlds. Equipped only with the contents of your herb pouch, you're now equipped to explore nearly any world imaginable, including those with lead-melting heat, atmospheres so cold it falls to the ground as snow and environments so radioactive that even the ground glistens with energy.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n最新の植物は素晴らしいもので、最も危険な世界からも身を守ってくれる。ハーブポーチの中身だけを装備して、鉛が溶けるほどの熱さや大気が凍りつくほどの寒さの世界を含む、想像しうるほぼあらゆる世界を探索できるようになった",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe universe is a gruelling place, requiring great effort to extract the meanest of resources from it. Your research uses the miracle of life to lift this burden, by creating plants which provide silk, genetic resources, healing, and mining aids, saving your valuable resources and effort for where they're needed elsewhere.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n宇宙は過酷な場所で、わずかな資源を得るにも大きな努力が必要だ。研究では生命の奇跡を活かし、絹、遺伝資源、回復、採掘補助を提供する植物を作ることでこの負担を軽減し、貴重な資源を節約できる",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nAn adept at genetic engineering, you've begun to create plants which greatly light your way in the darkness, beyond the level that Gold Shroom was capable of. You're also experimenting with organic performance enhancers, including those which protect your body from lethal falls and gravitic rain.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n遺伝子工学の達人として、ゴールドシュルームを超えるレベルで暗闘を照らす植物を作り始めた。致死的な落下からも身を守る有機パフォーマンス向上剤の実験も行っている",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThe plants you've learned to make would be illegal in any Olympics, if Earth still existed. You can now run at breakneck speeds, jump up sheer surfaces and even alter the strength of gravity on your body, all with the use of plants. You've also dipped into stranger, less corporeal realms, and created a type of plant which can be eaten in a life-or-death situation to pull you away to safety.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\nあなたが作れるようになった植物は、地球がまだ存在していたならどんなオリンピックでも違法とされるだろう。植物の力だけで、猛烈なスピードで走り、垂直な壁を跳び登り、重力の強ささえ操れるようになった。また、より奇妙で",
  "^orange;Tier 4.5^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to develop some specialized plants that enhance your mobility in water, and created Vorit, a strange jelly-like mushroom which allows you to breathe normally underwater or even in a total vacuum for a while, then harmlessly passes through your system.\n\nAquapods are especially useful for the copious amounts of genetic information they contain, in both the seeds and bulbs.": "^orange;ティア4.5^reset;\n\n水中での機動性を高める専門植物の開発方法を習得し、水中や真空状態でも一時的に普通に呼吸でき、その後無害に体内を通過する奇妙なゼリー状キノコ「ヴォリット」を生み出した。\n\n水生",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned some more complex methods of farming and can now build several helpful farming objects. The ^cyan;Growing Tray^reset; is the most important of these, as it will automatically grow seeds placed inside with the help of fertilizers that increase yields far beyond what is possible through manual labor. Craft it at your ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\nより複雑な農業方法を習得し、役立つ農業用オブジェクトをいくつか製作できるようになりました。^cyan;育成トレイ^reset;がその中でも最重要で、内部に置いた種を肥料の助けを借りて自動的に育て、通常をはるかに超える収穫量をもたらします。",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nWith a ^cyan;Heatlamp Tray^reset; made at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;, you can turn electrical power into faster plant growth. They'll use more water per plant than a Growing Tray, but the added speed is worth it! \n\nIn addition, you've learned to create hydroponic and aeroponic tubing, more advanced sprinkler systems, and other useful farming enhancements for farming the old-fashioned way if you prefer that.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n^orange;エレクトロニクス・センター^reset;で製作した^cyan;ヒートランプ・トレイ^reset;を使えば、電力を植物の成長速度に変換できます。育成トレイより植物1株あたりの水消費量は多いですが、速度の向上はそれだけの価値があります！\n\nさらに、水耕栽培の製作方法も習得しました。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned to raise bees in an apiary to provide you with useful resources. Make an ^cyan;Apiary Crafting Station^reset; at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset; to get started.\n\nRaising bees is pretty complex. If you're not sure how, buy a guide from the Bee Refuge in the Science Outpost, accessible once you leave your starter planet.\n\nAs a simple starter tip, you need a microscope-identified queen, a matching microscope-identified drone, one or more frames, and some flowers planted nearby for production to start.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n養蜂場でミツバチを飼育して有用な資源を得る方法を習得しました。始めるには^orange;マシニング・テーブル^reset;で^cyan;養蜂クラフト・ステーション^reset;を製作しましょう。\n\nミツバチの飼育はかなり複雑です。やり方がわからない場合は、サイエンス・アウトポストの養蜂場からガイドを購入してください。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nChemistry is a wonderful field with many practical applications such as the creation of plastics, bombs, medicine, fertilizer or biodiesel. With the ability to make an ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset; at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset;, you're now ready to start exploring its potential.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n化学はプラスチック、爆発物、医薬品、肥料、バイオディーゼルなどの製造など、多くの実用的な応用を持つ素晴らしい分野です。^orange;マシニング・テーブル^reset;で^orange;錬金術テーブル^reset;を製作できるようになり、その可能性を探求する準備が整いました。",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nHaving learned a lot about plastic creation, you can now create a much more potent rigid plastic that is extremely durable and quite heat-proof. Advanced Plastic is a key ingredient in tons of things, and you can almost never have enough. Luckily, you've learned of several different ways to make this substance, though you'll probably be deriving it from petrol most of the time.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\nプラスチック製造について多くを学んだことで、非常に耐久性が高く耐熱性のある硬質プラスチックを製造できます。アドバンスド・プラスチックはあらゆるものに使われる重要素材で、いくら持っていても十分ではありません。幸いにも、いくつかの異なる入手方法を習得しました。",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nGraphene is one of the most wonderful substances ever created, and now you know how to make it yourself. A one-atom thick sheet of hexagonal graphite, graphene is ridiculously durable. In addition to being a key component in many powerful weapons and armor, graphene is also very useful in the creation of complex circuitry.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\nグラフェンは人類が作り出した最も素晴らしい物質の一つで、自分で製造できるようになりました。六角形のグラファイトを原子一枚分の厚さに並べたグラフェンは驚くほど耐久性があります。多くの強力な武器や防具の重要素材であるだけでなく、非常に",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThrough intense experimentation, you've learned to create an amazing substance that exploits the strange properties of phase matter to be simultaneously incredibly durable and highly moldable. Besides its use in weapons and armor, it's also quite conductive and will allow amazing new electronic devices to be made.\n\nYour knowledge of phasic materials has also allowed you to create 'blocks' of raw matter in your lab that are useful for a couple different esoteric reactions.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n激しい実験を通して、位相物質の奇妙な特性を利用して信じられないほど耐久性があり、かつ高度に成形可能な驚くべき物質の製造方法を習得しました。武器や防具への使用に加えて、非常に導電性も高く、驚くべき",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've begun to learn how to make useful crop-growing aids out of chemicals and can now craft basic fertilizer at your ^orange;Alchemy Table^reset;\n\nAmmonium Sulfate can be extracted from many sources. Try grinding up some Core Fragments or Poop in your Hand Mill.\n\nYou'll need a ^orange;Growing Tray^reset; to do anything with your fertilizer - if you're just growing plants out of the ground with a hoe and watering can, it won't be of any use to you.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n化学物質から有用な農作物栽培補助剤を製造する方法を学び始め、^orange;錬金術テーブル^reset;で基本的な肥料を製作できます。\n\n硫酸アンモニウムは多くの場所から抽出できます。コア・フラグメントや糞を手動ミルで粉砕してみてください。\n\n必要なものは",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nNormally, this stuff is only found in the depths of gas giants, but you found a way to make it in your lab by yourself. Metallic Hydrogen is a powerful superconductor, and an amazing fuel source. Also, you found the best way to weaponize Unstable Particles - by combining them with Metallic Hydrogen to build ridiculously destructive grenades.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n通常はガス惑星の深部でしか見られないものですが、自分の研究室で製造する方法を発見しました。金属性水素は強力な超伝導体であり、驚くべき燃料源でもあります。また、不安定粒子を組み合わせることで最良の武器化方法を発見しました。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've taught yourself some basic medical knowledge and can make simple healing items.\n\n^yellow;Did you know?^reset; Healing items in Frackin' Universe impose a moderately long cooldown upon use during which no other healing items can be used. Don't expect to spam bandages to victory!": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n基本的な医学知識を習得し、シンプルな回復アイテムを製造できます。\n\n^yellow;ご存知ですか？^reset; Frackin' Universeの回復アイテムは使用時に中程度の長いクールダウンを課し、その間他の回復アイテムは使用できません。バンデージを連打して",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nBrewing and winemaking are some pretty handy skills to know for an aspiring alcoholic. You can now dip your toes into the craft of booze-making. A word of warning, though - it's a complicated process. You may want to ask a master brewer at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset; for advice.\n\n^yellow;Did you know?^reset; Frackin' Universe incorporated the beer-brewing system from the Starbooze mod way back in 2015!": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n醸造とワイン醸造は、飲酒家を目指す人にとってかなり便利なスキルです。今ではお酒作りの技術に足を踏み入れることができます。ただし警告があります — 複雑なプロセスです。^orange;サイエンス・アウトポスト^reset;のマスター醸造家に聞いてみてください。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've gained the skills needed to govern a large colony. You can now build a ^orange;Colony Station^reset; at your Inventor's Table, allowing you to craft several colony automation devices.\n\n^yellow;Colony System Guide^reset;: The basis of your colony is the Colony Core, a device which passively collects rent from (and only from) Mk2 Tenant Deeds, which generate no rent on their own - they are co-dependent.\n\nThe happier your tenants are, the more rent they will pay. Happiness can be increased by constructing various add-ons for your colony, which can also generate resources, doing so faster the more tenants you have. There is a limit of one of each add-on per colony.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n大規模なコロニーを統治するために必要なスキルを習得しました。発明家のテーブルで^orange;コロニー・ステーション^reset;を製作できるようになり、コロニーの自動化デバイスをいくつか製作できます。\n\n^yellow;コロニーシステムガイド^reset;: コロニーの基盤はコロニー・コアで、",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nLong ago, the Peglaci were a race of arctic carnivores, the apex predators of their world, until they were uplifted by a race they know only as the Wanderers. You've learned to replicate their unique crafting style, a mix of ice and lignin developed in their race's infancy and metallically augmented by gifted knkowledge.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n遥か昔、ペグラシは彼らの世界の頂点捕食者である北極の肉食獣でしたが、ワンダラーとしか知られていない種族に文明化されました。幼年期に氷と木質を組み合わせて発展させた彼らの独特な工芸スタイルを再現する方法を習得しました。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nSure, there's merit to traveling with friends, but with mercenaries you won't need friends. Though 'reliable' mercs may pass you up, you can nonetheless hire some greenhorns eager for work at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset;.\n\nHold ^green;shift^reset; while using a crew contract to satisfy your inner xenophobe, and guarantee a recruit of the same race as you.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n友人と旅するのも良いですが、傭兵がいれば友人は不要です。'信頼できる'傭兵には避けられるかもしれませんが、それでも^orange;サイエンス・アウトポスト^reset;で仕事を求める新米を雇うことができます。\n\n乗組員コントロールを使用中に^green;シフト^reset;を押しながら",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThe ^orange;Machining Table^reset; is the place to produce mechanical components, and will serve as the base workstation for many of your scientific forays. You've learned to create one yourself along with variety of basic items used in engineering.\n\nTo craft a ^orange;Machining Table^reset; you'll need to use your basic ^green;[C]rafting^reset; menu.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n^orange;マシニング・テーブル^reset;は機械部品を製造する場所で、多くの科学的探求の基盤となるワークステーションです。自分で製作する方法と、エンジニアリングに使われる各種基本アイテムを習得しました。\n\n^orange;マシニング・テーブル^reset;を製作するには",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWith a solid understanding of computer technology and physics you can now create Force Fields that ^green;protect your base from harm^reset;, ^green;control gravity^reset; and ^green;provide breathable air^reset;. Quite useful!\n\nTo protect a location, place two field markers at the opposite corners of a square around the area, and wire them to the field generator's output connector. Field extenders can be used as relays, to connect the field markers beyond the normal wiring range.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\nコンピューター技術と物理学の確固たる理解により、^green;拠点を危害から守る^reset;、^green;重力を制御する^reset;、^green;呼吸可能な空気を提供する^reset;フォース・フィールドを製作できます。非常に役立ちます！\n\n場所を守るには、フィールドマーカーを2つ配置して",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWith access to Morphite, even AI technology is within your reach, allowing the creation of supremely fast computing components that are capable of self-improvement and basic decision-making. It's no surprise that many governments ban this technology outright for fear of what amazing things it can do.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\nモーファイトへのアクセスにより、AI技術さえも手の届く範囲になり、自己改善と基本的な意思決定が可能な超高速コンピューティングコンポーネントを製造できます。多くの政府がこの技術を完全に禁止していることは驚くに値しません。",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've designed a trio of powerful energy cores, each with their own laundry list of scientific and military applications. Molten Cores are excellent when dealing with intense heat such as in blast furnaces or lava-spewing flamethrowers. Power Cores shine in kinetic applications, and are useful in machines with many moving parts and high-end ballistic weaponry. Nuclear Cores are useful for channeling radiation, such as in a fission reactor, or just plain making tons of energy for high-demand inventions.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n科学・軍事用途の長いリストを持つ3種類の強力なエネルギーコアを設計しました。モルテン・コアは溶鉱炉や溶岩噴出火炎放射器などの強烈な熱を扱う際に優れています。パワー・コアは運動力学的な用途に輝きます。",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour skill with compact power sources has allowed you to make two more useful cores, expanding your engineering capability greatly. Teleporter Cores are perfect for transportation and constructing large, automated item networks, while Particle Cores are unmatched at channeling atomic and subatomic particles - the photons in a powerful laser, for example.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\nコンパクトな電源に関するスキルにより、さらに2つの有用なコアを製造でき、エンジニアリング能力が大幅に拡張されます。テレポーター・コアは輸送と大型自動アイテムネットワークの構築に最適であり、パーティクル・コアはチャネリングに無比の能力を発揮します。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of resource extraction and can now build rudimentary devices to extract, research and centrifuge materials. \n\n^cyan;Extractor^reset;\n\nPut almost anything in and it will convert it into something else. Most items are processed in groups of 50. \n\n^cyan;Centrifuge^reset;\n\nPut any liquid inside and the centrifuge will start working - though the wooden one isn't quite durable enough to handle lava and other volatile stuff. Researched in the ^orange;Power Systems^reset; tree. \n\n^cyan;Research Computer^reset;\n\nPut an item with a value greater than 0 in one and it will automatically convert it into an amount of research equal to ^green;5% of the item's pixel value^reset;. Faster computers can be built by pursuing ^orange;Gold Circuits^reset; research.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n資源抽出の基礎を習得し、材料を抽出、研究、遠心分離する簡易装置を製作できます。\n\n^cyan;抽出機^reset;\n\nほぼ何でも入れると別のものに変換されます。ほとんどのアイテムは50個単位で処理されます。\n\n^cyan;",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning that engineering isn't just about making new things, but improving on the ones you already made. To this end, you've learned to create a ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; which will allow you to make EPP modules, mining gear, special weapon upgrades, and useful tools such as a Hookshot or Mining Laser.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\nエンジニアリングとは新しいものを作るだけでなく、既存のものを改良することだと学んでいます。そのために、EPPモジュール、採掘ギア、特殊武器アップグレード、便利なアイテムを製作できる^orange;ティンカリング・テーブル^reset;の製作方法を習得しました。",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour spaceship may have broken down, but that doesn't mean you can't fix it. Using parts from your old junked FTL drive and the thermal power of Core Fragments, you are now able to make a basic ship engine (^cyan;STL Engine^reset;, created at a ^orange;Machining Table^reset;).\n\nWhile fine for intrastellar travel, the STL engine isn't nearly powerful enough to leave your system - you'll need to ^orange;Research^reset; proper FTL technology to do that.\n\nIf ^cyan;Fuel^reset; is proving an issue to find for your ship: head to a ^green;Moon^reset; or produce some ^cyan;Hydrogen^reset; by processing water (via ^orange;Extraction^reset; or ^orange;Centrifuge^reset;).\n\nAdditionally, you can craft a very simple mech for EVA or planetary usage (created at a ^orange;Mech Part Crafting Table^reset;. You can ^green;Research^reset; one later, or use the one at the ^orange;Outpost^reset;).\n\nMechs will provide a large amount of damage resistance and help you stay alive for longer in harsh situations, and are able to ^green;Fly^reset; in an atmosphere as well as space.\n\nIf you're having trouble finding ^orange;Core Fragments^reset;, just dig towards the planet core. You'll find some there.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n宇宙船が故障したからといって修理できないわけではありません。古いジャンクFTLドライブの部品とコア・フラグメントの熱エネルギーを使って、基本的な宇宙船エンジン（^orange;マシニング・テーブル^reset;で製作する^cyan;STLエンジン^reset;）を製造できます。",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nThe science behind Erchius Crystals is still very vague, but one thing is known for certain: these crystals hold the key to FTL travel. With the ability to make your own FTL drives, the whole galaxy is now open to exploration.\n\nWhen Erchius-based drives were still in their infancy, only Erchius fuel could power FTL travel. However, it has since been discovered how to fuel drives with a variety of sources such as ^green;radioactive isotopes^reset; or ^green;biofuel^reset;.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\nエルキウス・クリスタルの科学はまだ非常に曖昧ですが、一つ確実なことがあります。これらの結晶がFTL旅行の鍵を握っています。独自のFTLドライブを製造できるようになり、銀河全体が探索に開かれます。\n\nエルキウスベースのドライブがまだ初期段階だった頃は、",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned a lot about building modular mechs and can now make galactic-standard mech parts at a ^orange;Mech Crafting Table^reset;.\n\nThe weight of your mech is very important. Lighter mechs get around more easily and burn less fuel, while heavy mechs are more durable and can crush things by jumping on them.\n\n^yellow;Note:^reset; You no longer need to gather \"salvage\" components to make mechs - they are now made with other resources such as circuit boards and energy cores. Salvage can be ^orange;extracted^reset; to provide potentially useful resources instead.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\nモジュール式メックの製作について多くを学び、^orange;メック製作テーブル^reset;で銀河標準のメックパーツを製造できます。\n\nメックの重量は非常に重要です。軽量メックはより機動力があり燃料消費が少なく、重量メックはより耐久性があります。",
  ". Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\nThe left button at the top left corner will move the view to the center of the tree, and the left button will open a list of researches, from which you can zoom to other researches.": ". グリッド上のアイコンをクリックして研究を選択してください。\nグリッドは左マウスボタンでドラッグして移動できます。\n左上のボタンでビューをツリーの中心に移動し、左のボタンで研究一覧を開きます。そこから他の研究にズームできます",
  "^orange;Blacksmithing - Tier 1^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Copper^reset; and ^cyan;Iron^reset; ores. Through these materials you'll be able to dive into crafting and really get started. This research will lead to greater knowledge of metalworking.\n\nYou've also learn to smelt basic items like ^cyan;Clay^reset; and ^cyan;Glass^reset;. Should you have trouble locating the requirements for these, you'll need to dig. You'll find both ^cyan;Clay^reset; and ^cyan;Sand^reset; readily.": "^orange;鍛冶 - ティア1^reset;\n\n^cyan;銅^reset;と^cyan;鉄^reset;の鉱石を加工する方法を習得します。これらの素材を通じてクラフトに本格参入できます。この研究はより高い金属加工の知識へと導きます。\n\n^cya...（省略）のような基本アイテムの精錬も習得できます",
  "^orange;Industrial Metals - Tier 3^reset;\n\nNow you can work with ^cyan;Titanium^reset;, and through it you'll be able to upgrade many of your crafting stations. Furthermore, you'll learn to work with more unusual materials such as ^cyan;Protocite^reset; and ^cyan;Penumbrite^reset; (both of which are quite useful).": "^orange;工業金属 - ティア3^reset;\n\n^cyan;チタン^reset;を扱えるようになり、多くの作業台をアップグレードできます。さらに^cyan;プロトサイト^reset;や^cyan;ペナンブライト^reset;などの特殊素材も扱えます（どちらも...(省略)）",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThe simplest of the metals for you to work with. It is soft, conductive and abundant. ^cyan;Copper^reset; remains useful in most industrial processes thanks to its requirement in wiring. \n\nYou'll find ^cyan;Copper^reset; on ^green;most worlds^reset;, as it is extremely abundant throughout the cosmos.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n扱いやすい最も基本的な金属です。柔らかく、導電性があり、豊富に存在します。^cyan;銅^reset;は配線に必要なため、ほとんどの工業プロセスで有用です。\n\n^cyan;銅^reset;は^green;ほとんどの世界^reset;で見つかります。非常に豊富です...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\n^cyan;Iron^reset; is perhaps the most commonly used metal, even in our current age. Without it, the fundamentals of industrialization seldom come to pass. It forms the backbone for early survival, fashioning useful hunting weapons.\n\n ^cyan;Iron^reset; is found on a great deal of worlds, but is most easily located on ^green;Lush^reset; worlds.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n^cyan;鉄^reset;は現代においても最も広く使われている金属です。それなしでは工業化の基盤が成り立ちません。初期の生存と有用な狩猟武器の製作に欠かせません。\n\n^cyan;鉄^reset;は多くの世界で見つかります...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\n^cyan;Tungsten^reset; is a tough metal with a very high melting point. This makes it a favorite in advanced construction, as it is exceptionally useful in weapons and equipment. \n\n^cyan;Tungsten^reset; can be found on many worlds but is most easily found on ^green;Forest^reset; and ^green;Desert^reset; biomes. You've also learned to make a functionally similar steel-like substitute by alloying Iron ore at an ^orange;Industrial Furnace^reset;.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n^cyan;タングステン^reset;は非常に高い融点を持つ硬い金属です。武器や装備として非常に有用なため、高度な建設で好まれます。\n\n^cyan;タングステン^reset;は多くの世界で見つかりますが、^green;森林^reset;世界で最も入手しやすいです...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nDurable, extremely hard to melt, and one of the most important metals for construction in the known galaxy. \n\nYou can find ^cyan;Titanium^reset; on most ^green;Tier 3^reset; worlds. ^green;Oceanic^reset; worlds prove to be the lowest threat, but also have less abundant sources.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n耐久性が高く、融点が非常に高く、既知の銀河で建設に最も重要な金属の一つです。\n\n^cyan;チタン^reset;はほとんどの^green;ティア3^reset;世界で見つかります。^green;海洋^reset;世界は脅威が最も低いですが、産出量も少なめです...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nA dense metal with the uncanny ability to meld seamlessly against a vaccuum, ^cyan;Durasteel^reset; is a favorite among space engineers. \n\n^cyan;Durasteel^reset; can be found on nearly all ^green;Tier 4^reset; worlds. ^green;Alien^reset;, ^green;Sulphuric^reset;, ^green;Mountainous^reset; are all good sources.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n真空に対してシームレスに融合する不思議な能力を持つ高密度金属で、宇宙エンジニアに人気です。\n\n^cyan;デュラスティール^reset;はほぼすべての^green;ティア4^reset;世界で見つかります。^green;エイリアン^reset;、^green;硫黄^reset;、^green;山地^reset;...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2.5^reset;\n\nLearn to process the unusual ore known as ^cyan;Telebrium^reset;. Lightweight, conductive enough to create charge but unsuitable for holding it long-term, this metal has found use in numerous areas.\n\nYou can find Telebrium primarily on ^green;Moons^reset;, where it can be found abundantly forming.": "^orange;ティア2.5^reset;\n\n^cyan;テレブリウム^reset;と呼ばれる珍しい鉱石の加工方法を習得します。軽量で、電荷を生成するのに十分な導電性はありますが、長期保持には不向きで、さまざまな用途に使われています。\n\nテレブリウムは主に^green;衛星^reset;で見つかります...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Densinium^reset;. \n\nYou can find Densinium primarily on ^green;Cyberspheres^reset;. It can also rarely be found on ^green;Sulphuric^reset; biomes and ^green;Gas Giants^reset;. It is the most dense of metals, capable of unimaginable resistance against force. It is extremely hard to work with as a result, reserved for the most skilled weaponsmiths.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n^cyan;デンシニウム^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nデンシニウムは主に^green;サイバースフィア^reset;で見つかります。^green;硫黄^reset;バイオームや^green;ガスジャイアント^reset;でもまれに見つかります。最も密度が高い金属で、想像を絶する...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Effigium^reset;. \n\nYou can find Effigium  only on ^green;Lightless^reset; worlds, where it blends into the terrain around it as if it were insubstantial. This is a strange trick of physics that few can even begin to understand, but many have theorized that it is able to repel light photons.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n^cyan;エフィジウム^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nエフィジウムは^green;ライトレス^reset;世界のみに存在し、周囲の地形に溶け込んで実体がないように見えます。これは物理学の奇妙な現象で、ほとんどの人には理解できませんが、多くの人が理論化しています...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Isogen^reset;. \n\nYou can find Isogen primarily on dangerous freezing worlds like ^green;Ice Wastes^reset;. Even touching this ore can risk frostbite, so care should be excercised when working with it. It can make fantastic shielding against heat, and can be worked into deadly frost weapons.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n^cyan;イソゲン^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nイソゲンは主に^green;氷の荒野^reset;のような危険な極寒世界で見つかります。この鉱石に触れるだけで凍傷の危険があるため、取り扱いに注意が必要です。熱への優れた遮蔽材として機能し...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Pyreite.^reset; \n\nYou can find Pyreite primarily on dangerous burning worlds like ^green;Infernus^reset;. It is perhaps the best known insulator against cold temperatures and doubly great for incendiary use. Do not leave on any easily melted surface for longer than 2 minutes. This metal never grows fully cold.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n^cyan;パイレイト^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nパイレイトは主に^green;インフェルヌス^reset;のような危険な灼熱世界で見つかります。冷温に対する優れた断熱材であり、焼夷用途にも最適です。溶けやすい表面には置かないように...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3.5^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Protocite^reset;. \n\nYou can find Protocite only on ^green;Proto Worlds^reset;. This ore is famed for its ability to store and channel power while insulating at the same time, making it a popular metal for numerous processes. It glows yellow, giving away its presence to the intrepid miner.": "^orange;ティア3.5^reset;\n\n^cyan;プロトサイト^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nプロトサイトは^green;プロトワールド^reset;にのみ存在します。同時に絶縁しながら電力を蓄え通す能力で有名で、多くのプロセスで使われる人気の金属です。黄色に輝き...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Quietus^reset;. \n\nThis horrifying metal is found only on ^green;Atropus^reset; biomes. It pulses and throbs almost imperceptibly, and when worked hard under a hammer it can almost be heard to 'scream'. It possesses useful properties, especially in regard to biological weapons.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n^cyan;クワイエタス^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nこの恐ろしい金属は^green;アトロパス^reset;バイオームにのみ存在します。ほぼ感じ取れないほど脈動し、ハンマーで強く打つとほとんど「叫び声」が聞こえます。有用な特性を持ち、特に...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Lasombrium^reset;. \n\nRaw chaos and entropy given form, this metal is unique and not a natural part of the universe. It phases between solid and non nearly constantly. It is only found in ^green;Corruption^reset; sub biomes, found on and beneath many types of decaying worlds.\n\nTo process this rare and unusual mineral, you'll need at least a ^orange;Chem Lab^reset; (upgrade of the Alchemy station) to properly cleanse the toxic outer shell and remove impurities. A ^orange;Blast Furnace^reset; or ^orange;Arc Smelter^reset; can also do the trick on their own.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n^cyan;ラソンブリウム^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\n生の混沌とエントロピーを形にしたこの金属は独自のもので、宇宙の自然な一部ではありません。固体と非固体の間をほぼ常に位相移動しています。^green;コラプション^reset;サブバイオームにのみ存在し...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nLearn to process ^cyan;Prisilite^reset;. \n\nPrisilite is a truly interesting mineral. Capable of holding charge but not discharging it without an impact, it has been harnessed for many creative purposes across the galaxy.\n\nYou can find this chromatic crystal in many places, but ^green;Chromatic^reset; biomes are among the best places to hunt.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n^cyan;プリシライト^reset;の加工方法を習得します。\n\nプリシライトは非常に興味深い鉱物です。電荷を蓄えられますが、衝撃なしには放電できず、銀河中でさまざまな創造的な目的に活用されています。\n\nこのカラフルなクリスタルは多くの場所で見つかりますが...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nGlittering beautifully, crystals have long fascinated people across the cosmos. Through this branch of research you will learn to process Crystals. If you're desperate for some, crystals are best found on ^green;Crystalline^reset; biomes.\n\nTo craft or process these gems, you'll need a ^orange;Crystal Fusion Station^reset;.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n美しく輝くクリスタルは宇宙の人々を長い間魅了してきました。この研究分野を通じてクリスタルの加工方法を習得します。クリスタルが必要なら、^green;クリスタライン^reset;バイオームが最もよい産地です。\n\nこれらの宝石を製作・加工するには...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nSought after as decorative for reasons few have ever been able to discern, diamonds are allegedly beautiful (nevermind the fact that they are colorless and bland!). However, diamond is exceptionally useful to those with the means to make the most of them. You're able to do just that, and will be able to make exceptionally useful gear.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n装飾として珍重される理由を誰も明確に説明できませんが、ダイヤモンドは美しいとされています（色も特徴もないのに！）。しかし、使いこなせる人にとっては非常に有用です。あなたなら使いこなせます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2.5^reset;\n\nWhile it doesn't look it, Carbon houses great potential, and you'll need it for many useful technologies. It plays a part in a great deal of crafting, and paves the way to strong alloys and powerful equipment.\n\nCreating carbon is simple enough, through research into ^green;Chemistry^reset; or by extracting coal. Turning it into a form that is useable in everyday processes for crafting is another matter entirely. You've learned to do just that.": "^orange;ティア2.5^reset;\n\n見かけによらずカーボンには大きな可能性があり、多くの有用な技術に必要です。多くのクラフトに関与し、強力な合金や高性能装備への道を開きます。\n\nカーボンの製作は^green;C...(省略)^reset;の研究で簡単にできます",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nProcessing isotopes is dangerous to the uninitiated. That used to be you. Now, though, you're confident that you can safely handle these sorts of materials and utilize them in very lucrative scientific pursuits.\n\nYou're ready to start working with Plutonium, which can be quite useful for numerous applications": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n同位体の処理は未熟者には危険です。それがかつてのあなたでした。しかし今は、これらの素材を安全に扱い、非常に有益な科学的追求に活用できると確信しています。\n\nプルトニウムを扱える準備ができました...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThrough your scientific studies, you've found a certain fascination with the past. You've studied the basics of Archaeology and Anthropology, and can now create gear to help you find ^green;Fossils and Artifacts^reset;. You can craft the ^orange;Fossil Station^reset; at your ^orange;Inventor's Table^reset;.\n\nTo dig up fossils, you'll first need to find some in the soil underground. Once you do, simply stand next to the fossil and target it with your Fossil Brush of choice, and swipe it for a few seconds. You'll then be taken to the Fossil Minigame for a skill-testing challenge.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n科学的研究を通じて過去への特別な関心を見出しました。考古学と人類学の基礎を学び、^green;化石とアーティファクト^reset;を見つけるための装備を製作できます。^orange;フォッシルステーション^reset;を^...(省略)で製作できます",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour understanding of science and geology now makes it possible to directly interfere with planetary ecology. Through advanced technology you can edit the very nature of worlds you explore.\n\nThe first step: ^orange;Microformers^reset;. These handy devices can be placed to convert small regions into new biomes.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n科学と地質学の理解が深まり、惑星の生態系に直接干渉できるようになりました。先進技術で探索する世界の本質を編集できます。\n\n最初のステップ：^orange;マイクロフォーマー^reset;。これらの便利なデバイスを設置すると...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nWith the science of Microformers now easily understood, you've moved on to more advanced forms of terrestrial editing. You can now craft Terraformers capable of converting an entire planetary biome to one of your choosing.\n\nNote that in order to make these devices function you will require ^#e43774;Ancient Essence^reset;. This rare resource can be found in many mysterious places.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\nマイクロフォーマーの科学を完全に理解した後、より高度な地球改変へと進みました。惑星全体のバイオームを任意のものに変換できるテラフォーマーを製作できます。\n\nこれらのデバイスを機能させるには...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYou've done it! You've determined how to create stable fusion reactions! This is an efficient producer of energy, but ^red;requires coolant such as water or liquid nitrogen^reset; or you risk potentially fatal explosion.\nCan be fueled with hydrogen isotopes such as Hydrogen, Helium 3 and Tritium.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\nついに安定した核融合反応を実現しました！効率的なエネルギー生成器ですが、^red;水や液体窒素などの冷却剤が必要^reset;でなければ致命的な爆発の危険があります。\n水素同位体（水素、Hなど）を燃料として使用できます",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nWhy stop at -basic- fusion when you can create something far more appealing? While expensive, the ^orange;Large Fusion Reactor^reset; is well worth its weight for the power it can produce using hydrogen isotopes. It still ^red;requires coolant such as water or liquid nitrogen^reset;.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n-基本-核融合で止まる必要はありません。費用はかかりますが、^orange;大型核融合炉^reset;は水素同位体を使って生産できる電力に十分な価値があります。^red;水や液体窒素などの冷却剤が必要^reset;...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of making weapons and armor. You can now create an ^orange;Armorworks^reset; at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset; where you can create a huge variety of EPPs, armor, and weapons out of many materials. There, you can now make a variety of basic armor and equipment out of simple metals like iron.\n\n^yellow;Note^reset;: While the old Anvil is still available, it has essentially been superseded by the Armorworks in function. You no longer really have a reason to make one.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n武器と防具の製作の基礎を習得しました。^orange;加工台^reset;で^orange;アーマーワークス^reset;を製作でき、そこで多くの種類のEPP、防具、武器を多くの素材で製作できます。さまざまな基本防具も製作できます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to work Tungsten like steel in the creation of more advanced forged weapons, armors, and the especially useful ^orange;Breathing EPP^reset;. Besides being generally quite durable when forged correctly, Tungsten also has the heat tolerance to start making useful energy weapons.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\nより高度な鍛造武器、防具、特に有用な^orange;呼吸EPP^reset;の製作にタングステンを鋼鉄のように扱う方法を習得しました。適切に鍛造された場合の耐久性に加え、タングステンは有用なものを製作し始めるのに十分な耐熱性があります...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nWhen worked properly, Carbon is extremely durable, resistant to elements and very lightweight. You've learned to apply it to the creation of powerful armors. As your skill with weaponmaking grows, Carbon Plating will be the basis of many weapons and armor down the line. It pairs especially well with ^orange;Zerchesium^reset; ore, forming a solid and nearly indestructible cutting edge.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n適切に加工するとカーボンは非常に耐久性が高く、元素に強く、とても軽量です。強力な防具の製作への応用方法を習得しました。武器製作の技術が上がるにつれ、カーボンプレーティングが多くの武器と防具の基礎となります...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nDurasteel is known to be tailor-made for use in a vacuum because of its amazing ability to smooth dents and cuts, assuming anything is strong enough to scratch it. Unsurprisingly, it is a great metal to make armor and weapons out of - something you now have the skill to do after much painstaking practice with 'easier' metals.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\nデュラスティールは真空での使用に特化しており、傷を自動修復する驚異的な能力で知られています。当然ながら防具と武器に最適な金属で、技術習得後に製作できます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNot only is Irradium far more durable than common isotopes, but its radiation can, uniquely, be contained to an extent. When treated correctly, Irradium will only undergo its deadly radioactive decay when pressure is applied to it, allowing for the creation of weapons that 'discharge' when striking foes but won't slowly fizzle out when stored. It's all around a great way to give your foes cancer in their last moments before death.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\nイラジウムは一般的な同位体よりはるかに耐久性が高いだけでなく、ある程度放射線を封じ込められます。適切に処理すると、圧力が加えられた時のみ致命的な放射性崩壊が起こり、「...(省略)」する武器を製作できます",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nEven more durable than its constituent Durasteel, Tritanium is very light, very durable, and very resistant to hostile environments. Armor made from Tritanium is among the most readily available source of protection from the ^red;lethal pressure^reset; within gas giants, while its weapons are reliable and very destructive.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n構成材料のデュラスティールよりさらに耐久性が高く、非常に軽量で環境への耐性も高いです。トリタニウム製防具はガスジャイアント内の^red;致死的な圧力^reset;から最も容易に入手できる保護の一つです...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nSolarium is one of the few things known to the galaxy that is more radioactive than Irradium, and it's extremely heat-resistant to boot. Despite these barriers to working with Solarium, your incredible skill has made weaponizing it downright easy. You can make fantastic, lethal weapons and armor out of Solarium.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\nソラリウムはイラジウムよりも放射性が高く非常に耐熱性が高い稀有な存在です。これらの障壁にもかかわらず、あなたの素晴らしいスキルでソラリウムの武器化は非常に簡単です。素晴らしい致死的な...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nFamed for its tendency to be blazingly hot at all times, Pyreite is as much a danger to its user as it is to foes... were that user anyone but you. With your skill, you can create the hottest weapons and armor in existence, which will not only fry the competition to a crisp but protect you from the worst cold the galaxy has to offer.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n常に燃えるほど熱いことで有名なパイレイトは、使用者にとってもほど同様に危険です...あなた以外の誰かにとっては。あなたのスキルで最も熱い武器と防具を製作でき、相手を焦がすだけでなく...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThe fact that Isogen ceaseslessly devours all heat, and somehow remains just above absolute zero, presents an interesting dilemma: how do you forge and work with something like that? Well, you've figured it out with your smart blacksmith brain, and can create the coldest weapons and armor in existence. Not only will they freeze your foes solid, but Isogen armor will let you dive into an ocean of lava and come out no worse for wear.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\nイソゲンがあらゆる熱を絶え間なく吸収し絶対零度をわずかに上回る状態を保つという事実は興味深いジレンマを提示します：どうやってそのようなものを鍛造・加工するのか？あなたは賢い鍛冶の頭で解決し、最も冷たい武器を製作できます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 7^reset;\n\nThough you only recently discovered what you've dubbed 'Aetherium' alloy, you've already set about weaponizing it in the creation of the literal best weapons and armor known to man, Floran, and everything in between. You'd have to make a pact with an eldritch god to do better than this.": "^orange;ティア7^reset;\n\n「エーテリウム」合金を発見したばかりですが、すでに人間、フローラン、その間のすべてのものに知られている文字通り最高の武器と防具の武器化を始めました。それ以上を達成するには邪悪な神と契約が必要でしょう...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned make better EPPs which improve on the basic breathing model or do other useful things like resisting elements or improving your combat capability.\n\n^yellow;Reminder^reset;: EPPs in Frackin' Universe are much different than vanilla! There's no one EPP that is perfect for all situations, and the kind of EPP you choose should be tailored to the planet you want to explore.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n基本的な呼吸モデルを改良したり、元素耐性や戦闘能力を高めたりする優れたEPPを製作する方法を習得しました。\n\n^yellow;注意^reset;：Frackin' UniverseのEPPはバニラとは大きく異なります！すべての状況に完璧な単一のEPPは...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 0^reset;\n\nLately, you've been thinking of things in new ways. The numerous sciences feel new to you again, and you are anxious to utilize fresh methodologies in your experimentation and theorizing.\n\nThis all came about thanks to your dreams, where you swear you've heard voices whispering new theories and formulas to you. Obviously it's just your genius manifesting while you sleep, but it ^green;feels like more^reset; to you. You are compelled to investigate these thoughts.": "^orange;ティア0^reset;\n\n最近、物事を新しい視点で考えるようになりました。多くの科学が再び新鮮に感じられ、実験や理論化に新しい方法論を使いたくなっています。\n\nこれはすべて夢から始まりました。誰かの声がささやいているのを聞いた気がします...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've done a fair amount of pondering things beyond the limits of modern science thanks to your new insights.\n\nYou know without a doubt that you can revitalize the entire scientific community, but to do it you'll need to be willing to take ethical and moral steps outside of the conventional. \n\nPsychic powers, otherworldly entities and more are all within your grasp if you're willing to step above and beyond silly limits put in place by cowards afraid to truly discover.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n新しい洞察のおかげで、現代科学の限界を超えたことについてかなり熟考しました。\n\n科学界全体を活性化できると確信していますが、そのためには倫理と道徳の外に踏み出す意志が必要です...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned that the brain is a marvellous thing, and unlocking its secrets is only the beginning. To really dig in you'll need to...dig in. Are there ethical issues with removing brains from subjects? Yes. Do you care? Probably not...\n\nYou can now harvest brains from subjects for further study with the use of a Brain Extractor.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n脳は素晴らしいもので、その秘密を解き明かすことは始まりに過ぎないと学びました。本当に深く掘り下げるには...文字通り掘り下げる必要があります。被験者から脳を摘出することに倫理的な問題はありますか？はい。気にしますか？おそらく...\n\n被験者から脳を採取できます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe energy that binds all things, the very life-essence of the cosmos, is at long last a thing you can quantify. While the results are less than concrete, you cannot deny the truths you have discovered in your studies.\n\nYou can now use brains and their 'Psionic Energy' to accomplish incredible things.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\nすべてを結びつけるエネルギー、宇宙の生命力そのものをついに定量化できます。結果が具体的でなくても、研究で発見した真実を否定できません。\n\n脳とその「サイオニックエネルギー」を使って...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nNot only have you proven psionics are real, you've learned to harness the brain itself to grant untold possibilities to science! Your next task is to learn to use your own mind to do impossible things. You can start by connecting with your Astral self...who knows what awaits beyond that.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\nサイオニクスが実在することを証明しただけでなく、脳自体を活用して科学に無限の可能性を与える方法を習得しました！次の課題は自分の心を使って不可能なことをすることです。アストラルの自己との接続から始めましょう...先に何が待っているか...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nUnhappy with the paltry offerings of knowledge provided in conventional educational facilities, private collections and 'reputable' locations of the sort, you have begun to delve into the more fantastic and unknown. \n\nWild theories that defy physics, ludicrous tales about things living just outside our reality - you've determined through experiments that its all real. To prove it to the galaxy, you are willing to do just about anything.": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n従来の教育施設、私的コレクション、「評判の高い」場所の貧弱な知識では満足できず、より幻想的で未知のものへ踏み込み始めました。\n\n物理学を否定する奇妙な理論、薄い...(省略)についての荒唐無稽な話...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou have not only discovered Dark Matter, but also how to harvest and harness it for your own ends. Through perseverance and know-how you have done what billions before you failed to accomplish! \n\nThis should prove both profitable and educational, and the changess this may bring to all areas of galactic life will make you a public name in no time.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n暗黒物質を発見しただけでなく、自分の目的のために採取・活用する方法も見つけました。粘り強さと知識で、何十億もの人々が失敗したことを達成しました！\n\nこれは利益にも学習にも有益なはずで、もたらされる変化は...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou have proven that there are multiple dimensions, and are close to devising a way to connect them.\n\nWith a bit of patience and study you could even learn to send messages or even -cross over- to the other side! The potential here is staggering, but the risk is equally high. You should take precautions before doing anything too crazy.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n複数の次元が存在することを証明し、それらを接続する方法を考案しつつあります。\n\n少しの忍耐と研究でメッセージを送ったり、さらには「向こう側に渡る」ことも学べます！ここでの可能性は驚異的ですが、リスクも同様に高いです...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYou have, beyond a doubt, communicated with a being from another reality. Such was its voice that you are forever changed, and all of this dimension must know the truth you have gleaned.\n\n They will all worship the glory of the Thing you have glimpsed beyond the veil. If they know what is good for them.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\n別の現実からの存在と疑いなく通信しました。その声はあなたを永遠に変え、この次元のすべての者がその真実を知らなければなりません。\n\nあなたが垣間見た「存在」の栄光を皆が崇めることでしょう。もし彼らが...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNow that you've uncovered a new form of particle and the sciences to utilize it, it's obviously time to start weaponizing it to shoot at other beings to see what happens!\n\nNot only have you utilized its more defensive properties to design new armor suits, but you've also devised a line of weapons that should cause ample amounts of pain and misery! Enjoy.": "^orange;ティア4^reset;\n\n新しい形の粒子とそれを利用する科学を発見したので、次は他の存在に向けて撃ち何が起こるか見るために武器化する時です！\n\n防衛的な特性を活用して新しい防具スーツを設計しただけでなく...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThanks to modern psychiatric help you can seek out a bit of aid should you feel disconnected from reality. Sure, they'll psychoanalyze you. Sure, it's expensive. Sure, they think you're nuts...but all of that is still better than eating your own face or ruining yourself with crippling addictions. It definitely won't be as fun, however.": "^orange;ティア1^reset;\n\n現代の精神医療のおかげで、現実から切り離されていると感じた時に少しの助けを求められます。もちろん精神分析されます。もちろん高額です。もちろんあなたを狂っていると思います...でもそれでも自分の顔を食べたり...(省略)よりましです",
  "^orange;Monstrous Visages^reset;\n\nYour dreams just get weirder and weirder as time goes on. You keep seeing this many-tentacled face in your dreams, so much so that you feel you can recreate its horrible form in reality...through using adorable plush toys suitable for all! Share the insanity with kids and adults alike! They'll thank you for it...eventually.": "^orange;おぞましき幻影^reset;\n\n夢はどんどん奇妙になっています。多くの触手を持つ顔を繰り返し夢で見るため、その恐ろしい姿を現実に再現できるほど感じています...すべての人に向けた愛らしいぬいぐるみを通じて！子供たちと狂気を共有しましょう...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've seen strange things, and know that there are beings out there we cannot comprehend with our limited perception of reality. You seek to learn of how living things work, no matter how exotic. What you do with that knowledge then, well...that's another matter entirely.\n\nFlesh is your canvas, and many would disagree with your methods. So long as nobody knows...nobody will mind. Right?": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n不思議なものを見て、私たちの限られた現実の認識では理解できない存在が存在することを知っています。生き物がどのように機能するかを学ぼうとしており、どれほど奇妙でも構いません。その知識で何をするかは...また別の話です。\n\n...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThrough examination of corpses, you've learned a great deal about how life and death work. But you aren't interested in just the DNA sequences...no, you seek something grander. A symphony you can play on flesh and show the universe how truly beautiful life is, whether they agree with you or not.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n死体の調査を通じて、生と死の仕組みについて多くを学びました。しかしあなたはDNA配列だけに興味があるわけではありません...いいえ、あなたはより壮大なものを求めています。宇宙に見せられる肉体で演奏できる交響曲を...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nLife and Death are only suggestions to you. You have learned to work within both the realm of the living and that of the dead. By fusing the two, you will accomplish the long-sought secret of eternal life, and so much more. \n\nYour perception of reality isn't what it used to be, though, and you've a tenuous grasp on things...at best.": "^orange;ティア5^reset;\n\n生と死はあなたにとって提案に過ぎません。生者と死者の両方の領域で活動する方法を習得しました。両者を融合させることで、長い間求められてきた永遠の命の秘密とそれ以上のものを達成できます。\n\n現実の認識はかつてのものではありません...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou're trying to delve into ways to improve existing technology as well as new sorts of machines and ideas beyond those of your peers. No topic is too strange! \n\nYou've been dreaming of a mathmatical formula that has been driving you slowly mad...and the only solution is to unscramble the numbers until the formulas speak to you. Whatever comes of it will surely be amazing!": "^orange;ティア2^reset;\n\n既存の技術を改良する方法と、仲間を超えた新しい種類の機械やアイデアを模索しています。どんなトピックも奇妙すぎることはありません！\n\n徐々に狂気に追い込んでいる数学的公式を夢見てきました...唯一の解決策は...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nConventional physics says that all energy simply becomes something else, and that nothing is truly ever destroyed. You're out to prove this wrong, because you know better! You can reach right into subspace and manipulate the fabric of reality to create a new sort of matter, and can construct potent robotic minions.": "^orange;ティア3^reset;\n\n従来の物理学ではすべてのエネルギーは単に別のものになり、何も真に破壊されないと言います。あなたはこれが間違っていることを証明しようとしています！サブスペースに手を伸ばして現実の構造を操作し、新しい種類の物質を創造できます...(省略)",
  "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThe Reality Bridge is a new theory you've formulated that states that all things in creation are connected to all other things, regardless of their dimensional phase or location. You can link biology with technology, biomass with particle antimatter...and limitless other things.\n\nThis is what they get for doubting you.": "^orange;ティア6^reset;\n\nリアリティブリッジは、創造の中のすべてのものが次元位相や場所に関わらず他のすべてのものと結びついているという新しい理論です。生物学と技術、バイオマスと粒子反物質...そして無限の他のことを結びつけられます...(省略)",
  " with ": "の"
}